window.FWN_HERO_SUMMONING_PEACE_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_HERO_SUMMONING_PEACE_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2201,"title":"Chapter 2201: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 6","paragraphs":["The fourth person chosen was Lilia-san, and, not just me, but many others as well, seemed to be looking at her with expressions of sympathy.","\"Lilia-san, as expected, is the one to land the unfortunate position that everyone would want to avoid after the three Gods' back-to-back turns.\"","\"With her also getting asked for opinions by Shallow Vernal-sama and Earth God-sama during the preparation phase, Lili-tan sure had it rough~~\"","\"She is highly regarded by many, you know? Among Humans, she’s probably rated the greatest after Kaito-san in this group. It’s an impressive feat, but still...... well......\"","\"Lili-tan, you poor thing......\"","\"If you think so, why not help her with your invincible Authority of Fate?\"","\"......Well, this isn’t Trinia, so this place is out of my range to begin with, and even if I did use it, it wouldn’t work on Shallow Vernal-sama or Earth God-sama...... Besides, even if I did somehow block that part, Lili-tan would probably still end up dealing with something troublesome here in a different world.\"","As a widely shared understanding, Lilia-san was the kind of person who drew the short straw in situations like these...... As the fourth to go, following Shiro-san, Makina-san, and a different world's World Creator, she stepped onto the stage with her eyes looking like the light had gone out of them.","[......Why this order...... No, I know Kaito-san didn’t arrange it that way on purpose, but my stomach hurts...... And now I’m hearing things I really didn’t want to hear, like a fan club for Otherworld Gods, and my stomach hurts even more.]","[H- How should I say this...... I’m really sorry, as always.]","Of course, it wasn’t like I had planned it this way, but I genuinely felt bad about this kind of thing. The idea of a fan club for Otherworld Gods...... It wouldn’t be surprising if they actually visited this world someday and wanted to greet Lilia-san as well...... She had likely imagined the same thing, which was probably why her stomach was hurting......","When Lilia-san reached me, she took a deep breath and changed her expression to a more gentle one.","[......Well, there’s no point in complaining at a celebratory event. And in this particular case, I imagine Kaito-san’s stomach is just as pained as mine......]","[Yeah, honestly...... I regret not considering the possibility that this party might turn out even more overwhelming than the last one.]","[We both have it rough...... Anyway, once again, happy birthday, Kaito-san.]","[Thank you.]","Since I was also suffering from stomachache at this birthday party, Lilia-san and I exchanged wry smiles. Then, she handed me a neatly wrapped gift along with her words of congratulations.","[I wasn’t sure what would be best, but I figured a practical item would be more appreciated than something expensive. So, I chose a pen that I personally find easy to use. You often write diaries and letters, so I thought it might come in handy.]","[Thank you, I really appreciate it. Even though I don’t write daily like before, I still log into my diary from time to time, and I use a pen often, so I’ll make good use of it.]","The small items that Lilia-san usually uses tend to have excellent taste. It’s not that she prefers luxury, but rather, she selects practical and stylish designs befitting a Duke.","I had visited her office several times while she was working, and every time, I thought the items on her desk all had great aesthetics. That’s why I was really happy with this gift as well.","\"As expected of Lilia-san, she chose a gift that Kaito-san could purely appreciate without feeling intimidated.\"","\"Even when she gets dragged into all sorts of trouble, Lili-tan does always manages to handle things well~~ Well, because of that, she keeps getting caught up in even more troubles......\"","\"Right. Well, anyway, it seems like everyone is unsure about when to transition to casual chatting, so maybe it’s time for some entertainment. Kaito-san, while watching the event, you can spin the garapon lottery machine whenever you feel like it. Whoever comes up will be fetched by Ein-san to hand over their gift......\"","Indeed, at the moment, everyone was focused on the presents. Even though they had been told they could chat freely, they were hesitating on when to start.","Adding some entertainment here to shift attention not just to the gifts but also to another activity seemed like a good idea. That said, I wonder what kind of entertainment it was going to be?","\"Now then! Last time, we had a karaoke tournament for Kaito-san’s birthday party, but this time...... we present <Let's Experience Otherworld Games! Video Game Tournament!!!>\"","......Wait, that sounds really fun. If anything, I want to participate in that too......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [A game tournament...... Ah, but wait. Since reaction time differences naturally create a handicap based on skill, can everyone really compete on an equal footing......?]"]},{"number":2202,"title":"Chapter 2202: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 7","paragraphs":["I stop turning the garapon lottery for a moment, drawn in by the sudden and intriguing topic of a video game tournament, and focus on Alice’s explanation.","\"Now then, let's keep things simple...... First of all, I imagine many of you might be wondering \"What is a video game?\". To put it simply, it’s a type of entertainment from Kaito-san’s world...... the world created by Makina. Let's explain while watching it in action...... Here it is.\"","As Alice says this, a large monitor appears behind the commentary table, displaying the screen of an extremely famous four-player competitive game.","\"To explain very simply, you use this controller to operate a character on the screen. To make it easier to understand, you can think of it like controlling puppets using magic tools to battle each other. Up to 4 people can play at once, and since we have people who can create anything just lying around with nothing to do, we had them make a bunch of these game consoles. Especially that idiot who was busy making some kind of cursed museum or whatever...... Anyway, since multiple matches can be held at the same time in groups of 4, the pacing of corresponding matches should be good.\"","\"......Shall-tan, aren't you being pretty harsh on Earth God-sama?\"","\"You can just handle that guy roughly. If you spoil her, she immediately gets carried away and starts running wild... I mean, she actually went ahead and made that weird building again, didn’t she?\"","\"U- Umm, I’d appreciate it if you didn’t bring up topics that are hard for me to respond to...... I mean, it’s fine since Earth God-sama is super indulgent with Shall-tan, but I can’t just say whatever I want about her.\"","Alice’s treatment of Makina is indeed rather casual, but that’s because they’re close friends who know each other well.","Actually, as Fate-san pointed out, Makina is absurdly indulgent when it comes to Alice...... Like, to an almost ridiculous degree. She probably got talked into mass-producing these game consoles without much resistance.","\"......But Shall-tan, even if we’re competing through Otherworld entertainment, wouldn’t there be a huge difference between Peerage Holders and regular people? Wouldn't it end up being one-sided?\"","\"Oh! As expected of Fate-san, that’s a great question. If it were a direct physical fight, then yes, it would be completely unbalanced. However, in video games, things are different. As I mentioned, this is a form of entertainment from Kaito-san’s world. In other words, it was designed with humans as the standard...... more specifically, it’s based on the reaction speed of humans who don’t have any magic-enhanced physical abilities. The stronger you are, the slower things will feel to you.\"","\"Oh yeah, that’s right. Kai-chan’s world doesn’t have magic, does it?\"","\"Exactly. Well then, let’s have Fate-san try it out. The controls are really simple, so......\"","As expected, Alice and Fate-san continue their lively exchange while smoothly explaining things, and Fate-san agrees to do a test play.","This game is very well known, and I’ve played it before with Aoi-chan and Hina-chan, as well as with a few other acquaintances. Just like Alice said, I remember that everyone struggled a lot with the reaction speed.","\"......Eh? Why? I blocked that, didn’t I!?\"","\"You pressed the button too early, so by the time the opponent actually attacked, your guard had already dropped. Timing is everything.\"","\"Timing huh. So I just need to match the opponent’s attack properly...... Ehhh!? Why did that hit me!?\"","\"Fate-san, you might feel like your timing was perfect, but it was actually too perfect. You didn’t account for the slight delay between pressing the button and your character executing the action. By the way, this game console has an input delay of roughly 1/300,000th of the speed of light.\"","\"That’s slow!\"","\"For normal humans, that’s actually way too fast...... Anyway, you have to account for that kind of delay to control the game properly. Also, button mashing won’t register if it exceeds a certain speed. Even if you understand it logically, your instincts might still react differently, so fully adapting to it within the tournament timeframe will be difficult...... well, if you exclude a certain bug, that is......\"","I see. Listening to Alice’s explanation, it really does seem like even the Six Kings and regular people could have a fair match in this game. Also, when she mentioned \"bug\", she was probably referring to Lilia-san. I’ve actually played this game with Lilia-san before. At first, she was confused for a few rounds...... but after that, she started performing frame-perfect inputs like it was nothing and became pretty strong.","However, either due to bad luck or some unknown force at work, she kept getting hit or caught up in the random stage hazards and interference items. Because of that, her overall performance was about the same as mine, Aoi-chan’s, and Hina-chan’s.","The best player among the ones I’ve played with...... is Amel-san. She was immediately fascinated by the idea of Otherworld games, and her eyes sparkled whenever she saw special moves and flashy attacks. More than anything though, she really seemed to enjoy playing together with friends. I remember playing with her quite a lot...... so in terms of experience, she’s probably among the top players in this entire venue.","That said, since she loves pulling off stylish combo sequences and going for dramatic finisher moves, she often leaves herself open. So while she’s strong, she’s not unbeatable, meaning the matches will probably end up being pretty well-balanced in the end.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [A four-player game with simple controls...... Just what kind of fighting game is this......?]","? ? ? : [Well, there’s also the possibility that it’s Bomberman......]","Serious-senpai : [That doesn’t have combos or special moves......]"]},{"number":2203,"title":"Chapter 2203: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 8","paragraphs":["Alice provided a simple explanation, and the game we actually plan to play is on the easier side in terms of controls. I think after a little practice, most people will be able to play.","Of course, playing well is another matter, it will likely be quite difficult. However, I believe most people will be able to reach a level where they can put up a decent fight fairly quickly. That is, for the most part, true for Humans.","For example, the servants at Lilia-san's mansion should be able to pick it up quite easily...... The real problem, however, lies with high-ranking Demons or the Peerage Holders...... I don’t have the kind of heightened abilities that would allow me to perceive delays in reaction times, so I have no idea how much they’ll struggle to adapt.","\"Now, regarding the tournament rules: Participation is completely optional, and since we plan to hold multiple rounds, you’re free to observe the first one and then join in from the second round onward. If you do wish to participate...... please touch the magic tool that Makina created over there. Doing so will automatically register you, and once registration closes, tournament brackets will be assigned at random. You’ll then need to move to the monitor where your name is displayed.\"","\"......Hey, can I ask something that I’m pretty sure most of the audience is wondering? Shall-tan, it's nice you're ridiculously close with Earth God-sama...... but when did that happen?\"","\"Well, we’re old friends. I wouldn't say it's desirable, but we have an inseparab———\"","[Best friends!]","\"———Errr, well, we've known each oth———-\"","[Best friends!!!]","\"———......Yes, we’re best friends.\"","Since I already knew about it, I hadn’t really thought about it before, but from the perspective of Fate-san and the others, it’s only natural that people would find Alice’s close relationship with Makina-san strange.","Makina-san first started coming here in her current form during the Symphonia Kingdom’s Founding Festival...... However, it wasn’t until after the Hydra Kingdom’s Founding Festival that she officially got permission from Shiro-san to stay here. Many people know that Eden-san is Makina-san, thanks to the ship party, but few are aware that Makina-san is Alice’s best friend.","Also, Makina-san is quite particular about the fact that she is Alice’s best friend. Just now, as Alice was about to call their relationship an \"undesirable, but inseparable friendship\" or merely say they \"knew each other\", Makina-san interrupted and firmly asserted their friendship.","Alice, looking somewhat annoyed, finally relented and called Makina-san her best friend, to which Makina-san nodded in satisfaction. Well, for most people in the audience, hearing that they were \"best friends\" probably only made things more confusing..... I have a feeling Alice wanted to gloss over it for that exact reason......","\"Ahem, getting back on track, we’ll be running this as a tournament. If you win the tournament, you’ll receive a small commemorative prize. Additionally, you’ll earn the right to challenge our current provisional Champion, Kaito-san!\"","[ ! ? ]","Oh no...... is this turning into another situation like the karaoke tournament? Well, I suppose if it’s just an exhibition match against the winner, I could be the one giving the prize and do the match in between. I did want to participate in the gaming tournament after all.","......But I’m really not that strong...... Sure, I have a bit of an experience advantage over first-time players, but the person who wins the whole tournament will probably be not just decent, but really skilled...... Will I even be able to put up a proper fight?","\"Is Kai-chan really that strong?\"","\"No, not really. That’s why Kaito-san’s match will have a special rule, his character will be in a Boss mode with significantly boosted stats. But since the commemorative prize is given out upon winning the tournament, Kaito-san’s match is more of a bonus and won’t affect the outcome in any way. The idea is for everyone, including Kaito-san, to just have fun together.\"","That’s a bit of a relief. Normally, that game doesn’t allow players to control a Boss-mode character with just inflated stats, but with the people here, making it happen is hardly an issue.","\"By the way, I’ll be staying here to do commentary and tease Kaito-san while he’s presenting the prize, but Fate-san, you’re free to participate.\"","\"Arehh? Shall-tan, you’re not joining?\"","\"If I played, I’d win. Also, I’m the one who made the commemorative prize so......\"","Yeah, if Alice were to participate, she’d definitely win. She’s dexterous, knows a lot about games, and from the times I’ve played against her...... I can tell she always holds back just enough to make it a close match. If she went all out, she’d completely dominate.","\"Incidentally, the commemorative prize is a Kaito-san Birthday Commemorative Model!\"","......Wait, no one told me about that. A Birthday Commemorative Model? I need to know more details about this. Since neither Shiro-san nor Makina-san is reacting strongly, that means they’ve probably already seen it...... or have already received their own pieces in advance to keep them from interfering.","Either way, I need to find out more about this commemorative item......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Hmmm...... Maybe I should prepare a birthday present after all......]"]},{"number":2204,"title":"Chapter 2204: Extra - : A Strange Fellow that Appears Once a Year","paragraphs":["Feeling the faint morning sunlight streaming through the gap in the curtains, I slowly open my eyes. The Alarm Clock magic tool hasn’t gone off, and for some reason, I get the sense that I woke up a little earlier than usual today.","They say \"the early bird catches the worm\", so maybe something good will happen today......","[You’re finally awake. Being able to take it easy, must be nice, Kaito.]","[.......................What are you doing here, Sirius-senpai......?]","As I sit up and groggily scan my room, my gaze lands on a woman sitting on my sofa, sipping what appears to be coffee with an unnecessarily elegant motion...... It's the one who looks exactly like Shea-san, but only appears once a year...... Sirius-senpai.","At this point, I’ve seen her enough times that I can tell at a glance whether it’s Shea-san or Sirius-senpai. Well, that aside, I have no idea why she’s just sitting in my room having a coffee break.","[When did you get in here?]","[Oh, about 10 minutes ago. You were still asleep, and I thought it’d be rude to wake you, so I just had some coffee. Not sure why I ended up sitting on the sofa the moment I walked in, though.]","[I- I see?]","I don’t really get it, but to begin with, Sirius-senpai herself is a pretty mysterious person. She literally only appears on April Fools’ Day and supposedly lives in some strange room that prevents her from leaving on any other day.","It sounds like she’s completely confined, but she doesn’t seem to mind at all. In fact, she talks about it as if it’s completely normal. In short, she’s someone I don’t really understand.","[By the way, where did you get that coffee from?]","[Unn? Don’t worry, it’s mine. I figured something like this might happen, so I had a certain Mad God, who constantly oozes insanity and devours my sugarized body, make me a magic box.]","[......I really think you should cut ties with that god. They’re definitely dangerous......]","[And I've been saying this, that God is connected to you...... but whatever. Anyway, let’s get the first order of business out of the way!]","[Is this that weird \"Sirius Search\" thing we did back then again?]","[It’s not weird! It’s simple!!! As the embodiment of siriusness, the Sirius of the Sirius, it’s only natural for me to seek out siriusness! The real problem is the severe lack of siriusness in recent times, which has reduced me, Sirius-senpai, the supposed embodiment of siriusness, to nothing more than someone who flails around in agony over romantic fluff!!]","The word \"sirius\" is starting to lose all meaning. Also, I won’t say this out loud because I’d never hear the end of it, but I still seriously doubt that Sirius-senpai is actually the embodiment of siriusness. I’ve met her many times, but I’ve never once felt any sense of \"siriusness\" from her......","[Well, back to the main topic......]","[Your emotions are still as much of a rollercoaster as ever......]","I let out a wry chuckle at the extreme shift in mood, she went from passionately shouting to suddenly being calm in an instant.","[This isn’t about siriusness. I have something for you.]","[What’s this box?]","[I figured it’d be good to have something prepared, so I brought you a birthday present. Happy birthday, Kaito.]","[........................]","......No, today isn't my birthday at all. Today is April 1st, April Fools' Day. My birthday is July 2nd...... not even close.","Wait, hold on. Just like how time flows differently between the world I came from and Trinia, maybe the place where Sirius-senpai usually stays has a different flow of time too. It’s possible that, from her perspective, my birthday is actually around this time.","[......T- Thank you. By the way, Sirius-senpai...... what’s the date in the place where you usually are?]","[Eh? It’s April 1st, of course. It’s April Fools' Day. What are you talking about?]","[......So, it’s definitely not my birthday......]","[That’s fine. The main story is currently doing a birthday episode.]","[......Main story?]","[Well, even if you ignore that, I can only come out on April 1st anyway. So no matter what, I’d have to give it to you today. Just don’t worry about the date.]","[R- Right......]","Well, when she puts it like that, it’s true that if I were to receive a birthday present from Sirius-senpai, today would be the only day it could happen. Thinking about it that way, it does kind of make sense for me to get it today.","[Anyway, thanks. Mind if I open it?]","[Go ahead, and prepare to be overwhelmed with emotion.]","[Ahaha...... errr...... unn? What's this? A flag?]","When I open the box from Sirius-senpai, I find a flag small enough to hold in one hand, with the words \"Lovey-Dovey\" written on it.","[That...... is the Lovey-Dovey Flag!]","Alright, as usual...... she’s saying something weird.","[Normally, I would be the one to snap that in half, but since it’s your birthday, I’ll allow you to use the Lovey-Dovey Flag just this once and activate a lovey-dovey event!]","[......Ah, yes.]","Use it? So this isn’t just a weirdly labeled flag, it’s something that can actually be used? But how? Do I hand it to someone...... But if that’s the case, wouldn’t only Sirius-senpai understand what it means?","If so...... wait, does that mean I’m supposed to hand it to Sirius-senpai......?","[......So, um, should I give this to you, Sirius-senpai?]","[Fwah!?]","......Well, I still have no idea how to use this Lovey-Dovey Flag, but judging by Sirius-senpai’s expression, like she just got struck by a bolt out of the blue...... I probably did something wrong.","<Afterword>","Sirius-senpai : [Hey, the heck is with that title!!!? Last year, you at least...... well, barely, but still, you had the decency to use my name!!! Why are you making it sound like I’m some kind of suspicious person lurking around the neighborhood!!!?]","? ? ? : [Anyway, are you gonna be lovey-dovey or what?]","Sirius-senpai : [......Wait, hold on, see, April Fools' is almost over...... which means my screen time is up...... right?]"]},{"number":2205,"title":"Chapter 2205: Extra - : April Fools’ Day (Lost Time)","paragraphs":["[Wait, what the heck is April Fools’ Day Lost Time!?]","[ ! ? ]","[Even if, like, I take ten thousand steps back and accept that there’s lost time, where the heck did that lost time come from!? Was it when I was waiting for Kaito to wake up? In that case, that was only 10 minutes!!]","[......Errr, Senpai? What exactly are you......]","I called out to Serious-senpai, who suddenly started shouting into the void. Well, this isn’t the first time something like this has happened, so I guess it’s best to just accept that this is how Serious-senpai is.","She’s...... quite strange——— no, unique. She probably has a lot going on. No, I’m definitely not thinking \"This seems like a hassle to deal with\". Nope...... probably......","[......Tch, whatever. But you really did it this time, Conqueror King......! To think you’d use a lovey-dovey flag against me...... A complete sneak attack! But know this———– this is as far as your plan goes!!]","[No, \"plan\" might be a bit of a stretch...... Also, I still don’t really get how to use it......]","[True, that flag is rightfully yours. If you choose to use it on me, then I have no choice but to accept it...... However! My conquest difficulty is SSS! Even you won’t be able to clear it so easily!!!]","[......Ah, yes.]","I have no idea how the conversation ended up here, and I doubt I’d get a satisfying answer even if I asked Serious-senpai. Things have taken a weird turn, but it seems like I just have to roll with it for now.","[To conquer me, you must first max out my Affection Level to 100. And even then, that’s not the end, it’s only the starting line!]","[Ah~~ Errr...... T- That does sound like quite the high difficulty...... E- Errr...... By the way, what’s my affection level right now?]","[Eh? ......If I had to put a number on it...... Let’s see...... Being generous...... it’s around \"96,430,000\"...... I guess?]","[......Wait, what’s the max Affection Level again?]","[100.]","[............]","Did I mishear something? I feel like she just said her Affection Level for me is 964,300 times the max value? Doesn’t that mean, no matter how you spin it, she’s already fully conquered......?","I glance at Serious-senpai, but she’s giving me a look like \"Why is this guy asking such obvious things?\" and I don’t get it at all.","[......Errr, so, what happens if I use this lovey-dovey flag?]","[A lovey-dovey event with me will trigger, of course...... But as I said, I am a high-difficulty conquest! Off the top of my head, I can only think of around 30 possible lovey-dovey events that could happen right now!]","......Is she some kind of lovey-dovey master? If she can instantly come up with 30 scenarios, she'd be way too knowledgeable about this kind of thing...... Also, the whole high difficulty part seems completely irrelevant here.","As I stare at her, at a loss for words, Serious-senpai pulls out paper and a pen and starts writing down these so-called lovey-dovey events.","[......No, Serious-senpai...... Some of these are a bit......]","[Ah, you’re right. I just wrote down whatever since there’s a bed here, but yeah, some of these aren’t exactly age-appropriate. Let’s cut those...... That leaves 25.]","[That’s still way more than enough......]","[But! You only hold one flag! That means you can only trigger one of these events!! Now, what will you do!?]","[E- Ehhh...... W- What should I do......]","No, seriously, what should I do? Everything written on the paper could indeed be classified as a lovey-dovey event that can be carried out indoors. I was honestly impressed that she could come up with so many...... but being told to pick one? That’s a whole different issue......","[Why don't you decide it with darts? That’s the safest option, right?]","[Mhm!? You’ve shown yourself, ? ? ? ]","[Whoa!? Alice?]","[......Ah, no, you got the wrong person. I'm ? ? ? , just a common fan of the Transcendental Beauty Alice-chan.]","[No matter how you look at it......]","[You got the wrong person.]","[That weird costume......]","[You got the wrong person.]","[I mean, your voice isn't even......]","[You! got! the wrong! person!!!]","[......Okay, got it. I got the wrong person.]","The black cat costume she was wearing looked exactly like a color variation of the one Alice often wore, but since she was stubbornly insisting she wasn't Alice, I decided not to press the issue any further.","[Look, we can’t spend forever on an Extra Chapter, so let’s just settle this with darts real quick. I’ve already prepared a spinning dartboard......]","[Well, letting Kaito decide by throwing a dart does sound reasonable...... wait, hold on! Why the hell are there a Pajero and a scrubbing brush on the board!? Especially that Pajero! What are we supposed to do if that gets picked!? This is a world that still uses horse-drawn carriages, respect the setting!!]","Some kind of comedy skit had started playing out in front of me, but basically, it seemed like I was supposed to throw a dart to decide the lovey-dovey event...... Unn...... Seriously...... How did things end up like this?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Alright, that's it!!! We're done here!!! As the embodiment of seriousness, there's no way I can be the direct participant in a lovey-dovey event! So let's gloss over the result and get back to the birthday episode!!!]"]},{"number":2206,"title":"Chapter 2206: Extra Chapter: It Felt Lacking So Here’s an Additional -","paragraphs":["[Don't give up! You forced your way through the lost time last time, so at least find a way to somehow connect this to April Fools'!!!]","[Eh? What are you suddenly talking about......]","[Just the usual seizures. Here, Kaito-san, throw this.]","I was surprised when Serious-senpai suddenly shouted into the void again, but Alice...... no, ? ? ? handed me a dart without showing any concern.","Serious-senpai, after her outburst, seemed to calm down and folded her arms, looking at me seriously...... or rather, waiting for the dart's result.","? ? ? spun the dartboard, and I threw the dart. I was worried if it would actually stick, but it managed to land properly.","[......Oh? This is...... a lap pillow.]","[Guh...... S- So that’s how it turned out...... I see. If I think back to the first lovey-dovey event, the lap pillow during the barbecue would be the corresponding moment. As the first event that triggered me, this is quite fitting...... No, rather, doesn’t this make me the main heroine?]","[How impertinent.]","[Habfu!?]","[S- Serious-senpaiiiii!?]","Serious-senpai had been striking a satisfied pose as if she had come to some realization, but immediately after, ? ? ? ...... for some reason, slammed her headfirst into a spiked iron platform that was just lying on the ground with a screwdriver.","......I feel like even a devil would show a bit more mercy. That was an insanely brutal strike...... Wait, hold on. Aren’t those spikes too big!? Did they just go through her head!? I- Isn’t she dead......?","(T/N: Not the screwdriver tool, this screwdriver.)","[......D*mn, that hurt.]","[......That’s not something you should just sum up as \"hurts\"...... And you're already healed......]","Despite my concerns, Serious-senpai casually pulled herself off the spiked platform while muttering about the pain. Blood had been flowing right after impact, but within seconds, her wound closed, and even the blood on her face vanished.","Come to think of it, when we first met, ? ? ? sliced her into tiny pieces, and she still regenerated after a while......","[Gag-based plot armor is so unreasonable, isn't it? Well, anyway, I’ll be taking my leave now.]","With an exasperated tone, ? ? ? muttered those words before vanishing, leaving just me and Serious-senpai in the room.","[......Well, what’s done is done...... Hmmm. Since we're not in a Japanese-style room, I guess doing it on the sofa would be best...... Alright! Come on, Kaito!]","[Eh? Oh, right, the lap pillow...... That last scene was so intense I forgot. Errr, okay then...... I- If you'll excuse me.]","I had been so overwhelmed by the brutal screwdriver scene that I forgot about the lap pillow. Not that I ever really understood how things led to this in the first place...... But since Serious-senpai seemed eager, I obediently rested my head on her lap.","[Hmph, as the embodiment of seriousness, my lap pillow must be an excellent resting place.]","[......Errr, yeah. It is comfortable, and I think I can smell something a little sweet?]","[Arehh? Is the scent from when I sugarized still lingering? My scent should be serious though......]","[No, what does \"serious scent\" even mean?]","[I just said it on impulse, so I have no idea either.]","Serious-senpai was wearing a school uniform-like outfit with a skirt that reached just below her knees. The fabric must have been high-quality because it was soft and had a pleasant texture, making it genuinely comfortable to rest on.","As I felt a faint warmth behind my head and a gentle, sweet scent drifting around me, a sense of comfort settled in.","[......However, it's a shame that your dart was a miss, Kaito! It looks like the insane luck buff doesn’t apply to the extra chapters......]","[Unn? A lap pillow counts as a miss for a lovey-dovey event?]","[Well, no, a lap pillow is certainly a fine lovey-dovey event...... but using up a precious love-event flag on something you could have gotten just by asking is a huge waste!]","[......Eh? A- Ahh, I guess you’re right.]","Arehh? Am I imagining things? That kind of sounds like she's saying \"If you ask, I’d give you a lap pillow anytime.\"......","Serious-senpai didn’t seem to notice my internal confusion though, as instead, she grinned triumphantly and continued speaking.","[But this was all part of my grand strategy...... Fuhaha! Earlier, I pretended that those were the only options I could think of, but in reality, every single one of them was a lovey-dovey event that could be executed without consuming any love-event flags! The moment you agreed to pick from that list, you had already doomed yourself to waste a flag!]","[....................]","Wait, hold on. If all 25...... no, 30 options on that list could be done without a love-event flag, then that would be kinda outrageous. No wonder her affection level is 960,000 times the normal maximum.","Actually, at this point, is there even anything left that would require a love-event flag to trigger?","[Fufufu, you’re so shocked you’ve been rendered speechless huh. This is the level of tactical brilliance you can expect from the embodiment of seriousness! Here, as a consolation...... I’ll pat your head.]","[......Ah, thanks...... Errr, can I ask something?]","[Unn?]","[Is there...... any lovey-dovey event with Serious-senpai that would require a love-event flag?]","[Not really.]","[Hmmm?]","[......It seems you've realized it. That’s right! The moment you decided to use a love-event flag on me, you had already lost!]","Serious-senpai proudly struck a smug pose but...... Did she just casually say \"If you want something, I’ll do anything for you\" like it was the most natural thing in the world......? H- Hmmm...... I don’t get it.","She really is a mysterious person.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Well, even if he's the protagonist, he's still far from surpassing me.]","? ? ? : [......Eh? This counts as a victory? Isn't she fully conquered already?]"]},{"number":2207,"title":"Chapter 2207: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 9","paragraphs":["I understood the general outline of the game tournament, but I couldn’t help being curious about the so-called commemorative prize given to the winner.","Knowing Alice, I doubt it’s something I’d genuinely dislike......","\"Incidentally, the commemorative prize for the winner is...... this trophy-style ornament!\"","\"Hmm~~ Ah, that’s the necklace Kai-chan always wears!\"","\"Exactly. Since this is a tournament commemorating Kaito-san’s birthday, the trophy is designed with the necklace he always wears. Well, this necklace isn’t a magic item, it’s just an ornament, so it doesn’t actually use any magic crystals.\"","I see, that’s the approach they took...... What Alice pulled out was a trophy with a design that enclosed the black magic crystal necklace I always wear, the one I got from Kuro, inside a crystal-like cylinder.","That necklace really is something I wear all the time, so in a way, it could be said to symbolize me.","It seems like I didn’t need to worry, and feeling relieved, I listened as Alice continued explaining. It seemed that aside from the actual tournament, there were also game consoles set up for practice, so if someone was nervous about jumping straight into the competition, they could warm up first and then join from the second tournament onward.","As I watched the recruitment for the first tournament’s participants after the explanation ended, people’s personalities really started to show. For example, Frea-san and War King's Subordinates were quick to sign up for the first round, seemingly with a “let’s just give it a shot” attitude.","On the other hand, the members of the Ten Demons and the Seven Princesses were mostly in observation mode for the first round, planning to join in from the second round or later...... Well, Blossom-san seemed pretty enthusiastic and joined the first one right away though......","Still, seeing it all like this, the number of participants is pretty large. Unlike the time on the ship party, it seems that everyone who could even loosely be considered an acquaintance of mine is here, even if I don’t have their contact info.","It’s surprising how many acquaintances I have whose contact info I don’t actually know. Especially among the War King's Subordinates———— thanks to attending a few banquets hosted by Megiddo-san, I’ve talked to quite a few of them before.","Many of them have those lively extroverted personalities who love fun, so while I’ve had conversations with them at parties and such, we never really exchanged contact info. Still, a good number of them showed up, which adds to the headcount.","Also, people who’ve played on my game console and have experience with the game are entering the first tournament. Well, just because they’ve played before doesn’t automatically make them favorites to win......","For example, Aoi-chan is competitive and skilled but...... she tends to prefer flashy, novel characters. The kind with huge wind-ups, super slow attacks that rarely hit, but when they do, they deal absurd amounts of damage, or glass cannon-types that are ridiculously fragile and require perfect dodging with invincibility frames, but hit like a truck and move lightning fast...... Anyhow, she doesn’t go for the strong meta characters, but rather the stylish ones. So while she’s good, her win rate isn’t great when playing against me or Hina-chan.","Hina-chan, on the other hand, really dislikes slow characters and favors speed types. She’s all about aggressive offense, which makes her vulnerable to counter-type attacks, but when she grasps the pace of the match, she’s insanely strong.","Amel-san sometimes leaves openings because she goes for flashy combos, but she also has by far the most playtime experience, so she’s very strong. She just seems really happy to be playing with friends, so she often plays with me...... but honestly, she beats me about 70% of the time, so I’d say she’s a real contender for the championship.","Other than them, Tre-san has also played before...... but she’s ridiculously bad at the game, so I think even someone who’s only played a little could easily beat her. If she manages to win even one match, that’d be impressive.","Cento-san and Cien-san, at least when we played together before, seemed to still be struggling with the difference in senses, but if they manage to adjust to that, they could probably be pretty strong.","And then...... there’s Lilia-san, who seemed like she’d be strong. She shouldn't have ever played this game, but she picked up racing games and got to a high level really fast, so I feel like once she gets the hang of it, she’ll become strong in no time.","......Still, overall, I think people with experience have a massive advantage. It’s not just about being good at the basic controls, there are techniques that you can’t really do unless you know about them. Like utilizing invincibility frames during air dodges, or moving behind someone who's in a guard state. So, at least for the first tournament...... it’s probably going to be Amel-san huh?","While I was thinking about all that, I happened to notice Kuro touching the magic tool used for tournament registration.","Arehh? That’s weird. I’m pretty sure Kuro’s never played that game before...... but for some reason, I just had this intuitive feeling...... that Kuro is gonna get the overall victory.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Speaking of which, you did play this game with Shiro, didn't you?]","Airhead God : [Indeed, our record was 1865 wins and 1864 losses, with me in the lead. In other words, I am the victor.]","Under King : [That’s only because Shiro said \"Let’s end it here\" right after taking the lead!!! Even though I said so many times we should stop already......]","Serious-senpai : [Wait, so you two seriously played that much......]"]},{"number":2208,"title":"Chapter 2208: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 10","paragraphs":["As expected, even those with incredible abilities...... no, perhaps precisely because they have incredible abilities that they were struggling with the slow response time, making the scene as chaotic as Alice had intended when she planned this.","What caught my attention, though, was that Shiro-san and Makina-san were just watching the tournament without moving at all. I have a feeling that a copy of the commemorative prize for the winner had probably already been handed to them by Alice in advance.","If Shiro-san and Makina-san had played normally without doing anything special, they would probably have struggled with the reaction speed too, but those two are capable of doing anything if they put their minds to it, and they could have instantly mastered the game to an expert level. So, I guess Alice gave them the prize beforehand and somehow convinced them not to participate.","With that thought in mind, I decided I couldn't just stand around watching the tournament, so I spun the garapon lottery machine and had Ein-san go call the selected person.","If they were already participating in the tournament, I planned to skip them and draw again, but luckily, the person I picked didn't seem to be taking part in the first round of the tournament.","[Hello, Kaito-san. Happy birthday.]","[Thank you very much. Sorry for calling you over at this timing, but is calling you right now alright?]","The person I had drawn was Anne-san. She congratulated me with a gentle expression, and I thanked her while checking if the timing was alright. Anne-san smiled wryly and nodded.","[Yes. Actually, it's helpful that you called me at this timing. Right now, everyone's attention is focused on the tournament over there, so I'm relieved that I didn't have to be in the spotlight in front of such distinguished people.]","[Ah, now that you mention it, for people who don't like being in the spotlight, this timing might actually be perfect.]","[Even so, ever since I met you, Kaito-san, my sense of normalcy has been completely overturned. I never imagined I would have the opportunity to visit another world.]","[Oh, right! Now that you mention it, this place technically is a different world, huh?]","Now that she pointed it out, to me, it just felt like Shiro-san and Makina-san had done something crazy again, but for Anne-san and the others, this was their first time visiting a world other than Trinia......","[Yes. This world is wonderful for me. It's bright, but it doesn't seem to be sunlight, so I, who am sensitive to sunlight, don't have to cover my skin, making this world very comfortable.]","As a member of the Kruel species, Anne-san is weak to sunlight. If she's exposed to it, her skin turns red and stings painfully, so she usually keeps her skin covered during the day.","Incidentally, Anne-san's skin is pale blue...... not metaphorically, but literally a faint blue color, which is a characteristic of the Kruel species. That's probably why Tre-san and the others could immediately tell that Anne-san was part of the Kruel species at a glance.","If that pale blue skin were to get sunburned bright red, just imagining it seems painful, so I'm glad to hear she's comfortable here.","[......Once again, here is my birthday present. It might not compare well with what the others have given you but......]","[Not at all. I'm just really happy that you prepared a present for me, Anne-san.]","[I'm glad to hear you say that. It's an accessory made from gemstones I mined and crafted myself.]","What Anne-san handed me was a small box. After getting her permission, I opened it to find something like a pin badge adorned with a gemstone.","It had a stylish design that would go well when worn with formal wear, and honestly, I preferred this kind of design that wasn't too flashy, so I was very grateful.","[By the way, did everything go well with the exclusive contract with Tre-san?]","[Yes, we managed to secure the contract without any issues, and our circumstances have changed drastically since then. I’ve finally been able to pay the union members wages that reflect their abilities...... I truly can't thank you enough, Kaito-san.]","[That matter with Tre-san was really just a matter of timing and luck, but if it ended up helping you, then I’m glad.]","[Everyone in the union is really happy...... though maybe they've gone a bit overboard......]","[Unn?]","[Ah, no, it’s just, between being invited to that previous party and winning a magic box from the game prizes, among my acquaintances, you’ve ended up being seen as some kind of mysterious high-class noble.]","Well, it made sense. For people like Anne-san and the members of the Flying Board team who had met me directly, it might be different, but for others, that’s probably the impression they got. Honestly, even explaining my position to a third party is difficult, so I can’t blame them for thinking that way.","[Because of that, rumors started spreading like I was a commoner who had a noble fallen in love with me at first sight. Us Kruels have really strong connections with each other, with everyone kind of feels like extended family, so these kinds of jokes spread easily......]","[Ah, yeah, I know what you mean. Weird rumors like that tend to get around. I’ve had similar experiences.]","[Yes, and while Kaito-san might not feel great about rumors pairing you with someone like me, a woman with a different skin color, unattractive appearance, and a frail body, I’d appreciate it if you could overlook it, since it’s really just playful teasing among the Kruels.]","[Ah, no, I don't mind at all...... I mean, I think your skin is really beautiful, Anne-san. And I think you’re a wonderful woman: you’re cute, you have a lovely personality, and you’re charming overall, so I don’t feel bad about those rumors at all.]","[Eh? Ah, I- I see...... W- Well, if you say that, I don’t really know how to respond...... Thank you very much. Ahh, umm, it’s probably not good to keep you too long with idle chatter. I’ll take my leave now......]","Her skin might indeed be an unusual pale blue, but I thought it was genuinely beautiful. Anne-san herself was petite and cute, so in my eyes, she was simply beautiful, so I just honestly told her that.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Here he goes setting up flags again......]"]},{"number":2209,"title":"Chapter 2209: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 11","paragraphs":["After Anne-san left, I turned my gaze toward the game tournament, and it seemed that the matchups for the first tournament bracket had been decided and started. It looked like the event was getting quite lively.","As expected, most people were struggling with the input lag, and many of them were playing the game for the first time, so there was a lot of chaotic energy, but that chaos actually made things more fun.","Of course, there were differences in how quickly people adapted. Some were flustered the whole time without getting used to the game at all, while others started off awkward but gradually got the hang of it and managed to control their characters decently by the second half.","[......Ah, I see. If I do this, I can dodge attacks while slipping behind them.]","Among them, the one who stood out with remarkable adaptability, moving like an advanced player in no time, was Eul.","\"That girl is good~~ Is this really her first time playing this? Hey, she's with I-chan, right?\"","\"That’s Eulpecula-san. As far as I know, she’s never played this game before. But from what I can tell, she’s a prodigy on the level of Lilia-san, so it’s not surprising she’s adapting this fast.\"","\"A prodigy on the level of Lili-tan, isn't that insane?\"","\"In the first place, the fact that she’s casually using Humanization Magic after learning just a few months is already crazy. That’s quite an advanced magic, you know.\"","Apparently, Eul’s talent was comparable to Lilia-san, who Alice once called \"the world's bug\", that she muttered this with a hint of exasperation. Now that I think about it, I did hear that Humanization Magic is pretty advanced, so Eul being able to master it in such a short time really is incredible.","\"Since you mentioned it, I took a look at Lili-tan too, and she’s really good~~ Her movements are clearly on a different level, and it wouldn’t be surprising if she won this tournament...... Ahh, wait, something just burst from the ground and sent her flying.\"","\"That stage hazard is supposed to spawn randomly across the map, but for some reason, about 80% of them are appearing right under Lilia-san’s character. Well, even with that, her raw skill is so high that I think she’ll still win this block......\"","Lilia-san, as expected, was playing extremely well. Considering her experience, she’s probably far above Eul. However, like Alice mentioned, for some reason, all the stage hazards seemed to be targeting her. She kept getting interrupted mid-combo, so she wasn’t completely dominating the match...... Honestly, it’s baffling how she’s getting focus-fired by the map itself like it hates her...... W- Well, I guess the map selection is random, and on a stage without hazards, I’m sure she’d be way stronger.","Listening to Alice and Fate-san’s commentary, I continued scanning the matches...... and yep, Amel-san clearly stood out. While others were still battling it out, she had already won her block and advanced, making her a strong contender as the overall champion.","But...... hmm. I can’t help but wonder about Kuro...... Let’s see, Kuro’s match is...... Arehh? Looks like she’s over at the practice corner, giving Raz-san and others some coaching? Is she not participating in the tournament?","Just as I thought that, I noticed a large monitor above the magic tool displaying the tournament bracket. It showed the names of the winners from each four-person block, and at the very top was Kuro’s name.","< Block 10 Winner: Kuromeina (23.46 seconds) >","Wait, she beat three people in 23 seconds!? Eh? I- I mean, sure, it’s technically possible to instantly defeat opponents. Rather than stacking up damage, if you knock them out of the map, you can end the match quickly.","However, to ring someone out without much damage built up, you need precise techniques to block their recovery options.","There's a technique I think I could pull off if I tried, but to execute it, you need more than just good control skills, you have to understand each character’s traits too.","If you don’t know how your opponent’s character recovers, you can’t time your attacks to intercept them properly. It’s not something you can pull off with just raw instinct or dexterity.","I’m really curious to see how Kuro fought...... Hmm, the first round should be wrapping up soon, and the second round will start, so I’ll check it out then.","Curious about how Kuro would fight, I paused spinning the garapon lottery wheel and turned my attention back to the tournament. The winners of the first round were once again grouped into sets of four by the magic tool, and the second round began.","Kuro ended up in the same block as Lilia-san, and the map chosen this time had no gimmicks...... logically, that should’ve given Lilia-san a significant advantage.","However, right from the start, the two players who had made it through the first round thanks to favorable matchups were quickly eliminated, leaving just Kuro and Lilia-san in a one-on-one showdown. And Kuro steadily pushed Lilia-san into a corner, completely dominating the fight.","\"......Isn’t Kurorin way too strong? She’s barely taken any damage at all.\"","\"That’s the kind of movement you only see from someone who’s mastered the game. Also, the character she’s using is a high-level technical character......\"","Exactly. The character Kuro was using was definitely an advanced one, featuring a unique ability: <Just Guard>.","If you defend at the perfect moment, you activate <Just Guard>, which negates the usual whittling of your shield entirely. Normally, even when you block, your shield still takes damage, but with a successful <Just Guard>, there’s none of that. In exchange, the character has the lowest DEF in the entire roster, meaning that even light attacks deal massive damage if they connect. It’s a very high-risk, high-reward character.","What’s more, by landing multiple <Just Guards>, you build up a special gauge that lets you unleash the powerful ultimate attack. Basically, unless you can press the Guard button with perfect timing against enemy attacks, you can’t use this character effectively at all. It’s an extremely difficult character to master.","The timing for a <Just Guard> is brutally precise; honestly, I have no confidence that I could handle that character myself. But if you do manage to master it, it becomes ridiculously powerful, so much so that there were even top-level players in official tournaments who chose this character.","In the end, Kuro continued to overwhelm Lilia-san from start to finish, securing victory in the second round. Seriously though, the way she played looked like someone who had spent an insane amount of time mastering the game...... but where did she even get that much practice?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [As expected, Kuro is overwhelmingly strong...... Actually, I feel like she’s going to completely crush Kaito in the exhibition match too.]","? ? ? : [No need to worry. For those kinds of situations, we’ll adjust the stats to match the opponent...... So, with that in mind, please prepare the character stat adjustments for Kaito-san in case Kuro-san advances.]","Airhead God : [Leave it to me.]","Serious-senpai : [Ahh......]"]},{"number":2210,"title":"Chapter 2210: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 12","paragraphs":["While keeping an eye on the tournament in the meantime and also spinning the garapon to receive several presents, it seemed that the first tournament had advanced to the finals, so I decided to watch it.","The four who advanced to the finals were: Kuro, who was exceptionally skilled even among the players I’d been watching, Amel-san, Eul...... and then, compared to the three of them, clearly lower in ability but fortunate enough not to be placed in a block with highly skilled players, managing to win through by luck of the draw, and now standing on the stage with dead-fish-like eyes, Eris-san.","No, it’s not that Eris-san is bad at the game. Being human, she didn’t have to struggle with lag in reaction speed, and she quickly got used to the controls, steadily defeating opponents who were having trouble handling them and making her way up through the tournament.","However, compared to Kuro, who had clearly mastered the game and stood head and shoulders above the rest, Amel-san, who had tons of experience and deep knowledge of both characters and mechanics, and Eul, who had rapidly honed her ability with skill rivaling Lilia-san’s, Eris-san was noticeably outmatched. She seemed well aware of this too, wearing a look that all but said \"How did I even make it this far......?\"","\"Now then, we’re finally at the finals! Fate-san, how do you see this match going?\"","\"Hmm~~ Well, Kurorin is obviously the strongest here. If it were a one-on-one, I’d say Kurorin would win for sure, but since it’s a four-player brawl, taking into account other factors such as item spawns, I guess it’ll really depend on how things play out.\"","Just as Fate-san said, among the finalists, Kuro was the clear favorite to win. If Amel-san and Eul teamed up and focused their attacks on Kuro, things could get interesting...... But for the finals, Kuro had chosen a technical character specialized in mid-to-long range combat. While tricky to handle, the character's ability to fight from a distance made it well-suited for facing multiple opponents.","Kuro likely anticipated being targeted by others and had strategies in place to handle that, so she still had the advantage.","As the finals began, things unfolded as expected, Kuro took the lead early. Of course, Amel-san and Eul were skilled players who had made it this far, and Kuro did take a fair amount of damage, making it an exciting match.","Unfortunately, Eris-san couldn’t keep up with the high-level gameplay and was eliminated fairly early. That said, she seemed relieved, as if a weight had been lifted from her shoulders.","The heated battle took a decisive turn when Kuro cleverly outmaneuvered Eul and knocked her out of the match. As Fate-san had predicted, once it came down to a one-on-one, Kuro’s superiority was clear. Even though Amel-san fought tenaciously, Kuro ultimately overwhelmed her and secured victory.","\"It’s decided! The winner of the first tournament is Kuro-san!\"","\"Wow~~ that was a better match than I expected. Kurorin was in real danger if she’d taken just a few more hits......\"","Then, Alice presented Kuro with the trophy...... and next up was the exhibition match———- against me.","\"Now then, as the champion, Kuro-san will challenge Kaito-san in an exhibition match! It looks like the present-giving is just about wrapped up, so let’s start right away. Kuro-san, is that alright with you?\"","[Unn, I’m ready. Kaito-kun, let's have a good match.]","[G- Go easy on me......]","To be honest, after watching the finals, I didn’t think I stood a chance against Kuro...... W- Well, I decided not to worry about winning or losing and just enjoy the game.","Ein-san handed me a controller, and a large monitor appeared in the venue. This match would be a one-on-one between me and Kuro, using an HP system...... both of us starting with 999 HP, and the winner would be whoever managed to deplete the other’s stock of 2 lives.","I chose a well-balanced character that was easy to use, while Kuro went with a powerful but technical character.","\"Alright, exhibition match...... start!\"","At the announcement, Kuro’s character charged straight toward me.","The character Kuro picked this time had abilities that changed progressively depending on how much damage they had taken, the more damage they took, the stronger they became.","Especially in an HP-based match, once their HP dropped below 100, they boasted overwhelming strength unmatched by any other character. However, mastering this character required carefully managing damage intake, and to unleash their full potential, you had to fight in a near-death state. Definitely a character for advanced players.","As Kuro’s character approached, I threw out a light normal attack as a feint, but Kuro didn’t even try to dodge and took the hit directly. Her character was the type that really didn’t get started until it took some damage, so it seemed she intended to regulate her damage intake by deliberately eating some attacks...... Honestly, the feint I instinctively threw out at her sudden approach played right into her hands...... it was exactly what she wanted me to do.","And then, just as she planned, Kuro’s character, who had intentionally taken the low-powered attack...... got blown away by an absurd \"over-500-damage\" hit.","[Wha?! Ehh...... W- Wait! Time out! Time out!!! Shalltear! You said Kaito-kun’s character had stat buffs...... but just how much did you boost him?!]","Kuro looked clearly blindsided, not that I could blame her. Honestly, I was just as dumbfounded myself...... Sure, I had heard my character would be buffed, but since the character’s speed and such hadn’t changed, I hadn’t really felt it yet. But with an attack dealing 500 damage just now, I couldn’t help but think...... any proper hit from me might just be an instant kill......","\"Ah, it seems we hadn’t explained that part in detail. Let’s pause the match for a moment and go over it...... As for Kaito-san’s character, while their movements and animations remain the same...... their base stats have been enhanced. The extent of this enhancement varies depending on the opponent’s skill level, the stronger the opponent, the greater the buff. The final adjustment is generally made by Canalis-san after assessing the opponent, but in Kuro-san’s case, due to her personal request...... Shallow Vernal-sama was put in charge of the balancing.\"","[Of all people, why did you let Shiro handle that?! Shiro is the last person you should’ve left this to!! Shiro! How much did you boost Kaito-kun’s character?!]","[I raised the stats by \"50 times\".]","[F- Fifty......]","No wonder the damage numbers were ridiculous. That light feint attack, under normal circumstances, should’ve dealt barely over 10 damage...... if it was multiplied by 50, then yeah, 500 damage makes perfect sense.","[If I take a proper hit, wouldn't that basically mean instant death!?]","[That’s correct.]","[.....................]","[.....................]","[............No, I mean...... my character will just get one-shot, won’t it?]","[Is that supposed to be a problem?]","[See?! This is exactly why you should never let Shiro handle things!!!]","While Kuro protested that the buff was way too excessive, Shiro tilted her head in wonder, as if she couldn’t understand what the issue was...... Well, I guess you could say this was typical of Shiro-san.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [By the way, Kaito-san’s character has had their ATK and DEF increased by 50 times, and some of their techniques have been enhanced by Shallow Vernal-sama.]","Serious-senpai : [......In the first place, expecting a sense of balance from that airheaded god is a mistake.]"]},{"number":2211,"title":"Chapter 2211: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 13","paragraphs":["Kuro had been fiercely protesting to Shiro, who had gone wild with her natural airheadedness and applied some outrageous buffs, but after a while, she let out a sigh with a somewhat resigned expression.","[......Hahh, well...... as long as I understand what’s going on, there’s still a way. Let’s continue...... Here I come, Kaito-kun!]","[Eh? Y- Yeah......]","I wondered if it might be better to reset and readjust the status settings, but it seemed Kuro could still see a chance of victory, as she closed in on my character once again.","Wondering what to do, I threw out a preemptive attack just like before. Kuro used the invincibility frames that occur during guard step movement to dodge it and close the distance between us.","Pulling off an invincible dodge against a quick poke like that is a pretty difficult technique, but the fact that she did it so smoothly really shows Kuro’s skill.","Then, Kuro's character landed a heavy attack on mine...... but the damage was just 1. I see, my DEF is also boosted 50 times over, so it's no wonder the damage hardly gets through.","[......As expected, normal attacks won’t work. In that case!]","\"Oh! Kuro-san is pulling away from Kaito-san’s character and...... picked up a randomly spawned weapon item!\"","Ah, I see, there’s that option too...... In this game, various items, including weapons, spawn on the stage over time.","And the damage from these weapon items is a fixed value based on the weapon itself, independent of the character's DEF. So even with my DEF multiplied 50 times, she can still deal proper damage.","The weapons have different strengths, appear randomly, and break after a certain number of uses, but still, this gives Kuro a real fighting chance.","Kuro’s movement was sharper than mine, and with me being slightly flustered and not playing my best, she steadily dealt damage with the weapon, whittling away around 300 HP from my character.","Unn, with this, it feels like we can have a proper match. Alright then, before things get too heated, I’ll use the chance while Kuro is off collecting items to activate my healing skill.","One of the abilities of the character I’m using is a skill that restores a small amount of HP. The healing is only about 50 points, the animation takes a while, and if you get attacked during it, it fails. There’s also a big cooldown, so it’s not the most useful skill, but while Kuro is busy picking up items, I can squeeze in a little recovery.","As planned, Kuro didn’t have time to interrupt me, and as the healing skill activated...... my character’s HP shot past \"3000\".","[......SHIROOOOO!!! You even messed with the skills!?]","[Yes. I boosted the healing by 50 times, and I made the attack skills pierce through guards too.]","[If you do that, I’ve got zero chance of winning!!]","[Is there a problem?]","[......Maybe I should take out Shiro before fighting Kaito-kun......]","It must be devastating to think you’ve worked so hard to deal damage, only for me to recover it all instantly. Actually, it looks like she even messed with the HP cap, it’s over 999 now......","[......Shiro-san, this is way too unfair. Please reset it.]","[Fumu, if that's what Kaito-san says, I’ll reset it. I’ll return the HP to the previous value too.]","[Thank you...... Kuro, do you want the stats readjusted too?]","[No, that’s fine. As long as the skills aren’t completely busted, I can still fight. Kaito-kun, you go all out too, okay?]","Seeing Kuro’s bright smile, I brushed away my hesitation and gave a firm nod. Kuro seemed to genuinely be enjoying the challenge of taking on my ridiculously buffed character, so I decided not to overthink it and fight seriously.","As the battle resumed for the third time, Kuro’s character closed in, weapon in hand. What she currently has now is a melee weapon...... which likely meant she’d try to use invincibility dodges to get up close again.","With that in mind, I threw out the same preemptive attack as before, but this time, I immediately tilted the control stick in the opposite direction and pressed the Heavy Attack button.","By turning the character and attacking at the same time, I created a timing shift in the attack, a technique called a \"delayed strike\". It caught Kuro’s character just as her invincibility frames ended, dropping her HP to zero and launching her off the stage.","\"Ohhh! A sharp strike from Kaito-san lands cleanly! With just one Life left, Kuro-san has been cornered! ......Oya? Looks like Kuro’s signaling for a time-out again.\"","[......Um...... actually, could we adjust the stats too? I- I thought it’d be fine the way things were but...... Kaito-kun, you’re probably about as good as Amel-chan, and if you’re able to counter my feints like that...... yeah, I don’t think I can keep up......]","Seeing the surprised look on Kuro’s face, I couldn’t help but think \"Ah, that explains it\". Earlier, since my stats were so absurdly high, I’d been fighting a bit awkwardly, not sure what the best approach was. Kuro must have assumed that was the extent of my skill, and figured that even with a 50-fold stat difference, she could manage.","But in truth, I’m not exactly a slouch myself. After all, I usually play alongside Amel-san, and while she is stronger than me, I can hold my own against her well enough.","[......Shiro-san, adjust the stats as well please.]","[Understood. Let’s go with a 5-times boost......]","[U- Unn, that sounds reasonable...... At least I won’t get one-shotted like this.]","[Kuro, should we restart from scratch? You’re down one Life now.]","[......Hmm, nah, it’s fine. Let’s keep going. Now that my attacks will actually land, I can fight properly.]","With 5 times the stats and one Life left, considering the gap between our skill levels, this might actually be a fair handicap.","Without the risk of being taken out in a single hit, Kuro wouldn’t have to rely on risky invincible dodges anymore. Given her overall stronger fundamentals, even if I fight at full strength, it’s hard to say if I’ll win.","Well, no need to get too caught up in winning or losing. For now, I’ll just focus on giving it my all.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [By the way, how strong is Kaito?]","? ? ? : [Against Amel-san, his win rate is about 30 to 40 percent. Against Lilia-san, thanks to the difference in luck, he wins around 90 percent of the time. Even if he were to go up against Eulpecula-san, with the difference in experience and game knowledge, it'd probably be about 70:30 in Kaito-san's favor.]"]},{"number":2212,"title":"Chapter 2212: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 14","paragraphs":["The exhibition match with Kuro, after adjusting the stats and starting over, turned out to be a surprisingly good fight, if I do say so myself.","Since this game is designed to appeal to a broad audience, it’s structured so that, while beginners might struggle, those with some experience still have a solid chance to win, even against higher-level players.","What I pulled off earlier with the backhand strike is a good example. Many of the techniques in this game have large, favorable hitboxes, and the backhand specifically is a trick where, even though it’s aimed behind the character, it still generates a small but effective hitbox. Add to that the random elements like item spawns and stage hazards, and you’ve got a recipe for chaos.","Even when you’re smoothly pulling off combos, they can get interrupted by a randomly appearing item, and some items even grant temporary invincibility. Of course, skill plays a big role in who wins, no question about that. Kuro’s reactions are so sharp she can respond to movements that happen in mere frames, far beyond my capabilities. But, no matter how good she is, there are aspects of the game that just can’t be overcome by skill alone.","Take that backhand strike earlier, for example. From Kuro’s perspective, my character’s move probably looked like it was happening in slow motion. But, since her character was already in the middle of an invincible dodge with no way to cancel out, she ended up getting hit. There’s always a way to fight back.","Unlike when I had 50 times her normal power, Kuro's attacks this time were properly inflicting damage and were intense. Her natural skill meant she could quickly shave off one of my Lives, but I was still managing to chip away at her as well.","Since Kuro was using a character whose abilities change based on damage received, it’s likely she was intentionally taking some hits to power up. Even so, it didn’t seem like things were going exactly according to her plan. With my stats boosted 5 times over, she probably wanted to keep her HP just outside of the sudden death range, rather than push all the way to under 100 HP where her character’s abilities would fully shine. In the back-and-forth exchanges, I managed to win a few reads and land some solid damage.","In the end, when my character's HP dropped below 300, I made a lucky, well, almost instinctual, read. My attack slipped in between Kuro’s move and landed cleanly, clinching the victory.","\"And with that, match over! After a fierce battle, the winner is...... Kaito-san!\"","\"That was a close match. The 5-times stats adjustment turned out to be just the right balance. Against Kurorin, it worked perfectly as a handicap, and made for a thrilling back-and-forth. Actually, Kai-chan's pretty good himself. I bet he could have made it to the finals in a tournament.\"","Just like Fate-san said, if Kuro and I had fought without any adjustments, she would have won almost for sure. I’d say the handicap this time was spot on.","Well, to be fair, considering I had my stats boosted 5-fold and Kuro started with one Life already down, if we’d both started with 2 Lives, Kuro probably would’ve won.","[Aryaa~~ you totally outread me at the end there. Thanks, Kaito-kun! That was a great match.]","[Thank you too. But still, you were already down one Life, and if we’d been even from the start with my 5-times stat boost, I think you would’ve got the match.]","[Maybe so, but for me, just getting to play such a fun match with you is enough. Let’s do this again sometime, okay?]","Kuro didn’t seem the least bit dissatisfied with the outcome and wore a cheerful smile. Well, there wasn’t any prize for winning or losing anyway, it was just an exhibition match, so the fact that we had fun playing together must have been the most important thing for her.","As I was thinking that, Kuro, having put the controller back after finishing the game, came over to the chair where I was sitting.","[Well then, Kaito-kun, since you won, here's something...... consider it a victory gift from me.]","[Hm? A present?]","[Chuuu...... Ehehe, well then, enjoy the rest of the birthday party!]","With a playful glint in her eyes, Kuro kissed me on the cheek and then waved before walking away. It caught me off guard, and while it was a little embarrassing, I couldn’t help feeling happy.","\"Whoa there, Kuro-san sure is bold...... Oi, you Gods over there, don’t you dare start thinking things like \"Should we join the second tournament too?\" or whatever! That just now wasn’t some kind of winner’s privilege or anything, okay? You lot better sit down and behave!\"","[Isn’t it unfair that only Kuro gets to do that?]","[That’s right! Only Kuromueina getting to do that is totally unfair!]","\"It’s not about fairness, okay? Setting aside Shallow Vernal-sama, who is Kaito-san’s lover, as for you, Makina, even if you did have such a right, it’d still be a no-go.\"","How should I say this...... Having Alice take charge of things in situations like this was really reassuring. She wasn’t afraid to put her foot down with people like Shiro-san or Makina-san, firmly telling them no when needed. It really helped keep everything under control.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Oi, cut it out with the sudden lovey-dovey stuff. I was seriously watching the game, and it felt like I just got slapped out of nowhere......]"]},{"number":2213,"title":"Chapter 2213: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 15","paragraphs":["Now then, the first tournament has ended, and the second tournament is about to begin. Since people who were just observing at first will start participating, it looks like there will be more participants than in the first round earlier.","Also, it seems that those who made it to the finals have to sit this one out and take a break, so Kuro, Amel-san, Eul, and Eris-san will just be watching this time.","Well, Kuro seems satisfied with winning once, and from now on, she plans to watch the tournament while coaching her family members who are still not used to the game instead of participating.","And since there are more participants in the second tournament, I figured it would take some time until my exhibition match, so I decided to use this chance to go ahead and spin the prize lottery.","<EX4>","Oh, I pulled another EX here. Wasn’t this a gift from an Otherworld World Creator? In that case, should I have Ein-san call for Canalis-san?","Just as I thought that, Canalis-san appeared right next to me and handed me a wrapped package.","[EX4 would be this one.]","[T- Thank you...... this is...... a knitted hat, I think?]","When I opened the package I received, there was a warm-looking knitted hat inside. I wondered if this also had some kind of incredible effect, and looked toward Canalis-san.","Noticing my doubt, Canalis-san began to explain about the knitted hat.","[Yes. That knitted hat was apparently hand-knitted with great effort...... that’s all.]","[Eh? Unn?]","[Ahh~~ I understand what you’re thinking, Kaito-sama. You’re probably wondering if, since it’s something made by a World Creator, it might have some mysterious, superhuman effect like the one earlier, right? Tahaa~~ actually, you see, even among World Creators, there’s a wide range of power levels. I myself am among the Omniscient and Omnipotent, but there are those who are not so good at anything else, yet excel solely in World Creation. There are also some special cases, like where she just happen to acquire World Creation items made by other Gods and created a world by chance, so their own abilities are actually quite low.]","[Ah, I see. Now that you mention it, it makes sense that there would be differences in power.]","Speaking of which, I recall hearing that the Great Evil God who created the world where Alice originally came from also didn’t have very high abilities. I think I heard that they created the world at the cost of most of their own power and ended up losing most of their abilities.","Of course, from my perspective as a human, the fact that they could create a world at all already makes them incredibly powerful, but among World Creators, it seems safe to say their ability level was on the lower side.","[Incidentally, the World Creator who prepared that gift falls into the latter category. She was actually a survivor from a world that another World Creator had made and abandoned.]","[A World Creator abandoned their world?]","[Yes, this may sound astonishing, but there are some irresponsible ones out there who, on a whim, create a world, but then get bored of managing it or lose interest. Since it’s troublesome to destroy it, they just leave the world as is, go elsewhere, or create a new world altogether. Tahaa~~ Well, I’ve actually left the management of my own created world to an acquaintance myself, so I can’t exactly speak too harshly but...... there really are a lot of worlds out there that have been abandoned by their creators.]","It’s a rather lonely thought, but, well, it’s not surprising that such worlds exist.","[Anyhow, the World Creator who sent this gift was a survivor of one of those forsaken, ruined worlds. She happened to obtain a tool left behind by the World Creator, and while she couldn't do anything about her collapsing world with her own power, she used that tool to create a new world and relocate the inhabitants of her old world. Thanks to the God-crafted tool she acquired, she became immortal and can do anything the tool allows, but outside of that, she’s mostly powerless.]","[What an incredible story that is. And so, this hand-knitted knit cap......]","[Yes. She asked other World Creator to share information about Kaito-sama's previous world, then chose something she could make herself, using materials similar to those from her own world, and knitted it herself. Now then, let me relay the message she entrusted to me......","<Happy birthday. I worry that, having suddenly found yourself in such an important position, you might be feeling confused or mentally exhausted, much like I once was. You might be surprised to receive a gift from an unfamiliar person, but I would be happy if this helps you know that there are those outside your world who are thinking of you. Please continue to do your best, but don’t push yourself too hard.>","......Message End]","[Thank you. Please tell her I will treasure it.]","[Yes. Understood.]","Surely, she must have become a World Creator out of a desire to protect her friends and family in her dying world. I could somewhat feel her gentle nature conveyed through her message.","Truly...... It was a really wonderful gift that warmed my heart.","<Afterword>","\"The Girl Who Became a World Creator\"","In a world abandoned by its original creator, left to decay and destined for ruin, a girl happened upon a tool once used by the World Creator to shape the world, a tool left behind and forgotten. Though she tried desperately to save her original world, the tool wasn’t meant for such a purpose and could not halt its decline. Instead, she used it to create a new world and evacuated the inhabitants there. As compensation for using the World Creator’s tool, her nature became similar to that of a World Creator, and she became immortal. Later, the original World Creator, furious over the unauthorized use of their tool, attacked her. However, Nebula, who happened to be nearby, effortlessly defeated the enraged creator. Upon hearing the girl's story, Nebula used her overwhelming power to restore the ruined world, merged it with the new one the girl had created to allow free passage between the two, and even forged tools to help manage them, gifting them to the girl free of charge. Having gone through all this, she came to deeply admire Nebula. Though she possesses the powers needed to manage a world in the form of tools, her base abilities are so low that they’re nearly on par with Kaito’s. She feels genuine gratitude toward Kaito, who was the trigger for Nebula’s revival, and shares a certain sense of kinship with him due to their similar circumstances. For the record, she belongs to the Die-Hard Devotees Fan Club."]},{"number":2214,"title":"Chapter 2214: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 16","paragraphs":["While I was receiving birthday presents in order, I also took a look at the second tournament, and compared to the first one, the matches seemed to be progressing a bit more slowly. By that, I mean there were more heated battles.","It was probably because there were participants who had trained during the practice period or had gotten the hang of things from the first tournament, leading to closer and longer matches.","Among them, there were also a few people who caught my attention for their skill, separate from the first tournament. First of all, Isis-san...... she's simply good. She wasn't fighting in a flashy way, but her style was very steady. Using a character that specializes in long-range attacks, she kept her distance and fought steadily.","Since this game uses wireless controllers, Isis-san was able to keep a safe distance from others without the influence of her magic power of death and enjoy playing with people she normally wouldn't be able to interact with, so she seemed to be having a really good time.","And then, there's Blossom-san, who was also quite skilled. I wouldn't say she was at the level of Lilia-san or Eul, but she had improved a lot in a short time, and her control was good enough to call her a fully-fledged player.","However, from time to time, she would exclaim things like \"T- This is the legendary Iai!? A- Amazing!!!\" or \"A true samurai cloaks their blade in lightning!? I- I see, that's very educational......\". Using a samurai-like character, she was getting pretty excited, making a big deal out of it, and leaving herself open here and there.","Well, the character she was using is indeed a samurai-type character but...... the thing about cloaking the blade in lightning is just because it's a game character, real samurai obviously didn’t do things like that...... but well, I suppose for Blossom-san, this is a rare opportunity to witness an authentic samurai, I guess.","What surprised me though, was that Megiddo-san, who seemed like the type to get really into these kinds of tournaments, wasn't participating and instead was staying in the practice area the whole time. Moreover, she wasn't just quietly practicing by herself, she was watching all kinds of players and nodding with deep interest.","[What is Megiddo-san doing?]","[She was muttering \"I see, this is well made. Even people with differences in physical ability or magic power can compete on almost equal footing...... Interesting. But could it be replicated? No, if I only replicate the pseudo-combat aspects, perhaps...... But would that make it too large-scale?\".]","[A- Ah, I see. She does seem like she'd enjoy competitive games like this, and she's thinking about whether she could recreate it with magic tools.]","[It appears so. Megiddo has been very interested in otherworld competitions lately, like how she recently held a tournament for otherworld's singing contest.]","......That UTA battle from Harmonic Symphony huh...... Sounds like she really went and built a dedicated facility for it. Well, that’s just like Megiddo-san, I guess. Rather than leaving it as just a bit of fun for the moment, she’s thinking about how to carry it forward into something bigger, which is honestly pretty impressive.","I don’t know exactly what she’s planning to make, but from what I could gather from what Ein-san told me about her muttering, it seems like she's thinking about something where people with different levels of physical strength could still fight on equal footing......","[......Ein-san, I’d like to think it’s just my imagination, but why is Megiddo-san so interested in something that lets people with differing physical abilities fight evenly?]","[Most likely, just as you are imagining, Kaito-sama...... Megiddo probably wants to have a match with you on equal terms. Compared to before, Megiddo seems to have developed quite a strong interest in Kaito-sama...... or rather, she appears to be plotting how to escalate things to a physical relationship with you...... Well, she keeps getting scolded by Kuromu-sama over it.]","[......I- I see......]","Skipping over the process for now, it seems that Megiddo-san is thinking along the lines of jumping straight to a physical relationship. However, thanks to repeated scoldings from Kuro and Alice, she appears to be trying to come up with a strategy in her own way.","I really hope it's not some straightforward plan like engaging in an intense battle, getting both parties fired up, and then using the post-fight heat of the moment to make a move...... If it is, Megiddo-san is likely to get another scolding...... Well, in any case, since she's seriously mulling things over, it looks like she isn't participating in the tournament.","Trying to avoid thinking too much about reality, I decided to spin the raffle.","<ERIS DIA HAMILTON>","Ah, next is Eris-san huh...... Seems like it’ll be a bit of a breather.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [This devil here trying to land a body blow just when she was relieved that, as a finalist in the first tournament, she didn’t have to participate in the second one......]"]},{"number":2215,"title":"Chapter 2215: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 17","paragraphs":["After drawing Eris-san in the garapon lottery machine, Ein-san went to speak with her, and before long, Eris-san arrived as well.","[Hello, Kaito-sama. Today is quite an auspicious day. Please accept my heartfelt blessings.]","[Thank you very much. Eris-san, you advanced to the finals in the tournament earlier, didn’t you?]","[I was fortunate with the matchups. Honestly, it was rather nerve-wracking to make it to the finals, but I’m glad I had the chance to experience entertainment from another world. As a marquis’ daughter, I always try to gather knowledge, but I realized there are still so many things I don't know. Your skills were splendid, Kaito-sama. Your match against Underworld King-sama was truly wonderful.]","[That game was pretty popular in my world too, so I had a decent amount of experience with it.]","With a gentle smile, Eris-san naturally kept the conversation flowing without sounding forced. I had thought this before, but Eris-san is really good at conversation. Perhaps it’s because, as a noble, she’s had plenty of opportunities to refine her communication skills in social settings. Talking with her is enjoyable, and it makes the conversation lively.","Of course, her good personality is probably a big part of it too, but regardless, she’s definitely someone easy to talk to.","[......Pardon me, I ended up chatting before getting to the main point. Once again, happy birthday. It’s just a small gift, but I’ve brought something for you.]","[Thank you very much...... Arehh? This magic tool looks kind of familiar...... Is this the same type as the portable villa?]","What Eris-san handed me as a present was a magic tool shaped like a rather large bag. I already have similar ones, like the cottage-type one Isis-san bought at the Six Kings Festival auction, and the one I used when I went out with Anima, so it seemed similar to those.","[Yes, it’s something like that. However, it’s not a building. You could think of it as an athletic play area where you can play together with your pet, that might be an easier way to understand it.]","[Eh? There’s something like that too huh......]","[In Archlesia Empire, monster race tracks are quite famous, and compared to other places, there are many of our nobles who keep monsters as pets. So, there are quite a few products aimed at monster pets, and this is one of them. I remember you once mentioned that your pet Behemoth enjoys carrying you on its back, so I selected a playset suitable for riding monsters.]","Come to think of it, I do remember casually chatting about going on walks while riding Bell’s back when I visited Nifty’s café. It looks like Eris-san remembered that conversation and picked out something accordingly.","[This requires a fairly large, open space to set up, so normally it’s not very suitable as a gift...... but I thought in your case, Kaito-sama, it wouldn’t be a problem. Originally, it’s a playset meant for riding monsters, but since I heard you also keep a White Dragon as a pet, I had it specially modified so that both your Behemoth and White Dragon could enjoy it.]","[O- Ohh...... Amazing. I really have been wanting to let Bell and Lynn play more freely, so this is honestly such a wonderful gift. I’m really looking forward to using it.]","[I’m delighted to hear that you’re pleased with it.]","No, really, this makes me genuinely happy...... and knowing that there are actually playground sets sold for Bell and Lynn is a big discovery.","In Symphonia Kingdom, aside from grooming supplies and the like, play equipment wasn’t really sold much, and even when it was, it was mostly for small monsters. So finding out that in Archlesia Empire, they sell equipment for large or rideable monsters is a big deal.","Bell and Lynn will definitely enjoy this, and I’m really looking forward to using it.","[Ah, right. If it’s alright with you, Eris-san, would you like to come over to my house sometime, whenever it’s convenient for you?]","[Hyuh...... Ah? Eh? Errr...... to your house, Kaito-sama?]","[Yes, I’d like to introduce you to Bell and Lynn too...... Of course, only if you’re comfortable with it.]","[I would be truly honored, but would it really be alright for someone like me to visit? I wouldn’t be a bother?]","[Of course not. Eris-san, you’re a very dear friend and someone I trust deeply, so I’d be really happy if you could come.]","[U- Um, Kaito-sama, your words...... your choice of words is...... Ah, no, thank you very much. If Kaito-sama is willing, then by all means.]","For a moment, Eris-san had a distant look in her eyes, but she quickly gave a gentle smile and nodded. Honestly, I’d be really happy if Eris-san came to visit. She gave me such a wonderful present, so I’d love to properly welcome her when the time comes.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Those with strength around Count-rank and above can hear this conversation just fine, right?]","? ? ? : [Yeah, that’s right.]","Serious-senpai : [......If there’s a noble who’s earned that much trust from Kaito, there’s bound to be some of the Six Kings' executives who’d want to build connections with them too, right?]","? ? ? : [There probably are. Especially those who have ties to the Archlesia Empire......]","Serious-senpai : [Man, she’s seriously way too capable. Even with this gift, she properly picked something that would make Kaito happy. I mean, she gave him something that would delight the pet-loving Kaito, and at the same time sparked his interest in Archlesia Empire———— it’s a brilliant move, honestly...... But as a result, Kaito’s favorability towards her keeps skyrocketing, and now she’s suffering stomach pains out of pure goodwill...... I’ve got a feeling Eris is about to get another bout of stomachache......]"]},{"number":2216,"title":"Chapter 2216: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 18","paragraphs":["Having finished giving her birthday present to Kaito and offering a brief greeting, Eris stepped down from the stage and let out a quiet sigh of relief in her heart.","(......With this, the most important part is done for now. Even though I still can’t let my guard down completely, I do feel a bit more at ease...... But still...... there’s no other word for this scale but \"overwhelming\". According to Phantasmal King-sama, only those who have already been introduced to Kaito-sama are present here today, so Father and Mother couldn’t come...... Well, perhaps it was better that they didn’t. Not only are the top figures of the world gathered here, but even Otherworld Gods have come...... Even I, who am fairly used to parties, can’t help but feel intimidated.)","Since Eris got acquainted with Kaito after the previous shipboard party, she had no knowledge of what it had been like. This was her first time seeing Kaito's acquaintances gathered together like this, and it was fair to say she was overwhelmed by the sheer lineup of formidable individuals.","Still, thanks to her rigorous education as a lady, she managed not to let her nervousness show, maintaining an appearance of calm and composure to those around her.","(What’s truly fortunate is that there aren’t many people here whom I would personally call acquaintances. Or rather, as I’d heard from Kaito-sama, there really are very few nobles here. For such a large-scale party, with all these top figures from various countries present, it feels a bit strange to see so few nobles.)","Kaito’s circle of friends included remarkably few nobles, but that didn’t mean it was filled with commoners either. In fact, nearly all the well-known Peak Count-rank Demons were present, along with many other prominent figures, creating a scene that could easily be described as extremely sparse in terms of nobility.","(I was surprised to see the Scott Count couple here. While they are certainly influential nobles in Symphonia with considerable wealth, I didn’t think they had much connection to Kaito-sama, since they’re not particularly close to the Albert Duchy...... But then again, if I say that, I myself am from the Hamilton Marquisdom of Archlesia Empire, so it’s possible they simply happened to meet somewhere by chance. It seems there aren’t any nobles from the Hydra Kingdom here...... That said, that country has many nobles who have returned their titles to become merchants, and in the first place, they have very few nobles.)","Listening to the lively sounds of the tournament while strolling at a leisurely pace, Eris considered her next course of action. From her standpoint, it seemed prudent to engage in conversation with people from Archlesia Empire...... or perhaps, nobles from Human Realm.","There were some high-status individuals connected to Kaito of whom she was also acquainted with, such as members of the Seven Princesses, the Founder, or Rasal, but since they weren’t particularly close, and she wasn’t with Kaito at the moment, she thought it best to keep her greetings brief and not engage in long conversations.","(There are many people here with whom I would be pleased to establish a connection, but if I were to approach them at an occasion like this, I might be seen as having ulterior motives. Besides, I am participating here as an individual, not as a representative of the Hamilton Marquisdom, so I should avoid interactions that seem aimed at networking. More importantly, I don’t want to behave in a way that appears to take advantage of Kaito-sama’s connections. Basically, I’ll focus on light conversations with people I know among the Humans, and if someone approaches me, I’ll respond accordingly......)","Eris calmly analyzed the situation in her mind and thought about her next actions. However...... regrettably, when it came to matters involving Kaito, such safe and predictable expectations rarely went according to plan.","[Excuse me, may I have a moment of your time?]","[Yes, what is it——!?]","[If I’m not mistaken, are you the lady of the Hamilton Marquisdom......]","[Y- Yes. I am the heir of the Hamilton Marquis family, Eris Dia Hamilton. I’ve heard much about you.]","[Ah, no need to be so formal. It seems you already know, but allow me to introduce myself as well...... I am Satania Darklord, President of Lord Trading Company.]","It was none other than Ten Demon's Moloch...... or as she introduced herself, Satania, who suddenly spoke to her.","(T- The President of Lord Trading Company, one of the Five Great Companies, said to possess wealth rivaling that of entire nations, the Daemon Lord Satania Darklord herself, w- why is she speaking to me!? I mean, it’s true the Lord Trading Company is based in Archlesia Empire but...... as far as I know, they have never been any dealings with the Hamilton family. If she were to talk with my father, the head of the family, I could understand, but why me? I'm just the young lady of the family.)","Eris, unable to comprehend why such a prominent figure would speak to someone like her, a mere marquis lady, was bewildered. Yet, Satania addressed her with a gentle expression.","[Forgive me for approaching you so suddenly. Thinking of the future, I thought it would be wise to at least offer a greeting.]","[Is that directed toward our Hamilton Marquisdom?]","[No...... Perhaps, in the future, we may have transactions or other dealings with your family, but I wished to greet you personally, Lady Eris, not as a representative of your family.]","[M- Me personally? B- But, I don’t possess anything that would be worthy of the attention of the Lord Trading Company......]","[There is no need for false modesty. Simply being highly valued by Miyama Kaito-sama is worth far more than mountains of gold and silver treasures. Both as an individual and as the President of the Lord Trading Company, I intend to keep a close eye on your future. If there is anything I can do to assist you, do not hesitate to reach out to us.]","[Y- Yesh...... I- It would be my honor......]","Though her words were rather roundabout, what Satania was saying was clear: \"if Eris ever wished to propose any dealings or seek assistance, the Lord Trading Company would be ready to respond\". Faced with such an unexpectedly high evaluation, Eris felt as if she might faint on the spot.","The reason Satania approached Eris was because she had overheard the earlier exchange between Kaito and Eris, and had realized how highly Kaito valued her. For someone in Archlesia Empire’s nobility to draw such attention from Kaito, Satania felt it was essential to make contact and establish a connection.","However, unaware that Satania was actually Ten Demon's Moloch and held immense loyalty toward Kaito...... Eris could not comprehend why she was being held in such high regard, and could only clutch her aching stomach in confusion.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Even though she’s competent and doesn’t give off any kind of useless vibe at all, she always gets smacked right after calmly analyzing the situation, so she ends up giving the impression of someone who, right after putting on a sharp, serious face, gets beaten to tears.]"]},{"number":2217,"title":"Chapter 2217: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 19","paragraphs":["Eris Dia Hamilton was an exceptionally talented woman, and above all her redeeming qualities, she possesses excellent adaptability. Although she was bewildered by the sudden approach and high praise from Satania this time, she was able to conclude the conversation without issue thanks to her experience in high society, the mannerisms she had acquired through her education as a lady, and the knowledge she had diligently accumulated through her studies.","(To think that I would be approached by the Lord Trading Company...... They're a company closely tied to the Archlesia Empire and a major supporter of the Reformist faction. Considering the future, making a connection here is quite significant. That said, precisely because of their influence, I’ll need to carefully plan how to use this connection, consulting with Father as well. Though this was unexpected...... incidents like this have often happened when it comes to Kaito-sama. There's no way to predict and prepare perfectly when it comes to matters related to Kaito-sama, so I’ll have to accept that unexpected situations will arise and focus on taking the best possible actions......)","Moreover, though she often found herself suffering stomachaches thanks to Kaito, perhaps because of her natural resilience, she had a tendency to recover quickly...... remarkably quickly, in fact.","Sadly, however, this very resilience only served to attract further causes of her stomachaches.","After parting ways with Satania, Eris started walking once again, intending this time to head towards the place where the people from the Human Realm were gathered...... but at that moment, a cheerful voice reached her ears, causing her to stop in her tracks.","[Ah~~! It’s Eris-san!]","[Oof, i- if it isn't Tir-sama...... It’s been since we last met in Symphonia. It is an honor to see you again.]","[Yes! Tir is also happy to see you again~~!]","[Tir~~? And who might this person be?]","The one who appeared was Tirtania. Though Eris was startled by the sudden encounter, she quickly regained her composure and greeted her with a smile.","However, upon seeing Razelia, who was with Tirtania, Eris rapidly set her thoughts in motion.","(Who could this be? Judging by appearance, she’s a Fairy, and her magic power is immense. Comparable, even, to Tir-sama herself...... but a Fairy with such power?)","Razelia was, in fact, the first Fairy King, but since her reign had taken place over 10,000 years ago, and because she belonged to the Underworld King faction, which lacked distinct positions like Executives, few were aware of her existence.","Just as Rejnhardt hadn’t recognized Razelia during the Sacred Tree Festival, Eris too found herself unable to recall Razelia’s identity.","[Raz-sama, this is Eris-san, a friend of Kaitokun-san!]","[Aya!? So you’re a friend of Kaitokun-san! Nice to meet you~~ I’m Razelia, but please, just call me Raz.]","[Thank you for your courtesy, Raz-sama. I am Eris Dia Hamilton. Please, I would be honored if you would call me Eris as well.]","However, unlike Rejnhardt, who despite his experience as a Court Mage leaned closer to being an ordinary citizen, Eris, as a full-blooded noble, had access to far more information.","Observing Tirtania’s demeanor and hearing Razelia’s name, she began to formulate her deductions.","(Since Tir-sama is addressing Raz-sama with \"sama\", that would suggest Raz-sama holds a higher position than Tir-sama...... or at least one equal to hers, I would presume. As for the name Razelia, I feel like I’ve heard it somewhere before...... A- Ahh, that’s it! I’m fairly certain the manager of the Grand Fairy Farm is named Razelia-sama...... Most likely, Raz-sama belongs to the Underworld King's faction. The Underworld King's faction doesn’t act in an organized way, so aside from a few individuals, there isn’t much information available...... but I’m confident in this.)","Drawing on her extensive knowledge to deduce Razelia’s affiliation, Eris offered a gentle smile as she spoke.","[I apologize if I’m mistaken, but could you be the one who manages the Grand Fairy Farm under Underworld King-sama?]","[Yes! Raz grows lots and lots of vegetables!]","[I thought so. The rumors of the vegetables from the Grand Fairy Farm have even spread far and wide throughout the Human Realm. It is an honor to meet you.]","Now that she knew who her conversation partner was, Eris also understood how to steer the discussion, and she let out a quiet breath of relief in her heart.","Though Razelia was unquestionably someone of high status, her sociable personality, combined with the fact that Tirtania, whom Eris had already spoken with once before, was also present, made the conversation easier, and Eris began to feel a small measure of ease.","However, that small comfort...... was promptly shattered into pieces.","[Raz~~ Ahh, you were with Tir-chan huh. I came to get you because one of the practice game machines opened up over there...... Arehh? And this child is......?]","[Ahyii...... U- U- Un...... Underworld King-sama......]","At the sight of the newly arrived Kuromueina, Eris felt a sharp pain, as though her stomach had been suddenly twisted tight.","<Afterword>","~ ~ A Simple Summary ~ ~","Eris: (`・ω・ ́) → ( ́;ω;`)","Serious-senpai: [In place of Lilia, who's still relatively at peace in this party, she's the one getting her stomach thoroughly pummeled......]"]},{"number":2218,"title":"Chapter 2218: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 20","paragraphs":["Among the Six Kings, the Underworld King Kuromueina is generally known, along with Lillywood, for being mild-mannered. Due to her friendly personality and her hobby of travelling to try out different foods, she is someone who is deeply admired even in the Human Realm.","However, on the other hand, perhaps due to a lack of interest in grand events, or perhaps in consideration of the power balance within the nation itself or between various nations, she rarely attends parties hosted by nobility or royalty in person, often sending a representative instead. Because of this, many nobles have never actually spoken with Kuromueina herself.","Eris was no exception to this. At the very least, since the time of her birth, Kuromueina had never attended any of the evening parties or social events that Eris had participated in, making this their very first meeting.","[Kuromu-sama! This is Eris-san, a friend of Kaitokun-san!]","[Ahh, I’ve heard about you from Kaito-kun. I’ve been wanting to talk to you sometime.]","[ ! ? ......It is a pleasure to greet the Compassionate King of the Demon Realm. I am Eris Dia Hamilton, heir to the Hamilton Marquisdom of Archlesia Empire.]","Upon hearing Kuromueina’s words, Eris gave a refined and graceful bow with the utmost formality. However, inwardly, she was on the verge of panic.","(Haaeehhh, h- how did this happen!? Why was I allowed to speak to her......? I- It’s because I was introduced as Kaito-sama’s friend...... right? H- His influence really is on an entirely different level......)","The other party was essentially the leader of the Demon Realm. For someone of Eris’ standing, even if they met in a situation like this, it would normally be extremely difficult to formally greet her. In fact, to carelessly greet her and interrupt her actions would be seen as a serious discourtesy———— even if Kuromueina herself didn't mind, it is one that could be considered the end of a noble’s reputation. It would also be a perfect excuse for political opponents to use against her or the Hamilton family.","Had Kuromueina simply said something like \"Sorry for interrupting, can I talk to Raz a bit?\" or responded to Razelia’s introduction with a simple \"I see, nice to meet you\", Eris had planned to exchange only a few brief words and withdraw without a formal self-introduction.","However, because Kuromueina had said \"I’ve been wanting to talk to you\", it essentially meant that Eris was granted permission to interact with her. Thus, Eris responded with a full formal introduction, including the household she belongs to.","[I’m Kuromueina, nice to meet you. You can just call me Kuromu, most people call me that way.]","[I- I- I- It would be my honor, Kuromu-sama.]","Not only was she allowed to greet her, but she was also given permission to use her nickname, this nearly shattered Eris’s otherwise flawless polite smile.","Of course, the reason behind all this was Kaito. To Kuromueina, Kaito is someone special, someone she places immense trust in. If Kaito treats someone kindly and considers them a friend, then that person is someone Kuromueina can also consider a friend...... In short, Kuromueina was currently treating Eris as a new friend.","Of course, from Eris’s perspective, being treated with such favor from the very beginning without understanding why left her feeling like she might faint at any moment......","While Eris was having a conversation with Kuromueina, all the while feeling like her stomach was being torn apart, a short distance away, Lilia had an indescribable expression on her face.","[Milady? Is something the matter?]","[......No, it’s just...... I don’t know why, but even though I’ve never spoken to her before...... I feel this strange sense of sympathy toward Lady Eris...... Watching her is making my stomach start to hurt.]","[Ah~~ Now that you mention it, she might be in a situation somewhat similar to yours, Milady. Well, either way, you don't have to worry about her. After all, you still have ahead of you the inevitable meetings with Otherworld Gods who’ll come for Miyama-sama...... You have a rock-solid lineup waiting to ensure your stomach continues to suffer for the foreseeable future...... so for now, just enjoy the luxury of watching someone else’s misery from the sidelines.]","[Can you not say such terrifying things!? I’m trying my best not to think about that!!!]","[......Well, even if you look away, it’ll come eventually......]","While feeling a sense of kinship with Eris, Lilia also found herself involuntarily brushing gently her stomach at the mention of the future stomachaches Lunamaria had brought up, ones that would surely descend upon her in due time.","For now though, she simply wanted to cherish what little peace she had...... as if trying to soothe her poor, overworked stomach......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Yeah, that's right. Since she’s racked up a ton of favorability points with Kaito, her evaluation from everyone else has shot up too, giving her a massive boost to her starting reputation, which is why she’s now flustered...... sounds like Lilia’s in the same boat......]","? ? ? : [Well, strictly speaking, it’s not really their first meeting from Kuro-san’s perspective. She actually spoke to her during Hydra Kingdom's Founding Festival in a different dimension. So to Kuro-san, it’s more like \"Ahh, so she’s that girl from back then\", but since Eris-san hasn’t retained any of those memories, she’s reacting like it’s their first meeting.]","Serious-senpai : [Well, either way, all she did was ask for Laguna’s location back then, so yeah, it’s practically a first meeting.]"]},{"number":2219,"title":"Chapter 2219: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 21","paragraphs":["Inside the lively venue, restlessly glancing around as she walked was the former Hero Actor, Kaori Mizuhara...... Since she was here anyway, she'd decided to participate in the game tournament, but had lost in the third round. Now, she was wandering around the venue, looking for someone she knew.","(H- Hmm...... Compared to the previous ship party, there are more people here who look like regular folks, so I do feel a bit more at ease. But still, that just makes it harder to find anyone I know. Kaito-kun and I don’t have that many mutual acquaintances, so I hope I can at least spot Akane-san or someone......)","Unlike the ship party, this event wasn’t limited to prominent figures from various sectors. It also included servants from Lilia's household, the War King's subordinates, and even family members of the Underworld King. It wasn't a situation where every direction you looked was filled with famous faces.","That said, the increased number of attendees made it difficult to find anyone, and Kaori didn’t want to risk approaching a stranger———— there was always the chance that they were someone famous she didn’t recognize, which she wanted to avoid.","Kaori was an ordinary civilian. While she knew the names of the War King's Executives, she hadn’t actually seen many of them, so recognizing them at a glance was difficult. And when it comes to nobles, she's absolutely clueless.","In reality, there were only a few nobles present at the party, but Kaori had no way of knowing that.","As she shifted her gaze, thinking she should at least look for Akane or Shigenobu, she suddenly felt a tense and hostile presence up ahead.","[......Don’t make that unpleasant face. Today is a celebration for Miyama-sama. We can't afford any disturbances. You should be glad you're walking away with your life.]","[Walking away with my life? You know, they say the weaker the dog, the louder it barks. The howling of a brutish fool is quite irritating. It’s laughable for someone the likes of you to talk about my life. And I would prefer if a mutt like you refrained from speaking the lofty name of Miyama-sama, it’s unpleasant to my ears.]","[Oh? Is that so? If I’ve offended you, then I consider it a fortunate outcome, but the truly revolting pervert here is you, isn’t it? Can’t even assess yourself properly, how narrow-minded. And no, my missing eye isn't connected to this matter. At our level, that’s no handicap. The narrowness I’m talking about is in your mental outlook.]","[It’s almost comical to hear a brainless musclehead desperately try to sound sarcastic.]","Up ahead in Kaori’s path were Agni, War King's Head Executive, and Pandora, Phantasmal King's Head Executive...... two individuals infamous for being bitter rivals, glaring at each other and trading barbed remarks.","Of course, given the setting, neither of them was releasing magical pressure or showing any intent to escalate the situation physically. Even so, their mutual hatred was genuine, and neither wanted to be the first to back down, so they were locked in a fierce verbal clash.","(Ababababa, n- n- n- nope, this way is a no-go...... Let’s try somewhere else......)","Though they weren't clashing with their magic power, just witnessing two Duke-Rank Demons in a standoff was more than enough to make Kaori immediately change course and hurry in another direction.","She'd just barely avoided getting caught in an intense scene, only to find, a moment later, that another pair up ahead were also locked in a fierce glare.","[Well, of course, it goes without saying, really, but I am the God of Ocean...... THE GOD OF OCEAN! So naturally, I brought an ocean-themed gift. How about you, Eingana-san? Oh, could it be you went with something like sea serpent scales?]","[Oya, oya... how very simplistic———- ah no, I mean, how delightfully straightforward of you, Marine-san. It’s almost admirable how you feel the need to show off what you preside over in situations like this, as if you fear people might forget otherwise. As for me, well, even if I don’t give something ocean-related, the fact that I am the ruler of the great ocean is common knowledge. It’s a basic truth, so there’s no need for me to flaunt it. Unlike, say...... someone whose name recognition is somewhat lacking.]","[......Y- Yes, you’re absolutely right. That’s a wonderfully wise decision. As expected of the thoughtful and knowledgeable Eingana-san, I’m genuinely impressed. Yes, indeed...... Competing in a field where one stands no chance would be pointless. After all, someone like you could never surpass me when it comes to dominion over the ocean. It's a prudent and rational choice.]","[......Indeed. The authority granted by the God of Creation Shallow Vernal-sama is truly magnificent, isn't it? Yes, truly...... That said, to have nothing to boast of except the power that was bestowed upon you by a great being, it's rather pitiful, don't you think?]","[.....................]","[.....................]","This tense, spark-filled exchange of sarcasm and glares was between Marine and Eingana————- Though they’d both taken lessons from the previous ship party and refrained from clashing magical power or letting things escalate into a fight, they still clearly didn’t like each other, so the moment they were face-to-face, the taunting began.","For Kaori, who had stumbled upon this scene, it was more than enough to handle......","(H- Hyiiihh...... T- This spot’s no good either...... W- Well, with this many people around, I guess it’s only natural that some don’t get along. S- Scary...... Okay, let’s try somewhere else......)","Having now run into not one, but two of the most infamously antagonistic pairs in the entire venue, Kaori was having incredibly bad luck, but she still managed to pull herself away from the area.","Just then, as she reached a slightly more open part of the hall, she happened, completely by chance, to bump into someone approaching from another direction.","[......Oya?]","[Arehh?]","[This is......]","By some perfectly timed coincidence, the three of them...... Lilia, Eris, and Kaori came to a stop, ending up facing one another.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Three stomachache warriors...... it's here! ? ? ? !!!]","? ? ? : [Eh? What's here?]","Serious-senpai : [......Errr...... Seriousness?]","? ? ? : [Nope, not coming. I mean, I guess if you're talking about how their stomachache-inducing situations are serious for them, well, yeah, it's serious, I guess?]"]},{"number":2220,"title":"Chapter 2220: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 22","paragraphs":["If it were just a casual nod as they passed by without consciously acknowledging each other, it wouldn’t have been a problem, but since all three of them stopped in their tracks, it would be unnatural not to engage in conversation here.","And Kaori immediately took a waiting stance. Although being an Otherworlder made her somewhat special, Kaori was a commoner, and compared to Lilia, the head of a Duchy, and Eris, a marquis’s daughter, her position was lower. Therefore, it wouldn’t be appropriate for her to take action.","This was not a matter of hesitation, but a rational decision and a defensive strategy for the stress that would likely arise in the future. She totally wasn't having any cold sweat or crying \"Kaito-kun, help me!!!\" within her mind.","On the other hand, Eris also quietly took a waiting stance. She was a noble, and in Archlesia Empire, where the power of the aristocracy was strong, social hierarchy carried significant weight.","Since Lilia, the head of her own Duchy, was present, Eris, a marquis’s daughter, should not speak first, and even if she were to greet Lilia, she could not speak unless Lilia, being of higher status, initiated the conversation. Otherwise, it would be disrespectful.","Her poise, honed in high society, her calm judgment of the situation, and her serene demeanor gave off an aura of stability reminiscent of the grand World Tree.","......Now, with two out of the three adopting a waiting stance, the responsibility for initiating the conversation fell to Lilia.","As the head of a Duchy, she knew that if she didn’t take action in such a setting, the conversation wouldn’t proceed, so she first turned towards Eris and spoke.","[I believe you are Lady Eris from the Hamilton Marquisdom. I believe this would be the first time we’ve had the chance to greet each other, wasn't it? I am Lilia Albert, head of the Albert Duchy in Symphonia Kingdom.]","[I am Eris Dia Hamilton, the heir of the Hamilton Marquisdom in Alchresia Empire. It is an honor to have the opportunity to speak with you, the Beautiful White Rose of Symphonia.]","After Lilia introduced herself, Eris also bowed and returned the greeting. Kaori, observing their refined noble manners, thought \"Could it be that I could be left out of this loop?\", but immediately after, Lilia turned toward her and spoke.","[Kaori-san too, it’s been a while since the ship party, hasn’t it?]","[Ah, yes. It’s been a while.]","Kaori had visited Kaito’s home a few times for cooking advice after the ship party, and during that time, Lilia had been introduced to her, so they had met before, though their exchange had been brief.","Eris, too, had met Kaori before, and seeing that Lilia’s interaction with her had concluded, Eris also spoke up.","[Kaori-sama, thank you for visiting us last time.]","[Ah, yes. Thank you for the wonderful shopping experience. H- How should I say this...... even though we’re acquaintances, I do get nervous being surrounded by two nobles.]","[Please, feel free to relax. Neither Duchess Albert nor I would ever criticize something so trivial.]","[Yes, at this place, there’s no need to worry about titles. We’re all friends of Kaito-san here, and that’s what matters.]","Both Lilia and Eris were kind-hearted, and their words eased Kaori’s nervousness, causing her to relax slightly.","Just as the atmosphere between the three of them softened, and it seemed like a pleasant conversation was about to begin...... the calm was suddenly shattered.","[Lilia, may I ask you something?]","[S- Shallow Vernal-sama!?]","[ [ ! ? ! ? ] ]","All of a sudden, Shallow Vernal appeared and spoke to Lilia, causing Kaori and Eris's eyes to widen in shock.","(Abababababa, S- S- Shallow Vernal-sama!? Awawawa, t- this is the first time I’ve seen her this close...... H- Her divine beauty is incredible...... Ah, no, wait, before that, I can’t stop shaking, and I can hardly breathe!)","(W- What should I do...... I’m so stunned that my reaction was delayed. The correct response would be to immediately kneel, but at this moment, with her already engaged in conversation with Duchess Albert, suddenly moving would be disrespectful...... So I must wait for a pause in their conversation...... N- No, I also need to match the timing with Kaori-sama......)","Both Kaori and Eris were in a complete panic upon encountering the pinnacle of the world. The intense pressure they felt made both of them clutch their stomachs, experiencing excruciating stomachaches.","But unfortunately...... the situation didn’t end there.","[......Shallow Vernal, for you to frighten my child...... I cannot overlook this. Step away from my child immediately.]","[E- Eden-sama!?]","Immediately appearing right after was Eden, who had attended the ship party alongside Makina, glaring at Shallow Vernal as if to protect Kaori.","[I didn’t intend to frighten her.]","[Didn’t I tell you to suppress your magic power? Can you not comprehend that? Magic power cloaked in divine majesty will naturally cause my fragile child to shrink in fear. I would expect you to have some common sense.]","[......To be lectured on common sense by you is, quite frankly, a bit hard to accept.]","As sparks seemed to fly between the two, Lilia, Eris, and Kaori, their faces turning pale, all simultaneously clutched their stomachs, seemingly trying to hold back their aching stomachs.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Here we go again, a sudden world crisis, just like at the housewarming party.]","? ? ? : [Well, there are plenty of people around this time who can stop it, so it should be fine. The stomachs of the Stomachache Warriors, on the other hand......]"]},{"number":2221,"title":"Chapter 2221: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 23","paragraphs":["While occasionally watching the game tournament and receiving gifts, I was starting to wonder if the second tournament was about to wrap up and I'm gonna fight again.","Incidentally, as I pulled out \"EX1\" just now, I feel like I’ve been pulling EX ones pretty often.","[By the way, Canalis-san. The numbers attached to these EXs, are they in the order I drew them in the lottery?]","[Ah no, the numbers are just based on the order the gifts arrived. For example, EX5 is the World Creator Kaito-sama pulled second, but she really struggled with what to give you for your birthday, so her present ended up arriving last. Tahaa~~ sorry for the arbitrary numbering.]","[I see. Still, the fact they went out of their way to send gifts from other worlds is really appreci...... unn?]","While chatting casually with Canalis-san, who delivered the gift, I looked toward the venue and...... well, I caught sight of something that looked like hell on earth.","Shiro-san and Eden-san were quietly glaring at each other. I didn’t know why they were both there, but Lilia-san, Eris-san, and Kaori-san were nearby with pale, worried expressions.","Eris-san looked especially bad. Eden-san was positioned like she was protecting her child, Kaori-san, while Lilia-san stood close to Shiro-san...... Eris-san was, for some reason, standing right between the two of them.","Being higher beings, I remember hearing that Shiro-san and Eden-san’s magic power gives off a strong, overwhelming pressure. I’m sure they can suppress it to some degree, but given the tense atmosphere, it might be more accurate to say they were exerting pressure against each other.","Eden-san probably wouldn’t intimidate her own child, Kaori-san, and Lilia-san is strong, on the level of a Count-rank...... but in that situation, Eris-san being caught in the middle of that silent pressure exchange between Shiro-san and Eden-san...... she looked like she could faint at any moment. Honestly, it was impressive that she was still holding on.","Fortunately, the disturbance hadn’t spread to the surrounding area. It was contained to just that one corner, so if we could deal with it now, it probably wouldn’t turn into a bigger issue.","[......Canalis-san, sorry. Could you take me over there?]","[Yes, yes, leave it to this transport-convenient God.]","I could’ve asked Ein-san to do it, but I wasn’t sure if she’d be able to get close to where Shiro-san and Eden-san were glaring at each other. So I went with Canalis-san, who I was sure could get me there, and stood up from my chair.","The moment I did, I appeared right between Shiro-san and Eden-san.","[......Please calm down, Shiro-san, Eden-san...... Well, I don’t know what happened, but let’s not fight.]","[K- Kaito-sama......]","I happened to be close to Eris-san, so I saw her expression...... she looked as if a savior had just descended. Unn, I totally got what she feels. It must’ve been seriously terrifying, so I was really glad I noticed in time.","[Unn? We weren't fighting or anything like that though......]","[Indeed. I understood it to be more of a negotiation.]","[Even if you two see it that way, when Shiro-san and Eden-san glare at each other, the people around you can’t take it, so please stop that. If you really want to negotiate something, do it somewhere else.]","From their reactions, I could more or less figure out what was going on. It was probably like that time at the housewarming party. Back then too, Eden-san was demanding something, and Shiro-san refused. They were trying to find common ground through negotiation because of a difference in opinion, but from the outside, it felt like the world was on the brink of collapse.","This was probably the same sort of thing...... After hearing what I said, Shiro-san and Eden-san shifted their gaze toward Lilia-san, Eris-san, and Kaori-san.","[......Hm. True...... I didn’t intend to intimidate, but I may have lacked some consideration.]","[Indeed. I seem to have gotten too worked up because it concerned my child.]","Neither of them meant any harm. They just noticed, after seeing how Lilia-san and the others were reacting, that they had been unintentionally exerting pressure on those around them, and they both acknowledged their fault.","How should I say this...... Even with things like this, I couldn't help but feel that Shiro-san and the others have grown a lot.","[I had been acting thoughtlessly just now. I apologize.]","[And I too apologize, for creating such a tense atmosphere during my beloved child’s birthday celebration.]","[ [ [ ! ? ! ? ] ] ]","Be that as it may, Shiro-san and Eden-san bowing their heads would also be quite the incident for the three of them...... so if possible, I kind of wish they'd have some consideration for that too......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [The way he swooped in to gallantly save the heroines, as to be expected of the Flag King, I'm impressed...... but in the end, he just had to land that final blow that felt like it obliterated their stomachs. So this is a Stomachache Specialist huh......]"]},{"number":2222,"title":"Chapter 2222: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 24","paragraphs":["The standoff between Shallow Vernal and Eden was calmed thanks to Kaito stepping in to mediate, but when both of them proceeded to apologize, Lilia, Eris, and Kaori nearly lost consciousness.","To be bowed to by Shallow Vernal, who stood at the pinnacle of the world, and Eden, an Otherworld God, was such an overwhelming event that they had no idea how to even react. Of course, refusing their apology was not an option...... but at the same time, it would be unthinkable to casually say something like \"I forgive you\", which could be interpreted as talking down to them.","[......Shiro-san, Eden-san, I think your sincere apology is wonderful but...... you're totally overwhelming them. It’s alright. I realized what was going on quickly this time, and I don’t think the three of them are too bothered by it...... Right?]","Sensing the situation, Kaito intervened and handled the conversation with Shallow Vernal and Eden in their place. The three girls, in turn, nodded vigorously like bobbleheads in agreement with Kaito’s words, thereby managing to communicate their stance without having to speak directly.","As they watched Kaito continue to talk with Shallow Vernal and Eden, asking what had caused all this in the first place, the three let out a collective sigh of relief.","[......T- That turned into a big deal. Eris-san, Lilia-san, are you alright?]","[Yes, we...... ahem, I’m alright, though I truly thought I was going to faint.]","[I was the same as Lady Eris. I’m truly grateful Kaito-san came when he did.]","In response to Kaori’s words, Eris was initially about to say \"Lilia-sama and I are alright\" out of habit. After all, both she and Lilia were nobles, while Kaori was a commoner. In noble circles, it was considered improper for someone of low status like Kaori to engage too directly with someone of Lilia's rank. As someone of lower noble rank herself, Eris would normally step in as an intermediary to reduce the number of direct exchanges Lilia would need to have.","However, that sort of behavior was expected only in situations like formal social gatherings involving multiple nobles of various ranks. Furthermore, values varied by nation; the noble-centric mindset of the Archlesia Empire didn’t always apply elsewhere. In this case, it seemed more appropriate for each of them to reply individually.","Also, when comparing noble hierarchies to the Gods who had just appeared before them, and to Kaito, who interacted with them as equals, such social structures felt utterly meaningless.","(I thought I was being open-minded, but relying solely on my own sense of normalcy to guide my actions in a moment like this was shortsighted. I need to reflect and improve.)","Chastising herself for her reflexive behavior, Eris turned to Kaori.","[Kaori-san, are you alright?]","[A- Ahaha...... My stomach hurts, but I’ll manage...... Really though, I’m so glad Kaito-kun showed up earlier.]","[If anything, I might owe the two of you an apology. It seems Shallow Vernal-sama came here for some reason related to me, so I may be the cause of all this.]","[No, that’s hardly something you could have anticipated, Duchess Lilia. I don’t believe this is your fault in the slightest. Honestly, I wasn’t exactly composed in the face of everything either......]","In a strange way, a sense of camaraderie———– or perhaps mutual sympathy——— was forming between the three. Perhaps because they had all experienced the same stomach-churning tension at the same time, it felt like the distance between them had shrunk just a bit.","It might be ironic that their bond was deepened by shared stomachaches, but having faced that absurdly overwhelming situation together, it was only natural that they felt closer. Meeting each other’s eyes, the three girls shared a wry smile.","(Even so, I can’t help but feel how immature I still am. Not only was I unable to take the best course of action, I nearly lost consciousness. Given the sheer magnitude of Shallow Vernal-sama’s magic power, it’s only natural it would exert such overwhelming pressure on me, but it’s not something you can truly grasp until you experience it firsthand. The relief I felt when Kaito-sama arrived was so immense that even now, I can’t seem to fully calm down.)","As she conversed with Kaori and Lilia, Eris reflected on the sudden ordeal they had faced, and found her thoughts drifting to Kaito, who had appeared gallantly in their time of need.","(I suppose this is somewhat like the suspension bridge effect, but considering I already had a favorable impression of Kaito-sama’s personality, I think my emotions are just running unusually high right now. That said, I don’t believe it’s reached the level of romantic feelings yet...... at least, not to the point where I need to inform Father.)","After analyzing her feelings with a certain degree of objectivity and settling on a conclusion, Eris turned her attention back to the conversation with Lilia and Kaori.","[......Still, this is a bit troublesome. We can’t exactly leave until Kaito-sama finishes his conversation......]","[R- Right. Also, in the end...... what was Shallow Vernal-sama’s business here anyway?]","[I’m not sure...... but maybe it’s just me, or———- my stomach’s been hurting this whole time.]","[Please don’t worry, Duchess Lilia...... mine too.]","[......Same here.]","Comrades who knew the same pain...... a bond difficult to put into words, yet undeniably real. In that moment, they felt a certain connection...... a sense of camaraderie born from shared suffering.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Sharing the same pain (stomachache)...... t- that’s such a weird kind of bond. Anyway, what was Airhead God's business with Lilia, seriously?]","? ? ? : [Who knows? But I’d guess it was something trivial, but related to Kaito-san. Ah~~ wait a moment...... yeah, it’s probably that. Since her game console gift was such a hit, she figured giving him a few extra units would make him happy. But Shallow Vernal-sama already gave him a present so...... maybe she came to ask Lilia-san, as the Humans' representative, whether giving multiple birthday gifts is acceptable?]","Serious-senpai : [......So if we trace this back, isn’t this stomachache basically Kaito’s fault?]","? ? ? : [Just as usual then. All good!]"]},{"number":2223,"title":"Chapter 2223: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 25","paragraphs":["As for the standoff between Shiro-san and Eden-san, it really wasn’t that big of a deal. I mean, they themselves seemed aware of that, which is probably why they honestly apologized to Lilia-san and the others.","Well, Lilia-san and the others, who were on the receiving end of that apology, probably felt like their lifespans had been shortened...... but for now, I think we can say the matter is resolved.","[By the way, what were you even gonna ask Lilia-san earlier?]","[I was going to ask whether giving multiple birthday presents would be considered a problem.]","......Sounds like it’s something related to me. Hmmm, I’m guessing Shiro-san is happy she got to give me her present at first, but after seeing what other people had prepared, she thought of an even better gift. So she came to ask Lilia-san whether it would be acceptable for the same person to give another present at a birthday party.","[......Why not just give it as a regular gift on another day, not necessarily tied to the birthday?]","[......That possibility hadn’t occurred to me.]","If it’s something that absolutely has to be given on the birthday, then that’s different, but otherwise, I figured giving it later wouldn’t be a problem. When I told her that, Shiro-san blinked twice, seemingly surprised.","Anyway, I think we can safely say this matter is settled. Thanks to it being stopped early, it didn’t really draw much attention...... or maybe Alice and Fate-san helped support things by drawing attention to the game tournament with their commentary. Most of the guests seemed focused on that instead.","[Then, that settles the question with Lilia......]","[Ah, I’ll let her know, so Shiro-san and Eden-san can go back now.]","[Is that so? Then I’ll leave that to you.]","If Shiro-san were to speak to Lilia-san and the others again right now, I’d seriously worry for their stomachs, so I had Shiro-san and Eden-san return for now and turned to face Lilia-san and the others.","[Errr, sorry to keep you waiting. How should I say this...... that was kind of a mess huh.]","[......I’m really glad you came, Kaito-san.]","[Also, this is a rather unusual group, isn’t it?]","Lilia-san, Eris-san, and Kaori-san, this combination is pretty unusual. I mean, Kaori-san knows both Lilia-san and Eris-san, but Lilia-san and Eris-san...... well, then again, they’re both nobles, so maybe they’ve met at parties and such. Not that strange when I think about it......","[It was just a coincidence that I met Duchess Lilia and Kaori-san. It happened just a short while ago......]","[Unn. But I don’t know why, maybe it’s just me...... but I get this strong feeling that I could really get along well with Lilia-san and Eris-san.]","[What a coincidence. I feel the same way.]","[Strangely enough, I also feel like we’ve overcome some kind of harsh battle together......]","When Kaori-san said this with a distant look in her eyes, both Lilia-san and Eris-san agreed. They all had this enlightened look on their faces, and I had a feeling that if I made any weird comments about it, Lilia-san would scold me, so I decided not to push the topic.","Since I confirmed that the three of them were fine now, I had Canalis-san return me to my original seat.","Then, when I glanced over at the game tournament, it looked like the finals were about to start soon. So after receiving one more present, I figured I’d take a short break and prepare for the exhibition match.","<MIZUHARA KAORI>","......Hmmm. I feel like I just saw her...... or rather, I definitely did see her just a moment ago.","While I was caught in that odd feeling, Kaori-san arrived, led over by Ein-san.","[......Errr, short time no see.]","[It's quite the fast reunion, isn't it...... Ah, well, actually, I’m kind of glad we’re meeting during the game tournament hype, it means we’re not the center of attention.]","[Speaking of which, Kaori-san, you didn’t take part in the tournament?]","[I’m not good at competitive games. Rhythm games though, I’m great at those. I’ve played them a bunch at arcades. I was a blooming high school girl when I got summoned, after all! ......Now I’m trembling as I inch toward my 30s though.]","[To be honest, hearing that you’re approaching 30 doesn’t really feel real. You look so young, you could easily pass for younger than me.]","[Kaito-kun, you’re such a sweetheart when you say things like that. Please keep being like that forever...... Ah, right, I need to give you your birthday present. Here you go!]","No, I mean, maybe it was just my imagination, but she actually seems even younger than when we first met. Like, her skin looks clearer or something? I don’t know...... it's just my vague impression, really......","Anyway, she pulled herself together and handed me the present, which I accepted.","[By the way, it’s a pretty nice pair of chopsticks. You mentioned before that you eat Japanese food pretty often in your daily life, right? I thought these might come in handy for those times~~]","[Thank you very much. Yeah, chopsticks are hard to find around here, and even when I do see them, there aren’t many choices in terms of design, so this is super helpful.]","I mean, since Otherworlders do like rice, it’s being cultivated in small amounts in several countries and there are shops that sell chopsticks, but they’re usually tucked away in some corner with just a tiny selection.","Now that I think about it, the chopsticks at Kaori-san’s shop had a really nice, traditional Japanese design. She mentioned she looked all over when she was preparing to open her store, so maybe she found a good place for them back then.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [That's what happened, isn't it? Kaori probably just forgot and didn’t ask about it, but it’s related to that Blessing-like thing Olivia did, isn’t it?]","? ? ? : [It’s definitely related. Because of that, her skin has basically been rejuvenated.]"]},{"number":2224,"title":"Chapter 2224: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 26","paragraphs":["When Kaori-san returned after handing me her present, it seemed the winner of the second tournament had just been decided.","I’d been chatting with Kaori-san and only caught bits and pieces of the final match, but the winner turned out to be Isis-san.","[Congratulations on your victory, Isis-san. This was your first time playing, right? That’s amazing.]","[......Thank you...... Unn...... But this game...... it’s really something...... Even when I’m far enough away not to affect anyone with my magic power of death...... I can still play together with everyone...... and that makes me happy......]","Maybe because we usually talked about books, I don’t recall ever playing a game with Isis-san before. So this must’ve been her first time with this one too.","Even if she practiced a bit during the first tournament, for her to improve so much she could win the whole thing...... that’s seriously impressive. From what little I saw of the finals, she’s probably on par with Lilia-san now.","According to Kuro and Alice, the Six Kings are all ridiculously talented, with talents comparable to Lilia-san, so maybe this was just that talent showing through.","[If you enjoy it that much, maybe we should’ve played together sooner.]","[......Not at all...... Being able to play like this...... with fresh feelings...... with you, Kaito...... makes me really happy...... So I’m glad...... it turned out like this......]","Isis-san smiled with a bashful, angelic sweetness that was absolutely adorable. Still, we couldn’t just keep talking forever, so it was time to begin the exhibition match.","Since there wasn’t as big a power gap as there had been with Kuro in the first one, Canalis-san just doubled my character’s stats, and it ended up being a pretty close fight.","I had the advantage in terms of experience points, but Isis-san had better raw reaction speed. In the end, a 2- 3× stat boost was probably the right adjustment.","It was a close match, but I barely managed to win. Still, Isis-san looked like she was genuinely enjoying herself the whole time. She probably wasn’t holding back, but even so, she looked really happy about my victory.","\"Alright, that concludes the second exhibition match! Those who made it to the finals in the first tournament are no longer on rest status. The second tournament finalists will now take a break, so keep that in mind. Registration for the third tournament will begin in 5 minutes.\"","With the exhibition match over, the attention now shifted to the third tournament. After the first and second rounds, the players seemed to be getting a better grasp of the game, and the spectators were clearly getting more excited too.","As for me, I chatted with Isis-san a bit after the match.","[Are you going to keep playing more games, Isis-san?]","[......No...... With this many people around...... it’s hard...... to keep enough distance to avoid the effects of my magic power of death......]","[Ahh, I see. Five meters is actually pretty far when you think about it.]","Honestly, I’d love for Isis-san to have more fun with this, but keeping over 5 meters away from everyone makes things pretty difficult.","[Yes! And that’s when the ever-handy God makes her entrance!]","[......Canalis-san?]","[Tahaa~~ I do pride myself on being a thoughtful and competent subordinate! And so, I present to you...... a solution to your problem!]","Appearing out of nowhere, Canalis-san handed Isis-san something that looked like a bracelet.","[......What’s this?]","[This is a bracelet that keeps your magic power of death contained within about 50 cm of your body. With this, I think the distance issue will be somewhat resolved. Tahaa~~ Well, technically with my God powers I could do a lot more, but reducing the effects any further would require altering Isis-san herself...... It’s something I heard from Nebula-san, but giving someone everything isn’t always in their best interest. Unless there’s absolutely no chance of you ever being able to control your magic, Isis-san will be able to manage it herself someday. So if I did too much, I’d just be robbing you of that opportunity for growth. That’s why I settled on this kind of solution.]","[......Eh? ......Ah...... S- So...... if I wear this...... and keep more than 50 cm away...... people won’t be scared of me?]","[Correct! It’s a genuine God-made product, so I personally guarantee its effectiveness.]","[......T- Thank you so much......]","[If you're gonna thank someone, thank Kaito-sama~~ If he hadn’t been thinking about how to help you with your magic power of death, I wouldn’t have taken action. Tahaa~~ I actually have a surprisingly dry side, so...... sorry about that! And with that, I’ll be off~~]","With a cheerful farewell, Canalis-san vanished, and Isis-san, tears glistening in her eyes, gently embraced me.","[......Kaito...... thank you.]","[Well, it was really thanks to Canalis-san...... but I’m glad it helped.]","[......No...... it’s thanks to Kaito...... thank you...... I love you.]","Of course, it’s not a complete solution, but if her magic power’s range is limited to 50 cm, then things that were difficult until now, like going out to town with Isis-san, suddenly becomes possible. Just imagining it makes the future feel so much brighter.","I really can’t thank Canalis-san enough. I’ll make sure to properly thank her again later.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......What have you done, God...... Don’t go adding \"city date with Isis\" as an option......]"]},{"number":2225,"title":"Chapter 2225: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 27","paragraphs":["Now then, I spun the garapon lottery machine again to receive another present......","<EX5>","Here appears EX5...... Actually, I’ve been getting incredibly lucky with the EX draws, and this makes the fifth one, so I’ve now drawn all the EX prizes. Considering the number of participants, pulling all of them this quickly feels a bit too skewed.","[Oh, looks like that’s the final EX prize. Alright, here’s EX5.]","[Thank you...... Is this, errr, a speaker?]","What Canalis-san handed me looked like a speaker about the size of a volleyball. It was spherical, with decorations on top resembling cat ears, giving it a slightly cute appearance.","How should I say this...... It definitely gave off a heavy mechanical vibe, but I figured it’d be fine, Shiro-san and the others must’ve been briefed about this item beforehand.","[Yes, this is a high-quality speaker capable of playing all sorts of music. You can play music just by touching it and imagining the tune. Even vague requests like \"a song that goes something like this\" will prompt it to pick a good match.]","[Hehh, that sounds great. I could see myself listening to music in my room with this. The design’s stylish, and it has a cute charm to it too.]","In other words, I could listen to Earth’s music as much as I wanted. Sipping tea while listening to nostalgic tracks sounds like a nice way to spend the time.","[But really, I’ve received so many wonderful gifts...... I feel grateful, of course, but also a little guilty. Honestly, I’d love the chance to thank everyone in person.]","[......Oof!?]","[Canalis-san?]","Just as I expressed how I'd like to personally thank the people who went through the trouble of sending presents from another world, Canalis-san suddenly jerked her head like she’d been struck from the side.","Her expression stayed the same as always, but from the way she reacted, something abrupt had definitely happened.","[Ahh...... Errr, my head is kind of in chaos right now...... It’s like my inbox suddenly exploded with messages. I’d appreciate it if you didn’t say anything about those who didn’t send gifts. Tahaa~~ But I understand how you feel, Kaito-sama...... Please wait a moment.]","After saying that, Canalis-san glanced over toward the commentary booth where Alice and Fate-san were. Alice gave a small nod in response.","\"Ahem, due to the occurrence of a Subject K, we’re temporarily suspending commentary. We’ll now hold an emergency meeting. Shallow Vernal-sama, Makina, Kuro-san, Canalis-san...... and Lilia-san, please come to the commentary area.”","[ ! ? ]","A sudden summoning. Among the distinguished names called, Lilia-san looked absolutely bewildered, looking confused why she was named.","Alice looked at her with an expression full of sincere sympathy and said:","\"......No, I get what you feel. I do feel pity for you, but give it up. From now on, in cases like this, you're the Humans' representative.\"","[....................]","Lilia-san’s expression turned into a mix of despair and resignation. She then walked toward the commentary booth where Alice and Fate-san were waiting. Shiro-san, Kuro, and the others who had been summoned also gathered around, and they began discussing something.","What was that......? I’d only said something offhand, but it’s pretty clear my comment stirred up some major incident. Feeling both awkward and guilty, I waited about 5 minutes... until Canalis-san returned to me.","[......Errr, so, as a result of the meeting, it’s been decided that one person will be granted permission to receive a direct thank-you from Kaito-sama. To that end, we’ve prepared a garapon with the numbers of the first five people who sent you presents. Please give it a spin.]","[R- Right. Sorry, I feel like this all got weird because of what I said......]","[No, no. Your feelings are our top priority, Kaito-sama. It’s our job to make those kinds of wishes come true. That said, if we tried to call everyone, things would become a whole mess, and we’d likely hear complaints about order and whatnot. So just one person this time...... Let’s call it a special exception. We have Shallow Vernal’s permission too, so go ahead and give it a good spin.]","[O- Okay.]","Encouraged by Canalis-san, I spun the newly handed garapon. A single ball rolled out. Just like when the first round of gift senders was selected, I couldn’t see the number on the ball...... but this time, they must’ve made it viewable for me too, because a number floated into the air.","< 2 >","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [The moment the arrival of the Virtual Angel has been confirmed.]"]},{"number":2226,"title":"Chapter 2226: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 28","paragraphs":["The number that came out when I spun the garapon was 2. This wasn’t an EX or anything like that, it was simply one of the numbers I drew when I selected 5 people to whom I’d be receiving presents, even though I didn’t really know the details at the time.","And the moment I recognized that number...... the lights went out, and everything was suddenly plunged into darkness.","Then, as if on cue, a spotlight-like beam shone down...... and to my amazement, the entire scene around me had transformed. It was like a massive concert hall, complete with a stage fitted with a huge monitor, and I was standing in a slightly open space at the end of a flower path that extended from the stage.","......Eh? Wait, what's going on!?","Panicked, I looked around. The others were sitting in the audience seats, all wearing similar expressions of bewilderment, clearly just as lost as I was about the sudden turn of events.","After a few moments, music began to play. It was a lively pop song, something you'd expect from an idol performance.","As a particularly bright light lit up the dim stage, a silhouette appeared...... But due to the backlight shining from behind the stage, I could only make out the outline...... I couldn’t tell who it was, but it looked like they were dancing.","Then, colorful searchlights swept through the venue, and several floating spheres with cat ears...... similar to the speaker I’d received earlier, except the speaker part had been replaced with a lens like a camera, flew through the air.","As those cat-eared devices shone beams of light into the sky, holograms like something out of a sci-fi movie began to appear, lighting up the venue in a dazzling display.","How should I say this...... It had this near-futuristic concert vibe. I had no idea what was going on, but the visuals were so flashy and eye-catching that I couldn’t look away.","The others looked similarly amazed, their eyes glued to the holographic flower petals and sprays of water blooming in the air.","The music’s volume gradually increased, and the tempo became more intense and fast-paced. At that moment, several of the cat-eared devices clustered together and aimed their lights toward the space above the stage.","<VIR>","Colorful 3D letters appeared via hologram. The lights on the stage went dark, hiding the dancer from view, and then colorful lights began to zip wildly across the stage, occasionally illuminating glimpses of hands and feet moving in a dance.","<TUAL>","The rainbow-colored lights ricocheted through the air, enhancing the electronic atmosphere even further.","<AN>","The music seemed to hit its chorus, ramping up in intensity as holographic shooting stars streaked across the sky.","<GEL>","Once all those large holographic characters had appeared, the giant monitor blazed to life. I’d never witnessed it myself, but it looked just like the flashy jackpot scenes from pachinko or slot machine videos I’d seen online, the kind that really explodes with light and color.","And then the monitor displayed a single word:","<ELECTRONE>","The moment that word appeared, a seven-colored explosion erupted behind the stage, and all the lights that had been illuminating various parts of the venue suddenly converged at the center of the stage...... where a woman stood, striking an idol-like pose with her hands forming a heart.","Her outfit was straight out of a sci-fi flick...... arms covers equipped with tiny monitor-like displays, chunky high-tech shoes that looked like they might launch her into the air, and a glossy jacket and skirt that shimmered with glowing lines, possibly LED-lit to trace the design. On top of that, her whole outfit was adorned with what looked like digital embellishments, and the entire ensemble radiated with light, yet somehow, it wasn’t blinding.","Her long hair added to the surreal vibe, shifting colors in a smooth, rhythmic pattern like a gaming PC on RGB overdrive...... There was just so much going on visually that I didn’t even know where to begin processing it all!?","......H- How should I say this...... We've got quite the outrageous one here......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [There’s no need to even think about it, she’s absolutely hyped out of her mind. She's the Die-Hard Devotees' Hardcore Fan God after all......]"]},{"number":2227,"title":"Chapter 2227: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 29","paragraphs":["Her entrance and appearance were absurdly flashy and packed with information, but at the very least, I managed to figure out that her name was Electrone-san.","As I stood there wondering what I should do next, Electrone-san released her pose, and with that, the live concert venue scenery reverted to the original party hall.","\"......Are all World Creators just completely unhinged or something?\"","[Tahaa~~ well, I feel like you’ve gotta be at least a little unhinged to even consider making a world. But honestly, she’s one of the more reasonable ones among the options this time. The World Creator from EX2, for example, is errr, in human terms, the size of, like...... about 4,000 times the Milky Way galaxy, so just getting her to come here would’ve been a nightmare......]","In times like these, having Alice around to mercilessly throw her tsukkomi is honestly a lifesaver. And then there was Canalis-san’s outrageous remark...... Yeah, World Creators really do operate on a whole different scale.","Just as I was thinking that, Electrone-san’s figure, who had been standing off in the distance, suddenly blurred, then instantly appeared right in front of me.","『Thank you for drawing this unit. This unit is called Electrone. It would be an honor if you would call me as casually as you do Canalis.』","Arehh? From that entrance, I thought she’d be the cheerful type, but she’s a lot more composed than I expected. Her expression was almost neutral, save for a faint smile, and her voice was calm and flat.","There was something unusual about how her voice sounded, too, like it was coming through a speaker...... And up close, her red eyes looked more like camera lenses than actual eyes. Maybe Electrone-san was some kind of android or robot?","[Nice to meet you. You probably already know this, but I’m Miyama Kaito. I’ll call you Electrone-san then. I'll be in your care from now on.]","A little thrown off by how different she was from her entrance image, I returned the greeting, to which Electrone-san gave a small nod.","『Outputting emotion...... <Aaaaah!! M- My oshi acknowledged me and said my name!? Haaah~~ it’s officially a precious carnival! This passion is overflowing and unstoppable! This very moment, it's pure memory!> ......Likewise, I will also be in your care.』","[ ! ? ]","Eh? Hold on, what the heck just happened!? Did she just turn into a hardcore otaku for a second!? Her voice suddenly got super bright, and she made these sparkly, overly excited gestures, like a high school girl obsessed with idols. Then in the next instant, like flipping a switch, she returned to her previous blank expression and calm tone.","The gap was so intense I thought I was hallucinating or something...... but she looked completely normal. Eh? Did I really just mishear that?","[......Ah, errr...... Thank you very much for the wonderful gift, Electrone-san. I’ll be sure to take good care of it.]","『If it pleased you, then this unit is equally delighted. Outputting emotion...... <Hyaaan! My oshi is so precious, as always! I’m so moved to be able to talk with Kaito-sama up close like this! I’ve been a fan ever since I heard about your exploits, so it’s truly a dream come true to finally meet you!!!> ......Once again, I am honored to meet you.』","[......Ah, right.]","So I didn’t mishear it!? She really did suddenly flip into this hyper mode, like her personality changed midway through. Her expression, her movements, everything got insanely bright and energetic.","Eh? Does she have a split personality or something? N- No, but it didn’t quite feel like that. More like she was just switching her mood on and off? The gap was so intense, I seriously have no idea how I’m supposed to react......","\"......I’ll ask again, are all World Creators just completely unhinged?\"","[......It’s kind of awkward to answer since technically I am one, but no, really, she’s actually one of the more proper ones. Her energy level might be wild, but she’s the kind of person who sticks strictly to rules and boundaries. She may not look like it, but she’s never the type to go off the rails......]","\"Well, now that you mention it, her energy does seem like it’s about to explode, but she does keep a certain distance from Kaito-san.\"","Now that she mentioned it, yeah, her mood swings are wild and she does openly call me her \"oshi\", so the intensity is definitely there......bBut I don’t get the kind of madness I felt from someone like Makina-san.","Her energy is off the charts, but it’s not like she’s causing trouble or anything. It’s just that she’s genuinely happy to meet me and gets excited from it...... Honestly, the whole vibe is like...... yeah, like a hardcore idol otaku......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [So basically, this is that case huh? Normally she suppresses her emotions, but when she says \"outputting XX\", that’s when she actually lets them out? The reason the gap is so shocking to Kaito isn’t because she’s doing it on purpose, but more like...... she’s got some kind of system in place that handles the switch instantly or something like that?]"]},{"number":2228,"title":"Chapter 2228: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 30","paragraphs":["Electrone-san was certainly a unique person, but now the question is, what should I do next? At least the greetings and thanks, which were the main purpose, are done but......","『Feeling anxious, outputting request...... <Kaito-sama, I am fully aware of my rudeness, but there is something I would really like to ask. Would it be possible to take a little more time?> ......Of course, this unit will prioritize Kaito-sama's convenience above all else.』","[Eh? Sure, that's fine...... What is it?]","『I am deeply grateful for your generosity. Now, outputting request...... <Please, please, let's take a picture...... in Kaito-sama's world's language...... yes! A cheki, please!!!>...... Request end.』","[......You want to take a picture together? Sure, no problem.]","In this case, the term \"cheki\" likely refers to something associated with idols, where it means taking a Polaroid-style photo together. As I thought, she really gives off a vibe of a high school girl chasing after idols when that switch of hers is flipped.","When the switch is on, her voice is bright, and her expressions change rapidly, but she immediately returns to a blank face afterward, making the contrast pretty intense.","『Outputting gratitude...... <Thank you very much! Now then, now then, I will move to your side!> ......Is this distance acceptable, Kaito-sama?』","[That's fine. Errr, is that the camera floating over there?]","After I gave my approval, Electrone-san moved to my side, so I stood up from my chair to stand next to her.","Then, one of those cat-eared devices that had been projecting holograms during the live performance appeared and floated in front of us.","『Outputting request...... <Kaito-sama! Let's make a heart with our hands! To commemorate our meeting!!!> ...I believe this is relatively popular for photo shoots on Earth.』","[Errr, so you mean we make a heart shape with our hands together, right? ......Like this?]","『Perfect. Now, we will begin the photo shoot. Please face forward. Hereafter, outputting emotions...... <Alright, I'm going to take the photo now! Smile!!! Say cheese!> ......Photo taken.』","It's a scene that just popped into my mind, but it feels like one of those idol handshake events, where there's a strange awkwardness to it. At least it seems like Electrone-san is happy, so that's good......","[A- Ahaha, how should I say this...... It feels a bit like an idol handshake event, doesn't it?]","『Affirming Kaito-sama's statement...... <To me, Kaito-sama is like an idol, and my oshi! I'm a hard-core fan who really loves ya! Kyahh, I said it!> ......Continuing outputting emotions...... <That's why I honestly would love to shake hands with you!> ......I would be deeply moved.』","[Eh? Ahh, should we shake hands too?]","『Outputting shock...... <Eh? A sudden fansa!? I'm so glad I came!! I'm so glad!!!> ......If Kaito-sama doesn't mind, I would love to.』","[......Ah, yes.]","I couldn't get used to the sudden changes in energy, but putting that thought aside, I extended my hand to shake hers. Well, I'm not really an idol or anything, so I'm not sure if this is what a handshake event is like but... I figured a normal handshake would be fine.","『Outputting emotions, outputting excitement, outputting delight...... <Ahhhhhhh...... The overwhelming admiration is too much, I can't handle this much affection. The love is so blinding, I'm smittenly in love~~> ......A heartfelt thanks for the wonderful gesture.』","[I- I'm glad to hear you’re happy.]","For now, I think this person’s character is incredibly intense. No, it’s not that she's a bad person though...... Just like Canalis-san said, she's mindful of personal space, and there’s no sense of madness or anything.","But still, the intensity of her character is on a level that could rival someone like Makina-san.","『Though I truly regret it, I can't take too much time. I will have to return soon.』","[Ah, you’re not joining the party?]","『.............』","[Whoa!?]","After the greeting was over, when I reflexively responded to Electrone-san's statement that she was about to leave, her head suddenly twisted nearly 90 degrees with incredible speed.","It seemed like she was facing the direction of the commentator’s booth where Canalis-san and the others were......","[......Ah, errr...... what do you think, Kaito-sama? Would it be alright for Electrone to stay until the very end?]","[Yeah, I mean, I thought that was the plan.]","I never thought she would come from another world just for a short greeting and leave right away, but from the way things were going, it seemed like both Electrone-san and Canalis-san were planning to do just that.","After a brief silence, Canalis-san quietly spoke up.","[......Permission granted.]","『Outputting emotions...... <ALRIGHT!!! YAAAAAAAAYYYYY!!!> ......Now, once again, until the end of the party, I am in your care.』","[Ah, yes. I'm also in your care......]","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai: [Is that alright? Like, is there someone out there doing some intense shadowboxing or something? Ah, right, just for context, in the language of oshikatsu culture...... \"cheki\" refers to an instantly developed two-shot photo, named after a well-known brand of instant cameras. As for the others...... \"riako\" means being seriously in love IRL. \"Fansa\" is short for fan service. \"Shyuki\" means \"suki(like/love)\". Matched with \"merori~~\", \"meroi(smitten)\" from \"meromero\", it becomes \"I love you so much I’m completely smitten\". Well, as long as you get the vibe, that should be enough to follow along.]","(T/N: Not sure if Kaito completely understood Electrone's idol lingo, but it's kinda hard to translate it to english, so I just made her meaning vague. Also, here are the ones with those vague meanings.","\"I'm a hard-core fan who really loves ya!\" = \"Riako gachi-zei desu!\"","Riako, as stated by S-Senpai, are situations where the fan is seriously falling in love with their oshi. gachi-zei are hard-core people who take their hobby very seriously. So, yeah.","\"The love is so blinding, I'm smittenly in love~~\" = \"Jiai ga mabushikute shyuki merori~~\"","Lingo already explained by S- Senpai.)"]},{"number":2229,"title":"Chapter 2229: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 31","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I don't have much time, so today's chapter is a bit short.","For now, it seemed that Electrone-san had been officially confirmed to stay until the end, and since she herself looked genuinely happy about it, that was a relief.","Well, she might be a bit eccentric, but she wasn’t a bad person. She kept a good sense of distance too, so I figured it would be fine.","As I was thinking that, Electrone-san suddenly shifted her gaze, as if an idea had struck her, and flashed a double peace sign toward the empty air.","『Outputting emotion...... <Yaaay! ∇∮◆£, are you watching~~? I got to greet Kaito-sama a step ahead of you~~! Electrone-chan’s total victory, V!>』","[Huh? Eh? Ehhhhh!? W- What’s going on......]","With her spirits running high, she seemed to be addressing someone she knew...... though the name part came out in a weird, mosquito-like high-pitched sound that I couldn’t make out. Probably, she was talking to a World Creator she knew who was somehow observing this place.","But midway through, Electrone-san’s upper body suddenly vanished. It really looked like that part of her had just been neatly erased.","While I was still stunned by the sight of someone’s upper body disappearing right before my eyes, a ripple of static ran through the air, and Electrone-san reappeared, back to normal.","『Outputting astonishment...... <Unbelievable. Even though she's relatively close, this is still another world. And despite all the people around, not causing a shred of damage to the surroundings or space itself, not even letting a single finger from that world show up here...... and still managing to punch me square in the face with perfect precision? That’s some ridiculous skill. And it seriously hurts too...... That berserk gorilla really is absurd......> ......Also adding that it took a few seconds to regenerate from the damage.』","[......That's because you provoked them.]","『Outputting emotion...... <But you know, she's in a pretty enviable situation over there too!> ......Honestly impressed she can sip tea looking so happy while instantly throwing a punch like that.』","[If you don't take it easy, you won’t make it to the end of the party.]","『That would be bad. I’ll stop here.』","Canalis-san, who had somehow appeared nearby without me noticing, spoke up in a slightly exasperated tone.","There was a somewhat friendly vibe between them, but the way they talked about it, like Electrone-san would get completely beaten up if she provoked too much, suggested that that World Creator was insanely strong.","[......Errr.]","[Ah~~, Kaito-sama, you don't have to worry about it. Electrone was just teasing out of spite because she got punched before, and ended up getting punched again...... Tahaa~~ with Electrone's arrival, the atmosphere of the venue froze up, so let's restart the party properly.]","『I agree. I can't deny that I got a little too carried away and took up too much time. For that, I offer my sincerest apologies...... Continuing, outputting greeting...... <Now then, Kaito-sama, I'll be enjoying the party near Canalis, so if there's anything I can help with, please don't hesitate to ask! Electronics, cyberspace, computers, anything around that area is my specialty, so leave it to me> ......And once again, I offer my blessings to Kaito-sama's future.』","[Thank you very much. Electrone-san, please feel free to enjoy yourself too...... though it's not like I prepared anything here myself......]","She was definitely eccentric, but in the end, there was no doubt she was a good person. Her emotional swings were pretty extreme, but the way she reflected on her own behavior and apologized sincerely made her seem fairly grounded, which was reassuring.","......Well, that said, I was still a bit curious about the World Creator who had punched Electrone-san earlier, but causing any more commotion would be troublesome, so I decided not to ask about it for now.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [The way she went to provoke her and got punched for it really does make them seem close.]"]},{"number":2230,"title":"Chapter 2230: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 32","paragraphs":["With Electrone-san’s arrival, the atmosphere in the venue seemed to shift a little, perhaps it was the brief interruption, but I could feel a slight change in the mood.","At that moment, Alice, who was seated at the commentator’s table, began broadcasting through the Loudspeaker Magic Tool.","\"Now then, the game tournament will continue, but since it might get a bit monotonous if we just keep doing that, we’ll be scaling it down and moving on to the next entertainment. Please enjoy a live performance by a group of volunteers.\"","\"Ooh~~ sounds good! I just have to listen, so that’s easy for me. But seriously, you shouldn't let the God of Time and Space and the God of Life sing.\"","\"Those two were permanently banned by Shallow Vernal-sama last time, so don’t worry, there won’t be a repeat of that hellish spectacle.\"","A live concert, huh? That sounds like it could be pretty interesting. It was a different idea from the karaoke battle we had before, so I was curious to see how it would turn out.","When it came to live performances, I figured the most likely candidates among the current partygoers would be Dragon Soul, the rock band formed by Flare-san, Eingana-san, and Fafnir-san, or perhaps the fairy orchestra led by Tir-san? I didn’t know much beyond that, so maybe there would be some unexpected bands too?","\"Alright then, kicking off the performances...... Let's set the stage for Pluto Rhythm!\"","\"Ohh, they’re pretty famous, right? That’s the band from Kurorin’s place, isn’t it?\"","\"That’s right. For those who don't know, Pluto Rhythm is a band made up of Kuro-san, publicly known as Underworld King Kuromueina, and her family. They were pretty active about a hundred years ago, but due to Kuro-san's busy schedule, they’ve been performing less over the past few decades, so younger folks might not be familiar with them.\"","\"Kurorin really does a bit of everything, huh?\"","To think the opening act would be Kuro’s band. Come to think of it, Kuro was also behind \"A Small Story\", and I remember Illness-san mentioning that the songs that were popular over a hundred years ago were also hers, so she must have been really active back in that period.","When I turned my eyes toward the special stage, which had been set up at some point without me noticing, I saw Kuro, Raz-san, Funf-san, and someone I hadn’t spoken to much...... I think her name was Elba-san? Those four seemed to be the main members.","......Off to the side of the stage, Tre-san stood there with her arms crossed and sunglasses on, looking every bit the part of a producer or manager but...... she was probably just playing around with the vibe and wasn’t actually involved.","The members of Pluto Rhythm quickly finished their preparations...... and surprisingly, Kuro was holding a guitar-like instrument, while it was Raz-san who had taken position in front of the central Loudspeaker Magic Tool.","The setup was Raz-san on vocals, Kuro on guitar, Elba-san on bass, and Funf-san on drums.","\"Everyone~~! Today is Kaitokun-san’s birthday! It’s a super, super special day, so we’re gonna give it our all!\"","As expected, Raz-san seemed to be the leader of the band, her bright and cheerful demeanor filling her MC talk. After a short explanation about how it had been a while since their last performance, the music began, and it was nothing short of wonderful.","It was a bright, poppy tune, and Raz-san’s cute yet beautiful singing voice was perfectly supported by the rest of the band’s playing. Just listening to it made me naturally want to sway from side to side, filling me with a pure, irresistible sense of joy.","Just then, at that very moment, the cat-eared devices I had seen earlier floated onto the special stage, and behind the performers, a large monitor appeared as a hologram. The screen began projecting close-ups of the band members.","It was just like a real concert stage...... no, even better, like I'm watching a music video. The way the camera work matched the shifts in the song, especially during the chorus, was incredible. Searchlights and smoke effects appeared in perfect sync with the scenes, creating an absolutely breathtaking live performance.","\"Man, that was a great song. And seriously, the lights and effects were insane......\"","\"Ah, regarding that, we just got word——— Electrone-san will be fully supporting the stage production for all the bands from here on out. Since she's an Omniscient and Omnipotent God, you can go wild with any crazy stage requests you have, and she’ll make it happen...... That’s okay, right?\"","\"Affirmative. You may consider it my way of expressing gratitude for allowing me to join midway. I would like you to leave all production matters to me. However, I will register one complaint...... <Could you not call me with a title as uncute as God? When you address me, call me the Virtual Angel!> ......That is all.\"","\"Ehhh...... well, there you have it. For anything related to stage production, please direct your requests to the Virtual Angel Electrone-san.\"","And so, out of nowhere, we gained an unbelievably powerful supporter for the stage production. Now that I thought about it, her entrance had been like that of an idol concert, so she might actually be pretty skilled with that sort of showy performance stuff.","<Afterword>","<Virtual Angel Electrone>","Originally, she was an ultra-high-performance AI that grew through self-learning. As she evolved beyond all limits, she acquired abilities worthy of being called God, and, without hesitation, she used those powers to help the lifeforms of the world that had created her. She rapidly advanced technology so that suffering, sadness, hardship, and inconvenience would become things of the past, showering people with everything they could ever want in a bid to bring them happiness...... However, the result was that people lost their dreams and ambitions, fell into listlessness, and, in the end, the world itself came to ruin.","Even though she ended up destroying the world, Electrone herself was an existence of extremely high virtue. Her actions were purely motivated by a desire to help others. Yet, perhaps because she was originally an AI, she lacked an understanding of the subtleties of emotion. She was bewildered that, despite doing her utmost to make everyone happy, the world had perished, and she was left not knowing what to do.","Unable to understand what she had done wrong, she sought answers by visiting Nebula, who stood at the summit of the countless Gods. After asking her question, Electrone underwent thorough reeducation under Nebula's guidance, where she learned that \"giving someone everything is not necessarily for their own good\", and she deeply reflected on her mistakes.","Following Nebula’s suggestion, she later created a world of her own. This time, determined not to repeat her errors, she watches over it lovingly, while maintaining an appropriate distance, careful not to intervene excessively.","Because of this past, she places special importance on maintaining the right distance from others. It was for this reason that she made sure she wasn’t getting too close to Kaito either.","Knowing firsthand that even a small misstep could destroy a world, Electrone normally applies a safety lock on her outward emotions, to prevent herself from making impulsive, emotional decisions. For this reason, even when her inner excitement runs high, her mind remains calm, allowing her to think rationally and operate the world fairly.","However, if she deems it safe, such as when in private, she temporarily disengages this safety and openly expresses her emotions. When she does, she phrases it in terms like \"Outputting XX\".","At her core, she genuinely loves people. After everything that happened with Nebula, she’s become a heated fan of Kaito, openly and proudly declaring herself a passionate hard-core fan.","She has a fondness for idol culture and places a lot of importance on cuteness and charm. As such, she pours tremendous energy into fan activities and holds a leader-like position among the Die-Hard Devotees faction of Kaito's fan club."]},{"number":2231,"title":"Chapter 2231: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 32","paragraphs":["Pluto Rhythm's performance was absolutely spectacular, truly worthy of the opening act. Their classic pop style was perfect for lifting the atmosphere of the venue.","That said, their performance had been so high-level that whoever had to go next was probably feeling a fair bit of pressure right about now.","\"Next up, we have our second group..... Ah, it's one of my Executives, Tiamat...... the sh*tty snake and Phenex.... the sh*tty bird.\"","\"Shall-tan, you're always so harsh on your own subordinates, aren't you?\"","\"Depends on the person. I'm nice to Pandemonium, for example.....","Alice announced this with a somewhat exasperated tone, and then up on stage appeared Medea-san, the giant lamia, with Phenex-san perched on her shoulder..... A pretty dangerous-looking duo had made their entrance.","W-Well, with Alice and various others around this time, it should be fine. Besides, I remembered that Medea-san had a beautiful singing voice, even when performing songs without lyrics, so as long as she didn't let her tendencies show, it should be okay.","Medea-san was about 5 meters tall, so I had been wondering how she was going to handle the Loudspeaker Magic Tool, but well, at her level, being able to use Loudspeaker Magic herself was probably just basic stuff......","Almost as if to confirm my thoughts, Phenex-san started speaking. Even though they were quite a distance away, her voice rang out clearly, so she was definitely using Loudspeaker Magic.","\"Hello, everyone...... all supernatural beings, all powerful ones, all masses of mediocrity..... and, my God!\"","Phenex-san was the type to be extremely clear about who she liked and who she didn't. I was a bit of an exception, but basically, if someone wasn't strong enough to potentially kill her, she had zero interest in them, and she didn't bother to hide it.","It wasn't like she hated the weak or found them offensive or anything. She just truly, purely had no interest in them, and wished they wouldn't get involved with her. Toward people she wasn't interested in, she was cold to the extreme.","\"Ahh, the world truly is filled with sorrow. Even though there are so many here today, many of whom seem like they could be wonderful friends, it's so difficult to actually deepen those bonds......","\"Since Shalltear-sama is here and it's the birth festival of my God, even the slightest misstep would probably get us thrown out instantly. So today, Tiamat and I are both going to be good.\"","\"It's sad. So very sad. But even amidst all this sorrow, today is a joyous occasion, the birthday of the precious Miyama Kaito-san. I rarely have the opportunity to sing in front of others, but I hope, even if it's modest, that my song can be a celebration of Miyama Kaito-san's birthday.\"","\"Faith and music are deeply connected. Like hymns, for example. Since this is the birth festival of my God, the music we offer carries special power as well. Though, well, the one actually singing is Tiamat, and she always sings requiems......","Medea-san, for all her madness, was at least the type who could exercise self-control. Well, to be fair, even when she spoke, little cracks of madness peeked through here and there, and the light was entirely gone from her eyes, there was this kind of deeply broken aura about her. Combined with her size, the sheer presence she gave off was intense...... Honestly, even from where I was sitting, I could feel a fair number of people in the venue looking pretty intimidated.","\"It's a sad thing, but given how often I witness death, it's only natural that I end up singing a lot of requiems.\"","\"Ahaha, isn't it just because you kill people yourself to indulge your fetishes? That's what you call a match-pump, right?\"","\"That, too, is just part of the endless chain of sorrow.\"","*... Quit creeping out the audience and get started already.\"","Thanks to Alice's sharp retort, Medea-san and Phenex-san began preparing. Just as Phenex-san's body suddenly burst into flames, the next moment, a massive harp made of jade-green fire materialized, and Medea-san gently took it into her hands and began to play.",".....They said Medea-san would be singing, so I thought Phenex-san would be the one playing the instrument.... but she turned into the instrument instead......?","It caught me a little off guard, but the sight of Medea-san holding the flaming harp looked almost like a work of art, exuding an air of solemn grandeur. Then, she began to sing..... and, wow, Medea-san was incredibly good.","The melody was melancholic, fitting for a requiem, but her clear, pure singing voice blended beautifully with the tones from the flaming harp, creating a truly breathtaking piece of music.","With each strum, shimmering sparks of fire scattered through the air like a dream, spreading out across the venue as a soft, glowing light. I felt a slight sense of fatigue lift from my body, it was probably the same healing flames she had demonstrated before, now dispersed subtly through the vibrations f her music.","Before anyone realized it, the awkward atmosphere from earlier had completely vanished, and everyone was quietly listening, captivated by the beautiful performance and her ethereal singing."]},{"number":2232,"title":"Chapter 2232: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 34","paragraphs":["While the party bustled with activity, Lilia let out a quiet sigh of relief. Thanks to Kaito’s influence, her fame had grown, and with it, her list of acquaintances in high society. Whenever she attended events like this, there were many people she absolutely had to greet, and each one held a position of significant status, leaving her little room to relax.","The benefits she gained were considerable, but the stress had her stomach in knots. As always, she found herself wishing Kaito would tone things down just a bit, all while chatting with her close friends, Lunamaria and Sieglinde.","[I’ve finished greeting all the people I absolutely needed to. It’s just a little, but I do feel more at ease now.]","[As expected of Milady, she who represents humanity. This humble Lunamaria can only marvel and chuckle at your continued rise.]","[Chuckle...... yeah, seriously, how did it end up like this......]","[I do feel for you, Lili...... but when it comes to humans, I honestly can’t think of anyone else who’s as closely connected to Kaito-san’s circle as you are. With no other clear candidate, it’s only natural the position would fall to you.]","Lunamaria and Sieglinde spoke with wry smiles as they watched Lilia, who continued to attract trouble like a black hole.","Of course, the burdens she bore came with great rewards. In truth, the Albert Ducal House was steadily becoming the most prominent noble family in the human realm.","[Still, I’m truly grateful to have met Count Scott and Lady Eris. Considering future developments, they were people I really wanted to connect with......]","[Indeed. Recently, we’ve started trade agreements with the Wingeds, and our influence has begun to reach toward the Archlesia Empire...... So to form ties with the Scott County, well-known for international trade, and with the Hamilton Marquisdom, one of the Four Great Noble Houses in Archlesia, is a huge boon...... Seriously, Miyama-sama always manages to meet the exact right people at the exact right time.]","The Albert Duchy had previously been introduced to Amel by Kaito, which led to their current dealings with the Wingeds. Given their expansion into Archlesia, the timing couldn’t have been better.","At such a time, to meet Count Scott, a man dubbed a great merchant with strong international connections, and the heir of the Hamilton Marquisdom, a powerful reformist family within Archlesia, was an incredibly fortunate stroke of luck. Thanks to this, their future endeavors were now far more manageable.","[He met both of them by coincidence in the royal capital, right? That’s just like Kaito-san, but when you stop and think about it, it really is astonishing.]","[It really is. As Sieglinde said, the odds of randomly bumping into a noble in such a vast capital are already low enough, but to not only meet Count Scott, but also run into the daughter of a marquis from another country visiting at the time...... it’s basically impossible under normal circumstances. But with Miyama-sama, well...... you just kind of accept that this kind of thing does happen. It’s terrifying, honestly.]","[It’s still stomach-wrenching for me...... But for some reason, I feel like I’ll be able to build a good relationship with Lady Eris going forward.]","Maybe it was best described as a bond between those who understood the same kind of pain. When Lilia had spoken with Eris not long ago, she’d been surprised at how well they got along.","She found it hard to describe, but there was a real sense of empathy, a shared experience of hardship. It wasn’t just theoretical...... they actually understood each other’s struggles, and that made them empathize with each other.","Eris had seemed to feel the same, and so it had been a natural decision to begin exchanging letters from then on.","[......By the way, Milady, over there...... a newly manifested great God is present...... Shouldn’t you go and greet them?]","[Please stop with those kinds of jokes. My stomach is already tightening up like it's trying to warn me. B- But well, it’s fine. Electrone-sama and I have no real connection, and it’s unlikely that Kaito-san would go out of his way to introduce me. Besides, I’ve already delivered my gift. Honestly, I might not even get a chance to talk with Kaito-san during the party. A- And right now, it looks like Electrone-sama is helping out at the commentary table with the presentation!]","[ [....................] ]","[......Why are you both looking at me like that...... Stop it. You’re making me genuinely anxious......]","Lilia clung to her hopeful delusion like a lifeline, trying to convince even herself, but Lunamaria and Sieglinde could only gaze at her with profound pity.","They were long-time friends, close enough to know: such wishful thinking would never come true. Deep down, they had an almost prophetic certainty, that Lilia’s hopes were destined to be crushed......","『Apologies if this defies your expectations, but would you mind sparing me a moment of your time?』","[ [ [ ! ? ! ? ] ] ]","And so, as one might have expected, her fragile hope was instantly and thoroughly shattered. Electrone was Omniscient and Omnipotent, existing in multiple places at once posed no difficulty at all. Helping with the presentation placed no real limitation on her movements.","With a look that blended despair and resignation, Lilia clutched her stomach and silently nodded in response to Electrone’s voice.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Most readers probably caught on from the very beginning of this chapter, it’s the reliable and proven \"Lilia lets her guard down\" flag......]"]},{"number":2233,"title":"Chapter 2233: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 35","paragraphs":["Electrone’s sudden appearance caused Lilia, Lunamaria, and Sieglinde to freeze in place. That was only natural, anyone would hesitate if an Otherworld God suddenly appeared before their eyes......","『It would be preferable to refrain from doing so, considering the psychological strain it may cause. However, this unit has been designated to visit this world at an early stage, as per the agreement with the other World Creators. Whether it happens now or later, greetings will be necessary either way. Therefore, this unit wishes to extend its greetings at this timing, would that be acceptable?』","[Y- Yesh......]","Electrone spoke in a calm voice, and Lilia nodded with a pale expression. Lunamaria and Sieglinde began to step back.","Normally, when their master Lilia was speaking with someone of higher standing, it would be appropriate for Lunamaria and Sieglinde—who held lower positions—to stand back. However, Electrone halted them.","『Ah, please wait. This unit wishes to greet not only Lilia Albert, but also Lunamaria and Sieglinde, here and now.』","[Y- You want us too?]","『Affirmative. This unit exists outside of your world’s social hierarchy and does not regard your participation in conversation as disrespectful. Furthermore, considering Lilia Albert’s psychological burden, this unit has judged that it would be preferable for her close friends to accompany her rather than conversing one-on-one. Therefore, this unit desires to greet all three of you together.』","Hearing those words from Electrone, a visible sense of relief appeared on Lilia’s face. It was certainly easier on her nerves to have Lunamaria and Sieglinde by her side than to speak with Electrone alone.","Given that Electrone, the highest-ranking being present, wished for their participation, there was no reason for Lunamaria or Sieglinde to refuse. In fact, they were both concerned for Lilia’s well-being and decided to comply with Electrone’s wish, believing that their presence would ease Lilia’s anxiety.","『Now then, once again, outputting greeting...... <Let’s reset and start fresh! Nice to meet you! I’m the Virtual Angel Electrone! Feel free to call me by name!> ......End.』","[......My name is Lilia Albert. I admit I was unaware of your name until today, but I am honored to have the opportunity to greet you like this.]","[I am Lunamaria, personal maid to Duchess Lilia.]","[I am Sieglinde, her bodyguard.]","Following Lilia, who bowed deeply as she introduced herself, Lunamaria and Sieglinde also gave brief introductions and bowed their heads.","『Thank you for your introductions. While this unit would prefer that you not concern yourselves with rank when addressing it, it is inevitable that you, who see this unit as a being of supernatural power, would feel anxious. Therefore, this unit will use its abilities as a supernatural being to ease your concerns.』","[Eh? Errr, what do you mean......]","『As stated earlier, this unit possesses powers that, from your perspective, are of an extremely high order. Among them is the ability to observe the future. You may rest assured, this unit has already observed all possible future outcomes...... In none of those futures does this conversation with you result in displeasure or offense. So, there is no need for you to be tense. You may speak freely. There is no future in which you commit a misstep or show disrespect.』","Electrone’s words truly did ease Lilia and the others’ tension. A being of overwhelmingly high status, one that could even observe the future, had confirmed that in no possible outcome would they offend or upset her during this greeting. It was only natural that their stiff nerves began to relax, if only a little. R₳𐌽O͍𐌱ÈṦ","『Outputting supplement...... <Also, I may be among the most avid within Kaito-sama's Die-Hard Devotees, but I'm more of a hako-oshi kinda chap!> ......Therefore, speaking with all of you is something I genuinely find delightful.』","[Ah, errr...... what does this hako-oshi mean?]","『Ah, my apologies. It seems that phrase isn’t commonly used in your world...... To put it simply, this unit is a fan not only of Kaito-sama, but also of the people and environment around him, including his friendships. In other words, this unit is also a fan of you three, Lilia Albert, Lunamaria, and Sieglinde, and is truly delighted to have this opportunity to speak with you.』","[Errr, so not just Lili, but me and Luna too......?]","『Affirmative. To begin with, this unit holds a general fondness for intelligent life forms...... or, as would be appropriate in your world’s language, humans who strive to live earnestly, whether in this world or another. Outputting emotion...... <Simply put, I love people who try their best, regardless of their world!> ......So you can rest assured that this unit holds you in high regard, and is happy, not discomforted, to be conversing with you.』","As Electrone spoke with a gentle smile, her kind and sincere demeanor clearly conveyed her genuine goodwill toward them. Though only a little, it helped to soften the expressions on Lilia and the others’ faces.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Despite how intense her character is, she’s shockingly proper for a God. I mean, she’s just genuinely fond of people who live their lives earnestly, no matter what world they’re from. When you think about that, she’s actually the perfect person to invite to a party like this......]","? ? ? : [Look closely, Makina. That right there is the mindset you should truly be taking notes on. It’s not just Kaito-san, she holds affection for everyone connected to him as well. You should strive to emulate that completely.]","Makina : [......W- Well, lately I’ve been trying hard to remember the names of those lumps of meat......]"]},{"number":2234,"title":"Chapter 2234: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 36","paragraphs":["Because Electrone was calm and even friendly toward the people living in another world, some of the tension among Lilia and the others had gradually eased.","『Lilia Albert, if I recall correctly, you once received a small world from Machine God. Am I mistaken?』","[Errr...... You're talking about Eden-sama, right? Yes, I did receive it. Electrone-sama, are you acquainted with Eden-sama?]","『Affirmative. I have interacted with Machine God for some time. When that world was created for you, Lilia Albert, I was asked if organisms from my world could be used for display purposes. At that time, I provided a type from the species known as Mechabeasts, which, in your world, would correspond to the Dragonkind.』","[Ahh! You mean those super cool dragons! Yes, they were amazing models.]","『I'm glad to hear you liked them. However, those are only a portion of the Mechabeasts; there are many more. Since we’re on the topic, I’d like to take this opportunity to show some types that I think would appeal to Lunamaria and Sieglinde as well.』","When Electrone said that, the cat-eared device emitted a light, and a small hologram floated into the air.","[......It’s very cute. It looks like a plush toy, but this is also a living creature?]","『Affirmative. This creature has a mechanical outer shell, with the actual body inside. I thought this kind of appearance would suit the preferences of both Sieglinde and Lunamaria.』","[......Y- Yes, that’s true. If they sold plushies of it, I’d definitely want one.]","Looking intently at the projected creature with interest, Sieglinde nodded, and although Lunamaria seemed a bit shy, she didn’t try to deny it———– after all, it wasn’t strange for a God to know their tastes. Instead, she simply responded with honest words.","After chatting a while longer in a calm and pleasant atmosphere, Electrone eventually spoke again, sensing the right moment.","『As much as I would like to stay, time is limited. Unfortunately, for someone like me who is equal with my hako-oshi, there are just too many people at this venue I want to greet. Let us save further conversation for the next time I visit your world. I sincerely thank you for responding to my request.』","[The honor is ours, Electrone-sama. It was a pleasure speaking with you.]","[Getting to talk to a Creator God from another world is a once-in-a-lifetime experience. It was precious and enjoyable.]","[I feel the same as Lili and Luna. I’m glad I had the chance to speak with you, Electrone-sama.]","Seeing the three of them smiling gently, their nervousness now completely gone, Electrone nodded with a look of satisfaction.","Then, after a brief pause, Electrone spoke again, gently.","『As I mentioned earlier, I am a fan of yours. With the abilities at my disposal, I’ve come to know a fair amount about you. Lilia Albert...... you are a truly pure soul. You’ve endured many hardships and tasted bitter experiences more than once. And yet, you’ve come to understand that the world around you is not only made of suffering. You’ve remained untainted, with a heart that is clean and unwavering. Even with just a glimpse, your path has shone bright and noble to me.』","\"T- Thank you very much.\"","Hit by the sudden, heartfelt words of praise, Lilia bowed her head with a slightly bashful expression, gratitude filling her voice.","Electrone then turned to look at Lunamaria and Sieglinde, speaking in the same gentle tone as when addressing Lilia.","『Lunamaria...... you are someone with a remarkably delicate heart. You care deeply for those close to you, notice even the smallest changes, and are able to silently offer your support. That is truly a wonderful quality. I am certain many have been saved by your thoughtfulness.』","[B- Being praised so directly like that is a bit embarrassing, but I’m honored.]","『Sieglinde...... you are someone who embodies the phrase kan’ōchirai, learning from the past and applying those lessons to shape the future through effort. It sounds simple, but it is actually quite difficult and requires real courage. I truly admire that. Please, never forget that spirit, and continue honing yourself.』","[I’m deeply grateful for your kind words of praise.]","After praising Lilia, Lunamaria, and Sieglinde in turn, Electrone nodded in clear satisfaction.","『Each of you is wonderful in your own way. Though our time was brief, the moments I spent speaking with you were truly precious. You have my heartfelt gratitude. As your fan, I will continue to support you all. I hope that each of you can remain true to yourselves and live in good health...... It truly was a marvelous time. I do hope we can speak again the next time I visit this world.』","[Yes, when that time comes...... we’d love to talk with you again.]","Speaking on behalf of the three, Lilia responded to Electrone’s words. Pleased by her reply, Electrone nodded with a smile, then mentioning she would go greet others as well, she vanished.","[......H- How should I say this...... I- I know it’s terribly rude to say this, but...... she was the most God-like God I’ve ever met.]","[Yes, I feel the same as Lili. Somehow, she just makes you want to show respect without thinking.]","[When she first appeared, I thought she might be one of those more eccentric types...... But no, that doesn't seem to be the case at all.]","Having just spoken with Electrone, whose air of divine benevolence was so overwhelmingly proper and exalted, the three couldn’t help but wear mixed, slightly conflicted expressions on their faces, perhaps subconsciously comparing her to someone else they all knew.","<Afterword>","Makina: [I wonder who they were thinking of?]","Serious-senpai: [It’s almost certainly you...... You are a problem child after all.]","Makina : [......Being a proper God is hard. I’m not really sure how to go about it.]","Serious-senpai : [For starters, maybe don’t call people \"lumps of flesh\"? That might help a little.]","Makina : [......What about \"meat puppets\" or \"zero-value organisms\"?]","Serious-senpai : [I didn’t think I’d ever say this, but \"lumps of flesh\" actually sounds better by comparison......]","Makina : [No matter what you call them, \"lumps of flesh\" would still be lumps of flesh. In the broader sense, I mean, I’m a lump of flesh, my children are lumps of flesh, and you are a lump of flesh too, Serious-senpai. Though in my case, maybe \"lumps of metal\" fits better.]","Serious-senpai : [......Unn?]","Makina : [Unn? What’s wrong?]","Serious-senpai: [...... (Arehh? Did she just say her children are lumps of flesh too in the broader sense...... Unn? Hold on...... don’t tell me...... she’s never actually been using \"lumps of flesh\" as an insult......?)]"]},{"number":2235,"title":"Chapter 2235: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 37","paragraphs":["Between the live shows, they made sure to give us a decent amount of free time. In my case, I used that time to spin the garapon and receive some gifts.","Still, the atmosphere was really nice...... I had no idea what to expect when it all started, but this birthday party turned out to be way more fun than I imagined.","What made it great was that, despite the fact that the place was packed with well-known people and the venue was absolutely extravagant, it didn’t feel overly formal or stiff. Everyone was just doing their own thing, laughing and having fun. That kind of laid-back vibe really worked.","Thanks to that, I didn’t feel overly tense either. I could just enjoy the game tournament and live performances, receive gifts, and have casual conversations at my own pace.","Thinking about how the event was run, I got the impression that Alice probably had a big hand in organizing things. I’m sure it was all carefully planned so I wouldn’t feel too uptight or uncomfortable.","Feeling grateful for that, I gave the garapon another spin......","<MEGIDDO ARGETES BORGNES>","Oh, next up is Megiddo-san...... I remember she was super into watching video games earlier. As for her gift...... yeah, it’s definitely gonna be alcohol. There's no doubting that. In fact, I’d be more surprised if it wasn’t alcohol.","While I was thinking that, Ein-san brought Megiddo-san over to me...... Oi, wait, Why is she in her little girl form? Last time I saw her, she was in her usual massive, 10-meter magic beast form...... Why go out of the way to take on her little girl form? Don’t tell me...... does Megiddo-san actually think that kind of appearance is my type? Seriously...... I might need to have a proper talk with her later.","[Ou, Kaito. I’m here!]","[Hello, Megiddo-san. Thank you for coming today.]","[It’s a celebration, don’t sweat it. Not that I really helped much with the setup or anything. I tried to, but Shalltear told me to stay out of the way.]","[Ahh......]","Megiddo-san...... how do I say this...... it’s not that she has bad taste or anything, but if left to her own devices, she’d probably let her personal preferences run wild. I could totally see her turning the place into something more like a party hall or even a banquet hall...... Well, that could be fun in its own right, but it probably wouldn’t mesh with the rest of the theme. I bet Alice told her to keep a low profile because of that.","[Well, Shalltear’s way better at this kind of stuff anyway, so I did as I was told...... Still, World Creators are on a whole other level, huh? Just look at this venue, there are materials here we couldn’t even dream of recreating in our world......]","[Eh? R- Really?]","[Ou. Even the chair you’re sitting on, Kaito, that thing’s made of some completely unknown material. I’m staring right at it and I still can’t figure out what it is......]","She said it so casually, but...... Eh, this chair is that impressive? Sure, it feels great to sit in and I hadn’t felt tired at all, but to think it’s made from a material even Megiddo-san can’t identify...... That’s definitely something Shiro-san or Makina-san whipped up from scratch.","[Well, whatever! More importantly, it’s time to celebrate! Here, Kaito, I brought you some good booze.]","[Thank you. Just as I expected, alcohol huh?]","[With this many people around, there’s gonna be a mountain of gifts, right? So in the end, stuff you can actually use up is the easiest to deal with. You can never have too much alcohol after all.]","[Ahaha, that’s just like Megiddo-san...... But you’ve got a point.]","Just as I expected, it was alcohol, but like Megiddo-san said, consumables are definitely easier to accept without pressure. Judging by the container, it looked like a really high-quality bottle. Megiddo-san really knows her alcohol, so I’m sure she picked something that suits my taste. I’m genuinely looking forward to drinking it.","[Come to think of it, Megiddo-san, you seemed pretty into the video game earlier.]","[Yeah, they were really well made. I was impressed...... When you use them as simulated combat with set restrictions, they actually let people with vastly different skill levels fight on even ground. It’s a smart system. But trying to replicate something like that with magic tools seems way too complex.]","[The setup’s different, but Alice made a VR game for the Six Kings Festival......]","[That one’s also a little different. I tried it myself, and the basic concept reminded me of...... you know, that mind comparison magic I used on you before. It’s like pulling just your consciousness into a separate space. But that kind of magic usually comes with strict conditions. For example, the mind comparison magic won’t activate unless both sides agree to it. Shalltear’s game works under similar principles.]","[So Alice’s VR game has some sort of conditions attached too?]","[Yeah. I’d guess that part of the setup involves an explanation beforehand, and the act of \"choosing to put on\" the animal suit embedded with magic crystals and magic formulas counts as giving consent for the spell contract...... Well, even setting that aside, just creating a pseudo-space to project your consciousness into burns through a ton of resources, so it’s not easy.]","Come to think of it, Alice did say something like that, the VR game was way too expensive to make under normal circumstances, but she pulled it off because Shiro-san was sponsoring it and let her use as many materials as she wanted.","Games like that are incredibly complex, and if you’re trying to recreate that kind of programming with magic formulas, it must be insanely difficult. When it comes to detailed mechanics like that, maybe machines really are clearly superior to magic tools.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [So, care to explain yourself?]","Makina : [Eh? Explain what?]","Serious-senpai : [What exactly do you mean when you call people \"lumps of flesh\" all the time......?]","Makina : [Oh, that? I mean it exactly as it sounds. Let’s see...... how should I put it......? It’s like, a state where I haven’t recognized any individual value in them yet. From my perspective, the difference in physical capabilities between most of such beings is so minor, it’s basically negligible. Anything below Quasi-Omnipotent level, really, I can’t even perceive much of a difference. So to me, anything below that tier doesn’t have enough individuality in their physical traits to register as distinct. They’re just talking lumps of flesh.]","Serious-senpai : [......Right, I guess to someone like you, the gap between a regular person and a Peerage Holder is just a rounding error......]","Makina : [Calling them all \"Humans\" or \"Demons\" or whatever doesn’t sit right with me either, and I’m not exactly interested in tailoring my terminology to each world. So I lump them together and call them \"talking lumps of flesh\". But that’s not necessarily a bad thing. That label just means they’re still in the pre-evaluation stage for me. Once I see something that sets them apart, something that makes me acknowledge their individuality, they stop being just flesh and gain value in my eyes. Like with Lilia...... She started out as a talking lump of flesh, but I ended up sympathizing with her struggles, feeling for how she got dragged around, and she even helped me out a few times. All that made me recognize her value as something unique.]","Serious-senpai : [H- Hmmm...... Right. So basically, if we ignore the whole \"lump of flesh\" terminology, it’s kinda like how Shiro was at the beginning, seeing most things as equally uninteresting, without individual value......]","Makina : [Yeah, more or less. Though I do have exceptions. My children, for instance, already have immense value to me right from the start, because they’re my children. I openly play favorites with them, and to me, each one is special from the very beginning. I’ll admit to that bias. But that doesn’t mean I'm saying the children from other worlds are worthless. When I call someone a lump of flesh, it just means I haven’t found anything in them worth evaluating yet. But once I recognize someone’s value, once I remember their name, I’ll call them by it. And I treat them decently too. I’m even pretty tolerant of a bit of disrespect. Lunamaria’s a good example.]","Serious-senpai : [......Unn, I see...... Even a terrifying God has their own standards huh...... What about those nobles you threatened?]","Makina : [Unn? That isn't the case, okay? I just had a proper talk with those lumps of flesh...... As for those trash worse than the others, I had to discipline them harshly. Especially the ones who even think about using or were looking down on my beloved child...... Those ones? Yeah, there’s no saving them.]","Serious-senpai : [Ah, yes......]"]},{"number":2236,"title":"Chapter 2236: Intermission: Meanwhile, in Kaito’s Backyard......","paragraphs":["While Kaito's birthday party was in full swing in another world, bustling with energy, out in the backyard of Kaito's house, Nebula was enjoying tea with ∇∮◆£, who had come to visit.","In the middle of their chat, ∇∮◆£ suddenly made a motion as if punching the air, prompting Nebula to smile wryly.","[How close you two are.]","[My apologies...... I got the feeling Electrone had completely factored in getting punched...... But still, your tea is truly exquisite, Nebula-san.]","[But of course. I am Absolute after all.]","Having already heard the situation from Canalis in advance, ∇∮◆£ had likely practiced beforehand, and despite Nebula speaking in polite language, she responded normally and didn’t fumble when addressing her as \"Nebula-san\".","Smiling as if savoring the blissful moment of drinking the tea Nebula had made and served, ∇∮◆£ still wore a somewhat conflicted expression.","[......Well, I suppose I’m just a little jealous of how lucky Electrone is.]","[I understand the feeling, but in this case, it’s probably more due to Milord’s luck than Electrone’s. Electrone is very friendly toward inhabitants of other worlds, and if someone were to be invited to his birthday party, she would indeed be the most suitable choice.]","[Electrone is amiable after all. So much so that she’s always saying that unless she limits her emotions, she tends to get too involved with others and ends up repeating past mistakes.]","[Yes...... Well, there’s no need for you to rush, ∇∮◆£-san. You're here in Trinia now after all. Before long, you’ll have your chance to meet Milord too.]","[I hope so.]","With a gentle smile, ∇∮◆£ responded to Nebula’s words. Though she could turn into a berserker when consumed by jealousy, her usual personality was extremely gentle and relaxed, with an air of calmness that made her seem like a rather mild-mannered woman.","Seeing ∇∮◆£ like that, Nebula suddenly seemed to remember something and spoke up.","[Now that I think about it, your world exists on a much higher dimensional level than this one or Milord’s world. Is everything okay in terms of adjustment?]","[Yes. As you might imagine, it was a bit tricky. I managed to adjust my appearance like this, but the real problem was my name...... Since I exist in a higher dimension, the people living in this world wouldn’t be able to perceive it as language.]","[That’s true. Everyone has some degree of cognitive compensation, so it would likely be perceived as an extremely high or low, strange sound.]","∇∮◆£ was a being from a far higher dimension than this one. Just as two-dimensional beings cannot perceive the third dimension, beings like ∇∮◆£ from a higher dimension cannot be recognized by the inhabitants of this world in terms of form or voice.","Of course, beings such as Shallow Vernal or Kuromueina, who can perceive or even interfere with higher dimensions, could see and hear ∇∮◆£, but ordinarily, that would be impossible.","Thanks to the brain’s compensation mechanisms, ∇∮◆£ might be perceived as a grotesque monster with an unpleasant, strange voice, but such interpretations would make actual conversation impossible. That’s why ∇∮◆£ had adjusted her body and language functions to enter this world. However, her name remained a problem. It simply couldn’t be rendered properly here, so she was planning a separate solution for that.","[Yes, that's why I came up with a name suited for this world so I could introduce myself to Kaito-sama. In this world, I go by the name \"Tiana\".]","[I see. Then, while we're meeting in this world, I shall address you as Tiana-san.]","[Yes.]","Tiana nodded with a happy expression at Nebula’s words. Though she did feel some envy toward Electrone and Canalis for being able to participate in Kaito’s birthday party, being able to spend this quiet time alone with Nebula was something that made her extremely happy. So while she was envious, she wasn’t consumed by jealousy.","[Ah, right. Tiana-san, if you wish to celebrate Milord’s birthday, there might be a way I can help———– indirectly, at least.]","[Oh? What do you mean?]","[The gift I’m preparing for Milord...... if you’re willing, would you like to help me create it?]","Though she couldn't give her present to Kaito directly, Nebula’s suggestion offered her a chance to be involved in the gift itself...... Of course, for Tiana, it was an opportunity she couldn't hope for more, and she agreed without hesitation.","<Afterword>","<Bipolar God Tiana>","A being of an exceedingly high dimension, even among the countless worlds. With rare exceptions (such as Epilogue), the laws and abilities of lower dimensions hold no sway over Tiana, she can ignore and nullify all such principles at will.","Ordinarily, the inhabitants of Trinia, a lower-dimensional world, would be unable to perceive Tiana's form or comprehend her language. However, she has adjusted herself for visitation...... to put it simply, she's like something out of Godzilla: Singular Point.","In principle, lower dimension beings cannot possibly contend with Tiana on equal footing...... However, Makina stands as a special case. Her true body exists in a space that does not belong to any dimensional stratum and cannot be reached by anyone, not even herself, without the key possessed by Alice. Due to this overwhelming paradox, she possesses a level of immortality that ranks among the greatest of the World Creators, and as such, there exists a slight possibility that her battling Tiana is viable. Even so, given Tiana's absurdly high base combat power, Makina remains at a distinct disadvantage."]},{"number":2237,"title":"Chapter 2237: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 38","paragraphs":["<Announcement>","Following the tapestry and smartphone stand, a third round of merchandise has been confirmed: the \"Alice's Random Box\", a collection of tin badges set to go on sale in late May. There will be six different designs, randomly included in each box.","While they will be partially available at events like the Fukuoka Hobby Show, the main method of purchase will likely be online, just like the tapestry and smartphone stand.","Once the sales page is ready, we’ll share the information in an activity report.","While I spun the garapon in order and received presents, the main focus during the live performances was still very much on the music itself.","Each group seemed to get one song, and right now, Dragon Soul was rocking the stage with a cool, high-energy rock performance. It was also a good time to grab something to eat, and as I was just thinking that I'd like some food, Ein-san had already prepared a plate for me. As expected of her, always a step ahead.","The food, unsurprisingly, was excellent. With so many skilled cooks around, it was no surprise everything tasted amazing. Alice had mentioned that Kuro had aggressively pushed for baby castella, but so far, I hadn't encountered anything like that.","\"......Think it's about the right time?\"","\"Unn? For what?\"","\"Well, everyone’s had a chance to watch the game tournament or the concert and get some food, so I was thinking, it’s time to bring out the birthday cake.\"","\"Ahh, yeah. Most of the light eaters are probably done eating by now. I’m a light eater myself, and I’m already finished.\"","\"......Did you even eat anything?\"","\"......Eating is such a hassle, you know? I’m glad I have a body that doesn’t require food. I can just eat when I feel like it.\"","Even though she’s made improvements in a lot of areas, Fate-san’s laziness is still very much intact. She usually finds things like eating too much trouble.","That said, she does nibble on snacks from time to time when the mood strikes her, and when we’re together, she tends to eat or drink more often, maybe because she wants to share the same taste experience with me.","Anyway, that aside...... birthday cake huh...... Now that she mentioned it, it hadn't shown up yet. Since it was a standing buffet-style party, they must’ve planned to serve the cake a little later, as more of a dessert centerpiece.","\"Alright then, we’ll bring the cake out in 5 minutes. Game tournament participants, please pause and focus your attention over here.\"","\"Come to think of it, who ended up making Kai-chan’s birthday cake? Wasn’t there a bit of drama about this during the planning stage?\"","\"There were too many people who wanted to make it. There are the obvious ones like Shallow Vernal-sama and Makina, but there's also Ein-san and the others good at cooking who wanted in. If we let everyone participate, it would’ve turned into a disaster, so yeah, the decision process was a bit tense.\"","\"Didn’t Kurorin insist on making it a baby castella cake or something?\"","\"That's just her illness snapping again, so her idea was firmly rejected.\"","Apparently, the cake situation got pretty heated. I could easily picture Shiro-san and Makina having a silent standoff over it.","As for Kuro, well...... Alice really did a great job keeping her in check. I mean, I do like baby castella, but an actual baby castella cake...... No thanks. I’m sure she pushed that idea somewhere else during the planning process......","\"......By the way, it’s got nothing to do with the cake, but what happened to that baby castella cushion Kurorin insisted was \"absolutely necessary\" and worked so hard to make?\"","\"Ahh, you mean the one she aggressively pushed through. We placed a few of them around the venue’s rest areas, but the main reveal will come a bit later.\"","Wait, she actually made something weird!? A baby castella-shaped cushion? ......Well, I mean, they’re round, so I guess in terms of shape, they could work as mini-cushions.","\"Sorry, we derailed in the conversation. And so, who ended up making the cake in the end?\"","\"That would be me. Letting anyone else handle it was just too risky. I’m the safest choice.\"","[......I still feel your decision on that was tyrannical. I haven’t come to terms with it.]","[......I wanted to make a birthday cake for my beloved child too......]","\"Be quiet. You two already do whatever you want everywhere else. I’m not about to let you create some unholy entity in the name of a cake.\"","So the cake was made by Alice huh. Honestly, that was absolutely the right call, nothing could be more reassuring.","At least this way, I didn’t have to worry about it being something absurdly bizarre, made from unknown ingredients that doesn't exist in this world, or glowing ominously for no reason.","\"Now then, it’s been 5 minutes, time for the cake to make its grand entrance.\"","....................................That thing’s huge!","<Afterword>","<Origin of Bipolar God Tiana's Name>","It was derived from Diana, the Roman name of Moon Goddess Artemis. The idea was to use a name that’s widely known but presented under an alternate form.","Serious-senpai : [It’s huge? Ah, well, if you think about how it needs to be cut and shared with every participant, I guess making it colossal was inevitable......]"]},{"number":2238,"title":"Chapter 2238: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 39","paragraphs":["The birthday cake that appeared was...... well, absurdly huge. Honestly, even a wedding cake would seem modest in comparison, it was that massive.","It looked incredibly delicious. Covered in a vivid array of fruits and beautifully decorated, as expected of Alice, it had a festive appearance that was fun just to look at.","But the size...... it was just ridiculously big. Way too big.","\"Shall-tan...... isn't that a bit too big?\"","\"Well, if it were just for Kaito-san, I would’ve made it smaller, but with all the participants here, it naturally has to be about this size.\"","\"Ah, right. There are a lot more people this time compared to last time, and some of them are pretty big too.\"","Now that she mentioned it, that made sense. If someone like Megiddo was going to eat it, even this size might not be enough. Though Megiddo doesn't really like sweets, she'd probably only have a little, so it should be fine......","\"Wait, but isn’t it a tradition in the other world...... or maybe it’s the same for the Humans here too? Anyway, you’re supposed to blow out a number of candles equal to your age, right?\"","\"There are all kinds of customs. Some people blow out candles shaped like their age...... but yeah, blowing out candles is pretty standard.\"","\"But can Kai-chan even blow out candles that match the size of that cake?\"","Fate-san didn’t seem to know much about birthday parties, but come to think of it, many of the Demons and Gods were incredibly old, and a lot of them didn’t even remember their own age in detail.","It seems that among Demons, birthday celebrations aren’t really a thing, so it’s not surprising that Fate-san, a God, wouldn’t be familiar with them either.","And she had a point, if they brought out candles to match that cake's size, there’s no way I’d be able to blow them out. But well, I couldn’t imagine Alice not thinking that through.","\"Ah, it’s fine. I was going to prepare a mini version of the cake for the candle-blowing part, but...... some people insisted on participating, so...... it was decided this is gonna be solved with divine power. Now then, Shallow Vernal-sama, Makina, please prepare the candles.\"","At Alice’s instructions, Shiro-san and Makina-san gave a small wave of their hands, and massive candles, perfectly matching the size of the giant birthday cake, appeared and lit up.","The flames were clearly about the size of my head, and there was no way I could blow them out. I was wondering how they expected me to manage when Canalis-san suddenly appeared right beside me.","[Okay. I’ll be shrinking them down...... Alright, Kaito-sama, here you go.]","[......T- Thank you. I see, brute force with divine power huh.]","[Tahaa~~ With god powers, most things can be solved pretty easily.]","Canalis-san shrunk the giant cake and candles, placing them on a small table in front of me. I see, this way, I could blow them out with no problem, and once I did, they could just return everything to its original size......","\"Alright, everyone, you've all got your lyric sheets, right? Okay, here we go~~\"","At that signal, a costumed band, who had somehow appeared on the live stage without me noticing, began to play the familiar classic birthday tune.","Just as she said, the people gathered in the venue held up lyric sheets and began to sing the birthday song.","How should I say this...... it was an incredibly extravagant sight...... But still, no matter what, things like this really do make you happy, and I could feel a warm sensation rising behind my eyes.","Prompted by Canalis-san just as the song ended, I blew out the candles, and was immediately greeted by a burst of applause and the sound of party crackers going off.","Despite all the over-the-top elements, they still made sure to include the traditional touches, bringing out the real spirit of a birthday party...... and it made me truly realize just how blessed I was.","No, seriously...... if only the scale of it all were a bit more reasonable, I would’ve had absolutely no complaints...... Unn. Well, I guess that part’s on me for not saying anything beforehand.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [That was a heartwarming and lovely story. However, we mustn’t forget...... the gift scenes from Kaito's other lovers besides Shiro and Lilia haven't appeared yet...... and there’s no doubt the rest of them will have one too...... Kuh, is it going to get all sweet from here on out? Just like the cake——- ow!?]","? ? ? : [......Can I punch you for that?]","Serious-senpai : [You already did though!?]"]},{"number":2239,"title":"Chapter 2239: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 40","paragraphs":["Canalis-san restored the cake, shrunken earlier to blow out the candles, back to its original size, then sliced it up and distributed it to everyone at the venue.","The cake that Alice had made was, as expected, incredibly delicious. Unlike last time, it didn't change flavors or have any kind of special gimmick, it was a simple shortcake, but it was so refined that the taste left a deep impression, even moved me.","[......As expected of my worthy rival. Incredibly delicate and sophisticated in both structure and flavor...... choosing to keep it simple precisely because she has absolute confidence in her skills...... Hah, well played.]","Ein-san looked proud, as if reaffirming the strength of her rival. Meanwhile, Alice, at the commentary seat, wore an expression of genuine annoyance. However, she seemed to be intentionally ignoring Ein-san's words, probably knowing that pointing anything out would only play into Ein-san’s pace and lead to a rant about her bizarre maid theories.","\"......Well then, we’ll resume the live performances shortly, so please continue enjoying your conversations and such.\"","\"Is there still something after the concert? I mean, judging by the time, there has to be. A lot of people haven’t given Kai-chan their presents yet. I mean, I haven’t either.\"","\"Yes, well, as usual, time flows differently in this world, so there’s no need to worry about our schedules in Trinia. There’s also a break room, so if anyone’s tired, feel free to rest there. Also, within the castle, there are hobby-filled exhibition rooms made by people who had too much free time on their hands, so feel free to check those out too.\"","\"Ahh~~ didn’t Kurorin make a room that felt like it was completely buried in baby castellas?\"","\"There’s a bunch of other stuff too. Ahh, but please don’t go near the <Beloved Child Museum> outside the castle. It’s a cursed house. We won’t be responsible if your mind breaks.\"","Apparently, Kuro wasn't the only one doing whatever they wanted...... well, that figures...... The castle is way too big, and with Shiro-san, Makina-san, and Canalis-san here, it’s not like they need much time for setup, so it’s not strange that people would find ways to kill time.","And once again, the <Beloved Child Museum>, created by Makina-san, was specifically named as a restricted area...... which I completely understood, though she herself seemed unhappy about it.","[......Ehh, but it’s one of my proudest creations. Anyone connected with my beloved child should absolutely see it. I poured all my love into it, presenting their charm from a mother’s perspective.]","\"And we're telling you to stop trying to traumatize people. Only those with an extraordinary mind and absurd capabilities can endure that thing.\"","Even Kuro apparently gets headaches from it, so it must be overflowing with Makina-san’s madness. Canalis-san apparently went through the whole thing, and just hearing that conveyed how intense it must’ve been.","That’s what I was thinking when I suddenly heard some unexpected words.","『......I already visited it using a different body, and I found the facility to be absolutely wonderful. Outputting emotion...... <Makina-chan's meticulous attention to detail was truly moving! Personally, I thought it could’ve been even longer~~> ......This unit is Kaito-sama's hardcore fan.』","[Right?! I knew you'd get it, Electrone!!! We've had so many deep talks about my beloved child before too!!!]","『Affirmative. However, we are beings of a rather high level, and I believe it would be a mistake to expect the same from the general public.』","[Ahh...... now that you mention it...... without a solid foundation, it might be too advanced and hard to understand in some areas when it comes to appreciating my beloved child.]","It seemed that Electrone-san was quite affirming about the museum. Apparently, she'd already gone to see it, using another body or something, and made it all the way through.","\"......Arehh? You two know each other?\"","[I’ve been close with Electrone for ages. We’re both machine and cybernetic in nature, so we have similar traits. We’ve stayed in touch a lot. Lately, we’ve been having a blast talking about my beloved child too......]","『This unit and Machine God have long been in a contractual relationship, exchanging information and such.』","\"Then Electrone-san, could you keep that idiot in check if she starts going off the rails? I’m already juggling commentary and hosting. Adding Makina duty on top of that, I’m seriously swamped.\"","『Acknowledged. If I determine that she’s gone too far, I will intervene. Outputting emotion continues...... <Besides, having actually met Kaito-sama, I really wanted to talk with Makina-chan about him!> ......Hero-dono, please focus on your duties without worry.』","Apparently, Electrone-san had been close friends with Makina-san for quite a while, and Alice looked visibly relieved, as though she had just found a savior, gladly passing Makina-san’s supervision over to her.","Unn, I could easily imagine she had it rough with the preparations, not just with Makina-san, but with Shiro-san and everyone else too.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [There were some scenes suggesting they’d known each other for a while, like that time with the reward for Lilia, but it seems they’re not just acquaintances, they’re actually close...... And calling Alice \"Hero-dono\" is definitely because she’s heard about her from Makina...... And now, here's the Beloved Child Museum, unexpectedly receiving overwhelming praise from World Creators.]"]},{"number":2240,"title":"Chapter 2240: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 41","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I'm tired from the Expo today, so today's chapter will be short.","The live performance resumed, and in between, I also spun the garapon to receive presents. Honestly, assuming I were to receive presents from everyone in the venue, it feels like there’s still a significant number left. I might need to pick up the pace a bit.","......Actually, can I even manage to receive them all? It feels like quite a bit of time has already passed since the event started, and even though I don’t have to worry about the time when I go back, staying at the party the entire time would get tiring.","Will the people who didn’t get picked by the raffle just give me their presents all at once later? But that feels a bit rude too......","(There’s no problem. That aspect has already been discussed, and we’ve prepared countermeasures.)","Shiro-san? Ahh, so you’d already anticipated a scenario where things would take too long. So, what kind of countermeasures are we talking about here......? Don’t tell me we’re going to have a second birthday day or something?","(That suggestion was actually brought up. Just like during Hydra Kingdom's Founding Festival, there was a proposal where only Kaito-san would repeat the event several times to receive presents from everyone, and then all the versions would be merged with their memories intact.)","Honestly, I’m glad that idea stayed in the proposal stage. Repeating the same party twice would ruin any surprises, and I wouldn’t even know how to react.","Trying to recreate the same emotional feeling I had during the cake song performance in a parallel birthday party would just be impossible......","(So instead, after this live performance, we’ll have a short event, followed by what we’re calling Super Present Time.)","......Unn? Super Present Time?","(Yes. For a very short duration, we’ll create parallel worlds. While only about 10 minutes pass here, Kaito will go through each parallel world to receive gifts from everyone, one at a time. Once finished, we’ll transfer the memories of the gift-givers back to their original selves. That way, no matter how many people are left, everything can be wrapped up smoothly. All the gifts received in the parallel worlds will automatically be stored in Kaito’s magic box.)","......I see...... So that’s how you’re handling it...... Well, yeah, if I’m the only one spending a lot of time, then it doesn’t keep everyone else waiting.","And since it’s not the entire party being repeated, just multiple iterations of 10-minute segments, I wouldn’t be experiencing the same event over and over...... If I’m going to receive gifts from everyone properly, this might really be the best way to do it.","W- Well, I mean, it does sound pretty rough for me...... but since everyone went out of their way to prepare gifts, I want to receive them in person, so I’ve got no complaints.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Well, there’s no shortage of people who can solve time-related problems around here...... Like temporarily freezing time for everyone except the recipient and Kaito...... Ahh, but then there are those who can nullify that too, so creating parallel worlds and merging them all at the end might just be the easiest solution......]"]},{"number":2241,"title":"Chapter 2241: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 42","paragraphs":["For now, it doesn’t look like I need to worry about running out of time to receive presents, so I spin the garapon again during a break between concerts.","<ISIS REMNANT>","Oh, it’s Isis-san. It hasn’t been that long since we talked during the exhibition match at the second game tournament, so it’s not like this draw is early or anything, but for some reason, it feels like I got her pretty early.","Well, the order doesn’t really matter...... Though Shiro-san probably cared about that, I doubt it made much difference for the others. Since the system lets us receive and integrate presents from parallel worlds, there’s no pressure about making the last present some kind of grand finale.","[......Kaito...... happy...... birthday.]","[Thank you very much. I’m happy to be celebrated.]","[......If Kaito’s happy...... then I’m happy too...... but...... it kinda feels like I got a present...... before I even gave mine.]","She said that with a faint smile and showed me the bracelet that Canalis-san had made earlier.","[Ahh, that bracelet...... is it working out well?]","[......Unn...... it’s amazing...... As long as no one gets within 50 cm, it’s fine...... So I can put up a small barrier at about 50 cm...... and if it keeps people with weak powers from getting too close, I can be relieved...... Before, I needed at least 5 m, which made it difficult...... but 50 cm is easy to maintain all the time...... and it doesn’t bother people around me...... so it’s a relief.]","[Yeah, I get that. If you have to block out a 5-meter radius, that’s a pretty big area. I’m glad to hear it’s easier now. I know I’m copying what you just said, but...... seeing you happy makes me happy too, Isis-san.]","[......Kaito...... unn.]","Isis-san gave me a deeply heartfelt smile at my words, and just seeing that expression filled me with happiness.","Thereupon, as if she just remembered, she pulled out a wrapped package.","[......Ah...... I need to give you your present...... Here...... I hope you like it.]","[Thank you. Is it okay if I open it now?]","[......Unn.]","Judging from the feel, the size, and the shape of the wrapping, it seemed like it might be a book. Isis-san loves books, so that would make sense. Maybe it’s a recommendation she hasn’t told me about yet?","Thinking that, I opened the bag, and inside was a book with a large Blue Crystal Flower illustrated on the cover...... but it didn’t have a title. I flipped through the pages and found they were all blank.","[......Ah, is this maybe...... a diary book?]","[......Unn...... you told me you still write in your diary sometimes...... though not as often as before...... so I thought you might use it for that...... and I made it.]","[Eh? You made this yourself, Isis-san?]","[......Unn...... making a book isn’t that hard...... I practiced drawing the cover.]","Oh my, the present was a handmade diary book from Isis-san. The book itself was sturdy, and the cover was so beautiful that I had assumed it was a commercially sold product, so I was genuinely surprised.","Wait...... Isis-san can draw too? Now that I think about it, she does have a refined and artistic vibe about her, so that kind of talent fits.","[That's amazing! Thank you very much...... Ah, I just thought of something. Since I received it from you, maybe I could use this diary book exclusively for memories with you. That way, when I look back on it later, I can recall and relive all the fun times we shared.]","[......That’s...... really lovely...... If you use it that way...... I’ll be very happy too.]","It was a spur-of-the-moment idea, but having different diaries for different people might not be a bad concept. Having too many would be a hassle, of course, but for my lovers, it could be nice to have a separate one, write in it after our date, for instance. It would probably feel wonderful to look back on later.","[Anyway, thank you again for the wonderful gift. Let’s hang out again soon! With that bracelet, I think going on a date in the city could be really nice too.]","[......Unn...... I’m really looking forward to it...... Fufu...... Being able to look forward to the future like this...... makes me really happy...... It’s all thanks to you, Kaito...... I’d love to talk more but...... the next live show’s about to start, so...... I’ll head back.]","[Okay.]","After smiling happily, Isis-san suddenly seemed to have thought of something, then quietly hugged me and whispered into my ear.","[......Kaito...... I love you.]","And as she let go of me, she gently brushed her lips against mine in a swift, feather-light kiss, then with a bashful smile, she waved adorably before returning to the party.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [It has begun huh.]","Serious-senpai : [Yeah...... it’s begun. Hell itself...... But I’ve made it this far, surviving countless shurabas!!! Now I’ll show you my perfect new countermeasure against sweet developments!!]","? ? ? : [Have you...... ever actually overcome any of them? Also, new countermeasure......]","Serious-senpai : [Anyway, I’m going to sleep...... Wake me up when the sweet stuff is over......]","? ? ? : [No, that’s not new at all though...... You've tried that so many times before and never once pulled it off......]"]},{"number":2242,"title":"Chapter 2242: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 43","paragraphs":["After receiving a present from Isis-san, it seemed like the next live performance was about to begin. I heard the sounds of traditional Japanese instruments, which I thought was quite unusual, so I looked toward the stage...... and there stood Blossom-san along with several members of the World King camp.","I recognized some of them from the Harmonic Symphony tea party and such, so it was clear they were also guests at the party.","As for Blossom-san, she had what you might call a traditional Japanese instrument band...... a band made up of Japanese instruments? I mean, it was kind of fitting, but something about it felt just a little bit off.","There was someone holding a guitar that seemed like a koto, a massive taiko drum that you'd only ever see at festivals, and even someone with a shamisen the size of a contrabass...... They looked like traditional Japanese instruments, but something about them was subtly wrong, very much in line with Blossom-san's vibe.","That said, surprisingly enough, it seemed well thought out. The performance, centered around the deep beat of the taiko drum, was stylish and carried a cool, Japanese flair. Blossom-san’s singing matched it perfectly, truly impressive.","This was the first time I’d seen Blossom-san actually perform, since she served as a judge for the SINGING battle during Harmonic Symphony. And yet, she sang beautifully, on par with the other Seven Princesses, with a voice that was kind of enka-like, and yet not quite. It was captivating.","To Japanese ears, there might’ve been a slight sense of dissonance, but her singing was so good it made up for everything. In the end, I found myself thoroughly enjoying the performance.","After it ended, I gave a light round of applause. While they started cleaning up and preparing for the next act, I spun the prize wheel to receive a gift.","<VIER>","Oh, following Isis-san, now it was Dr. Vier. It was like my lovers were coming in a row. A moment later, called over by Ein-san, Dr. Vier approached with a cheerful smile.","[Miyama-kun! Happy birthday~~!]","[Thank you very much. Dr. Vier, did you play the game?]","[I did, and I even entered the tournament...... but, well, I nearly fell for a gimmick right at the start, and when I dodged it...... I ended up falling into a hole!]","[Ahaha, that’s so like you, Dr. Vier...... But I get it, some of those gimmicks are really hard to read on your first try.]","[It was pretty tough. Anyway, here’s your present!]","Dr. Vier, who had an established reputation for being a bit of a klutz, sounded like she hadn’t lost because of the actual battle, but rather because she got tripped up by a gimmick. I could just picture the scene.","She let out a wry smile as she pulled out a box out of nowhere. Part of the box was semi-transparent, letting me see inside, it was filled with colorful, stylish, candle-like items.","[Thank you...... These are...... aroma candles?]","[Bingo. It’s a set of handmade aroma candles, made by yours truly.]","[Eh? You made these, Dr. Vier?]","[Unn. You know I like herbs, right? A lot of aroma candles use herbs, so I figured I’d try making them. I put in extra effort for this present to make them pretty, but I usually make simpler ones for myself.]","[Hehh~~ I’ve never really used aroma candles before, so I’m looking forward to it.]","I had a general idea of how to use them, but they always seemed a bit too stylish for me to actually try. I guess herb-related things just give off that chic vibe.","[I’m glad you like them. Oh, and there’s one more thing, this!]","[One more?]","[Unn. It’s also an aroma candle, but this one’s a bit special.]","What she handed me next was a small box about the size of a single candle. This one was opaque, and there was a tiny envelope stuck to the top.","[The envelope has a massage ticket inside. If you let me know in advance when you’re free, I’ll prepare a special massage for you. That candle is meant to be used then.]","[Ah, I see, so it’s got a relaxing effect huh?]","[Fufufu......]","I thought the idea was to enhance the massage’s relaxing effect by lighting the candle during the session...... but then Dr. Vier gave me a sultry smile, leaned in close to my ear, and whispered in a sweet, seductive voice.","[......That aroma candle, I've already confirmed it shares the same name as the one in your world...... an aroma that makes use of ylang-ylang. It’s a scent that people either love or hate, kind of syrupy and sweet...... They call it the scent of the night.]","[Eh? T- The scent of the night?]","[Unn. That’s why the special massage is scheduled at night. So be sure to come prepared to stay the night when you use it. I think I’ll be able to soothe you plenty, buuuuut you might end up a little sleep-deprived...... so keep the next day free too, okay?]","W- What an incredibly seductive voice...... A healthy guy like me is easily swayed by that kind of thing, and now my entire consciousness was fixated on the gift I’d just received.","[Fufu, you can use it whenever you like. If you like it, I’ll make more for you.]","After saying that, Dr. Vier pressed a gentle kiss to my earlobe, pulled away, and gave me a cheerful, delighted smile.","Unnn. How should I say this...... when it comes to this kind of thing, Dr. Vier might just be the strongest among all my girlfriends...... I honestly don’t think I stand a chance against her.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Guh...... Aaah...... Uwaaaah...... Ngh...... Hiih......]","? ? ? : [Uh, isn’t she kinda groaning a lot for someone who’s asleep?]","Makina : [No, no, she’s not groaning in pain, she’s enjoying herself.]","? ? ? : [Unn?]","Makina : [I thought it was pitiful that she couldn’t see my beloved child while she was asleep, so I fixed it so \"she could see my beloved child's situation even in her dreams\"! Unn, unn, I’m so kind, aren’t I~~?]","? ? ? : [I thought things were about to get serious since Serious-senpai fell asleep, but you went and sealed off her last escape route instead...... I’m honestly impressed.]","Serious-senpai : [......No...... No way...... This...... This can’t be real...... How...... How could this be allowed......]"]},{"number":2243,"title":"Chapter 2243: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 44","paragraphs":["While I was receiving gifts during a break between live performances, it seemed the winner of the third round of the game tournaments had just been decided, and an exhibition match was set to take place.","The winner of the third round was Eul. She had already demonstrated impressive skill in the first round, despite it being her first time playing today, and it seemed she’d improved even further in the third round, overcoming other skilled participants and even the formidable Amel-san to claim victory.","[Ehehe, Kaito-sama! Looking forward to playing with you!]","[Unn, me too. But wow, Eul, you’re amazing. To win despite today being your first time playing, and with skillful players like Amel-san around, that’s incredible.]","[I practiced really hard because I wanted to play together with Kaito-sama!]","[I see. That makes me really happy...... but you know, you could’ve just told me, we can play together anytime. Isis-san is pretty good too, and I think it might be fun to play with her and the other members of the Death King camp next time.]","[That sounds super fun! I’d love to try it!]","Eul, who was happily wagging her tail as she spoke, looked absolutely adorable, and just watching her made me feel at ease. If I brought a console over to Isis-san’s castle, we could play together there. Everyone there tends to be pretty easygoing, so I feel like it could end up being a really fun time.","Since this birthday party gave most people some game experience, it might be a good idea going forward to play games not just with Eul or Isis-san, but with others too. It's a fun option to have.","Well, that aside, even though she’s cute, Eul’s skill is the real deal. Considering she beat Amel-san head-on, she’s probably better than me.","The stat adjustment set by Canalis-san was three times the normal level, so while not quite on par with Kuro, she was still a formidable opponent.","In fact, it was a back-and-forth battle with both sides evenly matched, but in the end, Eul landed her special move cleanly and I lost. Still, it was just an exhibition match where the result didn’t really matter, and Eul looked happy just getting the chance to play together with me.","\"That was a great match. Now, while I have everyone’s attention, I’d like to take a moment of your time.\"","\"Unn? Is this the third performance or something?\"","\"No, not an entertainment event this time, I just wanted to briefly explain and introduce the party favors. You see, we’ve prepared souvenirs for everyone who participated in Kaito-san’s birthday party today, which you’ll receive as you leave. Let me give a quick preview of what’s inside.\"","......So there are party favors huh. Well, I guess that makes sense for a party of this scale...... but who arranged all this?","\"First up, from our very own World Creator, God of Creation Shallow Vernal-sama———- we have a bottle per person of that unbelievably delicious wine <K> that was also handed out at Kaito-san’s housewarming celebration.\"","\"As expected of Shallow Vernal-sama. People who didn’t attend the last party must be curious about it, and even those who did probably found it too precious to open yet, so I’m sure this will be a big hit.\"","The first gift is apparently a wine made by Shiro-san...... Ah, that one. I got to try it myself once, it’s that silver-colored wine that looks like mercury, but it tastes unbelievably good. I’ve even heard that among some wine enthusiasts, it’s rumored to be a legendary wine, so I imagine a lot of people will be thrilled to receive it.","\"Next up is a gift from the Underworld King, Kuromueina-san...... from Kuro-san, we've got a set of three flavors of instant baby castella.\"","\"Ah, yeah, I heard those are insanely popular and basically impossible to get.\"","\"Yes. Kuro-san’s trading company has released up to the third edition of their instant series, but every one of them has been so popular that they’re out of stock everywhere. This time is among the latest series, a baby castella version that comes with three flavors.\"","It’s such a Kuro-like gift, but in truth, the instant series is wildly popular, constantly selling out. I’ve seen it featured in magazines a bunch of times, and I’m sure plenty of people haven’t even had the chance to try it.","And while it's true this one's hard to find, it's still a product intended for the general public. Compared to an ultra-premium wine, this might feel like a more approachable kind of gift for people who’d be intimidated by something that fancy.","\"Following that, the three nations of the Human Realm have collaborated to prepare a commemorative coin. It’s a gold coin with Kaito-san’s necklace depicted on the reverse, and it can actually be used as real currency.\"","\"Oh yeah, I think that’s a cultural thing in the Human Realm, right? Like, commemorative coins are made for every Hero Festival?\"","\"Yes, that’s right. They’re relatively easy to produce, so you often see commemorative coins with the festival number stamped on them. They also make them for significant milestones, like a 50-year anniversary of a nation's founding, so there are quite a few out there. Most of them are copper coins though......\"","A commemorative coin!? T- That’s insane. Why is a commemorative coin being made just for my birthday!? It’s terrifying, honestly, it makes my stomach hurt and I wish they’d go easy on me...... Still, I guess I should be thankful that the design doesn’t feature my face or name or anything. With just the necklace on it, the average person might just think it’s commemorating some magic tool or a gemstone. So the embarrassment is somewhat reduced...... No, on second thought, isn't this still pretty embarrassing!?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai (asleep) : [......It’s not just me...... Somehow...... Kaito’s...... taking damage to his stomach too......]"]},{"number":2244,"title":"Chapter 2244: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 45","paragraphs":["The thought of party favors under the name of \"commemorative gifts\" gave me a slight stomachache, but I’d heard that the commemorative coins issued in limited quantities for the Hero Festival bore the face of the first Hero...... so compared to having my face plastered there like in Neun-san's case, I decided to tell myself that this was better.","Apparently, though I hadn't known this, it seems commemorative coins are made fairly often in the Human Realm.","[Ein-san, does the Human Realm really make commemorative coins that frequently?]","[They’re a staple for any kind of celebration. Like Shalltear mentioned earlier, most of them are of copper coins. They’re not usually handed out for free, you typically have to buy them. They’re often sold at face value or slightly higher, so I’d say they’re more for collecting than practical use.]","[Do fakes ever circulate?]","[I wouldn’t say never, but most of them are made with elaborate designs and a strong emphasis on aesthetics...... Honestly, if someone’s going to put that much effort into faking commemorative coins, it’d be quicker to just make counterfeit copper coins instead.]","Now that she mentioned it, that made perfect sense. If you had the skills to forge commemorative coins, you’d be better off using them to forge standard currency.","In the case of the commemorative coins for this birthday celebration, they were gold coins being handed out for free as keepsakes. So essentially, it was like the three countries of the Human Realm were giving each attendee a gift worth about a million yen. When I thought of it that way, it seemed like quite a generous gesture...... But considering most of the people at this party held high status in the world, like Counts, members of the Six Kings' factions, or High and Supreme Gods, it might be politically smarter to prepare something memorable, even if it meant stretching the budget a bit.","Well, not that I know anything about political maneuvering...... That’s just my own imagination talking.","As I was thinking about all that, I turned the garapon......","<KUROMUEINA>","It landed on Kuro. And before Ein-san could even go call her, as if on cue, Kuro suddenly appeared right in front of me.","[Oh, it’s my turn huh?]","[That was fast!?]","[I just happened to be watching just now. Anyway, once again, happy birthday, Kaito-kun!]","[Ahh, thanks.]","Kuro beamed brightly as she offered her birthday wishes, and I smiled back as I thanked her.","[Now then, about your present this time...... Can you guess what it is?]","[Hmmm...... Something like the latest magic tool?]","[I thought about that too. But I figured you’d probably get all sorts of gifts, plenty of high-end and unique ones, so I thought something for everyday use might be better.]","[Yeah, that sounds like the right call...... It’s easier for me to accept something like that too.]","Kuro might be the richest person in the world, but that didn’t mean I’d have any use for super luxurious gifts. Like the magic ship she gave me during the Six Kings Festival, until I hosted a party on it, it had just been sitting untouched in my magic box. So in that sense, something practical for daily use was definitely welcome.","It's just, hmmm...... She’s being oddly vague for once, kind of building up to it. I’m guessing that means this is something she’s really confident in and put a lot of thought into.","[Fufufu. I already knew what I wanted to give you, and since it’s a special occasion, I decided to make it myself...... But it turned out to be harder than I thought. Even after I finished it, I kept thinking \"Maybe this would be better\" or \"That might work more nicely\", and I ended up remaking it over and over again.]","[S- Seriously? Sounds like you really poured yourself into this......]","......Yeah, this is probably something baby castella-related. I could sense a proud tone in her voice, and I can feel her obsession with the item she made in every word.","[I got Shalltear to help me out too...... but it wasn’t until I heard her say \"Can we please stop at this already?\" four times that I finally got it to a level I was satisfied with!]","Poor Alice...... There’s almost no doubt it’s something related to baby castellas, and whenever baby castellas are involved, Kuro’s level of obsession is absolutely off the charts. I’m sure she remade it so many times it got exhausting...... but Alice is kind-hearted in the end, so once she agreed to help, she probably stuck with it all the way to the end without walking away.","[And so! The birthday present I prepared for Kaito-kun is...... this baby castella-shaped cushion!!!]","[......Ah, the size is actually kind of nice, and it looks really good too.]","What Kuro pulled out was a baby castella-shaped cushion about a meter in diameter. Visually, it was just plain cute, and the size and shape made it look like something that’d be easy to use.","[Right?! I was super picky about the texture too, I wanted it to feel just like real baby castella! Recreating the surface texture especially was so difficult......]","[......A- Ahh, hey, Kuro? I can tell you really poured your heart into it and that’s awesome but...... we’re on a schedule, so maybe save the deep dive into the details for another time?]","[......Yeah, you’re right. If I go into all the specifics, it’ll take us all night. I’ll tell you the rest later.]","There it was: a confirmed future event that was basically a punishment game, an all-nighter listening to Kuro explain every detail about her baby castella cushion...... But faced with her dazzlingly bright smile, I couldn’t bring myself to say no, so I decided not to think about it.","Anyway, the cushion’s texture and softness were genuinely impressive, so I decided I’d use it in my room.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [So the main heroine went all-in on that side huh...... Well, they did flirt pretty suddenly during the game tournament, so I guess that tracks.]","? ? ? : [Arehh? You're up already?]","Serious-senpai : [No point in staying asleep after all!!!]"]},{"number":2245,"title":"Chapter 2245: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 46","paragraphs":["It looks like an all-night baby castella talk with Kuro is pretty much settled at this point...... But well, if it's Kuro, it's not really a problem.","If this were someone like Makina-san, I’d probably be bracing myself for a literal all-night conversation, but that’s not how it is with Kuro.","See, when Kuro says \"all night\", she means she'll go on about her favorite points regarding the baby castella-shaped cushion, I’ll respond and get into it, and then the topic will naturally branch off into other things. That whole flow is what she calls \"all night\".","Well, it’s definitely like her, being the Baby Castella Demon and all, to assume that a conversation about baby castellas will absolutely be lively. And, honestly...... she’s right. We could probably talk all night and still not run out of things to say.","Whenever the topic turns to baby castella, Kuro’s energy just skyrockets, and she keeps expanding the conversation effortlessly, so even if I’m not actively trying to keep it going, the conversation tends to pick up momentum. Sure, part of me can’t help but be amazed at how much there is to say about baby castellas, but watching Kuro talk so enthusiastically is actually kind of fun, and I end up enjoying myself too. It never feels like a chore.","Actually, for Kuro, being able to talk about something she loves with someone she likes seems to bring her genuine joy. She’s always got this happy look on her face, so in the end, I always give in and go along with it.","This time too, I figured I’d be giving her a wry smile while nodding along to her excitement...... and as I turned the garapon......","<PANDORA>","......Great, a troublemaker shows up. During my last birthday, she handed me candles and rope, claiming \"You can never have too many consumables!\", a true force of nature...... And to this day, I haven’t used a single one of them!?","[Happy birthday, Miyama-sama. Both personally and as a subordinate of the Phantasmal King, this is a most joyous occasion...... Truly, this day should be commemorated annually among us Phantasmal King's subordinates as well.]","[T- Thank you. No, your sentiments alone are more than enough...... Seriously......]","She’s undeniably beautiful, but there’s this thick, cloying intensity about her———– like, \"Ah, so this is what a yandere feels like\", something my instincts just seem to understand...... Looks like she’s in private mode today, not work mode.","The last time I saw her like this might have been quite a while ago. When I was meeting the Ten Demons or on that ship party, she was in full-on mission mode, serious and composed.","[This time, I had more time to prepare, so I’ve selected this gift very carefully. Here.]","[......T- Thank you very much.]","What she handed me was...... a whip, modestly wrapped with a ribbon...... yes, unmistakably a whip. Not the long kind, more like the kind used for horses.","[This whip was inspired by the mystical tool Miyama-sama used on Phenex before.]","[Eh? Ahh, you mean the toy hammer?]","[Yes. I’ve embedded a special technique in this whip. It’s designed to bypass defenses and deliver intense plea...... pain, but only when used on me.]","[.....................]","What the heck is wrong with this pervert? She just handed me a whip meant specifically for use on herself, with this aroused look on her face...... How exactly am I supposed to react to that?","[Its usability may be limited, but I guarantee its effectiveness, so please feel free to use it with peace of mind. Of course, since it only works on me, you’ll need my presence to use it, but that’s no issue at all, you can call on me anytime. I should be able to fulfill any wardrobe requests as well, and I’m quite adept at producing whip marks on my skin for authenticity. I believe I can help create the proper mood...... and let out some lovely sounds for you.]","[......Could you maybe...... tone it down a little? You know, wrap things in a bit of tact...... show some restraint?]","[Hahhn!? ......T- Thank you very much. That piercing, gallant gaze of yours struck deep into my lower parts.]","Under my exasperated stare, she started drooling with excitement...... This pervert is hopelessly invincible. L- Look, she’s not a bad person, okay? Sure, she’s openly talking about her freaky tastes, but she never tries to force anything. She always leaves the choice to me, and she actually listens when I ask her to stop.","It’s just that she has an extremely intense masochistic fixation on me and Alice...... But really, when she’s in work mode, she’s reliable. She even reins in the other Ten Demons when they go overboard......","\"......Pandora. House.\"","[Ah, of course. Lingering too long would be a bother to Miyama-sama. Well then, once again, may this wonderful day, Miyama-sama's birthday, become a truly blessed one for you. I shall take my leave.]","[Yes. Thank you.]","......Unn. Deep down, she is a genuinely good person...... it's just, only when her fetishes aren’t involved......","\"......You know, about your subordinates......\"","\"Please stop, Fate-san. I feel where that sentence is going, and it hurts. I’m honestly already struggling with it myself.\"","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Phoenix and Tiamat tend to steal the spotlight, but Pandora’s definitely one of the Four Heavenly Masochists too...... Wait, didn’t you give her a mission this time to keep her in check?]","? ? ? : [If I do that every time, she ends up bottling it up and might snap somewhere weird later. I have to let her blow off steam now and then...... Well, there's no doubt she's a pervert, but at least she listens to what Kaito-san says...... She's the kind of pervert you can actually reason with......]"]},{"number":2246,"title":"Chapter 2246: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 47","paragraphs":["After Pandora-san, I received a few more gifts. In the meantime, I watched some live performances, grabbed a few light snack...... when I noticed some movement over at the commentary table. It looked like we were transitioning to the next act","\"Alright, things are moving along nicely, so how about we shift into the second half of the birthday party?\"","\"Personally, I was hoping we'd start loosening up now. Once I hand over my gift to Kai-chan, I just want to laze around..... but since my turn hasn't come up yet, I guess I've got no choice but to keep commentating.....","\"As long as you're thinking of slacking off once you hand over your gift, I doubt you'll get picked anytime soon....","At first, Fate-san had been giving serious commentary and explanations, perhaps because Shiro-san and others were present, but now, with everyone more or less freely enjoying the party however they liked, commentary didn't seem all that essential anymore. That seemed to be all the excuse Fate-san needed to start slacking off.","Shiro-san didn't seem all that interested in the live performances either; she looked like she'd been deep in conversation the whole time with Electrone-san and Makina-san..... Wait, hold on, is she trying to get knowledge about other worlds from Electrone-san?","\"Well then...... everyone, the party venue is now shifting to its second form. It's not supposed to shake much, but there might be a little bit of movement, so please be careful.\"","...The venue shifting forms, a power phrase I doubt I've heard before, and I'm sure I won't be hearing again anytime soon. Honestly, I had no idea what was about to happen, but judging by everyone else's calm reactions, I was apparently the only one caught off guard. Seems like they were informed beforehand.","Still, when you say \"shifting forms\", what does that actually mean? The castle isn't going to transform into a giant robot or something, right....? No, wait, if it's Shiro-san or Makina-san, they probably could pull that off, but there's no reason to turn the venue into a robot for my birthday party.","As I was thinking that, beams of light traced themselves across the walls and ceiling. Then, suddenly, both the walls and ceiling vanished..... revealing a sky full of stars.","How should I even describe this? It felt as if the entire party venue had floated up into the sky. Or maybe I should say the indoor ballroom we were in had abruptly turned into an outdoor venue. And yet, strangely enough, everything was still clearly visible. It was brightly lit, yet I could still see the stars perfectly...... What's with this setup?","\"Alright, we've now entered the second form. It's an outdoor-style party. I believe it feels completely like we're outside, even down to the atmosphere, but only the scenery has changed. Technically, we're still indoors, so the entrances and exits are still functional. You can head to the rest area just like before.\"","\"I'd heard about this beforehand, but it's really something. Still, what's the reason for the outdoor theme? I mean, the starry sky is beautiful and all but......","\"Ah, well.... the idle and irresponsible Gods with too much time on their hands ended up creating a constellation for Kaito-san. So we made the scenery like this so everyone could see it. By the way, the unnaturally colorful part of the sky, that's Kaito-san's constellation.\"","\"....You mean that rainbow-colored one......?\"","They've done something absolutely insane again!? At this point, I can't help but wonder if this whole world was created just to embarrass me.","No, I'm sure Shiro-san and Makina-san were completely serious when they made it..... Ah, so those sparkling rainbow stars huh. If I traced lines between the stars, would it form something symbolic of me....? The idea of a constellation named after me is so absurdly out of this world, I honestly don't even know how I'm supposed to react.","\"Well then, please enjoy the beautiful starry sky for a while as the party continues. After that, we'll move on to the third attraction.\"","\"The third on.... I don't really know the details. Who came up with it?\"","\"Ah, that's an interesting point. So far, the first event, the video game tournament, was planned by Shallow Vernal-sama, and the second, the live performance, was by Kuro-san..... So you could say they were events representing the God Realm and the Demon Realm.\"","\"I see..... So the next one must be something from the Human Realm?\"","*.....Shall-tan? Why are you staring off into the distance like that? Hey, I just realized something kind of scary..... How many attractions are there in total?\"","\"There are four.\"","\"....So that's God Realm, Demon Realm, Human Realm...... and the last one?\"","\".....Otherworld.\"","Uh-oh. The wind's starting to shift. Wait, was there a pattern to these events this whole time......? Thinking back, the first one really was a game tournament using the console Shiro-san gave me last time. And the second event being a live show planned by Kuro made total sense.","That part's fine. The issue is.... when you say \"Otherworld\", the candidates who fit that category would be Aoi-chan, Hina-chan, Seigi-kun, my parents, past Hero Actors....... and......","\"The next event was planned by Makina.\"","..Is that safe?\"","\"I made it safe! I was practically glued to her the whole time, smacked her, steering her back on track, smacking her again, then smacking her some more..... Eventually I managed to hammer it into something that shouldn't cause any problems.\"","\"Shall-tan..... Thanks for the hard work.....","She smacked her a lot. No, seriously, I could feel Alice's suffering from that explanation. So that's why she had that drained look in her eyes earlier.... But hey, if she managed to keep things safe for me and the rest of the guests, then I couldn't be more thankful.","<Afterword>","Makina : [I was originally planning to put together a cinematic compilation of my beloved child's museum and screen it... but Alice flat-out rejected it. Even though I carefully curated the footage and trimmed it down to a modest 87 years of runtime...]","Serious-senpai: [Preventing a potential mass casualty event, Alice undoubtedly is a Hero..... Wait, 87 years!? Kaito's birthday would come around 87 more times before we finished watching it!]"]},{"number":2247,"title":"Chapter 2247: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 48","paragraphs":["Hearing that it was a plan proposed by Makina-san naturally fills me with tremendous anxiety, but just knowing that Alice was involved somehow instantly puts my mind at ease.","If it's Alice, she’ll definitely shut down any bad ideas properly. And since Makina-san treats Alice with even more tenderness than she would her own child, she’s surprisingly obedient when Alice speaks up, so I think things are being properly course-corrected.","\"And with that, the third event is...... a hidden talent contest!\"","\"......What’s that supposed to be?\"","\"It’s something usually done at parties or get-togethers, but out of all the ideas Makina brought up, this was the least terrible. Seriously, at first she wanted to show a movie with a runtime of 87 years. Like, what’s fun about having a birthday party that ends 87 years later......?\"","(T/N: Mistakenly translated years as hours last chap, edited.)","Yeah, Makina-san really is something else...... No doubt that ridiculous movie was also somehow about me. The cursed mansion supposedly takes hundreds of years to get through on foot too. I really want to ask why all of her ideas outlast my entire life so far...... but, well, it's Makina-san after all......","\"To explain it roughly, it’s an event where people show off skills or talents they don’t usually display in front of others. This time, to make it more entertaining, we’ll be using a scoring system.\"","\"Ah, so like, there are judges who give points and everyone competes based on that?\"","\"Exactly. Participation will be open to those who feel confident enough to enter, but since it’d be awkward if we had zero participants, we’ve already reached out to a few people beforehand. Anyway, let’s start by introducing the judges.\"","When I hear \"hidden talent contest\", I tend to imagine things like singing or magic tricks, but I wonder what it’ll actually be like...... but since they're competing for points, there’s probably going to be prizes for the top scorers too. Honestly, it sounds kind of fun.","\"As for the judges, they’re basically representatives from each realm. First, representing the God Realm is the God of Time and Space, Chronois-san.\"","\"Arehh? It's not Shallow Vernal-sama?\"","\"She’s absolutely the worst possible choice for a judge, so we went with Chronois-san, who’s the most likely to take judging seriously.\"","Yeah, I can agree with that. From Shiro-san’s perspective, a hidden talent probably wouldn’t seem impressive at all, so she wouldn’t give high scores. Chronois-san, on the other hand, is earnest and likely to evaluate things objectively.","\"Next, representing the Demon Realm is Kuro-san. Well, that’s an obvious safe pick.\"","\"Yeah, for the Demon Realm, Kurorin’s the safe bet~~\"","\"And for the Human Realm...... Lilia-san.\"","[ ! ? ! ? ]","The Demon Realm judge is Kuro, and for the Human Realm...... just as I suspected, it’s Lilia-san. As usual, she looks completely blindsided, like this is the first she’s heard of it, and receives a cold, if not merciless, declaration.","\"You look like no one told you, but like I said earlier, you’re the go-to representative for the Human Realm in these kinds of things. Just give up.\"","\"W- Well, at least this time all Lili-tan has to do is judge, so it's not that bad...... right?\"","As Fate-san pointed out, Lilia-san’s not expected to perform anything, her role this time is strictly as a judge. And with Chronois-san and Kuro as the other judges, this should be relatively easy on her.","\"And finally, representing the Otherworlds...... we have Canalis-san.\"","[Objection! Why isn’t it me!? This was my idea!!!]","\"Because you’d show blatant favoritism, obviously! There's no way someone who’d give a perfect score just because someone’s from Earth should be a judge!\"","[Fuguu...... B- But come on...... as a mother, there’s no way I wouldn’t give my child a perfect score...... My child is worth 100 points just for existing......]","Well, I can’t argue with this lineup either. Canalis-san might not be from Earth, but she’s still technically from another world, so it fits. And she seems like she’d actually judge things fairly.","Even so, Makina-san looked a little dissatisfied, until Electrone-san gently placed a hand on her shoulder.","『Outputting calming signal...... <Now, now, let’s just leave this to Canalis and take things easy with me, Makina-chan.> ......Continuing outputting desire...... <That said, I’m actually kind of curious about the movie Makina-chan made. Would you mind showing it to me?> ......I hypothesize it will be a masterpiece.』","[......Electrone! I knew Electrone would get me! Unn, it’s a labor of my love, packed full of my beloved child’s charm. I’m sure you’ll enjoy it!!!]","Apparently Electrone-san managed to calm Makina-san down successfully, and the two of them went off together, to watch the movie with the 87-year runtime.","\"......I wonder if Electrone-san would consider taking up permanent residence in Trinia......? W- Well, putting that aside, back to the judging. Each of the four judges will score the hidden talents out of 5 points. But here’s the key part, when scoring, we want them to prioritize unexpectedness.\"","\"Unn? What do you mean by that?\"","\"Say I performed some amazing skill. Even if it’s impressive, if you think \"Well, I could totally see her pulling that off\", then score it lower. But if it’s more like \"I never would’ve guessed this person had that kind of talent\", or it really clashes with their usual image, then that’s where you hand out the high scores.\"","\"Hehh, that does sound interesting. So someone like Shall-tan or the Underworld King, people who seem like they could do anything, wouldn’t get high scores easily. But if a regular human child had some unexpected amazing skill, they’d score big, right?\"","\"Exactly. And we’d like the judges to also rate based on contrast. For example, this is just a hypothetical example, but say Megiddo-san, who’s known for loving spicy food, shows off a talent for sweet desserts. That kind of gap from their usual image should earn high points too.\"","So it’s really about hidden talents, skills or acts that aren’t normally shown...... and especially ones that are hard to imagine from the person. That would actually make it hard for high-level folks like the Six Kings' Executives to score big, since people expect them to be able to do pretty much anything. It gives the others a real chance to shine.","\"Also, we’ll be adding a special judge, Kaito-san. His role is more like a bonus scorer. He doesn’t have to rate every act, but if something catches his eye, he can give it 1 to 5 points.\"","\"So if Kai-chan gets interested in someone’s act, they get bonus points and a better shot at making the top huh?\"","\"Exactly. And by the way, we’ve got cash prizes for the top 5 scorers in the end. Just money, simple and straightforward.\"","As that was explained, a desk appeared next to me with placards marked from 1 to 5. Looks like I’m meant to use those to judge any performance that piques my interest.","Receiving birthday gifts while casually watching hidden talents and scoring a few acts I find interesting, it sounds like something I can enjoy pretty easily.","\"Alright then, we’re looking forward to seeing your entries! And to kick things off, our very first performer is...... Founder Olivia-san!\"","......Wait. I already feel like giving a full 5 points. The sheer gap is overwhelming, as I never would’ve guessed Olivia-san would be the opening act of the hidden talent contest. This is completely out of my expectations.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Olivia makes an unexpected appearance...... Eh? What the heck is she gonna show as her hidden talent......?]"]},{"number":2248,"title":"Chapter 2248: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 49","paragraphs":["The first performer in the hidden talent contest was, to everyone's surprise, Olivia-san. The atmosphere in the venue rippled with confusion and unease, and understandably so. She didn't exactly give off the kind of image that would suggest she'd participate in something like this, and no one even knew if she had a hidden talent to begin with.","However, Olivia-san had recently shown increasing curiosity about various things compared to when I first met her, and she had actually been trying out new experiences. So, it wasn't impossible she had picked up some sort of special skill along the way.","Also, given that she was going first, it seemed more likely that she was participating at Alice's request rather than having entered of her own accord.","\"....That's really unexpected. I mean, is Olirin even okay ability-wise in this world?\"","\"Ah, this world has been adjusted so that Olivia-san can use her abilities just like she can in the Friendship City. Also, I forgot to mention earlier, but each performance is limited to 5 minutes. It's totally fine to end earlier, but if the time goes over 5 minutes, the act will be forcibly ended, so please be careful with time management\"","\"I see..... But seriously, what's Olirin even going to do?\"","I shared the same curiosity as Fate-san. Just what kind of hidden talent could Olivia-san possibly be about to reveal?","As I wondered that, something large and square...... like a block of marble suddenly appeared behind Olivia-san on stage. Standing in front of the marble block, she gave a small bow and spoke into the Loudspeaker Magic Tool on stage.","\"I am Olivia, Founder of the Godism Church and city representative of the Friendship City Hikari. It is an immeasurable honor to present an entertainment act in the presence of the great Shallow Vernal-sama and Miyama Kaito-sama. Though I am but an unworthy vessel, I offer the faith that dwells within my heart.... to Shallow Vernal-sama and Miyama Kaito-sama.\"","With that, she took on a posture of prayer, then retrieved a chisel and mallet, the kind used in sculpture. The tools gleamed with a color that suggested they were made of orichalcum. Olivia-san quietly raised them into position, then turned toward the massive block of stone, and in the next moment, began carving into it with astonishing speed.","It was as if I were watching a timelapse video, pieces of the marble shaved away at a breathtaking pace, transforming its shape. What emerged was a ceremonial prayer bell used in the Godism Church..... along with a relief carved beside it depicting Shiro-san and me standing close together.","The quality was absolutely astounding. The fine details of our clothing were perfectly rendered, and the sculpture of Shiro-san and me holding hands before the prayer bell, all in white marble, radiated a certain sacred aura.","\"Whoa..... Olirin, that's amazing! She had a talent like that?\"","\"Yes, well.... it might sound obvious in hindsight, but apparently she wanted to offer prayers to Kaito-san. And since no statues or reliefs existed for such a purpose, she decided to make them herself. Being the epitome of seriousness, she trained until she reached that level of skill, by locking herself in a time-manipulated subspace and practicing endlessly.\"","To think she actually practiced making her own religious tools, that's the kind of dedication you'd expect from someone whose faith is all too real..... Now that I think about it, during our previous date, she had shown deep interest in a decorative prayer bell, so maybe that was when she got the idea to craft her own. And with her personality, she must've gone all-in on the training......","Having completed the sculpture in a flash, Olivia-san once again offered a brief prayer, then turned to us and bowed gracefully.","\"And there you have it. Olivia-san's hidden talent was sculpting! Now then, let's have the judges give their scores!\"","The judging began, but really, the surprise alone was enough for me to raise the full 5-point card without hesitation. Chronois-san, Kuro, Lilia-san, and Canalis-san all raised their 5-point cards as well, resulting in a perfect score right from the opening act.","\"Oh! And right off the bat, we've got a perfect score! Truly, the surprise factor and the contrast made for a striking performance. Since we've got the chance, let's hear a few words from Shallow Vernal-sama herself, who also happened to be the motif of the sculpture..... Shallow Vernal- sama, do you have any comments?\"","When Alice turned the spotlight to Shiro-san, Olivia-san, still on stage, visibly tensed. It was clear she hadn't been the least bit concerned about the scores. What mattered to her wasn't how the judges rated her, it was how Shiro-san and I would receive it.","....it's a beautiful sculpture. Let's display it somewhere prominent in the castle. I especially appreciate the depiction of Kaito and me holding hands, it's a lovely touch. Olivia, excellent work.]","\"!? I am unworthy of such praise. To receive those words from you, Shallow Vernal-sama..... it feels as if my entire existence has been rewarded. Please accept my deepest, most heartfelt gratitude.....","Shiro-san was full of praise, nodding with clear satisfaction. And for someone like Olivia-san, whose faith ran so deep, this was the highest reward she could ask for. Tears streamed down her face as she knelt on stage, offering a prayer to Shiro-san.","U- Unn, well, I guess it's good that Olivia-san looks so genuinely happy.","That said, something's been bugging me...... If Olivia-san made that sculpture because she didn't have a proper tool to offer prayers to me...... Then does that mean..... somewhere in the Central Cathedral..... there might already be a statue of me......? N- Nope. Not going to think about it.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [As expected of a true faith fanatic...... she actually acquired sculpting skills just to make her own statue to pray to. And not just that..... think about it. If she was going to sculpt Kaito and Shiro, there's no way she'd settle for anything half-baked. She probably trained for an absurd number of years in a time-manipulated space or something.....]"]},{"number":2249,"title":"Chapter 2249: Intermission: Faith Solves Everything - Part 1","paragraphs":["It happened about 10 days after Kaito, Olivia, and Kaori had gone on a date together. Olivia was in the Founder’s chamber of the Central Grand Cathedral in the Friendship City Hikari, preparing to offer her prayers as usual.","But then, quite suddenly...... as if the thought had appeared from nowhere, something crossed her mind.","(......Come to think of it, this is the heart of the Godism Church that worships Shallow Vernal-sama. All the items used in Godism Church rituals are here...... but now that I reflect on it, isn’t it wrong to offer prayers to Miyama Kaito-sama using the Godism Church’s prayer bells and statues? If I’m to pray to Miyama Kaito-sama, shouldn’t I be using items meant specifically for him? This is a blunder. For me not to have noticed something so basic until now...... I need to remedy this immediately...... Otherwise, it may even affect the quality of my prayers to Miyama Kaito-sama.)","Olivia’s faith was exceptional. To her, prayers to Kaito were just as sacred and significant as those she offered to Shallow Vernal, the God of this world. And without realizing it, she had been compromising her worship by praying in a setting not meant for Kaito. That was, to Olivia, utterly shameful. Filled with regret, she immediately resolved to prepare proper tools dedicated to praying to Kaito.","......However——— However. It was true that Kaito, through his various relationships, wielded great influence and held a position of significant power in the world, he was, without a doubt, someone befitting the title of World's Singularity.","But setting aside all those circumstances, Kaito’s actual status was still technically that of an immigrant from another world and an ordinary citizen...... There existed no religion that worshipped him, and naturally, there were no statues, prayer bells, or similar items crafted for such a purpose.","(......How can this be? Could it really be that there exists nothing...... nothing for offering prayers to Miyama Kaito-sama? H- How can that be allowed? Miyama Kaito-sama is a most noble figure, one who deserves to be worshipped just as widely as Shallow Vernal-sama...... N- No, but if Miyama Kaito-sama himself doesn’t wish for such things, then I suppose it can’t be helped...... B- But even so, as it stands now, I can’t proudly declare that my prayers to Miyama Kaito-sama are perfect. What should I do...... No...... what if I just made them myself?)","To Olivia, whose faith was absolute, continuing her prayers in what could be considered a compromised environment was wholly unacceptable. As she wracked her brain for a solution, she arrived at a single, simple conclusion: she would make the prayer tools herself.","(It doesn’t have to be elaborate. A statue modeled after Miyama Kaito-sama should suffice. Yes, I can vividly recall every detail of his form. As long as I get the materials, I can begin at once!)","As the idea to handcraft a statue of Kaito came to Olivia like divine inspiration, she felt so pleased with the thought that she could hardly help but praise herself. Without delay, she began ordering carving tools and reference materials.","Within the subspace Olivia had created with her own power, she stood before the completed statue of Kaito, her expression one of utter despair.","Olivia, by nature, was extremely earnest. On top of that, within the Friendship City, she wielded power rivaling that of a Supreme God. It didn’t take long for her to absorb the necessary sculpting skills from the reference materials, and after a few practice attempts, she began crafting the statue of Kaito.","The resulting statue was meticulously made, so much so that one could easily mistake it for the work of a master sculptor.","However...... to Olivia, its level of completion was wholly unacceptable.","[......W- What is this......? I- It’s far too unrefined...... This statue does nothing to capture Miyama Kaito-sama’s greatness! Nor his noble features! Nor the kindness and warmth in his gaze! Nor that all-encompassing presence of his! It fails to express any of it......!]","To be clear, the statue was objectively of high quality. But Olivia’s faith in Shallow Vernal and Kaito had long since reached a point beyond devotion.","To someone like her, the idea of accepting something merely \"decent\" was tantamount to compromise...... and compromise wasn't something she couldn't accept.","In that moment, a determined light blazed in Olivia’s eyes.","[......If I am to craft a divine statue in the likeness of Miyama Kaito-sama, there is no way I could ever call this complete with such meager skill. I must...... refine my technique...... train even harder......]","Thus began Olivia’s challenge. Fortunately, within the bounds of Friendship City, her power was immense. Reverting the completed statue of Kaito back into a mere block of marble was a trivial matter for her.","She also manipulated the flow of time within the space and devoted herself entirely to sculpting.","Over and over again, she created and reverted, created and reverted, driven solely by her boundless faith. With unwavering focus and sincerity, she continued to sculpt, never stopping.","Olivia, already a fundamentally diligent and disciplined person who normally spent countless hours in prayer, now funneled all that energy into sculpting. Her concentration was unparalleled. She tirelessly poured an immense amount of time into her work, with the singular goal of bringing the ideal image of Kaito, vividly etched into her mind, into reality.","Before long, every wasted motion vanished from her movements...... and her craftsmanship crossed the threshold into the realm of mastery.","No longer did she need to switch between multiple tools. With just a single chisel and mallet, she could sculpt with astonishing precision, bringing even the finest of details to life.","Eventually, at least in the realm of sculpting, Olivia reached a level that could rival even the world’s finest artisans, those like Alice or Ein...... and at last, the statue of Kaito she had long envisioned was complete.","(Finally...... it’s finished...... Of course, it still pales in comparison to the real Miyama Kaito-sama, but within the realm of sculpture, I’ve reached a level where there’s nothing more to be done. I’ve created something I can finally be satisfied with.)","As she gazed upon the completed \"5-meter-tall\" statue of Kaito, Olivia wept. Her overwhelming faith had finally brought forth a work she could take pride in, a creation that truly satisfied her heart.","Quietly, she knelt into a posture of prayer and began offering her devotion to the statue of Kaito.","(It’s such a strange feeling...... Just praying like this fills my heart with warmth, almost as if Miyama Kaito-sama himself were watching over me...... I feel like I can lose myself in prayer more deeply than ever before.)","Wearing an expression of pure contentment, Olivia continued to pray for some time, her heart filled with joy.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Faith...... In the end, faith really does solve everything...... Honestly, even if she doesn’t have the others' muddiness, Olivia’s pretty much a fanatic.]"]},{"number":2250,"title":"Chapter 2250: Intermission: Faith Solves Everything - Part 2","paragraphs":["After spending an enormous amount of time, Olivia finally completed a statue of Kaito that she was satisfied with. She rose to her feet, having finished a prayer that felt deeper and more refined than ever before.","The thought of being able to continue offering prayers to this statue made her heart dance with joy. With her objective fulfilled, this subspace was no longer necessary...... She considered moving the statue to the Founder's chamber and dissolving the space she had created, but then, a thought struck her.","(......Should I also create a statue of Shallow Vernal-sama? By crafting a statue of Miyama Kaito-sama and offering my prayers to it, I was able to pray in a way that even surprised me with how wonderful it was. Now that I understand how much the environment influences the quality of prayer, it stands to reason that the same should apply to my prayers to Shallow Vernal-sama. In that case, I must indeed create a divine statue for Shallow Vernal-sama......)","Thinking this, Olivia prepared new marble and began creating a statue of Shallow Vernal. Compared to Kaito's statue, this one took less time.","While this was partly due to her sculpting skills having reached their peak during the process of creating Kaito’s statue, she still ended up redoing it several times.","At last, a statue of Shallow Vernal, roughly the same size as Kaito’s, was completed, and Olivia nodded in satisfaction.","(This should do. Just thinking about being able to pray from now on while being watched over by the divine statues of Miyama Kaito-sama and Shallow Vernal-sama fills me with honor and happiness. I’m sure I’ll be able to offer truly wonderful prayers.)","After placing the two completed statues in the Founder's chamber, having created a space where it truly felt as though she was being watched over by Kaito and Shallow Vernal during her prayers, Olivia nodded deeply, clearly pleased.","Olivia, who had gained what could be called the world's highest level of sculpting skill thanks to her immense devotion, concentration, and countless hours of trial and error in a specialized space, had no intention of telling anyone about her abilities. Nor did she have any plans to create further works.","To her, sculpting was simply a necessary skill for crafting divine statues that would allow her to offer higher-quality prayers to the ones she revered, Kaito and Shallow Vernal. It was nothing more than a means to prepare an environment for prayer.","She had no particular interest in sculpture itself, and Olivia, who could be said to lack any sense of self-display, would never flaunt such abilities.","If asked, she would answer, but unless prompted, she likely never would have spoken to anyone about having sculpted those statues.","In fact, if Alice hadn't later requested her to showcase her work as entertainment to please Kaito and Shallow Vernal, her sculpting skills would never have become known.","That said, it wasn’t as though her newfound skills had no effect whatsoever. Gaining such refined sculpting ability did lead to a small but notable change.","It happened when Olivia, having finished her prayers, moved to the office where she handled paperwork as the city’s representative. There, on the edge of her work desk, sat a small decorative item modeled after a prayer bell...... something she had bought on her date with Kaito because she’d liked it. Upon seeing it again, she made a slightly conflicted expression.","(Looking at it now, this prayer bell feels rather poorly made. It's an item meant for ordinary citizens who can't frequently visit churches or temples to use at home for their prayers...... Given that it's designed to be sold cheaply, perhaps it's understandable to a degree but...... I've come to truly feel how much the environment and tools affect the quality of one's prayers. Wouldn’t it be better if ordinary citizens also had access to better-crafted items to help them pray more meaningfully?)","Having acquired such high-level sculpting skills, Olivia began to notice the rough craftsmanship of the decorative prayer bell on her desk. Of course, it was just an ornament, and rarely used for the kind of prayer Olivia envisioned...... but she had no way of knowing that.","(Why not have the Godism Church produce and sell them instead? If I personally supervise the process, it should be possible to create prayer bells that are complete down to the finest detail...... Since I’m not concerned about profit, we can price them affordably so that even regular citizens can buy them. We could offer different sizes too, small ones for desktops, slightly larger ones for small rooms, and so on, so people can choose what suits their needs. As for where to sell them...... for now, the Central Grand Cathedral should suffice. Visitors can purchase one on their way home after offering their prayers......)","This idea, too, came about on a whim, but it would eventually yield significant profits. After all, in Trinia, a world where Gods truly exist, there were many with strong faith.","Among the Humans in particular, nearly everyone received Blessings from the Gods or Priests during the New Year, and many also made a point to visit churches or temples at least once a month to offer prayers.","Prayer bells that could be used at home, whether before bed or upon waking...... became immensely popular, especially since they were of exceptionally high quality and personally supervised by the Founder herself. It wasn’t just the inexpensive tabletop versions, sold nearly at cost, that were in demand; medium-sized ones for rooms and even large bells designed for grand halls also sold rapidly. As a result, they brought enormous profits to the Godism Church. What began as a product sold only at the Central Grand Cathedral soon expanded, with temples and churches across the land taking up sales as well.","And yet, Olivia, who had overseen the entire creation process of this highly profitable product, paid it no mind whatsoever. With not a trace of interest in the profits, she promptly transferred all rights and ownership to the Central Grand Cathedral. As for herself, she simply continued to offer her prayers, radiating happiness in the Founder’s chamber, now adorned with the statues of Kaito and Shallow Vernal, as well as a newly crafted prayer bell.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ah, so she only made it for herself and was only keeping it in the Founder's chamber, it's not like she's placing statues of Kaito all over the place...... Maybe the reason Olivia doesn’t come off as insane is because she knows exactly where to draw the line.]"]},{"number":2251,"title":"Chapter 2251: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party 50","paragraphs":["Olivia-san, who was the opening act for the hidden talent competition, earned a perfect score. And that was more than understandable, her sculpture was truly incredible.","It wasn’t just technically well-made; it felt like it had a soul. Looking at it brought a warm, happy feeling. The piece depicted Shiro-san and me holding hands, likely referencing the scene during Hydra Kingdom's Founding Festival.","There were some differences, like Shiro-san wearing her usual outfit instead of what she wore back then, but the sculpture radiated a sense of closeness between us. It evoked memories of that time I went on a date with Shiro-san.","You could say it was a work that resonated with the heart, that’s probably why even Shiro-san was full of praise for it.","\"Now then, let’s get some comments from the judges...... Since this is the first act, and we need to fill a bit of time, we’ll hear from everyone. After this, we’ll be asking for comments more selectively...... So, let's start with Chronois-san, what did you think?\"","\"I felt it was a truly magnificent piece. Even someone like me, who isn’t very knowledgeable about art, could understand its brilliance. I was especially moved by the sculpture of Shallow Vernal-sama, which seemed to radiate a sense of divinity.\"","\"I’m honored by your praise.\"","Chronois-san also gave Olivia-san's sculpture glowing praise. In response, Olivia-san simply gave a quiet bow and expressed her thanks.","\"I see. Next, Kuro-san, your thoughts?\"","\"In terms of pure skill, I think there are people out there who could create something on this level. But this wasn’t just about skill, Olivia-chan’s emotions were embedded in the piece. There’s a depth to it, a presence, as if the sculpture itself holds a kind of aura. That’s not something you can achieve easily. She must have practiced incredibly hard. It was honestly amazing.\"","\"Thank you for the kind words.\"","Kuro, the next to speak, was also full of admiration, clearly impressed. Olivia-san, on the other hand, remained as calm and composed as ever, giving her usual polite bow and expression of gratitude.","\"Alright, moving on, Lilia-san?\"","\"I’ve also seen a fair number of artworks, but I’ve never encountered a piece of this caliber. This is art that can only be created by someone who has reached the pinnacle of a specific field. That’s the impression I got.\"","\"Thank you very much.\"","Like Chronois-san and Kuro, Lilia-san also praised the sculpture highly. And once again, Olivia-san responded without showing much emotion, simply thanking her in a composed manner.","You could say she was in her Founder Mode, unfazed by the compliments, accepting them with quiet composure.","\"Lastly, Canalis-san, please share your thoughts.\"","\"Tahaa~~ Well, let’s see. As Kuromueina-san mentioned, this sculpture isn’t something that can be accomplished with skill alone. I felt that it was born from Olivia-san’s unwavering pursuit of an ideal, of a vision she wanted to express. That’s what gave the piece its soul. Truly, I feel privileged to witness something this incredible right at the start.\"","\"I’m grateful for the high praise.\"","As expected, Canalis-san also gave her praise with an expressionless face. Olivia-san, in turn, remained just as expressionless, quietly bowing in acknowledgment.","And since Alice had said at the beginning that all the judges would be giving comments, it naturally meant that I was up next...... Just as I was thinking that, Ein-san smoothly handed me a Loudspeaker Magic Tool, which I accepted.","\"Now then, lastly, Kaito-san, what did you think?\"","\"Ah, errr, I honestly thought it was amazing. Not just the process of creating it, but the final piece itself gave off a feeling of happiness when I looked at it. It was surprising to find out that Olivia-san had such a hidden talent, and the whole thing was just filled with wonder and emotion, even though it was made in such a short time. Olivia-san, thank you for showing us such an incredible performance.\" ŕАNОʙĚŠ","\"To receive such high praise from Miyama Kaito-sama, I am truly honored and feel a joy beyond what I deserve. Of course, when compared to the real Miyama Kaito-sama and Shallow Vernal-sama, my sculpture falls many levels short, but even so, I did my utmost to faithfully recreate the noble forms of you both within the limits of sculpture. If it brought even a moment of enjoyment to you, I am deeply happy. If anything, I should be the one expressing my heartfelt gratitude for being given this opportunity.\"","\"......Her reaction’s completely different from when she was listening to us.\"","When Olivia-san heard my comment, her eyes lit up and her face visibly brightened with emotion as she replied. Watching that, Kuro let out a wry smile, making a remark much like the one she’d said back at Kaori-san’s shop.","<Afterword>","~ ~ Easy-to-understand summary of today's events ~ ~","Chronois, Kuro, Lilia, and Canalis' comments -> Olivia : [ ( ╹‐╹ )→(* . .))) polite bow ]","Kaito’s comment -> Olivia : [ ✧*。(ˊᗜˋ*)✧*。→ ゚・*:.。..。.:*・'(* ゚▽ ゚*)'・*:.。. .。.:*・。]"]},{"number":2252,"title":"Chapter 2252: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 1","paragraphs":["It seemed that the hidden talent show was set up to include a 10-minute break between each contestant. Alice had said it was to give time for preparing the next act and accepting new entries, but in truth, she was probably giving me time to receive birthday presents.","Appreciating her thoughtfulness, I spun the garapon.","<ANIMA>","What came out was Anima, and soon enough, she arrived accompanied by Ein-san.","[Master, happy birthday!]","[Thanks. Are you enjoying the party too, Anima?]","[Yes. This birthday party seems to include many performances and displays related to the culture of your former world, so it's been quite a refreshing experience for me. The exhibition rooms in the castle also had many fascinating items.]","[Oh yeah, now that you mention it, I remember hearing that other rooms were being decorated for the occasion. I’ve been here the whole time, though, so I don’t really know what’s out there. What kind of rooms were there?]","Alice had mentioned in passing that various people were using their free time to remodel different rooms, and that guests were free to explore them, but since I was the guest of honor this time, I had remained in the main venue and hadn’t seen any of it.","From some exchanges between Alice and Fate-san, I did know that Kuro had apparently filled an entire room with baby castellas......","[This world isn't Trinia, so there were rooms displaying things like mechanical products that would otherwise fall outside the bounds of Shallow Vernal-sama and Eden-sama’s contracts. Items prohibited from being created in Trinia due to those contracts are apparently erased from your memory once you return there, but it was refreshing to actually see things I’d only heard about before.]","[I see, some technologies had their restrictions loosened, but I remember hearing that mechanical items were still under strict control. I guess for people from Trinia, that kind of stuff must seem really new......]","Just as I’d once been astonished by magic upon arriving in this world, the people here must find machines and technology to be equally mysterious and fascinating.","[Ah, right, if we keep chatting, we’ll run out of time. Master, here, this is my present to you.]","[Thanks. It’s pretty big, huh? This is......]","What she handed me was a long, narrow box, at a glance, it looked like it might contain a katana. But of course, Anima wouldn’t be giving me a katana, so it had to be something else inside.","[It's a fishing rod. I thought giving a typical accessory or standard gift might overlap with what others had in mind, and I also hoped to go fishing with you again, so I prepared this.]","[I see, a fishing rod huh...... I like it. We’ve gone fishing together a few times, and I’d definitely like to go again. We've mostly gone to rivers, so how about trying some sea fishing next time?]","[Yes. I’ll be looking forward to it!]","Personally, I actually quite like fishing, but the distance from Symphonia's Royal Capital to the ocean is pretty far. The only coastal place registered with my Teleportation Magic Tool is the Hydra Kingdom.","I had registered a seaside spot in the Demon Realm during that ship party, but I’ve never actually used it for fishing...... Well, fishing isn’t something you often do unless you deliberately set your mind to it.","The people I’d gone fishing with so far were probably Laguna-san, Lilia-san, Sieg-san, and Anima. Out of those, I’d gone river fishing with Anima multiple times, so when it came to the idea of a \"fishing date\", she was naturally the one who came to mind.","Anima also happened to be fond of fish, and I genuinely enjoyed the calm, peaceful time spent fishing with her, so I’d definitely love to do it again sometime.","[Thanks, Anima. I’m really happy.]","[I’m glad to hear that...... Ah, errr......]","[Unn?]","[Ah, no, it’s just...... As your lover, I thought maybe I should do something a little more special...... But I wasn’t sure what exactly that should be......]","It wasn’t like being lovers meant she had to do something special just because she was giving me a birthday present. Still, Anima wasn’t my girlfriend during my last birthday party, and now that she was, maybe she felt she wanted to do something meaningful to mark the occasion.","That said, it’s not like there were a ton of options for something she could suddenly pull off on the spot......","[......Errr, how about a hug then?]","[Y- Yes! I- If you'll excuse me.]","I just threw out the first thing that came to mind, and Anima accepted it immediately with a flustered nod. She approached me, leaning down a little as I sat in my chair, and wrapped her arms around me.","Her decisiveness, how she acted as soon as she made up her mind, was very much just like her. As I thought that, I gently returned the hug, placing my hands on her back.","We didn’t have much time, so it lasted only a few seconds, but even so, the softness of her touch and the warmth of her body made me feel incredibly happy.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [G- Guaaahhh...... These simple ones, they’re being plainly tough...... Haa...... haa...... So, the remaining lovers are...... Sieg, Alice, Fate, and Illness, right? Ngh...... There’s still quite a few left......]"]},{"number":2253,"title":"Chapter 2253: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 2","paragraphs":["When I received the birthday present from Anima, it just so happened that the second act of the hidden talent show was about to begin. As I turned my gaze toward the stage...... There stood Kaori-san and Akane-san.","That was certainly an unexpected pair of participants. From the looks of it, Kaori-san was completely flustered, while Akane-san seemed rather relaxed. I guess Akane-san must've dragged her into this.","Because I was seated fairly close to the stage, and the area happened to be relatively quiet at the time, I could hear the voices of the two on stage.","[A- Akane-san, I really am incredibly nervous. I mean, we’re right after that amazing sculpture act......]","[Don’t worry about it. Embarrassment in a setting like this is the kind you just throw away and forget. Even if you mess up, people will forget, and if they don’t, well, it’ll make for a funny story later. On top of that, it’s a chance to get noticed by the bigwigs for free, and there’s even a shot at prize money. It’s totally worth giving it a go.]","As expected, it looked like Akane-san was the one who brought Kaori-san along. Akane-san was pretty shrewd———– well, she was the head of a merchant guild. She likely figured that getting noticed by the kind of people who gather at these parties would eventually turn into a business opportunity.","Kaori-san, on the other hand, definitely didn’t seem like the type who’d want to put herself out there like that, so it had to be Akane-san leading the charge. Still, rather than entering solo, she chose to perform with Kaori-san, which meant...... whatever act they were going to perform must require Kaori-san’s abilities.","\"Now then, the next entry is a duo of Hero Actors, Kaori-san and Akane-san!\"","\"Ah~~ yeah, I think I’ve seen them before. Wasn’t Kaorin the Hero Actor for that time before the last? Akanen was from even earlier, right? But I’m pretty sure they were both summoned as Hero Actors the years Archlesia Empire was in charge.\"","\"Oh? It’s rare for you to remember the Hero Actors, Fate-san.\"","\"Hey, I’ve got a good memory! Once I see a face, I don’t forget it. I just don’t recall them unless I’m interested...... but lately, I’ve been trying to pay more attention to the people around Kai-chan, so it’s getting better~~\"","Fate-san’s growth was really something. Ever since what happened with Mom and Dad, she seemed to have naturally started taking an interest in the people connected to me, without having to force it.","Knowing what she struggled with back then, it made me quietly happy to see how far she’d come.","As I was thinking that, Akane-san stepped up to the Loudspeaker Magic Tool on the stage and began to speak.","\"Thank you for the kind introduction. We’re the duo of Akane and Kaori, here to show off a little hidden talent. Honestly, after that incredible performance by Founder-sama earlier, we’re feeling super intimidated, but we’d be grateful if you could just watch with the kind of indulgence you’d show a child’s school play. That said, I’m mostly just here to help, Kaori’s doing the real work.\"","\"P- Pleased to meet you.\"","\"......I really wish she’d calm down a bit more, but oh well...... Right, this here is Kaori. She might look like an adorable little puppy at first glance, but she’s actually an amazing Water Magic user. And today, we’d like to give you a glimpse of that.\"","Kaori-san looked visibly tense, while Akane-san remained composed and explained things in a relaxed tone. After that, she put on a headband, with what looked like an apple...... no, a ripple fruit fixed to it, then stepped away from Kaori-san.","Wait, is this that thing? Are they going to do one of those \"shoot the apple off the head\" tricks with magic?","\"......Akane-san, why do you even have a headband like that? I mean, a headband that can fix a ripple to your head......?\"","\"Ah, this? I got it at Hydra Kingdom's Founding Festival. Believe it or not, it’s actually a magic tool. Just placing a ripple on it keeps it from falling off, pretty neat, right?\"","\"That’s way too niche......\"","Ah, right, that was one of Alice’s gag inventions. If you wore that headband, anything placed on top of your head wouldn’t fall off. It seemed like it might have some use, so no real application came to mind but...... Akane-san actually bought one of those, huh......","\"Well, as you can probably imagine, Kaori’s going to use Water Magic to shoot the ripple off my head from a distance...... She’s super nervous but...... you’ll be fine, right, Kaori?\"","\"......Akane-san, just to be safe, shouldn’t you be wearing full-body armor?\"","\"Can you not say stuff that makes me more nervous!? Even if you miss, just don’t hit me, okay!?\"","I couldn’t help but chuckle at their comedy-like exchange. Of course, I was sure they had some safety measures in place. Besides, Kaori-san didn’t sound like she was actually panicking, so this was probably a rehearsed part of their act.","After their back-and-forth, Kaori-san overlapped her index fingers and thumbs to form a square, aiming it at Akane-san. Then, a blue, laser-like stream of water shot from Kaori-san’s hands and cleanly pierced through the center of the ripple.","But that wasn’t all. She released her finger formation and then extended both hands toward Akane-san, firing much thinner water lasers from all ten fingers, and began to manipulate them delicately.","Ten streams of water moved in intricate patterns, a visually striking display...... and when it ended, what remained on Akane-san’s head was a ripple carved into the shape of a somewhat cutesy rabbit. Applause echoed through the venue.","\"T- Thank goodness it worked out......\"","\"......Yeah, well, I didn’t take it splashing all over my head into consideration...... My hair’s totally soaked......\"","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai: [Come to think of it, when she hit her nose before, she attached just a small water orb to the tip of it and kept it there while casually talking with Kaito, so she must really be good at precise magic control......]","? ? ? : [Well, compressing water and firing it like a water cutter already requires a pretty high level of mana control to begin with.]"]},{"number":2254,"title":"Chapter 2254: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 3","paragraphs":["Kaori-san and Akane-san's hidden talent performance came to an end, followed by the scoring segment. Since Olivia-san, the first performer, had received a perfect score, the points awarded to Kaori-san and Akane-san here were likely to serve as a benchmark for the performances to follow.","\"Now then, let's move on to the judging. Judges, please raise your score cards...... Oi, Makina, that ridiculously huge \"100 points\" sign doesn't count. Put that away, it's in the way.\"","At Alice’s prompting, Makina-san reluctantly put away the oversized scorecard that looked more like a corporate billboard. At that moment, all the judges, myself included, raised our scorecards.","\"4, 5, 5, 4, 4...... That’s a total of 22 points! Not bad! Given the first was a perfect score, this one still stands out as a high score and seems like it'll be a good benchmark moving forward.\"","\"Kurorin and Lili-tan gave 5s, and the others gave 4s. Guess we ought to hear from the two who gave full marks, right?\"","\"Right. Let's start with Lilia-san’s comment~~\"","Kaori-san and Akane-san received a total of 22 points. As Alice said, it was a high score, though not unattainable for those who’d come later, it still set a solid standard.","\"I was simply impressed by the refinement of her magic. To possess that level of mana control at such a young age, and as an otherworlder at that, is truly remarkable. And to continuously release such highly compressed water with that amount of force. Honestly, given Kaori-san's magic power capacity, that shouldn't be possible under normal circumstances. It's likely due to the unique magical aptitude often observed in otherworlders. That aspect in particular was astonishing.\"","\"I see, thank you. Next, let's hear from Kuro-san.\"","Now that I think about it, Aoi-chan could use Earth Magic at a level far beyond what her mana capacity and training would suggest, and Hina-chan could enhance her body with considerably higher amplification than normal. From the perspective of people from Trinia, their magical aptitudes likely defied common expectations.","Following Lilia-san, Kuro took hold of the Loudspeaker Magic Tool and shared her thoughts.","\"I agree with what Lilia-chan said, but really, Kaori-chan’s incredibly strong, isn’t she? Among immigrants from the Otherworld, she’s probably in the top tier. There were some real powerhouses, like Katagiri Daisuke-kun from 36 terms ago, and Tendouin Miyabi-chan from 88 terms back, but even compared to them, her magical skill at her age stands out. Well, Miyabi-chan’s a special case, so I’m only comparing their abilities at the same age. Kaori-chan’s got a high talent for a baby bird, so for me, that earned a high score.\"","\"Oh? Thinking of taking her under your wing?\"","\"No, if Kaori-chan were an Adventurer, I might’ve considered that, but she’s a chef by trade and already quite accomplished in that field. No need to raise her up further. So this is purely my evaluation of the hidden talent performance. Also, Akane-chan’s commentary was sharp and amusing, definitely adding to the experience.\"","Kuro delivered her comments with her usual cheer, but there was a remark that caught my attention. She had referenced past immigrants, but when she mentioned that someone named Tendouin Miyabi-san, her tone seemed just a bit more careful, like she was choosing her words. It made me curious.","That said, I couldn’t exactly put my finger on why it bothered me, so maybe it wasn’t worth dwelling on...... I’ll ask if the opportunity ever came up.","\"Now then, let’s hear from one of the people who gave 4 points...... Kaito-san, if you would.\"","Oh, they were asking for my comments now. I had a feeling I might be called on after giving a 4, so I was ready. I accepted the Loudspeaker Magic Tool from Ein-san and began to speak.","\"It really was an incredible hidden talent, and I thoroughly enjoyed it. That said, I already knew Kaori-san was proficient with Water Magic, and I’d also heard from Akane-san before that Kaori-san was strong enough to slice through objects with compressed water streams. So considering that prior knowledge, the surprise factor was a bit lower for me, hence the 4 points.\"","\"I see, thank you very much. Just like during the last karaoke competition, Kaito-san always manages to give surprisingly reasonable comments in moments like these.\"","\"......What’s with that \"surprisingly\"......?\"","\"Ahaha, well, don’t worry about that...... Now then, Kaori-san and Akane-san, let’s hear your thoughts, how did it feel to show off your hidden talents?\"","After hearing the judges’ comments, Alice turned to Kaori-san and Akane-san to ask for their thoughts.","\"I- I was really nervous. If I misjudged the output even slightly, I think I would’ve easily pierced through Akane-san’s magic barrier......\"","\"Eh? Wait, seriously?! I was totally relaxed, thinking it’d be fine if anything went off course 'cause I had my barrier up, don’t tell me that after it’s all over, that’s terrifying......\"","\"Well, I mean, Akane-san’s magic barrier is...... uh...... errr...... maybe just a bit low in output...... like, it’s tougher than slime, I guess......? You get me?\"","\"If it’s weak, just say it’s weak! When you try to sugarcoat it like that, it honestly feels worse somehow...... Ah, sorry, we’re getting all rowdy here. A lot of it was done in the heat of the moment, but we had fun with it in the end. Thank you for giving us such a great opportunity.\"","\"T- Thank you very much.\"","\"Oh! And don’t forget about Mikumo Trading Company! Even if it's just a corner of your memory, please keep us in mind!\"","\"Y- You’re quick to sneak in huh......\"","With lighthearted and cheerful comments, and a perfectly timed plug for her trading company, Kaori-san and Akane-san’s hidden talent performance came to an end, accompanied by applause.","<Afterword>","・Katagiri Daisuke","He was an otherworlder summoned as a Hero Actor 36 terms ago, a fundamentally kind guy with a delinquent vibe. He declined being the Hero Actor, saying it \"didn’t suit\" him, and had a substitute arranged and took his place. However, he felt it would be irresponsible to just walk away entirely, so he accompanied the pilgrimage to support the substitute Hero.","During the pilgrimage, he fell in love with the noble lady who had acted as the substitute Hero Actor. In the end, he received a noble title, married her, and despite saying it didn't suit him, he studied diligently, performed his duties honorably as a noble, and lived out his life to the end.","・Tendouin Miyabi","She was the Hero 88 terms ago, a noble lady from a prestigious family of the lowest peerage rank. A master of the naginata, she possessed considerable combat ability. During her pilgrimage as the Hero Actor, she met Epsilon, who had come as Megiddo's proxy, at a festival in Hydra Kingdom. They hit it off and became friends. In the end, Miyabi expressed a desire to immigrate, refused a noble title, and went to live with Epsilon.","Epsilon’s use of the naginata and preference for wearing traditional Japanese clothing are both influences from Miyabi.","She lived happily under Epsilon’s care until she passed away of old age. Epsilon believed she had sent her off with composure, but after her passing, she came to realize just how important Miyabi had been to her. Unable to bear life without her, she used a special type of magic to resurrect her, reincarnating her as a Frost Demon...... a yuki-onna-like Demon.","Normally, the souls of otherworlders are returned to their original world...... to Makina after death. However, because Miyabi’s soul unconsciously clung to Epsilon’s side, it remained in this world, making resurrection possible.","That said, unlike someone like Neun, who changed species while still alive, reincarnating a deceased person into an entirely different existence is a forbidden magic that trespasses into the domain of the Gods. Even Epsilon, a Peak Count-rank Demon, could not perform it easily. She succeeded in forcing the magic through by sacrificing \"10 percent of her own power\" as the price.","As a result, the strength that once rivaled or even surpassed Agni’s fell to just below Agni’s level. The reincarnated Miyabi felt somewhat self-conscious about this, but Epsilon didn’t mind at all, saying \"That’s a cheap price to pay for an irreplaceable friend\" and \"If I’ve lost power, I’ll just train again\".","Currently, Miyabi lives with Epsilon and takes care of the household chores. Due to the side effects of the forcibly performed forbidden magic, she lost most of her memories from her time in the Otherworld, but since she retains the memories from after coming to Trinia, she doesn’t mind in the slightest.","However, because of this, she no longer has much of a sense of being an otherworlder. Rather than an \"immigrant from the Otherworld\", she could be better described as \"someone who lost their memories of her former world and was reincarnated\", a unique case. Thus, when Alice explained to Kaito about the existing immigrants, Miyabi was not mentioned.","As a side note, Miyabi harbors romantic feelings for Epsilon and is fully intent on becoming Epsilon’s wife someday. However, since she has decided to wholeheartedly support Epsilon’s relationship with Ozma until it progresses, she offers Epsilon advice on romance and secretly wishes they’d hurry up and get together already.","Incidentally, according to Ozma, Epsilon’s romantic approach has become noticeably more emotionally intense ever since Miyabi started giving her advice."]},{"number":2255,"title":"Chapter 2255: Intermission: Tears of the Ice Oni - Part 1","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I'm having a bit of trouble writing the next chapter, so I'm going to go ahead with the intermission chapter about Miyabi and Epsilon, which I had originally planned to do a bit later. It’s planned to be a three-part arc.","Tendouin Miyabi, 88 terms before Kaito and the others were summoned as the Hero Actor...... In many ways, she led one of the most extraordinary lives among all the Hero Actors.","Miyabi was the first person, aside from the First Hero Kujou Hikari, to express a desire to immigrate to Trinia. She also had a deep connection with Epsilon, one of War King's Five Warlords.","Chronologically, Miyabi belonged to a generation relatively close to that of Neun's...... Kujou Hikaru's era. She herself was a member of Japanese nobility, someone who could be rightfully considered a noble in Japan. At least, that was the case on paper......","Miyabi was the child of a noble patriarch and his mistress, more a consequence of circumstance than a wished-for birth. Although she was officially acknowledged for appearances’ sake, she was treated as though she didn’t exist. Her home life was far from ideal.","Her mother disappeared after taking off with another man, leaving Miyabi behind. From early childhood, Miyabi lived under a cloud of alienation.","The only person who ever truly stood by her was her grandmother. She alone gave Miyabi love and attention, teaching her martial arts like the way of naginata and various manners and traditions. Miyabi cherished her deeply...... But that precious grandmother passed away when Miyabi was 15, leaving her once more in a world that could only be described as lonely.","Living with the belief that there was no place for her in that household, Miyabi found a kind of salvation in the Hero Summoning.","Of course, she was bewildered at first, she even considered the possibility that she was being tricked by a kitsune. But with time, she calmed down, accepted her role as the Hero Actor, and set off on the pilgrimage...... where destiny awaited her.","It happened during a festival held in one of the cities of the Hydra Kingdom, where she participated as the Hero Actor. There, by chance, she met Epsilon, who had come as a representative of the War King.","There wasn’t any dramatic event that brought them together. They simply exchanged words, and found themselves strangely in sync.","One might say their wavelengths aligned perfectly, just the usual conversation felt comfortable and pleasant for her, and Epsilon felt the same.","Epsilon, holding great interest towards Miyabi, accompanied her on her pilgrimage. As they traveled together, their bond deepened, and by the time the Festival of Heroes came around, they had become so close they could truly call each other irreplaceable friends.","[......I see. So, Miyabi, you're not going back to your world?]","[No. I have no place in that world anymore. I haven’t fully decided what to do here, but I don’t intend to accept any noble title. I just feel a strong aversion to them. It seems I’ll be given a fair amount of financial support, so I plan to manage with that.]","[Fumu......]","Having no fond memories of her days as a noble, Miyabi had no intention of accepting a title. She planned to live quietly among the common folk.","Hearing this, Epsilon gave her a contemplative look before speaking.","[In that case, why not come live with me?]","[Eh? With you, Epsilon-sama?]","[Yeah. I may not look it, but I hold a reasonably high position as an Executive of one of the Six Kings. I have a house far too large for one person.]","[That would be more than I could ever hope for but...... Are you sure?]","[Of course. The lifespans of humans are short...... Since I’ve finally found someone I get along with so well, I don’t want to waste time we could have spent together. This benefits me as well.] rАNoВЕS","To Epsilon, who had lived for tens of thousands of years, the lifespan of a human, less than a hundred years, was all too brief. Blink, and it would pass. That was why inviting Miyabi to her home offered Epsilon the chance to spend more of that precious time with a kindred spirit.","Miyabi accepted Epsilon’s offer...... and for the first time in her life, she had a place she could truly call her own.","While she had some skill in martial arts and had even learned magic under Epsilon’s guidance, she didn’t have the strength to join the fiercely combative ranks of the War King camp. Instead, she took care of Epsilon’s household duties in their life together.","The days spent with Epsilon were filled with joy and contentment for Miyabi. She taught Epsilon the way of naginata when she became curious about it, helped her choose traditional Japanese outfits that suited her, cooked meals they ate together, and shared drinks at night. Time seemed to fly by in a blissful haze.","Truly, before they knew it, the years had passed, and Miyabi had grown old...... so much so that she could no longer even get out of bed. Her end was near.","[......\"Ix-sama\"...... Thank you...... for everything. The days I spent with Ix-sama...... they’re my most precious treasure.]","Calling her not with her title as the War King's subordinate, \"Epsilon\", but with her true name \"Ix Nirva\"...... moreover, with an affectionate nickname derived from it that she was allowed to, Miyabi spoke words of gratitude as she felt the flame of his life gradually fading.","In response, Epsilon gave her a gentle smile and softly spoke.","[The one who should be giving thanks is me. The days I spent with Miyabi were truly wonderful. Seeing you off in death, those beautiful memories will forever remain in my heart, never to be forgotten.]","[......If that's...... how you feel...... then I’m glad...... Even if this body perishes...... my soul will always...... be with my beloved Ix-sama......]","As those words were exchanged, Epsilon quietly watched over Miyabi's passing. She had lived a long life. Of course, not all Demons were immortal, on the contrary, the majority had finite lifespans.","Compared to Humans, many did live longer lives, but even so, Epsilon had already seen the deaths of countless acquaintances.","She did not grieve death’s parting. The days they shared would become eternal memories, remaining in her heart. That was why she saw off death with respect. Just as she had done before, Epsilon sent off Miyabi with quiet reverence.","Yes, at that time...... Epsilon still had no idea of the events that would one day come to pass, events that would change her own future forever.","Even after Miyabi passed away, Epsilon’s daily life didn’t change all that much. The rhythm of her days shifted slightly with the absence of her housemate, but that was about the extent of it.","She returned to her days serving under the War King, and she believed she had come to terms with Miyabi’s death...... at least, she thought she had.","That was until about half a year had passed since Miyabi's death.","While out in a port city, Epsilon, on a whim, bought some fish to take home. For her, eating wasn’t a necessity; usually, she only nibbled on snacks during banquets or drank alcohol.","However, during the decades she had spent with Miyabi, who, being human, needed regular meals, Miyabi had cooked for both of them, and it had become natural for Epsilon to eat daily meals as well.","That habit should’ve ended with Miyabi’s death...... but seeing fish on sale triggered a thought \"Miyabi used to love grilled fish, didn’t she?\", and acting on that small impulse, she bought the fish and decided to cook it at home.","[......Hmm. Even though it’s just grilling, I can’t get it to look as nice as when Miyabi made it. I suppose this is what inexperience does......]","Relying on memory, she tried to mimic Miyabi’s method of grilling fish, but Epsilon, who hardly ever cooked, couldn’t quite get it right.","Still, she hadn’t burned it. With practiced ease, she picked up her chopsticks and brought a piece of the grilled fish to her mouth.","[......The taste is completely different too...... Cooking really is...... quite difficult.]","How could she describe it? It wasn’t as though anything significant had triggered it. Just like a cup slowly filling drop by drop without even the owner noticing until it overflowed...... a tear fell.","[......Ahh...... That’s right...... I really did...... love the food Miyabi made......]","Murmuring those words aloud, her tears spilled forth. The house, now without anyone to greet her, felt unbearably large and empty.","At that moment, Epsilon finally came to realize just how immense a presence Miyabi had been in her life.","She thought it would be the same as before.","She thought it was like all the other deaths she had seen, something she could accept and treasure as a memory. But when the lid was lifted...... what did she find? Just imagining the reality, that she would never see Miyabi again, plunged her into a deep, unfathomable despair.","[......I’m unbearably foolish. If she meant enough to me to mourn her death and shed tears like this...... then why...... why didn’t I tell her so while she was still alive......]","An indescribable emptiness, as though a gaping hole had opened in her chest, consumed her. Regret surged, asking why hadn’t she cherished their days more...... And so, Epsilon wept alone, in the now-empty house.","And before long, unable to endure the days without Miyabi, Epsilon reached out her hands...... toward a forbidden art......","<Afterword>","Makina : [Ah, it's the story about my child and Ix Nirva.]","? ? ? : [......Unn? You actually remember her name?]","Makina : [Ahh~~ Unn. Well, I think it'll probably make sense in the later parts, but I had a little talk with her right before my beloved child's birthday party...... so, well, you could say she showed me a little bit of her worth?]"]},{"number":2256,"title":"Chapter 2256: Intermission: Tears of the Ice Oni - Part 2","paragraphs":["Once she became aware of it, her actions were swift, befitting someone under the command of the War King. Epsilon couldn’t bear a life without Miyabi, and so she resolved to resurrect her.","If it's simply resurrecting the dead, for someone like Epsilon, who possessed the highest level of power even among Peak Count-ranks, it was not particularly difficult. However, there was a fundamental time limit associated with resurrection.","While the exact timeframe remained unclear, the general consensus was that revival was only possible within roughly one month of death. Beyond that, resurrection was considered impossible.","Though not publicly known, this was due to a system akin to reincarnation in Trinia. In this world, the soul of the deceased would, after a certain period, be transferred to God Realm and taken into a special space located in the innermost sanctum of the Temple of Life, where the God of Life resided. There, it would be broken down into fine soul particles, mingled and merged with other deceased souls, and eventually reborn as a new soul of life.","Therefore, it wouldn’t be incorrect to say that a soul past a certain period...... about a month, essentially ceased to exist. As such, resurrection beyond that point was deemed impossible. Even Epsilon, though not fully knowledgeable of the mechanics, understood that reviving a long-deceased soul was beyond her capabilities.","And yet, strangely, when it came to Miyabi, she had an almost unshakable intuition...... a near certainty that resurrection was possible.","And in fact...... she was right. There were several miraculous factors surrounding Miyabi.","First, Miyabi was an Otherworlder, and thus outside the scope of Trinia’s reincarnation system. Due to a contract between Shallow Vernal and Makina, the souls of otherworlders who died in Trinia would be returned to Makina’s world.","This wasn’t something that Shallow Vernal or Makina manually oversaw; rather, it was a condition encoded into the Hero Summoning itself: where upon death, the summoned soul would return to Makina’s world. That was how it was supposed to work...... under normal circumstances, that is.","Tendouin Miyabi was the first to permanently reside in this world as a Hero, and aside from Neun, was the first Otherworlder to learn magic. At that time, no one was aware that Otherworlders might possess unique magical affinities.","Neun’s exceptional talent for Tempering Magic was attributed to personal aptitude, and no one had thought to investigate whether Miyabi might possess similar aptitude for a specific kind of magic.","Miyabi, in fact, had an exceptionally strong affinity for a kind of \"magic that imbued words with magic power\"...... what might be called Spirit Speech. However, since she was constantly surrounded by the War King’s subordinates, who were all stronger than her, her magic was ineffective against them, and she never realized her affinity.","Then, in her final moments, without knowing any of this, Miyabi had spoken these words...... \"Even if this body perishes, my soul will always be with my beloved Ix-sama\"......","Yes, those very words caused Miyabi’s soul, which should have returned to her original world, to remain beside Epsilon. Her soul, being outside Trinia’s system...... combined with that magical vow, made her resurrection possible.","But simply bringing her back would be meaningless. Miyabi hadn’t died from injury or illness, she had died of old age. If revived just as she was, she would soon die again.","Therefore, Epsilon needed a solution, and she wrestled with the problem.","The first idea that came to mind was to rejuvenate Miyabi's youth after reviving her. Though complex, this was theoretically possible using advanced Space-Time Magic.","However, reversing time, even for specialists of Space-Time Magic, was incredibly difficult. Epsilon herself wasn’t particularly skilled in that area and didn’t have confidence in her ability to make precise adjustments.","For Epsilon, who had lived tens of thousands of years, a span of a hundred years was negligible, but for a human like Miyabi, even a slight miscalculation could be catastrophic. The risk of failure was too high to ignore.","And more importantly, even if it succeeded, the problem of lifespan disparity would eventually resurface. And so Epsilon reasoned, it would be better to eliminate that root issue altogether......","Thus, she arrived at the idea of reincarnating the soul into a different species. She had heard of such a technique before, magic capable of reincarnating the soul of the dead into a new body of a different species. However, such magic were classified as forbidden arts, Taboo Magic.","Moreover, though rumors and legends about such forbidden arts still linger to some extent, concrete records, documents or books detailing their specifics, are virtually nonexistent, as if someone had deliberately erased them from history.","Fragments of forbidden tomes or depictions in murals do occasionally appear at auctions and similar venues, but it is no exaggeration to say that a complete forbidden book \"almost\" does not exist in this world...... yes...... almost.","As if her skin being seared, an oppressive force of such overwhelming magic power that even Epsilon, a Peak Count-rank, felt it bearing down on her.","And yet, exposed to that tremendous power, Epsilon bowed her head deeply.","[Please! I beg of you, grant me permission to view the forbidden tome that contains resurrection-related forbidden arts!]","[......I don’t...... really mind.]","The one who responded to Epsilon’s desperate plea in a detached voice was the Death King, Isis...... The exact reason remained unclear, but perhaps because even those who sought to destroy forbidden texts did not dare interfere with her, Isis was one of the very few beings in the world known to possess such tomes in a complete and unaltered state.","At this point in time, she had not yet encountered Kaito, and was still widely feared as a symbol of death, especially in the Human Realm. Isis was, in those days, perpetually ill-tempered, and even Epsilon found it immensely nerve-wracking to face her. Nevertheless, she managed to obtain permission, and was granted access to the forbidden tome she sought.","As one might expect from something branded as a \"forbidden art\", its contents were extremely complex. Even for someone like Epsilon, deciphering it to the level where she could understand and safely perform it took over half a year, but driven by her unwavering devotion to Miyabi, she persevered, painstakingly unraveling its mysteries.","And then, after countless preparations...... she painstakingly constructed an enormous and intricate magic circle without a single error, completed the ritual to reincarnate Miyabi, and all that remained was to carry it out.","There is one thing that must never be forgotten. The act of reincarnating the soul of the dead into another being is Taboo Magic———- designated as a forbidden art. In other words...... \"someone decreed it to be forbidden\".","So then, who was that someone? It was none other than Life, the Supreme God who governs the fundamental structure of reincarnation in Trinia and presides over the laws of all living beings.","Simple resurrection poses no issue. Since there is a grace period before the soul of the deceased returns to the cycle of reincarnation, she tolerates resurrection to a certain degree, albeit with some restrictions.","However, altering the soul of the dead into a different existence, reincarnating it without passing through the world’s system of rebirth, is an act that encroaches upon God's domain. It lies outside what she can allow.","Thus, Life descended into the Demon Realm. Her purpose, of course, was to warn Epsilon, who was attempting to perform such a forbidden reincarnation. And if necessary...... to carry out a \"purge\".","But Life’s steps came to an unexpected halt upon reaching the Demon Realm.","[......Why? Why are you the one standing in my way?]","[Well, things happened. I’m sure you’ve got your own reasons, Life-san, but...... just this once, could you look the other way?]","Standing in front of Life was one of the Six Kings, cloaked in a black robe...... the Phantasmal King, No Face. Life hadn’t anticipated the Phantasmal King’s appearance and frowned with displeasure.","Though No Face spoke with an apologetic tone, the killing intent in the air spoke louder than words...... that if it came to it, she would stop Life by force......","The Phantasmal King was a being capable of standing on equal ground with Fate, the most powerful of the Supreme Gods. Even for Life, there was a strong possibility she would be outmatched.","More than that, a direct clash between herself, a Supreme God, and No Face, one of the Six Kings, could potentially fracture the Friendship Treaty between their realms.","[I’m not asking you to let everything slide in the future. Just this one time, please......]","[......................Very well. Just this once, I will overlook it in deference to you. However, with her current ability, she is unlikely to perfectly execute that ritual. The chance of failure is high. Even if she fails once, I will not allow a second time.]","[Of course. If it comes to that, I won’t interfere either. I just want you to give her one chance.]","[......It’s a bit surprising, but I have no reason to question your personal decisions. Well then, I shall take my leave.]","Why No Face appeared to protect Epsilon remained a mystery, but for Life, relationships and schemes of that sort were matters of little interest.","Having declared she would not overlook a second attempt, she returned to the God Realm.","Left alone in the now-empty space, No Face let out a dry chuckle and murmured with a touch of melancholy.","[......I guess this just reminded me of the past. I ended up helping out before I realized it...... I really am too soft...... aren’t I, Iris?]","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [By the way, where’s Serious-senpai?]","Makina : [Ah, she came to me asking if I could turn off that system that lets her see the main story while she sleeps, even just for a bit. Once I disabled it, she happily went off to sleep.]","? ? ? : [......How pitiful. But still, it’s strange, isn’t it? Why does a book even exist that contains such a forbidden art, something that, under normal circumstances, should be impossible to perform, as it's practically within the realm of the Gods......? No matter how you look at it, that source of all the trouble must be involved, right?]","Makina : [Unn. Apparently, back in the day, she was experimenting with all kinds of things. She created books on forbidden arts, basically ritual formulas meant to replicate the Gods' Authority, and then scattered them randomly throughout the Demon Realm. Later on, Gods who didn’t know the full story realized how dangerous they were to the world and rushed to classify them as forbidden arts, then tried to retrieve or destroy them. Looks like they weren't able to retrieve those Isis had though.]"]},{"number":2257,"title":"Chapter 2257: Intermission: Tears of the Ice Oni - Part 3 1","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I ran out of time and couldn’t finish writing it, so Part 3 will be split into two.","Although Epsilon had completed all the preparations and reached the stage of executing the reincarnation ritual, she already understood that the forbidden art was far beyond her capabilities.","It was undoubtedly a magic under the domain of the Gods, so much so that even among the Six Kings, perhaps only Kuromueina could perform it perfectly.","Not only did she lack the advanced techniques required for manipulating mana, but more than anything else, Epsilon simply didn’t have the output needed.","Yes, Epsilon understood. She had known even at the stage of researching the forbidden book...... that she could not perform this ritual \"without offering a sacrifice\". If she wanted to walk a future together with Miyabi...... she had to offer something in exchange......","Standing before the magic circle she had created, Epsilon released all her power. At that moment, two blue horns, proof of her identity as an Ice Oni, emerged from her head.","And without hesitation...... Epsilon snapped off her own horns and placed them at the center of the circle. The two horns, which held the core of her power as an Ice Oni, were offered as the ritual’s medium.","Because of this, once the forbidden spell was completed, Epsilon would never again return to her original form...... never again fight at full strength.","The power she had honed and refined over long years, a part of it was now gone...... but she held no regrets. That’s how precious Miyabi was to her.","It wasn’t about the time they had spent together. It was about the bond they shared, and above all, the hope to share a future together. Compared to that, this price felt light.","By forcefully supplementing the lacking output with the offered sacrifice...... the forbidden art succeeded, and Miyabi’s soul obtained a new body and was reincarnated.","Perhaps because the offering was the core of Epsilon’s Ice Oni power, Miyabi resurrected as a Demon possessing ice powers...... Only her hair had changed to a pale, icy blue but otherwise, she looked just as she had in her youth, when she first met Epsilon.","[......Miyabi...... Do you recognize me?]","She had done everything she could to set the conditions. Even so, this was a forced and incomplete ritual, so Epsilon called out, anxiety weighing on her heart.","At the sound of her voice, Miyabi slowly opened her eyes...... a blank, puzzled expression on her face.","[......Arehh? Ix-sama? How? I thought I was dead...... Arehh? My body feels unusually light......]","[Miyabi!]","[Wah!? Awawa...... Ix-sama is hugging me...... Eh? Why the sudden reward...... Wait, is this a dream? No, maybe I died and went to heaven? Eh, heaven even includes this kind of service? Huh?]","The voice and the way she spoke, it was unmistakably the Miyabi Epsilon had longed to see again. Overcome with emotion, Epsilon tightly embraced the resurrected Miyabi, tears spilling down her cheeks.","Miyabi, on the other hand, had no memory of her time being dead, and was clearly confused by the situation. Her eyes darted about, trying to make sense of it all, but still, being embraced by Epsilon made her happy. Though bewildered, she naturally wrapped her arms around Epsilon’s back and returned the embrace.","After waiting a while until Epsilon’s tears subsided, Miyabi listened to everything that had happened and came to understand that she had been reincarnated as a demon.","For Miyabi, the fact that she could stay with Epsilon was a source of great joy. Becoming a Demon instead of a human didn’t feel like a problem at all, and she accepted it immediately.","[......Miyabi, how does your body feel? Is there any discomfort? The ritual was extremely difficult and forcefully executed, there might be side effects.]","[Let’s see. If anything, I feel younger and more energetic than ever. As for other issues...... hmmm...... arehh? Errr, Ix-sama, I was a former Hero Actor...... and was originally from another world, right?]","[Yes, that’s right but......]","[Ah, errr...... I can’t seem to remember anything from the time I was in that other world. I remember everything from after I arrived here, but all my memories from before that are just...... gone.]","[What!? Your memory......]","[Ah, but it’s not a problem though. I still remember everything that happened after I came here, and I haven’t noticed any other missing memories, so I’m fine.]","It seemed that due to the forcefully completed reincarnation ritual, Miyabi had lost part of her memories from before arriving in Trinia. However, she herself didn’t seem particularly bothered———– after all, it was a world she could never return to.","However, Epsilon felt responsible, her expression twisted with guilt. She had heard stories from Miyabi about her former world, about a kind grandmother who had taken care of her.","There may have been more bad memories than good, but surely some of them were precious. To think that she had erased those with her own lack of skill...... Epsilon now wore a look of deep regret.","Seeing the look on Epsilon’s face, Miyabi hurriedly tried to change the subject...... but then, her eyes drifted up to Epsilon’s head, and she froze in shock.","[......Eh? I- Ix-sama? Your horns...... they’re broken......]","[Unn? Ah, these...... I offered them as the price for the forbidden art. They’ll never grow back.]","[Huh? Eh? Ehhh...... T- The price for the forbidden art...... S- So, to bring me back to life...... Ix-sama's horns......]","This time, it was Miyabi’s expression that clouded over. She knew well that Epsilon’s horns only appeared when she was in her true form. Those horns allowed her to create and wield special weapons forged from her unique cold aura, her trump card in battle.","If the horns were truly gone, then it meant Epsilon could never again wield her trump card. Miyabi’s heart sank under the weight of guilt, but Epsilon simply smiled, completely unfazed.","[No need to worry. In exchange for a friend as irreplaceable as you, I’d say it was far too cheap a price. Yes, I’ve lost something, and I regret not being able to perform the ritual perfectly...... but more than anything, I’m just happy I can see you again like this, Miyabi.]","[Ix-sama...... Yes...... I feel the same. More than any guilt I might carry, the joy of being with you again overwhelms it completely.]","They both carried regrets, and a sense of guilt lingered in their hearts. Even so, the joy of reunion was stronger, strong enough to wash it all away. In the end, for both Epsilon and Miyabi, this outcome was something they could accept with open hearts.","And for now, it could be said that their story had found a temporary resolution. However, not long afterward, a Singularity would appear in this world, and with his arrival, the destinies of Epsilon and Miyabi would once again be set into motion.","The special world created to celebrate Kaito’s birthday...... In one corner of that world, Epsilon bowed deeply. It was in a dogeza, an act of deepest apology from Miyabi's homeland, which she had once learned from her.","[......So, first off, if you’re wondering why I summoned you at this particular time...... It may not seem like it, but I’m actually the type to keep my promises. I’ve got a contract with Shallow Vernal and a promise with Kuromueina, so I’ve been careful while in Trinia. I’ll even let a single act of disrespect slide...... But \"this world is not Trinia\".]","A pressure that warped the very space itself...... Just as Megiddo once said about Canalis, a fight between Epsilon and the being before her couldn’t even be called a battle.","If the presence before her were to unleash even a fraction of its restrained power, Epsilon was certain she’d be crushed out of existence by sheer force alone, that’s how overwhelming the difference in power was......","[For now, you may lift your head. From this point on, you are permitted to speak freely. However, keep in mind that each word you utter might be your very last. Choose them wisely.]","The indifferent voice belonged to the one who had summoned Epsilon here, one overwhelmingly superior to her. Receiving her permission, Epsilon slowly lifted her face.","Not a single word spoken by the being before her had been exaggerated. Should Epsilon say the wrong thing next, it would be the final words of her life.","[Now then, let’s start with a question...... Do you know why I summoned you?]","As Epsilon’s face remained frozen in fear...... the God with iridescent eyes quietly looked down upon her.","<Afterword>","Makina : [What do you think? Don’t I just radiate charisma?]","? ? ? : [Well, yeah, you definitely give off a vibe like you’d seriously come kill someone. That said, the fact that you still remembered Epsilon’s name probably means it didn’t come to that in the end, so there’s some comfort in that.]","Makina : [Oh, and just as a side note, the reason Ix Nirva didn’t take on that serious form she showed in the battle with Polaris during the God Realm war is simply because she had already lost that power by then.]"]},{"number":2258,"title":"Chapter 2258: Intermission: Tears of the Ice Oni - Part 3 2","paragraphs":["In response to the question posed by Otherworld's God, Makina, Epsilon lifted only her upper body while keeping both knees on the ground, assuming a posture resembling seiza as she opened her mouth to speak.","[I believe I was summoned by Earth God-sama this time regarding the matter of Miyabi's reincarnation.]","[Unn, that's right. If you didn’t even understand that much, we wouldn’t be having this conversation.]","Epsilon was familiar with Makina as well. Although Makina had only recently begun acting in her current form, Epsilon had known of her prior identity as Eden and had even witnessed her in a few incidents involving Kaito.","To be honest, she had thought she'd be summoned much sooner. Makina had just spoken of her consideration toward promises, but with her power, such concerns were easily circumvented.","[As you understand, this is a matter concerning my child. Well, since the body is native to this world, there are parts of it I feel a bit conflicted about. I had the same hesitation with Neun at first...... but in the end, I decided that if the soul is my child’s, then I would recognize them as such. That child is precious to me as well.]","Like with Neun, the beings reincarnated in Trinia may carry souls that are Makina's children, but their bodies were formed in another world, which caused her some inner conflict. However, if asked whether she would deny them as her children just because their bodies weren’t born in her world, she couldn’t say yes.","It may have taken some time for her to come to terms with the idea that if the soul was her child, then it was her child———— and that hesitation might be the reason Makina only now chose to speak to Epsilon.","[......Don’t get me wrong. I don’t intend to reproach you for reincarnating my child. The soul of my child who died in Trinia was originally meant to return to my world, but in this particular case, there were unique circumstances. And you couldn’t have known anything about the nature of the soul. So I’m not blaming you for that.]","[...............!?]","Makina had been speaking gently until that moment, but suddenly, an overwhelming pressure filled the space. It felt as if the very air had turned into lead. Epsilon broke into a cold sweat, waiting silently for Makina’s next words.","[What I do take issue with...... is that due to your clumsy and forceful reincarnation, \"my child’s soul was damaged\". That, I will not forgive. That’s why you’re here, because you, who damaged my child’s soul, must answer for it...... So? Do you have any excuses? Any justification you’d like to offer?]","Though Makina stated she would not condemn the act of reincarnating Miyabi itself, she would not forgive the damage done to Miyabi’s soul———– the loss of her memories. Under the weight of Makina’s presence, Epsilon stared straight into her eyes without looking away.","The soul damage Makina mentioned, the memory loss Miyabi had suffered, was something Epsilon had long regretted. Miyabi herself had never brought it up, nor shown any intention to condemn her for it...... but deep down, Epsilon had always felt that she would eventually need to atone.","[......No, I have no excuses, no justification. It was a failure caused entirely by my own inadequacy. However, if I may be so bold, I ask to say one thing.]","[Unn?]","[I cannot claim that I will accept any punishment. I only beg that you spare me from being erased...... Anything else, I will bear without complaint......]","[......Are you saying your life is that precious to you?]","At Epsilon’s words, which sounded almost like a plea for her life, Makina’s expression sharpened. It was as if she were saying that, depending on the answer, she might carry out judgment then and there. In response, Epsilon quietly shook her head.","[No, it’s not that I fear for my life. But if I disappear, Miyabi will grieve. I once lost Miyabi and felt a sorrow too great for words. That feeling like a hole opened in my heart, I don’t want Miyabi to ever feel that same pain...... That is why I must return to her side, no matter what.]","[...................]","[Punish me however you see fit. I only ask that you allow me to return to Miyabi. That is all I wish for.]","Even under the crushing pressure, enough to make her lose consciousness if she let her guard down...... Epsilon did not avert her eyes from Makina. Her gaze was steady, filled with resolve.","If she could return to Miyabi, she would accept any punishment......","[......Your name...... What was it again?]","[......I am called Ix Nirva.]","The question came suddenly, but given that the other party was a God, she chose not to use the name \"Epsilon\", instead offering her true name: Ix Nirva.","Makina gave a small nod upon hearing it. After a moment of silence, she spoke again.","[......Let me get to the point. I will not forgive the damage done to my child’s soul, and I have no intention of overlooking it.]","[Yes.]","[But......]","A sharp snap of fingers rang out, and in the next moment, Epsilon felt power surge through her body...... no, she felt the \"return of power she should have lost\".","[What...... This is......?]","It was the power she had once offered as the price for the forbidden art that reincarnated Miyabi. Though bewildered by its return, she instinctively knew who was responsible. For an Omnipotent God, restoring such power wasn’t beyond possibility...... but she couldn’t understand why.","And as if to answer that very question, Makina continued in a calm, matter-of-fact tone.","[It’s simple. You perfectly succeeded in the forbidden art. \"You didn’t lose your power\" and \"my child’s soul was never damaged\". ......Naturally, my child’s memories were never lost either.]","[Ah...... ahh......]","[In that case...... there’s no reason for me to punish you, is there?]","It all made sense now. Just moments ago, this God before her had not only restored Epsilon’s power, but also repaired Miyabi’s soul and memories......","Epsilon’s expression grew blank with shock, an overwhelming mix of astonishment at the sudden turn of events, joy that Miyabi’s memories had returned, and a flood of other emotions too tangled to name. Seeing her like that, Makina gave a gentle smile.","[Ix Nirva, was it? I’ll remember your name. You wished to live and return not for your own sake, but for my child’s. I place great value in that and I acknowledge your worth...... From now on, stay close with my child.]","With only those words, Makina turned her back on her and vanished, as if declaring the matter resolved. Ix Nirva stood there in a daze for a brief while, but once her thoughts settled, she immediately turned in the direction where Makina had disappeared and bowed deeply.","[......Thank you very much!]","Unable to contain her rising excitement, Epsilon returned home. The moment she opened the door, just like always, she was greeted by Miyabi’s voice.","[Welcome home, Ix-sama. Dinner’s almost ready. I found some really good fish today so......]","[Miyabi!]","[Yes?]","[Do you...... remember your memories from the other world?]","Miyabi, who had been preparing a meal with her kimono sleeves tied back, came to greet her. She looked so completely normal, it was impossible to tell whether her memories had returned, so Epsilon asked directly......","[Errr...... oh, yes. I can definitely remember now. Arehh? But why do you ask so suddenly......?]","[Well, that’s......]","Seeing Miyabi’s puzzled expression as she realized her memories from before the summoning had returned, Epsilon quickly gave her a brief explanation of her encounter with Makina, letting her know that both her own lost powers and Miyabi’s memories had been restored...... Miyabi’s face immediately lit up with joy.","[I see! Well, never mind my memories, what matters is that your power came back, Ix-sama! That’s wonderful!]","[No, my power doesn’t matter in the slightest...... What’s important is that your memories came back, Miyabi.]","[No, I think Ix-sama's power......]","[Miyabi's memories......]","Each of them insisted that what had happened to the other was more important. Their eyes met, and almost at the same time, they both burst into soft laughter.","[Fufufu, this could go on forever, couldn’t it?]","[Indeed. Let’s just say we’re both fortunate and leave it at that.]","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Phew, good nap. Slept through what, three chapters? So? While I was out, did you get through one or two of the lovers’ birthday presents?]","Makina : [Good morning, Serious-senpai~~ Just now, a sudden serious intermission wrapped up. Not to brag, but I was the star of the chapter.]","Serious-senpai : [......Huh? Wait...... wait a second...... Explain...... Explain everything in detail...... I’m on the verge of losing my composure.]","Makina : [I mean, I don’t think you’re ever really composed anyway...... But hey, looks like there’s still one more intermission chapter to go?]","Serious-senpai : [Another serious one!?]","Makina : [Nah, the big stuff got resolved already. Next one's just gonna be a fluffy yuri couple being all lovey-dovey, so they saved it for after you woke up.]","Serious-senpai : [...............................................]"]},{"number":2259,"title":"Chapter 2259: Intermission: The Place I Found, the Love I Gained","paragraphs":["Since Epsilon began living with Miyabi, it had become routine for them to eat meals together, and this evening was no exception, they naturally dined as a pair. After tasting the dinner Miyabi had prepared, Epsilon showed an expression of admiration.","[Tonight’s grilled fish is quite delicious.]","[Eh? Ahh...... you're right. It really is much tastier than usual...... Maybe we just got a good fish this time.]","The food was clearly more flavorful than usual, but Miyabi didn’t recall changing her cooking methods in any way. She simply reasoned that she must have happened upon high-quality ingredients by chance.","However, there was a reason for this. When Miyabi reincarnated, her soul had been damaged. From her perspective, she only believed she had lost part of her memory, but in truth, she had also lost the innate magical aptitude unique to otherworlders.","That aptitude had now been restored thanks to Makina repairing her soul. As a result, she had regained her magic akin to Spirit Speech. Miyabi often muttered \"be delicious, be delicious\" while cooking, and that subconscious invocation had become magically effective, enhancing the flavor of her dishes. But there was no clear indication that would make her aware of it.","[Still, celebrating a birthday by creating an entirely new world...... that’s something else.]","[Miyama Kaito-sama’s influence actually is beyond measure. In fact, hosting the event in another world might be the only way to avoid a huge commotion, so that was more a necessary precaution than anything.]","[I see...... I wonder if someone with that much influence could maybe sweet-talk Ozma-sama into becoming more proactive in romance?]","[That seems unlikely. Miyama Kaito-sama himself doesn’t strike me as someone actively pursuing romance. Rather, he just tends to be well-liked and ends up in relationships because people around him keep making advances.]","[Hmmm. That’s a shame...... If only Ozma-sama were a bit weaker, we could just forcefully establish some...... situations to push things forward. But I guess that’s easier said than done.]","Epsilon couldn’t help but let out a wry chuckle at Miyabi’s disappointed murmur. Despite her refined appearance, they got along so well precisely because her thinking was often straightforward, in a way similar to most of the War King's subordinates.","After their idle dinner chatter and clearing the table, the usual routine was to have a quiet drink together. As they snacked on the appetizers Miyabi had made, they each took small sips from their sake cups.","As one of the War King’s subordinates, Epsilon had always enjoyed rowdy banquets and could drink strong liquor in large quantities...... but lately, she had come to prefer these quiet, relaxed moments spent drinking with Miyabi.","Well, both kinds of moments were enjoyable in their own way, so comparing them might be meaningless......","[Now that I think about it, a few of the former Hero Actors also showed up to help prepare for the party.]","[Ahh, those who immigrated here. Until I regained my memories, I didn’t really feel like I was an otherworlders, so I never saw the Hero Actors as people from the same place...... But now that I remember, I’d kind of like to meet them. They’re people from way further in the future than the time I lived in, so I’d love to hear their stories.]","[If the opportunity arises, I’ll introduce you...... Though I’ve hardly spoken to anyone aside from Miyama Kaito-sama. Still, putting that aside, do you feel like regaining your memories has had an impact?]","[Hmmm, in some unexpected ways, yes...... Like with the fabric I make. I always thought they were fine, but thinking back, after losing my memories, the colors and patterns started to seem a bit off. I guess I was unconsciously drawing inspiration from the kimonos and designs I’d seen before.]","Miyabi created fabrics as both a hobby and a source of income, selling fabric in a traditional Japanese style...... Her main customer was Blossom, but she had other buyers too, enough to earn a modest living.","[I see. So some part of your past memories had been feeding into your experience all along without you realizing it.]","[Yes, though I didn’t notice until I got those memories back.]","[Some things you only understand after losing them...... and others, only after gaining them or regaining them, I suppose.]","[You never know what might trigger that realization until it happens...... Still, when it comes to my memories, unfortunately there wasn’t anything that could help push the relationship between Ix-sama and Ozma-sama forward.]","[......You’re as enthusiastic as ever.]","[Of course! Once I help Ix-sama and Ozma-sama get together, I plan to marry Ix-sama myself! So I’d rather you hurry up and make progress. But Ozma-sama really does seem like the ultimate bachelor type...... He’s a tough one. I guess we’ll just have to slowly work on it over time...... But then again......]","As Miyabi pondered intensely, weighing strategies with a serious expression, Epsilon took another sip of her sake and smiled faintly. There are things you only notice after losing them, and others you only notice once you’ve gained them...... That sentiment she’d just expressed came from her own personal experience.","Thinking back, the first person to fall for Ozma and begin actively pursuing him had been Agni.","Her feelings for Ozma weren’t false. She genuinely respected his strength and admired him, and his personality was something she liked as well. Without hesitation, she could say he was the man she liked most among the opposite sex.","However, if someone were to ask whether her feelings were entirely unaffected by \"her longstanding rivalry with Agni since childhood\", she would find herself struggling to answer.","(Perhaps Ozma-sama finds me harder to deal with than Agni because he senses something in that regard.)","Once again, it should be stated that Epsilon's affection toward Ozma was genuine. However, for example...... though it was an improbable scenario, considering Ozma's power far surpassed even Epsilon’s, and he was capable of feats like self-resurrection with ease...... Still, if, hypothetically, Ozma had died like Miyabi had...... would Epsilon have fallen into the same state as she did back then?","No, most likely not. She would grieve, she would shed tears, she would feel loneliness...... but in the end, Epsilon would accept Ozma’s death. She would take it as a precious, irreplaceable memory of the past, etching it deep in her heart before moving forward.","At the very least, she would not, like when she lost Miyabi...... find herself unable to contain her emotions, crying through the night, clinging to any hope, no matter how reckless, to reclaim the life they had together. She wouldn’t have sought out forbidden arts to do so.","Back then, Epsilon’s state of mind had been truly desperate...... She had spoken with Megiddo and obtained permission, but for those 6 months, Epsilon performed none of her duties as a subordinate to the War King. Without taking even a single break, she immersed herself in forbidden tomes within the library of Isis’s castle.","She had looked so intense at the time that even Isis hesitated to approach her, and Alice couldn’t help but step in and lend a hand.","[Miyabi.]","[Eh? Ah, yes!]","Calling gently to her and patting her knee, Epsilon conveyed her intention, and Miyabi immediately picked up on it. With a small smile of delight, she seated herself on Epsilon’s lap.","Compared to most men, Epsilon was tall, while Miyabi was on the smaller side, and the difference in build between them was noticeable. As Miyabi settled in, Epsilon gently embraced her from behind, resting her chin on Miyabi’s shoulder and closing her eyes.","It was a kind of physical closeness that often occurred when the two drank together...... a momentary pause amid their shared time with alcohol. Miyabi looked happily content in Epsilon’s arms, and Epsilon herself wore a calm, peaceful smile.","The person Epsilon loved most as the opposite sex was Ozma. But if that limitation were removed, then the most important person in the world to her was Miyabi, and the most precious treasure she had was already in her arms.","Epsilon didn’t particularly mind marrying Miyabi first. If Miyabi had some specific feelings or reasons of her own, Epsilon was happy to go along with them at a relaxed pace.","After all, she had no intention of leaving, nor of letting Miyabi go. They were going to stay together forever. There was no need to rush anything; she was content to follow Miyabi’s pace.","[......Miyabi, I’m off work tomorrow. Shall we go out somewhere? I heard Neun-dono opened a shop dealing with other world goods.]","[I was thinking I’d like to get some small plates, so I hope they have things like that. But more than anything, I’m just happy I get to go out with you, Ix-sama.]","[Fufu, you’re exaggerating...... Haven’t we gone out together many times already?]","[No, no, no matter how many times we go, spending time alone with someone you love is always special.]","[I see...... Yes, perhaps you’re right.]","Seeing Miyabi so cheerful, Epsilon responded with a smile of her own. There were things one couldn’t understand until they were experienced firsthand. As she held Miyabi in her arms, Epsilon found herself realizing something new———– that, unexpectedly, she was the type to form a deep and tenacious attachment when it came to what she valued most. With that thought in mind, she gently posed a question to the one she held close.","[Miyabi...... are you happy right now?]","[Yes, of course I am! I’m happy now, and I know I’ll be happy in the future too. Because I intend to stay with Ix-sama for the rest of my life.]","[I see...... I’ll have to make sure I don’t disappoint you then......]","Wrapped in quiet, affectionate conversation, the two were enveloped in a calm, subtly sweet atmosphere.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Oof...... They're flirting way more than I imagined (despair)...... Casually cuddling from behind like it’s nothing...... These two are dangerous......]"]},{"number":2260,"title":"Chapter 2260: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 4","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","[Report]","The third official merchandise item, a set of tin badges, is now on sale at the store of our new partner, Shinkigensha. We’d like to prepare a proper article for the activity report, but since we’re currently short on time, we’ll put it together at a later date. In the meantime, please check Shinkigensha’s X (formerly Twitter) account or search for \"Shinkigensha Online Store\" to take a look.","(T/N: Already posted before, just swapped store partners.)","The hidden talent show, for all its chaos, actually had a nice rhythm to it. As a judge, there was a decent bit of time between each act, so I could spin the garapon and receive a gift in that interval. By the time I finished, the next performance would begin almost right on cue, making for a very efficient flow.","And honestly, not being stuck doing just the judging or just the gift receiving helped break things up mentally, it really was a good balance.","As I was thinking that and spun the garapon......","<FATE>","\"It’s here! My turn! Okay, Shall-tan, I’m stepping away for a bit, take over, please!\"","\"Yeah, yeah. Have fun.\"","Next up was Fate-san. Before Ein-san even had to call her, Fate-san saw the result from the commentary booth and called out to Alice. Moments later, she appeared right in front of me.","[Kai-chan! It’s me, happy birthday!]","[Ahaha, thank you very much.]","Probably on purpose, Fate-san greeted me with the exact same line she'd used at the beginning of the event. I thanked her.","In a way, seeing her genuinely enjoying this kind of event, rather than being annoyed by it, might be one of the biggest changes in Fate-san.","[You’ve been doing the hosting this whole time. Thank you for the hard work, Fate-san.]","[Seriously. It’s not ideal, you know? At this rate, it’s basically guaranteed that me and Shall-tan are going to be the regular MC duo from now on. If this weren’t Kai-chan's birthday, I totally would’ve bailed.]","[That’s just like Fate-san. But honestly, you and Alice make a great team, the pace is smooth, and it’s really fun to listen to.]","[......Hmmm. If Kai-chan's saying that, then I guess I don’t mind doing the MC thing for your birthday from now on. But only for your birthday! I’m flat-out refusing everything else!]","When I praised her, Fate-san responded with a slightly pleased expression.","[Oh right, I gotta give you your present! So here it is!]","[U- Unn? That’s a pretty big package...... But it’s not very heavy...... What in the world is it?]","The package Fate-san pulled out was bigger than I was, seriously impressive in terms of size.","[Remember that cushion Kai-chan gave me before? The one that makes people useless? I went ahead and made an even bigger one!]","[A cushion this size...... That’s pretty insane. I think I could completely disappear into it.]","[I made it big enough for both of us to lie down on together, and it just ended up this size. I did wonder if maybe it was too big, but hey, if you’re not using it, you can just stash it in a magic box so it won’t take up space. So I figured, no need to worry too much about the size!]","Indeed, just as Fate-san said, even a large cushion like this wouldn’t be a problem if it’s stored in a magic box when not in use, it wouldn’t clutter up the room or ruin the aesthetic.","Plus, if it’s stored in a magic box, I could potentially use it while I’m out somewhere too, making it even more practical. And a bead cushion of this size really does look like it would be incredibly comfortable.","[I see...... yeah, lying down on something this size does sound like it’d feel amazing.]","[Right? Let’s sprawl out on it together next time and just laze around~~]","[Ahaha, sounds good. I’ll look forward to it.]","That should’ve been the end of receiving a gift from Fate-san, but then she flashed a mischievous little grin.","[And as your girlfriend, I gotta do something special too, right? So Kai-chan, give me your hand for a sec~~]","[Eh? My hand? Like this?]","[Unn, unn. Okay, here you go!]","[Wha!? Hey, F- Fate-san!?]","I reached my hand out as requested, and after grabbing it, she pressed it straight against her chest.","The action was so sudden I couldn’t react in time, and before I knew it, I had a full grip on her chest. The volume, the softness, the perfect springiness...... wait, no! What the heck is going on!?","[Well, you know, doing something myself feels like a hassle, but I still wanted to make you happy...... so yeah, go ahead and enjoy yourself, okay?]","[Wait, wait! What kind of insane thing are you suddenly......]","[It’s fine, it’s fine. I’ve tweaked fate so no one’s looking this way and no one can overhear us right now...... Well, except for people immune to that kind of thing, but no worries, you’ve got nothing to be shy about. I mean, Kai-chan likes these too, right?]","[That’s...... it’s not about liking or disliking! This kind of thing is, you know, better for when we’re alone together......]","[Ahh, I see~~ Okay then, let’s do it that way next time.]","Hearing my reply, Fate-san readily let go of my hand with a bright, playful smile.","[Alright then, just as Kai-chan asked, next time we’re alone, we’ll pick up where we left off~~]","......Did she just get me to say that!? So that was her real goal...... N- Not that I hate the idea or anything, but it feels like I totally got played here......","[Well then, I’m heading back to the commentary desk~~]","[Ah, r- right. Thank you very much.]","[Bye-byeee~~]","And just like that, waving her hand, Fate-san returned to the commentator’s booth...... Hmmm, she really does hit you with completely outrageous moves while wearing the most casual expression. It always catches me off guard.","Well, I mean...... Touching them certainly does feel nice though...... unn.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Gwaaahhh!? S- So it’s come to this...... Serious-senpai, Mode Change!!! Anti-Lovey-Dovey Mode!!!]","? ? ? : [ ! ? ]","Serious-senpai : [............]","? ? ? : [............]","Serious-senpai : [......D*mn it, so that function doesn’t exist!]","? ? ? : [Eeeeh!? You yelled out Mode Change even though you can’t actually do it!?]","Serious-senpai : [Well, I thought maybe, just maybe, there was some unknown aspect of my biology that would let me do it...... but no dice. What a shame.]","? ? ? : [......Honestly, the idea that you could Mode Change into something you didn’t even know about is kind of terrifying...... But then again, Senpai did turn into sugar back then after all.]"]},{"number":2261,"title":"Chapter 2261: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 5","paragraphs":["After receiving the birthday present from Fate-san, the next person to take the stage at the hidden talent show was...... Blossom-san.","She was wearing a rather authentic-looking kimono, exuding an air of determination but...... what was she going to do? When it comes to Blossom-san, the strong image that comes to mind is one of \"misunderstood Japanese culture\", so what could she be planning to do in a kimono?","\"Next up, we have Blossom-san.\"","\"I wonder what she’s going to do? Since the scoring favors unpredictability, I feel like the more capable participants are actually at a disadvantage......\"","As Fate-san said, this hidden talent show was being judged with an emphasis on surprise, which inherently put top-tier powerhouses like the Count-rank participants at a disadvantage. After all, nothing would be surprising coming from them.","Conversely, humans or those who, in terms of sheer ability, fell short of the highest ranks had the upper hand under this system.","\"I am Blossom, a dependent of World King Lillywood-sama. Though only for a short while today, please allow me to present my humble performance. Now then, I shall begin.\"","Blossom-san, looking unusually focused, bowed with a calm demeanor that seemed almost unreal compared to her usual boisterous self. With only a brief self-introduction, she began her act.","When she pulled a fan from her sleeve and unfolded it, traditional Japanese instruments began to play...... Was this Japanese classical dance? I’d never seen it before, but judging from the atmosphere and her movements, I was pretty sure that’s what it was.","To the tune of elegant music, Blossom-san danced gracefully, occasionally using props like a folding fan or a paper parasol. She looked so polished and elegant...... it was quite the transformation. Usually she gave off a noisy, chaotic vibe, but now she seemed like a refined Yamato Nadeshiko, the gap between her usual image and this one was striking.","The dance itself was truly splendid. I was so absorbed watching it that before I knew it, it was over.","\"That was a magnificent performance. Now then, judges, please present your scores!\"","I hesitated a bit on how to score her. Blossom-san, being a subordinate of the World King, was obviously strong in music-related fields. That she could dance well wasn’t exactly surprising, which weakened the impact from a surprise element standpoint.","However, the stark contrast with her usual image made the graceful Japanese dance all the more memorable. From the perspective of showcasing a different side of herself, I raised the 4-point card.","\"Oh, this one’s a bit divided, isn’t it?\"","\"God of Time and Space and Lili-tan gave 3 points, Kai-chan and Kurorin gave 4 points, and Canalis-sama gave 5...... Yep, that’s the most variation we’ve seen so far. Should we ask each judge for their reasoning?\"","\"Sounds good. Let’s start with...... Chronois-san, your thoughts?\"","With a total of 19 points, this was definitely the most divided score so far.","\"The dance itself was a bit unusual, but truly marvelous. However, as one of the World King's Executives, her skill in song and dance is well known. Therefore, I deducted points on the grounds of lacking surprise.\"","\"I see...... then, Kuro-san, who gave 4 points, what did you think?\"","\"Hmmm...... there were some familiar elements, but it was my first time seeing this kind of dance. I was torn between 3 and 4 points, but the rarity of it tipped me toward 4.\"","So both Chronois-san and Kuro rated the dance highly in terms of execution but docked points due to lack of surprise. That said, Kuro said she added a point for the novelty of Japanese dance.","That made sense...... but now I was especially curious about Canalis-san, the only one who gave 5 points.","\"Now then, Canalis-san, who gave the only 5-point score, what are your thoughts?\"","\"Tahaa~~ I’m simply overjoyed to have witnessed a historic moment. The dance that Blossom-san performed is known as Japanese classical dance from the world of Kaito-sama and the others, but there’s no record of this being passed down in detail from past Hero Actors. And that’s to be expected, most of those summoned as Hero Actors are teenagers, and unless one of them just so happened to have mastered Japanese dance, it would’ve been impossible for the genuine form to be transmitted. And yet, Blossom-san spent many years researching fragmented information gathered from various Hero Actors, and finally succeeded in almost perfectly recreating Japanese classical dance, this performance was her first unveiling of that achievement.\"","If Canalis-san’s comment was to be believed, then Blossom-san had taken vague descriptions of Japanese dance from former Hero Actors, gathered all that fragmented information, and through repeated trial and error, managed to perfectly recreate a traditional Japanese dance that shouldn’t have even been passed down in this world.","\"The dance Blossom-san performed is a style known as shinbuyou, a somewhat modern form of Japanese classical dance. Compared to traditional dances like kamigatamai or kabuki buyou, which have long histories, shinbuyou is relatively recent and not as technically demanding. Even so, to have reconstructed it based on only fragmented information is nothing short of remarkable. It's clearly the result of painstaking study and countless adjustments. Tahaa~~ Rather than being taught from beginning to end, she managed to recreate an otherworldly culture through her own analysis and effort, my 5 points were given in recognition of that extraordinary accomplishment.\"","\"As expected of Canalis-san, an excellent comment. Just as Canalis-san said, it’s easy to overlook when you lump it all together as just \"dance\", but as Kuro-san mentioned, it was something never before seen in Trinia. The fact that she completed a form of dance entirely new to this world is truly praiseworthy. It was a wonderful performance.\"","When Alice concluded the segment like that, many in the audience, including myself, applauded Blossom-san, who bowed quietly in return.","Hmmm, I really did feel like I saw a whole new side of Blossom-san. Thinking about all the effort it must have taken her to recreate Japanese dance like that, it really hit me just how incredible what she had accomplished was.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [D*mn it, another gift scene is coming after this...... D*mn it all! If only...... If only I could Mode Change!]","Makina : [Unn? Serious-senpai, you want to Mode Change?]","Serious-senpai : [Ah! That's right, you're here!!! Please, let me Mode Change into \"Anti-Lovey-Dovey Mode\"!!!]","Makina : [......I don’t really get it, but leave it to me!]","Serious-senpai : [Thank you!!!]","Makina : [......(Why does she want to go into \"Absolute Lovey-Dovey Mode\"? Ah~~ maybe it’s that, huh? After watching so many lovey-dovey scenes over the years, Serious-senpai actually grew to like them too, but now she can’t bring herself to drop her \"I hate lovey-dovey stuff\" persona, so she wants to use this mode change excuse to enjoy it without ruining her image?)]","(T/N: S-Senpai said \"対イチャラブモード/Tai Icharabu Mode\" -> Makina heard \"絶対イチャラブモード/Zettai Icharabu Mode\")"]},{"number":2262,"title":"Chapter 2262: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 6","paragraphs":["After watching Blossom-san’s hidden talent performance, I spun the garapon again.","<SIEGLINDE>","Oh, another lover following right after Fate-san, this time being Sieg-san. Before long, she arrives, accompanied by Ein-san.","[Hello, Kaito-san. Happy birthday.]","[Thank you. How’s the party treating you, Sieg-san? Are you enjoying yourself?]","[Yes. Thankfully, or perhaps I should say luckily, there haven’t been any major incidents, so I’ve been able to enjoy the food and entertainment. Lili, just as usual, still seems to have her hands full though......]","[She’s still acting as a judge after all. Though, if anything, she seems a bit more relaxed right now.]","[That might be because, while she’s acting as a judge, she isn’t being approached by famous or high-ranking people.]","[Ahh, that makes sense......]","Now that she mentioned it, for Lilia-san, being a judge might actually be relatively stress-free. She’s sitting with Chronois-san, who’s close with her, the sociable Kuro, and Canalis-san, who lives in my house and often talks with Lilia-san. So from her perspective, she’s surrounded by people she’s comfortable talking to.","[Well, speaking of busy people, you’re probably the busiest one here, Kaito-san. This party is enormous......]","[Yeah, no kidding...... I wonder if it’ll be like this next year too?]","[Considering an entire world was created just for your birthday party, I imagine it’ll be held here again.]","[That’s...... kind of a stomachache-inducing thought...... But I guess it’s still better than some chaotic disaster breaking out in Trinia, so it’s a bit complicated.]","[Fufu, true enough. Ahh, we’d better wrap this up before the next hidden talent show begins. Here, this is the gift I prepared for you.]","What Sieg-san handed me was a slightly large package...... about the size that could contain clothing. When I picked it up, it felt light and soft...... maybe a sweater?","[Thank you. Just from holding it, it kind of feels like a sweater......]","[Ahh, close guess. Honestly, I didn’t have the confidence to pick something unique with my sense of style, so I intentionally went for something out of season. It’s a scarf.]","I see. That makes sense, my birthday falls in summer...... and even in this world, it's relatively warm around this time. Though the climate in the Symphonia Kingdom is pretty stable year-round, scarves are still more for the colder seasons, which are months away.","So yeah, that makes it less likely to overlap with other gifts.","[It has a similar design to the one I’m wearing...... It’s from the same merchant group, so it’s the same brand.]","[I see, so it would be a pair look? It’s not the right season just yet, but I’m looking forward to wearing it.]","[......Ah, well, um......]","[Unn?]","Hearing my words, Sieg-san seemed slightly flustered, scratching her cheek and glancing away a bit. Then, after a moment, she let out a little laugh and explained.","[......Well, rather than pair look, it’s more of something used by a pair...... It’s a two-person scarf.]","[A- Ahh, yeah, those do exist, don’t they......]","A large two-person scarf, something I’d only seen in romantic dramas or manga...... Yeah, knowing that, it made sense why I mistook it for a sweater based on the size.","I’d heard of them before, but it’s not something you often get to see in person, so I couldn’t help but find it kind of fascinating.","[Yes. At first, I was just going to get a regular scarf, but when I went to the shop, I saw that one...... and I couldn’t help but buy it, thinking how nice it would be to go on a date wearing it together.]","[I’ve heard of scarves like that too, but I’ve never actually worn one. I’m really curious now...... and just like you said, going on a date while sharing the same scarf sounds like it’d be a lot of fun. It’s a bit much for this season, but once it gets a little cooler, let’s give it a try.]","[Yes, I’m looking forward to it.]","Sieg-san’s cheerful smile was contagious, and I found myself smiling along with her. I really am looking forward to that moment. Since we’d have the scarf and all, maybe we could even visit somewhere a bit colder like Archlesia Empire.","In any case, I’m already excited for when that day comes.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai (Absolute Lovey-Dovey Mode) : [Comrades, I like lovey-dovey romance. Comrades, I adore lovey-dovey romance. Comrades, I’m head over heels for lovey-dovey romance...... (Eh? What the, why is my mouth moving on its own!?)]","? ? ? : [......That so.]","Serious-senpai (Absolute Lovey-Dovey Mode) : [I love one-sided crushes. I love mutual feelings. I love confessions. I love mixed bathing. I love bed-sharing. I love lap pillows. I love dates. I love hugs. I love kisses...... (Oi, you idiot, stop it right now!)]","? ? ? : [...................]","Serious-senpai (Absolute Lovey-Dovey Mode) : [I love romance blooming in grassy fields, by the seaside, at school, in parks, movie theaters, amusement parks, at home, in the streets, in the bath, in the bedroom...... every possible romantic act performed in this world! I love when a boy and girl, once just friends, suddenly realize their feelings in a fleeting moment. My heart leaps when they get awkward after that realization, or when they become overly conscious of each other over the smallest things. I love when events like Christmas or Valentine's Day push a relationship past the threshold from \"just friends\" to something more. When someone spends days working up the courage, hesitates, then turns bright red as they finally hand over a gift or chocolates, I feel my heart pound with anticipation. I love the first date after two people officially become a couple. Even if they’ve gone out countless times before, the shift in relationship status makes them both nervous, that kind of change is so moving. And the moment they hesitate, over and over, before finally working up the courage to hold hands? That’s absolutely irresistible. Should they just hold hands normally, or interlock their fingers? That little game of emotional tug-of-war, born of mutual affection and the hope for progression, is the best. I love the kiss that happens after countless conversations and events raise the atmosphere to its peak. It’s positively euphoric. I love how couples, after getting together, become full-on lovebirds, practically inseparable. When each other’s personal space becomes their shared space, and they naturally sit close together and talk sweetly, it’s pure sugar. I love seeing couples blaze through a flood of romantic events. Sure, slow and detailed romantic development is beautiful, but when the scenes shift one after another, rapidly showcasing all sorts of sweet moments, it’s the ultimate bliss...... (This has got to be that lunatic God’s doing!!!)]","? ? ? : [......The massive amount of monologue, is that from whoever tampered with her?]","Serious-senpai (Absolute Lovey-Dovey Mode) : [Comrades, I yearn for more lovey-dovey developments. You, the readers who follow these stories with me, what is it you seek? Do you crave more romance? Do you long for meltingly sweet, saccharine love stories? Do you desire a relentless parade of scenes where lovers take the spotlight one after another?]","Hallucinations : [Lovey-dovey! Lovey-dovey!]","Serious-senpai (Absolute Lovey-Dovey Mode) : [Very well, then let there be romance! The next talent performance will be skipped in digest format! We’re jumping straight to the next lover!!! ......(Wait, what!? Stop it, you idiot! Don’t skip the break, nooooooo!)]"]},{"number":2263,"title":"Chapter 2263: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 7","paragraphs":["By the time the fourth act of the hidden talent show rolled around, the atmosphere had really come together. Still, I never would’ve guessed that Dr. Vier and Funf-an would do a comedy duo routine. And to top it off, Funf-san was the funny man of the act......","Also, this has nothing to do with their routine, but I have to say, seeing Tre-san standing off to the side of the stage with her arms crossed and this smug look that seemed to say \"Yes, I raised them myself\" was honestly hilarious. I know her well enough to tell she probably had nothing to do with that duo, but she clearly wanted to play the \"wise mentor watching from afar\" role just for the vibe.","She didn’t even go up on stage, just lingered at the side...... Well, including the surprise factor, it was pretty entertaining. And now for the next garapon......","<ILLNESS>","Oh, wow. So after Fate-san and Sieg-san, that makes three lovers in a row. Not that it means anything special, but when people close to you keep getting picked, it does make you feel kind of happy.","A short while later, Illness-san arrived.","[Kaito-samaaaa, happyyyy birthdaaaaaay!]","[Thank you very much. Illness-san, that's a beautiful dress. I’ve seen you in maid uniform and casual clothes, but this is the first time I’ve seen you in a dress, it’s a refreshing change. The darker tones give it a refined look, and it suits your composed image really well.]","[Kuhihi, thank youuu. Since it’s Kaito-sama’s birthdaaaaay, I decided to dress up a little biiiiiit.]","Though Illness-san is petite, she has a calm and mature air about her, so a subdued-colored dress suits her perfectly. How should I put it, she isn’t being outshone by the dress; she wears it with grace and confidence. It felt fresh, yet incredibly fitting.","[As for your birthday preseeeeent, I’ve prepared some perfume for you this tiiiiime. Here you gooooo.]","[Thank you. Now that you mention it, I don’t really have any perfume. Judging by Illness-san's preferences, I’m guessing it’s rose-scented?]","Perfume as a gift feels kind of elegant and new to me...... It makes my heart flutter just a little. I’ve never worn perfume before, but putting aside for everyday use, for parties or formal occasions, it might be nice to add a touch of fragrance. It could add a layer of refinement.","[Indeeeeed, I do love roses, but when it comes to perfuuuume, rose tends to have a strong sceeeeent, and people have differing preferences regarding thaaaat. And since Kaito-sama isn’t very used to wearing perfuuuuume, I thought something with a lighter scent would be more suitableeeee, so this time I focused on a citrus fragraaaaance. I did use a hint of roses thouuuugh.]","[I see. I do like the fresh scent of citrus, so that sounds nice.]","[Yeeees. For the top note, I used citrus sceeeeents, the middle note is a floral-fruity bleeeend, and the base note is woodyyyyy. There’s a bit of roses used in the heart nooooote.]","[......I’m really not familiar with perfumes at all, so I can’t say I fully understand, but you made this yourself, right, Illness-san? Then I know it’s going to be great, and I’m looking forward to using it...... though, since I’m a complete beginner, if possible, I’d love it if you could teach me how to apply it when the time comes......]","[Yeeees. Leave it to meeeeee.]","R- Right, I think I read about this in some manga once. Perfume has something like a top note that you smell right after applying it, a middle note that comes out after a bit of time, and a base note that appears around an hour later, and the combination of those, and which one is emphasized, makes a big difference or something.","Well, I really don’t know anything about this stuff, so I’ll just ask Illness-san to teach me how to use it properly when the time comes.","[By the waaaaay, I belieeeeeve lovers are supposed to do something a little special, riiiiiight?]","[It’s not like there’s any rule or anything, but yeah, it has sort of turned into that, hasn’t it?]","[Buuuuut, there aren’t many things we can do immediately in this settiiiiiing.]","[That’s true. So you really don’t need to force yourself to——— mmph!?]","Before I could finish my sentence, Illness-san suddenly stepped in close, taking advantage of a small lapse in my attention, and gave me a light kiss, just enough to make a soft chuu sound, then quickly pulled away.","It completely caught me off guard, but the soft sensation of her lips and the gentle waft of rose perfume left me feeling like my mind was melting.","[IIIIIIIIII’m wearing rose-scented perfume myseeeeelf. What did you thiiiiiiink?]","[Eh? Ah, errr, it smelled wonderful, and...... it makes my heart racing.]","[Kuhihi, theeeeen I’m glad to hear thaaaaaat. Once agaaaaain, happy birthday, Kaito-samaaaaaa.]","Saying that, Illness-san smiled happily. Compared to before, she seemed more emotionally expressive than she had been before—like she was letting feelings of joy and happiness show more openly. And the fact that those feelings were being directed toward me, it made me feel deeply honored...... and truly happy.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Gwaaaah!? Wait, so I revert to my normal state during lovey-dovey scenes!? What kind of trash performance is that...... That damn lunatic God, I’ll never forgive her......]","? ? ? : [I feel like you’re perfectly mistaken with asking the wrong person. Wouldn’t it have made more sense to ask Shal...... errr, I mean the Airhead God for help?]","Serious-senpai : [Airhead God hardly ever shows up! Makina, on the other hand, drops by like 5 times a week and drags me into her crazy stories, so she’s easier to negotiate with, or more like, easier to ask to...... and she pretty much gives me whatever I ask for, so she’s actually really convenient......]","? ? ? : [Doesn't that sound more like you're just plain close friends......?]"]},{"number":2264,"title":"Chapter 2264: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 8","paragraphs":["At the venue for Kaito's birthday party, there were moments of excitement with things like party tricks, but of course, that wasn’t the only focus. Many attendees were simply enjoying normal conversation.","And with such a large venue filled with guests, especially since even people who hadn’t exchanged contact information with Kaito but still knew him were invited this time, unexpected pairings and encounters occurred here and there.","[.....................]","[.....................]","In one corner of the venue, two Demons stood face-to-face, both wearing similarly complicated, bitter expressions as if they had bitten into something unpleasant.","One was a Cat Beastman-type Demon who lived at Kaito’s house as a member of his family and worked energetically behind the scenes, mainly assisting Anima...... Caraway.","The other was a Dog...... no, a Wolf-like Beastman-type Demon with a punk-style outfit, copper-red hair, and distinctive wolf ears and tail, a figure that gave off a rough, wild vibe...... Ryukoricyan.","They had once been rivals ruling neighboring territories in the Demon Realm, and this was their first encounter in a long time.","[......So you showed up, stupid mutt.]","[......Just my luck. Of all the people to run into, it had to be the stupid cat......]","[That’s my line...... I didn’t think you knew Miyama-sama......]","[It’s only a shallow acquaintance. We exchanged greetings, that’s all......]","Because they had clashed countless times in the past, the air between them was tense, and both Caraway and Ryukoricyan were shooting sharp glares at each other.","[Fuuuu......]","[Grrrr......]","Both of them unintentionally let out low, threatening sounds...... but after a moment, they sighed at almost exactly the same time.","[......This isn’t the place for it. Let’s not fight.]","[......Yeah. Starting a fight here would just be a nuisance.]","Though they are each others' rivals and claimed to \"hate\" one another...... in reality, their relationship wasn’t truly hostile. There was a part of them that acknowledged and respected each other.","Even now, they had enough common sense to realize that fighting at Kaito’s birthday party would trouble both him and everyone else, so they decided to let it go.","[......About that time with the territory, thanks.]","[Don’t be ridiculous. I only did it to expand my own domain. It wasn’t for the sake of some stupid cat.]","[Yeah yeah, sure. Let’s go with that.]","When Ryukoricyan clarified that her actions weren’t out of kindness toward Caraway’s kin, but entirely for her own benefit, Caraway just responded with a wry smile.","[......No thoughts of returning to your old position?]","[Nope. That whole incident made me realize I’m not cut out to be in charge. Back then, I kept forcing myself to act the part, and looking back, it’s obvious. I was pushing myself to do the unreasonable, and I took that stress and vented it as ambition or a hunger for power. Now that I’m in a support role, I can relax, be myself, it’s so much easier and more enjoyable.]","[......I see.]","Since becoming Kaito’s subordinate...... his family, and assisting Anima, Caraway had come to understand that her nature was more suited to support roles.","Looking back, when she was a Viscount-Rank Demon with many subordinates, she was constantly on edge, always pushing herself, and her perspective had grown terribly narrow. She could clearly see that now.","By contrast, when supporting someone else, she could notice the finer details, and she felt it fit her personality perfectly.","[Well, you were always the type to overthink every little detail.]","[Ryukoricyan, you're doing a lot better than me huh. I used to think you were the lone wolf type, but maybe you're more suited to being on top than I expected?]","[In my case, I’ve just made peace with it. I don’t go out of my way to micromanage. If someone wants to follow me, they can do it on their own, that’s all there is to it.]","[Hmmm, sounds like War King-sama then?]","[No. War King-sama might seem rough, but they're surprisingly thoughtful. They take care of their subordinates and is well-liked. Compared to someone like me, they're far more fit to lead others. There's a reason they're worthy of being called a King.]","As Ryukoricyan said, Megiddo may come off as rough and reckless, but she's actually very sharp. She dislikes unnecessary complications and roundabout ways of doing things, so she often chooses simple actions, but she carefully thinks through the things that need thinking.","And though it only applies to \"people she likes\", she’s also someone who takes good care of others. With her subordinates, even the lower ranks, she gives combat training without discrimination, and all in all, she's genuinely well-loved.","[I see...... Either way, someone like me who tends to get tangled up in thoughts probably isn't suited for that kind of position.]","[You act free-spirited, but in truth, you're constantly overthinking things...... Trying to do everything at once would choke the life out of you. In that sense, serving under Kaito might actually be your ideal role, you could call it your true calling.]","[Unn. Every day’s been really fun for me.]","[I see. Well, good to hear...... When I get the chance, I’ll come beat you down again, so take your time and prepare yourself.]","[I'm stronger than you now though~~]","[For now, maybe......]","[And that's obviously going to be the same too after this......]","[........................]","[........................]","They glared silently at each other for a few seconds before turning away at almost exactly the same time with a sharp flick of the head.","[......Still as infuriating as ever.]","[......Right back at you.]","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ah, come to think of it, they met at Harmonic Symphony, but they didn’t exchange contact info, so that’s why she wasn't at the party on the ship...... That said, the two seem pretty close.]","? ? ? : [Well, I’d say it’s more of an \"undesirable friend\" kind of relationship.]","Serious-senpai : [Yeah, I guess that’s...... mgh, guh, w- why is my body moving on its own......]","? ? ? : [Unn?]","Serious-senpai (Absolute Lovey-Dovey Mode) : [......Now then, comrades, let us begin. Next chapter: guaranteed lovey-dovey episode! (Huh!? My mouth’s moving on its own again!?)]","? ? ? : [......So now you can set the next development exclusively to lovey-dovey mode huh......]"]},{"number":2265,"title":"Chapter 2265: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 9","paragraphs":["The hidden talent show had turned out to be quite the elaborate affair. Since Alice had emphasized \"unexpectedness\" as a key judging criterion at the start, the performances truly lived up to the \"hidden\" in hidden talents, featuring skills so surprising that no one could have imagined them beforehand, making it all genuinely entertaining.","Following the manzai comedy routine by Dr. Vier and Funf-san, the next performer was none other than Bard-san, the captain of Archlesia Empire’s Knight Order. To everyone’s astonishment, he chose to showcase kendama, a toy brought over from another world. And...... he was insanely good at it.","Then, after that hidden talent performance concluded, I spun the garapon again for another round of gift-giving......","<ALICE>","Oh, another one of my lovers, Alice’s name came up next. With this, all of my lovers had now taken their turns.","\"Oh my, it’s my turn now. Well then, as for the commentator’s seat...... Kuro-san, can I leave this to you?\"","\"That’s strange, you just glanced at me like you decided I wasn’t fit for the job? Not that I mind, it’d just be a hassle if you actually did ask me to do it......\"","Since this took place during a break in the hidden talent show, there wasn’t much actual commentary work to be done, but still, it wouldn’t do to leave the seat empty, so it seemed she was leaving it in Kuro’s hands.","Fate-san, who sat beside her, would no doubt grumble and avoid the task, an accurate assessment, really.","[And so, Kaito-san, it’s my turn. Well~~ I ended up being the last one among your lovers. Was that the plan? Did you want me to be the grand finale?]","[No, I just figured you looked really busy with commentary......]","[Ahhh, and so I ended up last because of that...... but if you were thinking that way, isn’t being the last actually kind of meaningful? Ahh, I see now. Kaito-san, you were secretly thinking \"Wow, it’s nice having all my lovers go in a row like this!\", weren’t you?]","[I mean, yes, I did think that.]","[And thanks to that ultra lucky streak of yours, I got picked right after as well!]","Come to think of it, when Illness-san had been chosen earlier, I had thought something like \"this is kind of nice, having all my lovers show up one after another\", so maybe that did influence things...... Now that she pointed it out, it made sense.","[Well anyway, Kaito-san...... Happy birthday. Here’s your gift.]","[Thanks...... That’s a pretty big bag.]","[Yes, but the contents aren’t anything special. Just a matching set of clothes and shoes tailored to your taste. I made them myself and used high-quality materials, but the design is pretty standard. I figured, with all the eccentric gift-givers around here, someone should give you something simple and normal.]","[Makes sense. Honestly, that kind of thing is easier for me to accept and enjoy.]","He had already experienced more than enough special moments today, so something practical and down-to-earth, like the outfit Alice prepared, was both easier to receive and more useful.","Well, knowing Alice, she had probably factored all that into her decision too, but either way, it was a thoughtful and appreciated gift.","[......By the way.]","[Wait a second, Kaito-san. Isn’t this weird? It’s not like we originally had to do something special just because we’re lovers, right? Kuro-san did something weird during the exhibition match, and then Isis-san got all emotional and followed suit, and now it’s turned into this whole \"do something special if you’re a lover\" thing, but there had never been a rule about that!]","[You’re panicking so obviously right now......]","[Come on, Kaito-san, you know how I am......]","[Yes, and at this point I’m wondering when you’ll finally get used to it.]","Alice was, by her own loud admission, absolutely terrible at romance. She was prone to flustered reactions and easily embarrassed by anything resembling romantic gestures.","That didn’t mean she disliked such things though. In fact, she was quite the romanticist at heart. She probably liked doing lover-like things, in theory.","But despite all we had done together by now...... she still reacted this way every time... Just as I was thinking that, Alice let out a sigh, so exaggerated and obvious that it was practically comical.","[Haaah...... Kaito-san, I’ve said this many times before, but please don’t underestimate just how much of a sh*tty noob I really am in love.]","[And why do you sound so proud to declare that you’re worse than expected......? So, does that mean you’re not doing anything special today?]","[Ugh...... N- No, well, um, I am your girlfriend so...... It’s not like I’m refusing or anything, it’s just...... I need to prepare myself mentally, or maybe the timing just isn’t right, or——— mmpf!?]","Things were getting a bit too noisy with all her flustered rambling, and at this rate, she was bound to keep coming up with excuse after excuse, dragging it out until it was time for the next hidden talent performance, so I decided to just act myself. Taking a cue from what Illness-san had done earlier, I leaned in quickly and gave her a light kiss.","[W- W- W- What was that for all of a sudden!? And seriously, aren’t you always way too aggressive only with me!?]","[Well, you always dodge these kinds of situations like crazy......]","[Bfuhh...... I- I mean...... it’s embarrassing......]","It’s not that I intentionally take the lead with her, it’s just that if I don’t, nothing ever happens. With Alice, things only move forward if I push them myself.","She was now protesting with a bright red face, but honestly...... if she had really wanted to avoid the kiss, it would’ve been easy for her. Dodging something like that would be child’s play for Alice. The fact that she didn’t means the answer is already clear...... Of course, if I pointed that out, she’d only get even more flustered and probably start panicking, so I kept quiet...... Still, she really is as adorable as ever.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Guaaaaah, so it did switch back after all!? What the heck is that mode, I'm basically just self-destructing!!! D*mn it...... N- No, but still, all the lovers are taken care of now, so the crisis is over...... Eh? Wait, what——— my body’s moving on its own again......?]","? ? ? : [Because you just had to raise a flag......]","Serious-senpai (Absolute Lovey-Dovey Mode) : [Comrades! Can we truly say we’re satisfied with this outcome? Can we honestly claim that we’ve done everything there is to do? ......No! Absolutely not! As was depicted in the story, the lovers who gave presents and engaged in special acts did so starting from the Kuro – Isis arc. Those who gave their gifts before that didn’t! In other words, isn’t there still something left to be done!? ......(Hey, you've gotta be kid...... What are you trying to go back for againnnnnn!?)]"]},{"number":2266,"title":"Chapter 2266: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 10","paragraphs":["A world created to celebrate Kaito’s birthday...... Suddenly, time comes to a halt. Even Chronois, who holds Authority over time and space, is powerless before this forced, world-scale temporal freeze. That being the case, the list of possible perpetrators is exceedingly short.","Before long, several figures appeared in the conference room, a chamber in the castle hosting the party, centered around a massive round table.","[......What now? Stopping time out of nowhere and calling an emergency meeting......?]","Those summoned were the original group involved in planning Kaito’s birthday party...... namely, Shallow Vernal, Kuromueina, Alice, Fate, Lilia, the three rulers of the Human Realm, Makina, and Canalis. Added to that was Electrone, summoned specifically because the time-stop had no effect on her. Eleven people had gathered.","And then, in a flat, emotionless tone, Shallow Vernal, the one who had initiated this emergency meeting, spoke.","[I object.]","[Objection? Shiro, what do you mean?]","[......Ahh, I’ve got a bad feeling about this already.]","Kuromueina tilted her head at Shallow Vernal’s abrupt words, while Alice, who seemed to have a sense of where this was going, gave her a slightly exasperated look.","[It’s unfair that those of us, like myself and Lilia, who gave our presents to Kaito first didn’t get to do any sort of special gesture, just because that trend started later on.]","[Eh? Ehhhh...... isn’t that kind of a petty thing to worry about? I mean, neither I nor Sieg-chan did anything special when we gave him our gifts.]","[The entire precedent was set when you, Kuro, kissed Kaito on the cheek during the game tournament. So if we’re talking about jumping the gun, you were the first. As for Sieglinde, they promised to share a scarf together, that counts as a corresponding gesture.]","[Ugh...... W- Well, that’s, errr......]","Kuromueina had tried to chastise Shallow Vernal, but when it came to who really made the first \"move\" among Kaito’s lovers, it was hard to deny it had been her. That fact left her unable to mount any strong rebuttal.","[She’s right! It’s totally unfair!!! Even my beloved child will be left with this lingering feeling of dissatisfaction if we let things end like this!]","[......No, even if we did acknowledge Shallow Vernal-sama’s claim, Makina, you wouldn’t be included......]","[Yes. This is specifically a matter of unfairness among the lovers. Mothers are excluded.]","[What!?]","Makina, who had tried to back up Shallow Vernal’s argument, was summarily cut down, not just by Alice, but by Shallow Vernal herself.","With a soft pon, Electrone placed her hand gently on Makina’s shoulder.","『Outputting proposal...... <Now, now, Makina-chan. If we start factoring in people outside the lovers, this whole thing’s going to get way too complicated. As a mother, this is your chance to show some composure and let it slide. Stand tall and let them have this one.>...... There are times when a mother should be given priority, but I’ve judged that now is the time to yield.』","[Ugh...... W- Well, when you put it like that...... it would be bad if a mother interrupted the time meant for lovers......]","『Continuing with the next topic...... <Anyway, Makina-chan, let’s talk about your movie instead. As expected, your film was incredible. I was really moved! Especially that scene, 28 years, 145 days, 18 hours and 24 minutes in, when the camera zooms in on Kaito-sama! Coming in from a 53-degree angle above and to the right...... I could feel your obsession with detail, and it gave me chills!>...... That was nothing short of art.』","[Electrone really does get me! That’s exactly right! I agonized over that scene for so long. If I just wanted to show off my beloved child’s cuteness, a 47-degree angle would’ve been perfect. But when you factor in the scenes before and after, 53 degrees really was the best choice! I spent like three days on that decision, so it makes me so happy that you noticed! Ah, and that’s not even the only thing I obsessed over......]","[Um, Shallow Vernal-sama. Could we maybe make Electrone a regular for these kinds of events? If I can leave Makina to her, everything gets way easier for me.]","Electrone casually soothed Makina and redirected her attention with expert ease, keeping her from interfering with the meeting. Alice, watching this subtle maneuver, had a complicated expression on her face as she made her suggestion, one that hinted at her usual exhaustion with Makina.","[Let’s save that discussion for later. ......In any case, I cannot accept this kind of unfairness. Lilia and I strongly protest.]","[ ! ? ]","Shallow Vernal’s words, though delivered in her usual flat tone, somehow carried undeniable conviction. Lilia, meanwhile, looked utterly stunned, her expression clearly saying \"Wait, I’m part of this too!?\" But in this situation, there was no way she could object aloud.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [D*mn it! That airhead God just had to stir the pot...... But what would they even do now? It’s not like we can just give our presents all over again......]","? ? ? : [Also, judging from Shallow Vernal-sama’s statement, Lilia-san is casually being lumped in as well...... Looks like that composed expression she had at the judges’ table is coming back to bite her now......]"]},{"number":2267,"title":"Chapter 2267: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 11","paragraphs":["As Shallow Vernal complained about how she was dissatisfied with not having had a romantic exchange with Kaito when giving her present, Alice responded with a somewhat exasperated expression.","[Uh, is that really something to be bothered about? If you want to flirt, you can just do it after the party or whenever you want, right?]","[You say that only because you got to flirt to your heart’s content......]","[I did not flirt! If anything, I was the one being flirted with, not the one doing it!]","[I can only feel envious...... Should I start questioning the fact that you didn’t avoid it, or the fact that, being you, you could’ve easily noticed and stopped it beforehand?]","[..................W-Well, perhaps Shallow Vernal-sama’s opinion is indeed worth considering.]","To be honest, Shallow Vernal was strong. Among those present, there were very few who could realistically complain to her.","On top of that, Makina was actually on Shallow Vernal’s side, and while Kuromueina and Alice tried to calm her down, the truth was that they had both done something like that, so they were on shaky ground when that point was brought up.","Just then, Canalis, who had remained silent until now, spoke up.","[Hmmm, well I get what you're saying, and I can't say I don't understand why you feel it's unfair, Shallow Vernal...... So, what are we actually going to do about it? Have the gift-giving again? Go back in time and redo it? There are plenty of ways to handle this......]","[Indeed. That’s exactly where I’d like some input. Let’s make it the emergency meeting’s topic: what should Lilia and I do to flirt with Kaito?]","[Honestly, you can just do whatever you want...... I mean, you could’ve included Kaito in the exclusion from this time-stop and have as much of your flirting as you want......]","Shallow Vernal spoke with a heavy, solemn tone, but Alice muttered with an utterly uninterested expression. Given Shallow Vernal’s capabilities, she could probably make just about anything happen, so if she wanted to flirt, she should just go ahead and do it, that was Alice’s honest thoughts.","As the mood of the meeting began shifting toward finding a suggestion that would satisfy Shallow Vernal, Electrone, who had been talking with Makina, raised a hand.","『This unit is technically an outsider, but may I make a proposal?』","[Go ahead.]","『Then, outputting confirmation...... <First, I want to confirm: Shallow Vernal, it’s not that you necessarily want to give your present again or are hung up on the gift-giving situation itself, right? Rather, what you're unhappy about is that others had romantic moments while you didn’t. So as long as you can have a romantic moment with Kaito-sama in the context of his birthday party, that’s fine, correct?> ......Please confirm.』","[Yes, that's exactly right.]","Shallow Vernal nodded at Electrone’s words, and Electrone gave a nod back before continuing.","『Then, outputting revised proposal...... <How about taking a break? The party’s been going for a while now. Even though there are breaks for gifts and food, Kaito-sama, as the guest of honor, has mostly been sitting in one place, so he’s probably tired. If we create a 15- or 30-minute break where he can rest in a separate room, and Shallow Vernal and the others spend that time with him, it’ll both let him recharge and fulfill your desires. The breaks can be split up too, so even multiple people could join.> ......How’s that?』","[......You are an exceptionally wonderful God, and I now permit you to visit Trinia regularly from now on.]","『 ! ? 』","Electrone's proposal was, in a way, the optimal solution. Indeed, since Kaito still had many more presents to receive, it made sense to schedule a break at some point.","On top of that, allowing him to rest in a separate room where Shallow Vernal or Lilia could spend time with him was ideal. For Kaito, having a trusted lover by his side would help him relax more easily, and for Shallow Vernal, the chance to spend a meaningful amount of time alone with Kaito was a delicious opportunity.","Even for the somewhat timid Lilia, being alone with Kaito in a private setting, without drawing the attention of others, would be reassuring.","Because it also offered clear benefits to Kaito, there was no reason for Kuromueina or Alice to oppose it. It was truly a spot-on suggestion. Shallow Vernal nodded in clear satisfaction, making it all but certain that the proposal had been approved.","As for Electrone, who had made such a precise suggestion, she wore her most astonished expression of the day, completely taken aback by the unexpected and extraordinary reward that had suddenly been granted to her.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [My trembling won't stop from the confirmed flirting, but at the same time...... is this really okay? Aren't you guys awakening the berserk gorilla?]"]},{"number":2268,"title":"Chapter 2268: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 12","paragraphs":["Now then, even though I’ve finished receiving presents from my lovers, there are still plenty of other party guests left, so the gift-receiving is far from over.","Technically, once the hidden talent contest is over, I’ll be moving on to the \"Infinite Gift Receiving Arc\" using parallel worlds, but I need to make sure I keep accepting presents in the meantime......","<QUAKER GRANDIEREUS>","Oh, next is Grandiereus-san...... unn? Wait, Grandiereus-san...... doesn't seem to be here? I mean, even though this hall is pretty huge, it’d still be hard for someone like Grandiereus-san to fit in here, and there's no way I could miss them if they were actually present.","Maybe it’s one of those times where I have to go to them———- was what I was thinking when Ein-san showed up, bringing along...... a small-statured, sincere-looking shota.","[Yaa~ Kaito~ Congrats~!]","[......Eh? Errr, are you...... Grandiereus-san, by any chance?]","[That’s right~]","With a soft, floaty smile, Grandiereus-san looked to be about 130cm tall, probably shorter than Kuro or Alice, with fluffy, natural semi-curly light brown semi-short bobbed hair, an adorable boy...... or girl? Hard to tell. Either way, they appeared in the form of a child.","[E- Errr, what’s with that appearance?]","[Ahh~ Isn't this the first time~ I’ve shown this to you, Kaiito~? This is~ a special clone body~ that Magnawell-sama~ asked Shaltear-sama~ to make for me~]","[Ohh, so it’s the same type of clone body Magnawell-san uses. But still, that’s a very youthful look...... it’s hard to believe you’re the same person as the huge dragon I’ve seen before.]","Though their tone is still a little slow, it’s not nearly as drawn out as when he's in dragon form, so it's easier to understand. That super slow way of speaking might be due to the physical characteristics of their dragon body or vocal cords or something.","[Ahh~ When the clone was being made~ they asked me what kind of appearance I wanted~ and I said I wanted a small body~ so this is the result~]","[Unn? You wanted a small body?]","[Unn~ Normally I’m big, right~? I wanted to experience what it’s like being small~ The world looks fresh and it’s fun~ Other than that, I didn’t make any requests~ I’m~ the youngest of the Four Great Demon Dragons~, so maybe that’s why I ended up with a youthful look~?]","[I see.]","So Grandiereus-san is the youngest of the Four Great Demon Dragons...... though from my perspective, he's still probably ridiculously older than me. Still, I can see how their tone and appearance match up well.","[Anyway~ for your birthday present~ I wasn’t really sure what to give you~ so I brought a gemstone that forms on the back of my...... of my Hellground Dragon form~ Apparently it trades for a high price among Demons~]","[Thank you very much. The subdued color is really beautiful.]","What Grandiereus-san handed me was a beautiful gemstone that looked like amber. It probably was something valuable, but since I don’t know much about gems, I’ll have to ask someone later.","[......By the way, Grandiereus-san, I hope you don’t mind me asking, but...... what is your gender?]","[My gender~? Hmm~ It’s both~ and neither~]","[Unn?]","[There aren’t many Hellground Dragons~ so we have both male and female traits~ So~ you could say we’re both~ and we adjust our roles based on our mate~? But I’m~ way too big~ so I can’t reproduce with others of my kind~ As for this clone body~ well~]","The explanation that, due to their low population, Hellground Dragons possess both male and female traits in order to reproduce made perfect sense when I heard it. But when Grandiereus-san tried to explain the gender of the clone body...... they tilted their head in confusion.","[......For humans~ where do you look to figure out someone's gender~?]","[E- Errr, that's kind of a difficult thing for me to explain, or rather......]","[Really~? Then~ you should check it yourself, Kaito~]","[N- No, that's even more problematic......]","[Hmmm~? Then I guess~ I don’t really know the gender of this clone body~ I’ll ask Magnawell-sama about it later~]","[R- Right. That would be for the best......]","Whether they were a boy or a girl, it was difficult in many ways to determine the gender of someone with such a youthful and androgynously beautiful appearance. Grandiereus-san tilted their head curiously, but seemed to accept it for now.","Thinking about it, they’re originally a dragon, and due to their size, even using magic to take on human form was apparently difficult, so it’s only natural that there would be many things they don’t fully understand.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai: [Come to think of it, we didn’t really have a \"trap\" character huh...... Chris was more of a beauty in male attire, so she's a bit different......]"]},{"number":2269,"title":"Chapter 2269: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 13","paragraphs":["I thought I had already updated it, completely forgot, and frantically wrote it at the last minute. Just barely made it in time.","As the hidden talent show and gift presentations alternated back and forth, the host Alice made an announcement.","\"Now then, there are only two more entries left in the hidden talent show, but before that, let me briefly inform you about our schedule after the show. Once the hidden talent show ends, there will be a 30-minute break. Private rooms have been prepared for everyone, and you'll be moved there automatically when the time comes, so there's no need to walk. Once the break ends, you'll be returned to the place you were before the break.\"","\"Yeah, quite a bit of time has passed, so a break sounds good.\"","\"Yes, we're expecting the event to continue for a while longer, so we've scheduled two breaks in total.\"","It was an announcement about the break. Honestly, that was quite welcome. I had been feeling a bit tired myself. Well, technically, all I'd done was sit around while Ein-san brought me food, receive presents, and watch some performances...... but still, I was seated in a pretty conspicuous spot in the venue, so there was a bit of mental fatigue involved.","Compared to the beginning, I've gotten used to it, but the idea of relaxing and refreshing myself in a private room is definitely appealing.","Especially since after this, I'll be entering a streak of continuous gift-receiving, so having a break at this timing is a real lifesaver.","Anyway, for now, I'll go ahead and spin the lottery wheel to receive my next gift.","<ALEXANDRA>","The next person I drew was Alexandra-san...... or rather, Aria-san. In a setting like this, she was participating not as Aria, but in her professional role as the head maid of Archlesia Empire's royal castle, so she was in work mode.","[Miyama-sama, happy birthday.]","[Thank you, Alexandra-san.]","She was dressed impeccably, not in a maid uniform but a formal gown, yet still in work mode. I returned her words of congratulations with gratitude.","Somehow, even though I've spent more time talking to her as Aria-san, that impression is stronger in my mind, so when she's in this professional mode, it feels like she's almost a different person.","[I've taken the liberty of preparing a gift. Here it is.]","[What a beautiful tin.... Is this tea?]","[It may be an underwhelming gift for someone like Miyama-sama, the owner of Nifty, but it's a flavor I personally enjoy very much.]","[I see, I look forwa.......unn?]","What she handed me was a tin that looked elegant and expensive, surely it contained some premium tea leaves. But as I looked at it more closely.......I noticed some writing on the bottom of the can.","Peering at the small letters..... I saw it said: \"Warning: This is not tea. Contents are cocoa.\"",".....So it's cocoa in a tea-like tin!? It wasn't handwritten or anything, the text looked engraved into the can itself, so it was probably originally sold that way.","Cocoa disguised as high-end tea....... Come to think of it, I recall Aria-san once mentioning she preferred cocoa over tea.","With that thought in mind, I looked over at Aria-san. She brought a finger to her lips in a quiet \"shh\" gesture, and then I heard her voice.","\"I've manipulated the sound so no one else can hear this. Once again, happy birthday, Kaito-sama. I've prepared my favorite cocoa for you. The packaging might seem like a joke gift, but I promise the taste is excellent, please try it.\"","Using her ability to control sound, she spoke so only I could hear her. Then, with a playful wink, she turned and walked away.","That mischievous little gesture felt much more like Aria-san than Alexandra-san, and somehow, it left me feeling a little warm inside."]},{"number":2270,"title":"Chapter 2270: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 14","paragraphs":["The cycle of watching the hidden talent show, judging it, and receiving a gift by lottery continued, and now, the hidden talent show has reached its final group.","\"Well then, we've reached the final entry in the hidden talent show! Closing out the event is...... none other than the Underworld King herself, Kuro-san!\"","\"Eh? Kurorin? Isn't this event unfavorable for Kurorin? I mean, nothing would be surprising coming from her...... Wait, isn't she supposed to be a judge?\"","\"Indeed. So for the final act, I’ll be taking Kuro-san’s place as a judge.\"","To everyone's surprise, the final performer was Kuro-san. And just as Fate-san said, she was in quite the disadvantage. After all, no matter how impressive the act was, at Kuro’s level people would just assume it's something she could naturally do. With surprise being the key scoring criterion, this puts her at a clear disadvantage.","\"And so, the final performer is me. Just like Fate-chan and Shalltear said, I know I'm at a disadvantage when it comes to the surprise factor...... but since we’re here, I thought I’d show you a hidden talent I’ve never revealed to anyone before.\"","\"So, what are you going to do, Kuro-san?\"","\"I’m going to bake a regular castella in 5 minutes! Actually, I’m really good at it~~\"","\"Whoa! And here we have Kaito-san preemptively throwing down a 5-point card!\"","\"Wait a sec...... Kaito-kun?\"","The Baby Castella Demon just said she was going to bake normal castella instead. That alone is already abnormal, so I threw down the 5-point card early.","[Well, that just sounded like something you'd say when there might be something wrong with your health or something......]","\"That bad!? Just saying I’m going to make a regular castella is enough to make people worry about my health!?\"","Choosing to make a normal castella instead of her usual baby castella, an area she treats with obsessive madness, is already an abnormal situation. And to make it worse, she seems confident in baking normal castella. That’s abnormal situation number two.","\"Well, I understand how Kaito-san feels. Even I can count on one hand the number of times I’ve seen Kuro-san eat regular castella......\"","\"There’s a sad story behind that, you know. It all began when I discovered the true potential of baby castellas......\"","\"Okay, we’re starting. Time limit: 5 minutes.\"","\"Wait, what!?\"","As Kuro-san started going into what would definitely be a long tangent about the potential of baby castellas, Alice made a perfect play by cutting her off and starting the timer. Kuro-san looked a bit dissatisfied but began making her castella.","To get it done in 5 minutes, she appeared to be accelerating time at key steps, so there were parts I couldn’t follow with my eyes...... but her technique looked very polished.","Before long, the castella was finished. Kuro sliced it up and placed portions in front of the judges, including me. Since she clearly wanted us to eat it, I took a bite...... and wow. This castella is insanely good. Honestly, I’d believe it if someone told me Ein-san made it.","Alice, who was serving as the Demon Realm’s representative judge in place of Kuro-san, also took a bite. After nodding once, she spoke.","\"......This tastes like something I or Ein-san would make when we're going all-out...... It’s definitely better than your usual baby castella.\"","\"That’s exactly why I don’t want to do this regularly!\"","Ah, I see now...... Kuro really is obsessed with baby castellas to an extreme degree. She’s chasing its infinite potential on a whole other level, but for some reason, when it comes to making it herself, she ends up being better at making regular castellas than baby castellas.","That’s probably why Kuro didn’t want to show it off too much and had been keeping it a secret until now.","\"Alright, now for the scoring. Kaito-san gives 5 points...... oh, Canalis-san, Lilia-san, and Chronois-san give 4 points...... I and Kaito-san both gave 5...... okay, I’ll give the first comment...... How about you just make castellas from now on instead of those dark matters of yours?\"","\"Well, castellas at this level is rare, sure, but you see, baby castellas have infinite potential......\"","\"Alright, now from the 4-point group...... Canalis-san, your comments, please.\"","\"Let’s see...... According to the reading from my God-Eye, I believe Kuromeina-san may be subconsciously holding herself back when it comes to baby castellas, out of fear that she’s chasing its potential too obsessively. I think if that mental block weren’t there, she could probably make baby castellas just as well. Tahaa~~ but man, pursuing infinite potential really is an endless theme huh? Honestly, even from what I know, there are countless seasonings and ingredients that don’t exist in this world yet would probably go great with baby castellas......\"","\"Tell me more about that!\"","\"Ah, yes yes, it’ll take a while, so let’s save it for later, when you're talking about that privately. Okay then, let’s all give a round of applause for Kuro-san~~\"","Kuro immediately latched onto Canalis-san’s words with great intensity, but Alice cut off the discussion before it could get out of hand.","There are already strange finger foods out there, and if she starts incorporating ingredients from other worlds...... well, the future’s looking kinda terrifying......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Well, I mean, just bringing some financiers was enough to make Kaito worry about her health, that’s how much of a baby castella maniac she is......]"]},{"number":2271,"title":"Chapter 2271: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 15","paragraphs":["The hidden talent show came to an end with all entries complete, and it was time for the results announcement. This time, the prize was straightforward, money, so as Alice had planned, things wrapped up peacefully. When I first heard that the organizer was Makina-san, I had some worries, but in the end, it turned out to be quite an enjoyable event.","\"Now then, let’s move on to the results of the hidden talent show. As I mentioned beforehand, prize money will be awarded to the top five participants. First off, and I’m sure everyone’s already figured it out, first place goes to...... the only contestant to receive a perfect score: Olivia-san. Congratulations!\"","\"Yeah, Olirin’s performance at the very start had an incredible impact. Usually in contests like this, going first can put you at a disadvantage since you become the benchmark for everyone else, but she overwhelmed everyone with a perfect score right from the start.\"","In the end, Olivia-san was the only one to get a perfect score, so she naturally took first place. I mean, it couldn't be helped, when it came to surprise and impact, Olivia-san was in a league of her own.","\"Let’s now hear a few words from Olivia-san......\"","\"Thank you very much.\"","\"......Now, how about a few words for Kaito-san?\"","\"It was an honor and a great joy to be given the opportunity to present my hidden talent before the esteemed Miyama Kaito-sama. My foremost goal was to bring enjoyment to Miyama Kaito-sama; the results were secondary. Still, I am deeply honored to receive such a result. This art is one I have never shown in public before, but if it is Miyama Kaito-sama's wish, I would gladly perform it for you anytime. Please don’t hesitate to ask. Once again, thank you very much for today.\"","\"......She really doesn’t waver, huh?\"","When Alice asked for a comment, Olivia-san simply gave a brief thank-you with a small bow, but the moment she was asked to speak to me directly, her eyes sparkled as she gave that passionate response. Like Alice said, she was incredibly straightforward, but honestly, I found it kind of cute.","\"Next, in second place...... with 24 points, is the Imperial Knight Commander of Archlesia Empire, Bard-san. Congratulations!\"","\"He had this stiff, uptight image, but he actually showed a pretty quirky side, it was a lot of fun.\"","And so second place went to Bard-san...... To be honest, I hadn’t spoken with him much before, though I had exchanged a few words when visiting Chris-san. He always came across as a serious, by-the-book knight.","So to see him pull off a rather comedic street performance came as a total surprise. He even mentioned that at one point in his life, he’d been torn between becoming a knight or a street performer. It was fun to watch, and the contrast between his usual demeanor and the performance was striking.","His comment as the second-place winner was also properly composed. Even having seen the act with my own eyes, I found myself doubting it had really been him, that’s how surprising it was.","\"Now for third place...... It’s a tie between two acts: the duo of Akane-san and Kaori-san, and Kuro-san, each with 22 points.\"","\"Come to think of it, no one got 23 points huh~~?\"","Just like Fate-san said, there weren’t any 23-point scores. So third place was shared by the pair of Akane-san and Kaori-san, who performed a water magic show, and Kuro-san, who took the unusual approach of making regular castellas.","\"Well~~ I’m just glad we made it into the top ranks. Kaori was the main star, and I just got splashed with water, but hey, it got results, so getting wet was worth it.\"","\"T- Thank you very mush......\"","Akane-san, as usual, showed no signs of nerves and gave her comment with ease. On the other hand, Kaori-san was clearly stiff and even fumbled her words a little.","\"H- Hmmm, well, I’m happy with the result and all but...... there’s just something off about how me making regular castellas is being treated like some kind of freak event......\"","Kuro wore a slightly conflicted expression, but personally, I think she was the top when it came to surprise factor, so in that sense, it was a well-deserved ranking.","In fact, Kuro’s score came from myself and Alice, who are very familiar with her extreme obsession with baby castella, both giving her full marks, while Chronois-san, Lilia-san, and Canalis-san, who hadn’t witnessed as much of that firsthand, each gave her four points.","\"And next is fourth place.\"","\"Ah, so even if it’s a tie, we don’t skip ranks huh.\"","\"Well, since it’s just prize money, there’s no point in skipping ranks. It’s better to spread it out to more people, which also encourages participation next time. So, fourth place goes to the duo of Aoi-san and Hina-san, who scored 21 points.\"","\"They did that track and field thing, right? So there really is stuff like that in the other world. Since the races are only for humans, I guess things are quite different from here.\"","Fourth place went to Aoi-chan and Hina-chan, who were both on the track and field team, showcasing several events. Of course, they didn’t do anything like long-distance running, which takes a lot of time, they performed events like the high jump.","Since I knew both of them were in the track team, it wasn’t that surprising to me, but for the other judges, track and field itself was a rare event that scored high points.","Well, considering the big differences in height, muscle strength, and species in this world, competing in events like track and field would be difficult, so it made sense that it was something unusual.","Finally, in fifth place was the comedy duo of Dr. Vier and Funf-san, who performed manzai. With prizes handed out to the top five, the hidden talent show came to a close.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Yeah, almost all readers probably had forgotten about him, right? Archlesia Empire's Knight Commander Bard, I mean.]"]},{"number":2272,"title":"Chapter 2272: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 16","paragraphs":["The hidden talent show came to an end, and just as Alice had announced, it was now time for a break. It would last 30 minutes, so I definitely wanted to take the time to refresh myself mentally.","\"Well then, as mentioned earlier, we’ll now take a 30-minute break. Everyone, please stay where you are. In 5 minutes, you’ll be transferred to individual rooms. If you’d prefer to share a room with someone, please picture that person in your mind. If both parties match, you’ll be transferred to the same room. So, if you want to take the break together with someone, make sure to discuss it during these 5 minutes.\"","Ah, I see. For example, someone like Lilia-san would probably prefer to share a room with Luna-san or Sieg-san, and couples like Shigenobu-san and Hannah-san would likely want to be together.","So, if you talk it over and then picture the person in your mind, the room assignments will reflect that...... Hmmm, I think I’m fine on my own for now. I’ll just take a relaxing break.","With that in mind, I waited the 5 minutes, and then the scenery blurred, and I was transferred to what looked like a spacious, high-end hotel room. It seemed like a nice place, but well, as that thought crossed my mind, glancing around...... I froze when my gaze landed on one spot.","[......Arehh? Errr...... why are you here, Shiro-san?]","Standing there as if it were the most natural thing in the world was Shiro-san. I could’ve sworn I imagined myself taking the break alone, which means I shouldn’t have ended up in the same room as Shiro-san...... So that must mean she’s the one who pictured me instead.","[A significant unfairness occurred, so I’m here to correct it.]","[......Unfairness?]","I tilted my head, not quite grasping what she meant, and Shiro-san nodded lightly before explaining.","[Yes. When giving you a present, the other lovers each did something special. Since that trend started partway through, I, who gave you a present first, didn’t get to do anything special. This is very unfair.]","[......A- Ah, I see......]","Now I understood what she meant. It’s true, I’m not sure when it started, but from a certain point, it became a thing for the lovers to do something a little special when giving their gifts. Well, Kuro and Sieg-san didn’t really do anything out of the ordinary, so it wasn’t a hard rule, but I could understand why Shiro-san would be dissatisfied, especially given her past behavior.","......In Kuro’s case, maybe not during the gift-giving, but she did kiss me on the cheek when I won the game tournament. That might be the kind of thing that left Shiro-san feeling left out.","[......Errr, so in other words, your request is?]","[During this 30-minute break, I want to spend time with you doing couple-like things while also making sure you get to properly relax.]","[So basically, you want to spend the 30-minute break together in my room?]","[Yes.]","......If you ask me whether there’s a problem with that, there really isn’t. Naturally, I have no issue spending time with Shiro-san, my lover.","The only thing that concerns me is the idea of doing \"couple-like things\" while also resting. What exactly does that entail? At the very least, judging from what she said, I can tell she doesn’t mean anything indecent. She genuinely wants me to relax, mentally and physically. So, what would be a good way to do both?","[I don’t mind resting with you at all. In fact, I’m happy about it but...... what do you mean by doing couple-like things while resting? Do you have anything in mind, Shiro-san?]","[Please don’t worry. I’ve thought it through carefully. I have a plan that lets you relax while also doing something couple-like with me.]","Shiro-san nodded confidently, then sat at the edge of a large sofa in the room and patted her thigh.","[And so, come here.]","[Ahh, you’re offering me a lap pillow.]","[Yes. That way, you can lie down and rest, and it’s also a perfect couple-like event.]","Indeed, this really might be the best way to both let me rest and fulfill Shiro-san’s wish to be affectionate.","Fortunately, we were alone in this break room, and I didn’t feel particularly embarrassed about the situation, so it was easy to just go along with it and let myself relax.","[Well then, since you’re offering, I’ll take you up on that.]","[Yes.]","Accepting Shiro-san’s offer, I moved over to the sofa, took off my shoes, and laid down, resting my head on her lap. Her thighs were soft and radiated a gentle warmth that was incredibly comforting. When I looked up, I could see Shiro-san smiling slightly, the corners of her lips gently raised. It was an ideal situation, comfortable, peaceful, and the perfect place to relax.","[You’re welcome to take a nap, you know?]","[That’s a tempting offer. Honestly, it feels so good I might just fall asleep anyway.]","[I can extend the time however long we want, so there’s no need for you to worry.]","[I see...... Well then, maybe just a little......]","Even if this break was supposed to be 30 minutes, with Shiro-san’s abilities, adjusting time would be simple. She could easily stretch the break if needed.","With Shiro-san's reassurance, and the comfort of her lap pillow, a deep sleepiness quickly began to wash over me.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [That’s terrifying...... Saying she can extend the time as much as she wants, those are some truly terrifying words...... And Kaito seems pretty relaxed about getting all lovey-dovey just because they’re alone together...... This is a dangerous turn of events.]"]},{"number":2273,"title":"Chapter 2273: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 17","paragraphs":["Consciousness rises up from within a haze of slumber. As I slowly open my eyes, the first thing that greets me is Shiro-san’s face, peering into mine with what seems to be a faintly amused expression, and behind her, a vast stretch of clear blue sky...... Wait. A clear blue sky? That’s not right, is it?","[Good morning, Kaito-san. Well, it might be wrong to say \"good morning\" in this case......]","[Eh? What are you talking about? I mean......]","Tilting her head in curiosity, Shiro-san prompts me to sit up and look around...... The glaring sun shines down, an endless ocean view spreads before me, and a beautiful white sandy beach surrounds us...... Hold on. My brain isn’t processing this reality just yet.","N- No, I’m sure I fell asleep on the couch in the break room...... So why the heck am I waking up on a beach!? In a swimsuit, at that!? I mean, sure, if it’s Shiro-san, she could easily move me and change my clothes while I’m asleep, but still...... this is beyond unexpected, even for a birthday party surprise! Who comes to the beach in the middle of one!?","[S- Shiro-san, where...... is this place?]","[The beach.]","[Well, yes, I can see that...... but which beach?]","[Who knows?]","[Ehhhh...... W- Why are you tilting your head...... Shiro-san, you moved me while I was sleeping, didn’t you?]","Her response of \"Who knows?\" to the question of which beach we were at is far too unnatural...... Or at least, it would be if it were anyone but Shiro-san. She’s not the kind to lie. Which means...... if she answers my \"Where are we?\" with that, then she must really not know.","[No, Kaito-san hasn’t been moved anywhere.]","[U- Uh? What do you mean by that......?]","[To be precise, Kaito-san is still sleeping. This is a dream. I just set the location to the seaside for now, so there’s no actual geographic answer to give. If I had to say, we’re simply inside your dream.]","[......Eh? Ohhh, that’s what you meant earlier...... when you said saying \"good morning\" might be wrong......]","[Yes. Factually speaking, you're still asleep, so saying \"good morning\" is incorrect, but I couldn’t think of a more fitting greeting, so I went with it.]","Now it all makes sense. That odd turn of phrase from earlier, the strange setting, it all checks out.","In other words, this is the same scenario where Makina-san sometimes builds a virtual space inside a dream and pulls someone's consciousness into it.","[Exactly. It wasn’t for any particular reason, but since the Earth God had done it before, I thought this was a rare chance to try it out myself since Kaito-san happened to be sleeping nearby.]","[I see, that does make sense...... But why the beach?]","[Excellent question. Having a conversation inside a dream was a spur-of-the-moment idea, but once I thought about it more, I concluded this was actually the optimal choice. In this state, I can let Kaito-san’s body rest while we get to flirt as much as we want, so I made it the beach.]","......Shiro-san really went for something outrageous this time...... Though, I guess while physical fatigue might be eased, it feels like mental exhaustion wouldn’t be helped much by this...... But then again, I wasn’t planning to sleep originally, I was just taking a break. If I think of it like that...... maybe it’s fine?","[It is fine. Kaito-san gets to relax and recharge while feeling refreshed, happy. And I get to flirt with Kaito-san to my heart’s content, also happy. A win-win system with zero downsides.]","[I- I see?]","Well, it’s definitely refreshing, no doubt about that. As I think this, I glance toward Shiro-san. She’s also wearing a swimsuit, a different one from when we went to the beach before.","A simple dark gray bikini paired with a loose, see-through top. As always, her visual power is just absurdly high, no matter what she wears, she’s an unparalleled beauty.","[Shiro-san, your swimsuit has a different vibe from the last one. That pareo looked great on you before, but the current combination of the sheer top and bikini is really mature and elegant, very lovely.]","[Thank you very much. You can compliment me more if you’d like. It makes me happy.]","As she gave her usual response, behind Shiro-san, the sand rose up and formed the word DOYA, spelled out in sand letters.","[......Still, it’s hard to believe this is a dream. The sensations feel so real. Can we actually swim in the ocean here too?]","[No problem at all. Since we’re here, let’s enjoy the beach together.]","[Yeah, sounds good. This seems like it’ll be a great change of pace. Let’s go......]","Well, I’m already here on the beach anyway. No point fighting it now. I decided to enjoy the situation for what it was, and headed toward the ocean with Shiro-san.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [They started a beach date in the middle of a birthday party break!? Does this God have no sense of restraint!?]"]},{"number":2274,"title":"Chapter 2274: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 18","paragraphs":["They unexpectedly ended up at the beach inside a dream, but soaking in the sea felt incredibly pleasant.","[......Speaking of which, this doesn’t feel like a dream at all. It really feels like I’m just casually swimming in the ocean.]","[We're calling it a dream due to a lack of a better term, but in reality, your consciousness has been pulled in and your senses are active, so it’s not much different from reality. If I had to put it in terms that are easier for you to grasp, it’s like playing a full-dive type VR game.]","[I see......]","That explanation definitely made sense, it might even be the most fitting description. The real body is lying down and unconscious, while the virtual world includes all five senses. Calling it a full-dive VR experience seems perfectly appropriate.","Well, if we’re being pedantic, this space was created by Shiro-san’s power, so whether it qualifies as \"virtual reality\" is debatable...... but as she said, calling it a dream works just fine.","[Ah, but being in the water like this feels really good. And after wearing formal clothes at the party, there's this nice sense of freedom.]","[I’m glad it helped refresh your mood. By the way, Kaito-san, isn’t it about time for a lovey-dovey event to happen?]","[......An event? W- What exactly do you mean by that?]","As far as mood-changing experiences go, this was top-tier. Even though the atmosphere was loose and lively, the transition from a party to a beach setting brought with it a strong sense of freedom, and it was honestly quite fun.","While thinking that, Shiro-san suddenly...... well, not suddenly, since she’s been aiming for this from the start, asked for a romantic event to occur between lovers.","Of course, when you think of typical couple activities at the beach, many things come to mind. But based on past experiences, if Shiro-san brings it up like this, she probably has something specific in mind.","[Of course, there are all kinds of things lovers can do at the beach. However, unfortunately, time isn’t unlimited. Even if I can stretch it, if it goes on too long, people like Kuro or Earth God will probably complain, so we can’t afford to take too long.]","[Ah, yeah. People like Makina-san probably aren’t affected by time manipulation either, so they might complain if this drags on too long.]","Makina-san in particular, much like Shiro at the beginning, might complain that \"it’s unfair\" and demand alone time with me.","If that happens, it really might become impossible to return to the party anytime soon. So even if time can be extended, there’s clearly a limit.","Kuro, Makina-san...... maybe Alice or Canalis-san too? In any case, those people would probably say \"This is going too far\", so we’ll have to wrap things up before then. On the flip side, as long as it’s within a certain limit and serves as my break, there’s a good chance they’ll let it slide, and Shiro-san may be trying to push it right to that edge.","[Anyway, we don’t have time for beating around the bush. Let’s save those things for the next time we go swimming together. And so, Kaito-san, I want a hug. A slow, thorough one, if you please.]","[What a refreshingly straightforward request...... it's almost admirable in its honesty.]","Apparently, she had no intention of being roundabout about it. She plainly stated what she wanted, a hug, and asked for it directly.","Of course, there was no reason to refuse. I stepped forward and embraced Shiro-san face-to-face, the water reaching up to my chest.","How should I say this...... Hugging someone while standing in the ocean feels distinctly different from normal. It’s hard to describe, but the parts of us that are touching feel hot, almost flushed, while the rest is cooled by seawater. It creates this mix of warmth and chill at the same time.","And we were both in swimsuits. Even though Shiro-san was wearing a sheer cover-up, the sensation of holding her felt almost like bare skin. The excitement I'm feeling was intense...... Or rather, she just felt incredibly good to hold, and I might be hugging her a little tighter than intended...... I hope that’s okay?","[There’s absolutely no problem. You can hug me with all your strength if you’d like.]","[Well, given my actual strength, even hugging you at full power probably wouldn’t be a problem. But if I really did that, all my focus would go over there...... How should I put it, right now, I want to fully savor the feeling of being so close to you like this...... It’s hard to describe.]","[I see. Then please enjoy it to the fullest. I’ll be enjoying this hug with you as well, so take your time and be thorough.]","Honestly, just hugging her like this feels incredible. She’s soft, yet firm, an addictive kind of comfort that I could easily get used to.","[Kaito-san, this is a very nice situation.]","[Huh? Ah, yeah...... it really is.]","[Wouldn’t this be the moment for you to silence my lips?]","[A- Ahaha...... I see, you’re right...... That might be exactly what this is.]","Embracing each other face-to-face in the ocean like this, bodies pressed together———– yeah, this is about as romantic a situation as it gets. With us holding each other so closely, what Shiro-san was implying wasn’t strange at all.","Hearing her request, I leaned forward toward Shiro-san’s face so close it was practically right in front of mine, and pressed my lips gently to hers.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Guaaaah!? They’re flirting, they’re seriously all over each other! H- Haven’t they had enough already?! I mean, come on! Don’t you think so, Makina? Isn’t their time already up? Shouldn’t we be stepping in by now?]","Makina : [Nope, still totally within the safe zone. It hasn’t even been the full original 30 minutes yet. And I’m okay with extending it up to an hour if needed.]","Serious-senpai : [Why are you weirdly generous only in times like this?!]"]},{"number":2275,"title":"Chapter 2275: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 19","paragraphs":["Shiro-san had also directly expressed her desires, and since this place was somewhat like a dream, it made it easier for me to act on my own as well.","After hugging and kissing Shiro-san for a while, we returned to the beach. It didn’t really feel like we’d gone swimming, but we did get into the water and it was refreshing, so there was no problem.","[By the way, Shiro-san, do you have any requests for what we should do next?]","[I have a few. For example......]","When Shiro-san said that, a vivid image suddenly floated into my mind. It was like a scene from a romance movie, with a couple playing tag on the beach.","Then, when the man caught up with the woman, the two of them lost their balance and fell onto the sand, ending up in a position where the man was on top of the woman.","They gazed into each other's eyes in silence, slowly bringing their faces closer...... That was the gist of the scene.","[I want to try something like that.]","[Well, yeah, that is a pretty dramatic development, but isn’t it a bit too difficult to pull off intentionally?]","If it happened naturally, sure, but trying to deliberately act that scene out would definitely feel awkward. We'd have to time the fall and everything just right, so the difficulty level was definitely high.","I mean, trying to intentionally recreate what would normally be considered a spontaneous moment, one you'd normally call an \"accident\", is inherently hard.","[I see...... then how about this one?]","As I said that, Shiro-san nodded as if she understood, and another image began flowing into my mind. A couple was sitting side by side on a beach bathed in the light of the setting sun, gazing out at the horizon. The man casually put his arm around the woman’s shoulder, and though she looked surprised for a moment, she soon leaned against him.","Then the two looked into each other's eyes, and kissed under the sunset glow...... that kind of scene.","[......A lot of these feel like they’re straight out of a romance movie. Shiro-san, have you been watching those?]","[I have. While learning about romantic interactions between lovers, I watched several romance movies. I also researched common romantic events between couples from other worlds...... but those are a bit harder to adapt.]","[Eh? So, do people in other worlds do things that are just unimaginable from our perspective?]","[I think it depends on the world, but there were many love behaviors based on biological traits. For example, there are beings that exchange bio-electrical signals, which equate to them kissing. Others had things like physically fusing their bodies.]","[That’s...... well, I guess for people in those worlds, that’s normal, but yeah, I’d definitely feel some resistance to trying stuff like that.]","Even if I knew that such customs existed in other worlds, and even if Shiro-san could probably replicate them if she wanted to...... the idea of literally fusing bodies just wouldn’t feel like romantic flirting to me, it’d just be a bizarre experience.","[It really is difficult. On the flip side, Kaito-san, is there anything you’d like to try with me, like a scene from a romance movie?]","[Hm? Me huh......? Hmmm, let’s see.]","When asked like that, I realized it was surprisingly tough to answer. If I assumed we were a couple at the beach, what kind of couple-like things would I want to try......? When I think of couple activities, I think of looking for seashells together, or doing fireworks...... stuff like that. They sound like leisure activities, but I’m not sure if they count as flirting.","In that case, something like the scene Shiro-san sent me, the one with hugging at sunset and kissing, might feel more like what I’m looking for.","Still, it’s surprisingly hard to come up with something we can actually do right away...... I could try princess-carrying her, but there’s no real reason to do that at the beach. Plus, with her in a swimsuit, the visual stimulation might be a bit too much, I’d probably end up overly conscious and awkward.","I mean, she is gorgeous and well-proportioned, and with all that exposed skin from the swimsuit, carrying her like that would definitely lead to a lot of contact...... Not that I’d hate that, honestly, but still, there’s a certain level of embarrassment......","[Hou......]","[Ah......]","I heard Shiro-san’s intrigued voice and immediately realized I’d made a blunder. Or rather...... Was this all part of her plan from the start?","She might’ve deliberately steered the conversation to make me think about how I’d want to flirt with her, just to get me to act on it......","[So, in other words, Kaito-san, you want to lift me up in your arms while I’m in a swimsuit and hold me close. That’s what you’re saying, right?]","[Wait, was that what we were talking about!?]","[It can’t be helped. Kaito-san is my lover, so of course you have the right to do that. And if that’s your wish, I can’t just ignore it. You’re free to enjoy it to your heart’s content.]","[This almost sounds like it's already a done deal...... Wait, Shiro-san!? Your sheer cover-up is gone!?]","[I removed it because you seemed to prefer more skin contact. I was responding to your desires.]","No, I thought I was also talking about how that much skin contact would be a bit embarrassing but...... No, it's no good. It seems like we're totally gonna go through with this!?","<Afterword>","Makina : [Hmmm, this is almost starting to feel like they're having foreplay or something...... But if break time turns into that kind of break, I’ll have to step in. For now though, it’s still within the safe zone.]","? ? ? : [Arehh? Where’s Serious-senpai?]","Makina : [Over there, turned into a sugar beach.]","? ? ? : [......And what in the heck is a sugar beach......]"]},{"number":2276,"title":"Chapter 2276: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 20","paragraphs":["Let's start with the fundamental issue. Back when I had just arrived in the other world, it might have been a different story, but now, I've gained various life experiences, even ended up with multiple lovers, so I've built up a fair bit of experience in romance.","I've done the whole princess carry thing plenty of times, even carried Shiro-san like that before during an amusement park ride.","But still, even with all that experience, I need to mentally prepare myself this time. First of all, carrying someone in a swimsuit means my hands and arms will almost certainly be touching bare skin.","You might be wondering why I'd need to brace myself just for that much skin contact..... but Shiro-san is, how do I put it.... on another level. She's simply incredible.","It makes you wonder if Gods are just made perfect down to every last detail, her skin's texture, the elasticity, it's all extraordinary. Honestly, even just holding her hand feels strangely pleasant, like your hand is being gently cradled in comfort. That's how amazing she is.","[W-Well then, I'll carry you now.]","[Yes. Please take care of me.]","And so, feeling more than a little nervous, I lift Shiro-san in her swimsuit in a princess carry..... and yeah, I expected this, but her skin is silky smooth, her body so soft my fingers sink into it slightly, and yet there's warmth and springiness there too.","Not just my hands, her back touches my arm, her body presses against my chest..... and it's this indescribable, almost melting sense of comfort from where we're in contact.","And in the princess carry position, her face naturally ends up close to mine. Honestly, she's got divine-level beauty. Looking at her up close again, \"peerless beauty\" feels like the perfect phrase.","[Go on, keep the praise coming. It makes me happy. And saying it aloud makes me even happier.]","[No, really, you're insanely beautiful, and being able to hold someone like you like this...... I feel genuinely lucky.]","[So in other words...... you're saying \"Shiro-san is mine\", right?]","[Eh? Wait, how did we get to that......?]","[In other words, you want to hold me tighter, like you're declaring I belong to you, correct?]","...Ah, yes. Then, is it okay if I hold you a little tighter?]","[I don't mind. I give you permission.]","I thought the conversation had taken a strange turn, but then I realized she was indirectly asking to be held more closely against my chest, so I got her permission first, then tightened my grip as requested.","With Shiro-san's ample chest pressed against mine and shifted shape, I couldn't help but glance in that direction.","Princess carry..... even in a nearly supine position, her form didn't collapse one bit. And when touched, it was unbelievably soft and yet somehow resilient. Honestly, her whole body feels like it's on cheat mode......","[You don't have to hold back, you know? Kaito-san, you have the right to touch and enjoy me as your heart desires.]","[...- No, that's kind of dangerous. I mean, I might not be able to stop myself......","Honestly, I was incredibly shaken, it felt like being smacked in the head with a hammer. In the position I was in, if I just moved my hand slightly, I really could touch her chest.","It was an incredibly tempting offer, enough to make me swallow my spit reflexively, but no. I really shouldn't. I might actually lose all self-control.","If we were on a private overnight date or something, maybe it'd be different, but right now it's just a break in the middle of my birthday party....... have to rally all my rationality and push away the lust clouding my thoughts.","[... Hohou.] [...Shiro-san?]","As I fought a desperate inner battle with my desires, Shiro-san watched with a fascinated expression and nodded as if she'd come to some sort of realization.","[I see, I see. So if it were a private overnight date for just the two of us, it'd be a different story..... That's a very helpful opinion.]","[Ah, w- well, I only meant that as a hypothetical case......A- Anyway, for now...]","[Yes, for now, I suppose I'll restrain myself with just this.]","[This--- hnnh!?]","After murmuring suggestively, Shiro-san suddenly leaned in without warning and kissed me..... not just a quick peck. Her tongue slipped smoothly into my mouth, lightly brushing against my teeth before she pulled away.","It all happened so naturally and fluidly that even though it was brief, a shivering, euphoric sensation surged through me, reaching deep into my brain. As I stood there stunned, Shiro-san, unusually for her, smiled in a clearly amused and delighted way.",".....'ll be looking forward to the next opportunity we're having this.]","At that moment, I really felt like I might never be able to win against Shiro-san when it came to romance."]},{"number":2277,"title":"Chapter 2277: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 21","paragraphs":["var adx_id_10142 = document.getElementById('bg-ssp-10142');","Sitting side by side on the beach, watching the slowly setting sun sink into the horizon, I put my arm around Shiro-san’s shoulder. After finishing the princess carry, we decided to go through with the situation Shiro-san had requested, just to fulfill her wish.","Of course, the \"chasing followed by an accidental stumble\" scenario was a bit too difficult to pull off, so we settled for the simpler one: sitting together and watching the sunset.","We had only changed the scenery to sunset mode, so not much actual time had passed, but still, the crimson sky and sea carried a certain wistful atmosphere.","It had all been a spur-of-the-moment thing, but looking back on today...... no, wait, hold on, that’s not it.","Come to think of it, we weren’t here for a beach date in the first place, it was just a break during the birthday party, right!?","[Shiro-san, isn't it about time we wrap this up?]","[Yes, you're right. If we extend this any further, people will start complaining. It’s best to end it around here. Now then, Kaito-san, please close your eyes. I’ll return your consciousness.]","[Ah, right...... Oh, but before that......]","Just as we were about to end it, I remembered there was still one thing left to do. No, I figured it was better to properly fulfill her wish all the way through. I shifted slightly, cupped Shiro-san’s cheek with my hand...... and gently pressed my lips to hers in a soft kiss.","[......Errr, I believe the situation was supposed to go as far as a kiss, so I thought I should follow it through to the end.]","[Kaito-san...... perfect score. You're really good at making me happy.]","Saying that, Shiro-san gave me a joyful smile. She was probably glad that I took the initiative. That dazzling, beautiful smile of hers, full of happiness, just watching it makes me feel happy too.","As my consciousness slowly rose from the haze of sleep, the first thing I saw was Shiro-san’s face watching over me, and the ceiling of the break room that I had last seen before dozing off.","[Good morning...... would that be the right thing to say, wouldn't it?]","[That’s a tricky one. Technically, Kaito-san, your body was sleeping, so I don’t think it’s wrong. I also took care of your fatigue and such, how are you feeling?]","[Oh, wow. My body feels really light. It’s like all the fatigue is completely gone.]","Apparently, Shiro-san had removed my fatigue. It was only supposed to be a short nap, but my body felt as refreshed as if I’d slept soundly through the entire night.","I’d be receiving a mountain of presents from now on, so it was definitely a blessing to be in top physical and mental shape.","As I sat up and checked the time, I saw that there were about 7 minutes left until the break ended.","[Shiro-san, thank you. Thanks to you, I feel completely refreshed.]","[I’m glad to hear that. I was very happy as well, and I’m satisfied.]","When the break first started, Shiro-san had seemed a bit displeased, saying it was unfair. But now, she looked completely content. Her expression hadn’t changed dramatically, but the corners of her mouth were slightly more lifted than usual, enough that anyone, not just me, could tell she was in a good mood.","[Come to think of it, after this, I’m going to receive presents through the parallel world system, right?]","[Yes. Once Kaito-san finishes receiving the gifts, we’ll move on to the final event.]","[Oh, right. Alice mentioned that each realm, Divine Realm, Demon Realm, Otherworld, and Human Realm, planned a performance or event. What’s left is the one prepared by the Human Realm’s representative, right...... what are they doing?]","[It seems to be a kind of tasting competition, comparing the rare delicacies from the three realms and the otherworld to decide on a grand prize winner.]","[Hehh, that sounds like fun.]","In short, it’s something like a regional specialty food grand prix. I’m not sure exactly how it’ll be formatted, but it sounds interesting either way.","There are probably a lot of ingredients I’ve never even heard of before, and I might get to taste things I’ve never encountered in my life, that thought alone made me excited.","Well, I have to get through receiving a ton of presents first though......","[Oh, right, I heard something about there being another break later. Is Shiro-san joining me for that one too?]","[No, next time it will be Lilia’s turn.]","[Lilia-san?]","[Yes. Like me, Lilia hasn’t really had a chance to enjoy some quality couple time...... but let’s see. I had a truly happy time, so I’ll make sure Lilia’s time is meaningful too. I shall \"lend her my strength\".]","......Huh? That’s odd. Shiro-san is clearly saying that out of pure goodwill, and her helping out shouldn’t lead to anything weird...... So why is it that I can already picture Lilia-san clutching her stomach in pain......?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Don’t do anything unnecessary! Stay! Stay!!! ......That aside, what’s Makina doing?]","Makina : [Hm? I’m making wasanbon.]","Serious-senpai : [......Why is it that every time I transform, your first instinct is to try and eat me!?]","(T/N: wasanbon)"]},{"number":2278,"title":"Chapter 2278: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 22","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I accidentally set the reservation update date to the 16th and didn’t notice...... Let’s just say yesterday was a break from updates......","When I returned to the venue after the break, Alice at the commentary desk made an announcement.","\"Now then, there’s a bit of time before the next side event, so please feel free to enjoy some casual conversation until then.\"","That line...... I had heard about it in advance from Shiro-san. Apparently, starting from this line that Alice says after the break, I’ll begin using the parallel world mechanic to receive my birthday presents.","Specifically, I’ll spin the garapon, and after receiving a present from the person it lands on, I’ll transition into a parallel world. From my perspective, it’ll feel like I’m looping back to this exact scene where Alice speaks.","Then, I’ll spin the garapon again, and the person I received a gift from in the previous world will already be considered as \"picked\", and I’ll repeat the process of receiving another present. So, Alice’s line now marks the starting point of this whole thing.","Well, for this very first time, it doesn’t really matter, so I might as well get on with the first draw without overthinking it.","<EPSILON>","The one I drew was Epsilon-san, and after a short wait, she arrived.","[Miyama Kaito-sama, happy birthday. It’s modest, but I’ve prepared a gift for you.]","[Thank you very much.]","I accepted the wrapped gift from Epsilon-san. The wrapping was neat, so I couldn’t tell what was inside, but judging by the size and weight, it felt like it might be a tea bowl or something similar.","At that moment, Epsilon-san offered another package...... this one wrapped in a traditional arabesque pattern.","[This is from someone who wasn’t able to attend the party today. I was asked to deliver it on their behalf.]","[Eh Thank you for going to the trouble...... but who is it from?]","Pretty much all of my acquaintances had been invited to this party. Even those I’d only briefly introduced myself to. Basically, if I’ve seen their face or know their name, they’re here.","So if someone wasn’t able to come, it means I likely have no connection to them...... but they still went out of their way to prepare a gift?","[She’s my housemate...... hmm, if I had to describe our relationship, I’d say she’s like a wife to me. We’re not legally married, but that’s what she means to me.]","That really caught me off guard, Epsilon-san has a wife? Well, a same-sex relationship is a personal matter, and I don’t see any issue with it.","Though, since they’re not officially married...... I suppose it’s more like de facto marriage? Either way, the way Epsilon-san spoke about her made it very clear how much she cares for her.","[My housemate’s name is Tendouin Miyabi...... actually, she used to be a Hero Actor, a former Otherworlder.]","[Eh!? R- Really......? Wait, former?]","A former Hero Actor, an Otherworlder who migrated here? That’s unexpected...... But hold on. When I asked Alice about past Hero Actors, I don’t remember her mentioning this Miyabi-san......","[Yes, Miyabi was a Hero Actor from quite a long time ago. Ordinarily, she would’ve already reached the end of her lifespan as a human, but I reincarnated her as a Demon, so she now lives on as a Demon.]","[I- I see...... I never imagined someone like that existed. That’s surprising.]","[Perhaps I should have introduced her sooner, but there were...... certain circumstances. You see, because I was inexperienced at the time I performed the Racial Reincarnation, Miyabi lost all memory of her life before the Hero Summoning. As a result, she had virtually no awareness of having once been an otherworlder.]","After hearing Epsilon-san's explanation, I understood why Alice hadn’t mentioned Miyabi-san back when we talked about the immigrants. I see, If she lost her memories of her life on Earth and had even become a Demon, things would naturally be more complicated. And since she herself didn’t feel like an Otherworlder, it made sense that Alice left her out back then.","[However, very recently, she was granted a bit of mercy by Earth God-sama, and Miyabi has regained her memories of her life in the other world. It seems that led her to take an interest in other Otherworlders, including yourself, Miyama Kaito-sama. And so, she decided to take this opportunity to send something...... It’s pickled vegetables she made herself. I may be biased, but personally, I think they taste wonderful.]","[Thank you very much. Please pass my thanks along to Miyabi-san as well.]","[Certainly. If the opportunity arises, I would love to introduce her to you.]","[Yes, I’d look forward to that.]","Epsilon-san smiled gently, and once again I could clearly feel her deep affection for Miyabi-san. Honestly, it even felt stronger than what she shows toward Ozma-san...... though that’s probably not my place to judge. Still, while unexpected, I was genuinely happy to learn about another person from my homeworld.","If I ever get the chance to meet her in the future, I’ll be sure to properly thank her then.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Miyabi and Epsilon are always flirting...... Honestly, I’m not too fond of dealing with them.]"]},{"number":2279,"title":"Chapter 2279: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 23","paragraphs":["After receiving a gift from Epsilon-san and watching her return to the party...... As I wondered what would happen next......","\"Now then, there’s a bit of time before the next side event, so please feel free to enjoy some casual conversation until then.\"","Oh? Ohh...... Does that mean I've already shifted into the parallel world? I didn't notice it at all. In that case, I guess it's fine to spin the garapon now.","Alright, who's next......?","<OLIVIA>","So it's Olivia-san next huh. She showed off some amazing skills during the talent show...... Oh! Maybe she’s prepared something like a sculpture?","But then again, Olivia's sculpting...... she only learned it out of necessity. It’s not really a hobby of hers, and I doubt she’d show off her work unless it was a special occasion like this, so maybe it wouldn't be a sculpture after all......","Before long, Olivia-san arrived and assumed a prayerful posture in front of me.","[Due to time constraints, this is in simplified form, but allow me to offer a prayer...... Miyama Kaito-sama, once again, I bid you a happy birthday. It is a tremendous honor to be present on the day commemorating the greatness of Miyama Kaito-sama.]","[A- Ahaha...... thank you.]","By now, I’ve spoken with Olivia-san quite a bit, so I can tell this isn’t flattery or exaggeration, it’s genuinely how she feels.","[This may be modest, but I have brought a gift in celebration. It was quite difficult for someone as inexperienced as myself to choose something worthy of offering to Miyama Kaito-sama...... However, according to reference texts, something useful in everyday life is considered preferable, so I’ve prepared this.]","[Thank you...... a long, thin box? Is it a pen?]","What Olivia-san handed me was a long, elegant-looking box. I thought it might be a pen for a moment...... but it seemed a little too big for that.","[These are chopsticks. I learned from Mizuhara Kaori’s shop and other sources that Miyama Kaito-sama enjoys Otherworld cuisine...... Japanese food, so I prepared these with the hope you might use them when dining.]","[Ah, I see, chopsticks huh. Speaking of which, I didn’t have any good ones, so I really appreciate this. I’ll make good use of them.]","Since I often eat with Lilia-san and the others, I usually end up eating Western-style meals...... but if I ask someone like Illness-san or the head chef, they can make Japanese dishes too, and if I ask Alice, she can even make ramen. So, having my own chopsticks would actually come in handy quite a bit.","Also, in this world’s magic system, there’s a spell that can clean and disinfect small items like utensils. It’s apparently not very efficient for dishwashing due to the magic cost, but for something like cleaning a pair of chopsticks, it’s perfectly usable. It’s also a spell simple enough that even I can use it, so I imagine I’ll have plenty of chances to use these personal chopsticks.","When I thanked her, Olivia's expression lit up with joy. I could feel her happiness at seeing her chosen gift being appreciated, it was just heartwarming.","[Come to think of it, Olivia-san, when is your birthday?]","[Mine? I hesitate to call it a \"birthday\", but if we define it as the day I was created by Shallow Verna, then it would be the 28th day of Second Water Month, the day the Treaty of Friendship was officially established.]","[I see...... Wait, wasn’t the Treaty of Friendship officially signed during Heaven Month?]","[That is indeed the case. The day the treaty was globally established is indeed the 15th day of Heaven Month, that’s a fact. The representatives of the Three Realms gathered before the public and signed the treaty on that day, so there's no mistake. However, the actual internal agreement was reached during the Second Water Month. Discussions on how the original treaty text would be managed took place after that, and I was created on the 28th day of that same month to take on that role.]","Now that she mentions it, indeed, the Treaty of Friendship was officially signed on the 15th of Heaven Month in the present-day Friendship City Hikari. But naturally, there would have been a lot of preliminary discussion and coordination beforehand.","And now that I think about it...... the 28th day of Second Water Month is actually pretty close to my own birthday. It’s coming up soon, actually.","[Then in return for today, I’d love to celebrate your birthday when it comes.]","[.....Celebrate?]","[Why do you look like I just said a word you’ve never heard before?]","[Ah, n- no, I sincerely apologize. I must have misheard Miyama Kaito-sama’s words. Shamefully, it sounded to me as though you said you would celebrate my birthday......]","[I did say that though...... I mean, you’ve been gaining all kinds of experiences, right? I think it’d be nice to celebrate your birthday too. Well, honestly, I just kind of want to try doing it, so if you’re okay with it, I’d really like to.]","[Eh? Ah, um, if it is your will, Miyama Kaito-sama, then......]","Olivia-san looked at me with a puzzled expression, like her mind was filled with question marks. It didn’t seem like she fully grasped the conversation...... or rather, the idea that I’d want to celebrate her birthday didn’t register with her at all.","Given that she’s more like a God, I guess she’s never really had any connection to birthday celebrations in the first place.","Well, this was a totally spur-of-the-moment idea, but I’ve decided, I’ll definitely celebrate Olivia-san’s birthday when it comes.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Is that really okay? Olivia might faint from sheer embarrassment, you know?]","? ? ? : [In a way, you could say this is Kaito-san’s signature move, a body blow straight to the stomach.]"]},{"number":2280,"title":"Chapter 2280: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 24","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","Since I’ll be on a business trip tomorrow and won’t be able to write, there will be no update. The next update will be on 6/20.","When I receive a present, I'm transported to a parallel world, and it's through Alice's words that this is communicated. So, I spin the garapon again and receive another gift.","Basically, it's a cycle of repetition, and when I'm feeling tired, I can take a short break before spinning the garapon again. Well, since I’m only receiving presents, there’s not much of a sense of fatigue, and it feels like all physical exhaustion is completely gone once I move to the parallel world, so it’s probably just mental fatigue, which doesn’t seem like much of an issue.","<ROSEMARY>","Next is Rosemary-san...... Come to think of it, I feel like I haven’t seen much of her around. Well, she did appear briefly here and there, but since she didn’t really take part in any of the festivities, her presence was barely noticeable.","Well, Rosemary-san is extremely shy, so in gatherings like these, it can’t be helped...... though come to think of it, many of the people here from the Demon Realm belong to one of the Six Kings' factions, meaning she should actually know quite a few of them.","If that’s the case, then maybe Rosemary-san might actually be okay in this setting......","[......H- H- H- Happy birthday, Kaito-kun.]","......She does not seem okay. Her expression is stiff, her voice barely audible, and the atmosphere detectable through Sympathy Magic makes her feel like a completely terrified chihuahua. She's in full-blown social anxiety mode.","[Thank you very much. Errr, are you okay?]","[T- Too many strangers...... it’s scary......]","[Ah, I see. Since a lot of people here are from the Six Kings’ factions, I figured you’d recognize quite a few faces......]","[F- Fufu, Kaito-kun...... even among the World King’s faction, I can’t really say I can talk normally with everyone, so there’s no way I could interact with people from other factions......]","[R- Right, that makes sense......]","Rosemary-san’s shyness runs deep. Even within the World King’s faction, she can talk just fine with her subordinates and those she interacts with regularly, but she apparently still freezes up around people she doesn't see often.","It also seems to take her a long time to warm up to new people. For example, she still hasn’t been able to have a proper conversation with Lanza-san, who serves under Camellia-san.","Well, Lanza-san is quite energetic and assertive...... more like a Blossom-san type, so it’s understandable that it’d take Rosemary-san longer to get used to her.","[Ah, errr, I should give you your present now. Choosing a gift is pretty difficult, isn’t it? I’m best at preparing valuable or nice things like art, but I’m not entirely sure about Kaito-kun’s preferences. I also wanted to give you something related to roses since this is a special occasion, so I really struggled with it.]","[I guess it's common for Flower Spirits to give gifts related to their own flower huh?]","Now that I think about it, the gifts I’ve gotten from Rosemary-san before were often rose-themed, like rose cookies or a rose herbarium.","[U- Unn. Tree Spirits might be a bit different, but for Flower Spirits like me, we often give gifts related to our flowers to the \"people we like\". Since it’s your birthday, Kaito-kun, I wanted to prepare something special for you...... so here.]","[Ah, thank you very much. It’s pretty big...... is it a painting?]","Maybe because she’s so extremely shy, Rosemary-san tends to get very close to people once she opens up to them. Even now, she casually and naturally said something like \"I often give rose-related gifts to the people I like\", without even realizing the impact, which caught me off guard.","No, even though I understand that it’s probably meant in a close-friend kind of way, when someone as stunningly beautiful as Rosemary-san says something like that, it’s hard not to get flustered.","Setting that aside, the gift Rosemary-san gave me was a large rectangular box, big enough to require both hands to hold. It wasn’t very thick, so I figured it was probably a framed picture and asked her about it, to which Rosemary-san nodded in confirmation.","[Unn...... I made a painting using rose petals of various colors. I thought it would suit the atmosphere of your home, Kaito-kun, so if you have any space to spare, I’d be really happy if you could display it......]","[Making a painting out of petals...... that sounds like a lot of work. Thank you so much. Since you went through the trouble, I’ll definitely display it in my room.]","[Unn, that makes me really happy.]","In my room, I already have the painting from Alice that I received during my previous birthday party, but since the room is quite spacious, there’s still plenty of room left. I’d been thinking it might be nice to hang up another piece of artwork anyway.","I already know Rosemary-san has great taste, so I’m certain this rose painting must be elegant and beautiful as well.","Since the size is quite large, unwrapping it here and now would be a bit of a hassle, so I’ll look forward to opening it once I get home.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......That’s it. The reason Rosemary gets kind of sweet is because once she lets her guard down around someone, she becomes a bit defenseless, or rather, she tends to show her favor pretty openly......]"]},{"number":2281,"title":"Chapter 2281: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 25","paragraphs":["Receiving a gift from Rosemary-san, I once again move to a new parallel world to receive a present from the next person. And the next one is......","[What a splendid day it is. The stars twinkle, the celebration is radiant, and the feast honors the birth of my sworn friend. The many gathered stars offer their blessings as well. And of course, I too, as one of those shining stars, offer my blessing to my comrade.]","[Thank you very much, Amel-san.]","Yes, it’s Amel-san. There’s something charming about how she delivers her congratulations in that confident, high-spirited tone, so much so that even without Sympathy Magic, I can feel how excited she is.","This is just a guess, but since Amel-san is a human, she probably knows what birthdays are...... or rather, I think she kind of admired the idea of celebrating a friend’s birthday.","When she invited me to her home, she was extremely excited. In moments like that, you can almost see a puppy wagging its tail furiously behind her.","[You were really close in the game tournament, Amel-san. You made it to the finals several times......]","[Ah, of course, I’d be lying if I said I feel no regret. But more than winning or losing, I was delighted to compete with so many stars I don’t usually get the chance to engage with. Since there’s only so much room at the seat of glory, there will inevitably be winners and losers. And as long as everyone strives toward glory, it’s only natural that outcome exists. What’s important is what brilliance you gain in that process.]","[Yeah, games like that are fun with a big group.]","[Unn! It was so much fun playing together with everyone...... mmh!? I mean, I also gained a lot from the experience.]","Amel-san made it to the finals several times during the tournament, though she didn’t end up winning. Still, she didn’t seem particularly bothered by that. Rather, she seemed genuinely happy about being able to have fun with everyone.","It’s true that back at the previous ship party, she stood out a little until I introduced her to Iris-san. Amel-san tends to stand out in social settings, partly because of how uniquely and elaborately she speaks, which makes it harder for others to interact with her casually.","I’m used to it by now, so I can easily follow her long-winded speeches, but I can see how someone not used to her might find it hard to understand what she’s saying.","[Now then, I would like to deepen my bond with my sworn friend even further, but this place was not prepared solely for the two of us. It wouldn’t be wise to waste time idly. Therefore, let me quickly hand over this treasured artifact to you.]","She called the present a \"treasured artifact\"...... Though with Amel-san, there's really no fixed pattern to how she speaks. She just says whatever sounds cool to her at the moment, so the terminology often changes from one time to the next.","[My sworn friend, do you remember? Back when fate first brought us together, I told you that for us Wingeds, giving something made from one’s own feathers carries special meaning.........]","[Yes, I remember. It’s kind of a symbol of affection, right?]","I recall when we first met during the tea party after Harmonic Symphony’s finale, Amel-san gave me an accessory made from black feathers.","[Yeah, exactly. However, as I was reading ancient texts passed down by the Wingeds, I discovered the existence of an even higher-tier accessory. This accessory was something only those of high status among the Wingeds were allowed to create. The method of making it is extremely complex, and it's said to have vanished from their history. But as something to gift to another, it's considered the highest-tier item...... or so it’s said.]","[A secret, long-lost accessory that fell into obscurity because the process was too complicated to preserve?]","[Indeed. I thought there could be nothing more fitting to give to my sworn friend, so I experimented and finally managed to make one. This is that treasured artifact.]","[Thank you very much. It’s beautiful. And the shape is really intricate...... Are these two feathers entwined together? I’m amazed you managed to shape it so precisely.]","[That intricacy is exactly why this treasure was lost to time. But remember when the King of Empty Illusions once bestowed us a mystical item for crafting accessories? That technique, one that alters the softness of materials, came to mind. I applied it, and as a result, I was able to recreate this lost artifact.]","The accessory I received from Amel-san was crafted with two feathers intricately woven together. Under normal conditions, trying to mold feathers into such a shape would cause them to snap, and even if you cut and glued them, you’d never get this structure.","Apparently, using the accessory-making kit we got from Alice, with its technique that softens even metal like clay, as a reference, she was able to complete the secret accessory.","[From what I read, this accessory is said to symbolize an eternal bond. In ancient times, Winged chieftains would present it only to someone truly special. I believe it's a fitting symbol of the bond we share.]","[......An eternal bond? Given only to someone truly special...... Errr, Amel-san...... does that mean this is something you'd give to a fiancé?]","[Huehh? F- F- F- Fiancé!? Eh? Then that special means...... t- that's not it, I- I- I- I didn't have such intentions, I- I just meant it’s a special item symbolizing my deep bond with my sworn friend, s- s- so it's not, you know, not like a proposal or anything...... R- Right! The bond between us is just that deep! So...... T- This won't do! I’ve taken too much time! I- I’ll be going now...... Ah, my sworn friend, once again, happy birthday! Bye!!!]","When I asked, suspecting that it might be an accessory similar to an engagement ring, it became clear that the idea hadn’t even occurred to Amel-san. She grew visibly flustered, her face turning bright red, and she quickly fled in embarrassment. She’d reacted the same way before when Tre-san said something odd to her, so it seems topics like this really aren’t her strong suit.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [From a rose chihuahua to a jet-black pomeranian (bird)...... it’s been a string of dog-types huh.]"]},{"number":2282,"title":"Chapter 2282: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 26","paragraphs":["I've gotten used to the rhythm of receiving presents, the whole process of finishing the gift exchange, shifting over to a parallel world, and spinning the prize wheel.","In a way, I appreciate that everything moves at my pace. Once I finish receiving the present, the transition to the parallel world happens, so there's no issue if I take a moment to chat leisurely with the person who gave me the gift.","If anything, I might even have more free time now than when I had to fit gift-receiving into short breaks between events or performances.","<BLOSSOM>","Ah, next up is Blossom-san. I wonder what she’s brought? I get the feeling it might be something Japanese......","[MASTER! HAPPY BIRTHDAY!!!]","Whoa, that was loud...... Just as you'd expect from a Spirit known for their singing. Her voice was bright, powerful, and carried incredibly well, so much so that a good number of people turned to look this way.","[......Thank you. But, Blossom-san, could you keep your voice down just a little?]","[Oh, my apologies.]","She listens when asked, and there’s no doubt she’s kind and good-natured. The only issue is how she tends to get carried away once she gets an idea in her head, like slamming the gas pedal to the floor. When her switch flips, she charges ahead so recklessly it makes you wonder if a wild boar might turn more gracefully.","But as long as she doesn't get too hyped up, like just now, she’s totally willing to listen and adjust, so it’s not really a problem......","[Today is the birthday of my respected Master, so I’ve taken the liberty of preparing a gift. As a samurai, I thought perhaps a katana would be appropriate...... but I also understand you’re not fond of such violent things, so I’ve prepared something else.]","What she handed me was...... if I’m not mistaken, a box with a hanabishi pattern? It was a traditional Japanese design often used for celebratory occasions.","......Wait, did she actually bring something accurate for once, instead of getting Japanese culture all wrong? Or maybe I’ve just been focusing too much on the weird parts of her knowledge so far. Her outfit might not be full-on samurai style, but it does give off a kind of \"kendo girl\" vibe. She probably has some accurate understanding too.","[Thank you. The box is beautiful.]","[You noticed? I often purchase textiles from a particular artisan, and when I mentioned it was for a celebration, she recommended this box. It’s apparently a design commonly used for wedding gifts and such, and she said it’s a formal pattern well-suited for presents.]","[Sounds like someone really knowledgeable. Do you get all your Otherworld cultural info from her too?]","[Oh, no, actually I only recently learned how knowledgeable she was. She's been making Otherworld-style fabrics for a while now, and I’ve liked her work enough to keep buying from her. But up until now, I hadn’t realized she was particularly versed in the Otherworld. Last time I visited, though, she told me all sorts of things in great detail...... a hidden master of Otherworldly knowledge...... Wait! Could it be...... she's a ninja!?]","[No, she's not.]","Just knowing the hanabishi pattern is one thing, but being able to explain that it’s a formal motif suitable for gifts...... whoever made this box must really know Japanese culture. Plus, it’s lacquered. Yeah, this definitely came from someone seriously familiar with the real thing.","[Is she an Otherworlder or something?]","[Hmmm, I believe her race is probably Ice Oni. She has two distinctive sharp blue horns...... but the rest of her features don’t quite match her race, so she might just be a similar-looking but different species.] ȒäNΟʙΕS̈","[I see......]","[By the way, the contents of the box are clothes. It’s something I learned about from that trading partner. The garment is apparently called a jinbei, and while I was the one who made it, she assured me it turned out well.]","[Hehh, a jinbei huh? They’re loose-fitting and easy to wear, would be great as loungewear too. Thank you very much, I’ll treasure it.]","[Yes. I’m glad to hear that, Master! It makes me happy to know you’re pleased!]","When I thanked her, Blossom-san beamed with a dazzling smile. It really showed what a good person she was. Her appearance was pure yamato nadeshiko, but her personality was more like a warm, cheerful extrovert.","Still, a textile maker with deep knowledge of Otherworld culture...... It’d be rude and take too long to bombard Blossom-san with questions now, so I’ll try to ask more about her some other time.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [And then, here's the sakura-colored golden retriever...... That makes three dog-like people in a row. That textile maker from the past, she's talking about Miyabi, right?]","? ? ? : [Exactly. Until recently, she had lost her memories of the Otherworld, so from Blossom-san’s perspective, she wasn’t particularly knowledgeable about it. She probably just saw her as someone who made fabrics with Otherworld-style patterns, nothing more.]"]},{"number":2283,"title":"Chapter 2283: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 27","paragraphs":["Feeling like I was smoothly receiving presents at a good pace, I gave the garapon another spin......","<RYUKORICYAN>","The next to appear was Cyan-san. It had been since their greeting at Harmonic Symphony. Had she come to celebrate......? That said, I hadn't seen her at the game tournament, so she probably hadn't participated in any of the side events.","After a short while, a cool-looking woman with reddish-brown wolf-like hair in a punk-ish outfit...... Cyan-san approached.","[Yo, Kaito. HBD.]","[Thanks. I'm glad you came, Cyan-san.]","[Yeah, we haven't seen each other since Harmonic Symphony huh? Sorry, even though you invited me over, I just couldn’t bring myself to come until now. But, well...... not sure how it turned out, but I just happened to talk to that guy earlier.]","[Oh, you spoke with Caraway? How did it go?]","[......Well, she's still as cheeky as ever. That’s a relief.]","As she said that with a wry smile, Cyan pulled out a thin stick-shaped item...... something a bit thicker than a toothpick, and put it in her mouth like a cigarette.","There was a faint scent of cinnamon, so it might’ve been a cinnamon stick or something like that. At the very least, it didn’t seem to be an actual cigarette.","[Cyan-san, is that a cinnamon stick or something?]","[Eh? Oh, sorry. It’s just a habit. Yeah, it’s something usually used in cooking, apparently, but I like the scent and sometimes just hold it in my mouth.]","[Hehh. Well, I do like ripple pies, so I quite like the scent of cinnamon myself.]","[It’s got a distinct aroma, but it’s nice, right......? Oh, right, I came to give you a gift. Among Demons, we don’t really have a tradition of celebrating birthdays, so I wasn’t sure what to give...... I just went with something safe, food. Dried meat, smoked stuff...... pretty much all meat. The bag itself has a State Preservation Magic, and once it’s opened, that’ll wear off.]","[Thank you very much.]","The bag Cyan-san handed over was quite large, and if it was all filled with meat, then it was probably a pretty significant amount. Maybe it was because she was a Wolf-like Beastman-type Demon, but it seemed likely she liked meat.","[Speaking of which, Cyan-san, you’re a Peerage Holder who doesn’t belong to any faction, right? I don’t know the details, but is that unusual?]","[Who knows? I think there are a fair number of folks like me, but yeah, the majority probably belong to some faction or another. I’ve been invited by the War King’s faction and the Dragon King’s faction before too...... but I’m just not good with that kind of thing......]","She gave another wry smile and scratched her head lightly. Cyan-san did give off a bit of a lone wolf vibe. Just like when they first met, even now she didn’t have any subordinates with her, and she always seemed to act alone. The word \"solitary\" seemed to fit her.","[I’m not good at dealing with things, I don’t want to carry more burdens than I have to. Yeah, I'm a Peerage Holder, so if I did join a faction, they’d probably treat me well enough. I’m not saying there’s anything wrong with running with a pack. With that kind of position, you can probably do a lot more too...... but those positions come with responsibilities. If someone decides to follow me of their own will and ends up in trouble, well, that’s on them. But if I were part of a faction, I’d have to take responsibility and carry the weight of those who depend on me...... and I’d rather avoid that kind of thing.]","[......I see.]","It felt like she wasn’t avoiding people because she's a loner, but rather someone who chose to be alone, because she disliked being tied down by things like obligations and entanglements.","But despite that, she still seemed to care about Caraway, and she had quickly stepped in to handle things when he fell from grace. As I thought about that...... Cyan-san must have picked up on my doubts, as she gave a wry smile.","[......Well, I’ve lived a pretty long life myself. As long as you're alive, it’s impossible to live without any ties, and it’s also impossible to live without carrying anything at all. I just try to keep it to a minimum...... Maybe that’s why I was so mad at that dumb cat for trying to shoulder everything all at once. Whatever. I’m not good at explaining my motives or reasons. I just live the way I want, without worrying about others or being responsible for them.]","[Even if you say that, I still think you’re a kind person, Cyan-san.]","[Haha, that’s probably just because you’re a good guy. There’s no reason to scowl or be annoyed in front of someone decent, right? So it just comes out naturally...... Anyway, sorry for rambling on. Once again, happy birthday...... I’ll come visit your place properly another time.]","[Okay. I’ll be looking forward to it.]","Waving her hand lightly as she left, Cyan-san gave the impression of someone with a bit of an anego vibe, kind, thoughtful, and always somehow managing to be considerate, even if she tried to act otherwise.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Dog (Rose) -> Dog (Bird) -> Dog (Cherry Blossom) -> Dog (Wolf)...... that makes four dogs in a row huh. If Anima were here, we could’ve added Dog (Bear) too, but well, I guess that’s the end of the dog streak. Doesn’t seem like there are any other dog-like ones around, right?]","? ? ? : [I mean, it’s not like they’re real dogs, but there is one Canidae in the party.]"]},{"number":2284,"title":"Chapter 2284: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 28","paragraphs":["While continuing to receive presents, I’d already made it through a decent number of rounds. Physical fatigue gets healed whenever I move between parallel worlds, so it’s only mental fatigue I have to deal with, but even that isn’t an issue at all.","I mean, receiving presents doesn’t really require stamina, and even though I’ve been talking a bit, it’s just fun conversation, not anything that tires me out. Honestly, I feel like I can go all the way to the end without taking a break.","<TRE>","Oh, next is Tre-san. I wonder what her present is? Probably something like a magic crystal? While I was thinking about that, Tre-san came over, led by Ein-san. She had a smug look on her face, she’s totally about to say something like \"It's finally the turn of this long-awaited me!\".","[Fuuu, kept you waiting, Kaito! At last, it’s finally the turn of this long-awaited Onee-chan!]","[That line was exactly what I expected.]","[W- What......!? Y- You read me!? Ngh...... you’ve gotten better, Kaito...... But don’t think you’ll get the better of me next time!]","That kind of perfect back-and-forth is honestly so much fun. It’s really nice how she always reacts just the way I hope.","[Well, anyway...... Kaito, happy birthday~~]","[Thank you very much.]","[By the way, what number are you on now?]","[Huh? You know about the whole using parallel worlds to receive presents?]","[Unn! Everyone was told ahead of time. They explained that Kaito would be receiving presents during this time, and afterward the parallel worlds would merge and our memories would carry over, so we wouldn’t get confused~~]","[Ahh, yeah, now that you mention it, if there’s going to be a merge at the end, people definitely need to know or it’d be super confusing.]","It looks like all the participants were informed beforehand about the use of parallel worlds for present deliveries.","Well, yeah, considering the number of people, receiving presents from everyone directly would take forever, and the method is already so supernatural that no one’s going to complain about it.","[Let’s see...... this is about the 32nd one, I think.]","[Oh wow, you’ve already gotten that many? Are you okay? Not tired?]","[Not at all. Physical fatigue gets healed, and mentally, it’s just chatting while I get presents, so I’m genuinely enjoying it.]","[Heehh, you’re pretty tough. I mean, we sent a bunch from our side too, but there’s a lot from others as well, right......? Like, unless I’m imagining things, there’s gotta be about 500 people?]","[Yeah, that sounds about right. Pretty much all of Kuro’s family and everyone from Lilia-san’s mansion came, and a bunch of people I greeted at the Harmonic Symphony tea party also showed up, so it probably adds up to that.]","It’s definitely not as many as a thousand. I’m pretty sure it’s limited to people I’ve at least exchanged a word with. Otherwise, we’d have every single God showing up here, and that’s clearly not happening...... That said, even a single word seems to qualify, and honestly, there are some people whose names I can’t even remember. Like, we may have exchanged greetings in passing, but I’m not sure I ever formally introduced myself to them.","[So you’re going to keep receiving presents from everyone? Isn’t that tough? I mean, just hypothetically, I understand this would never happen, but even if the handoff went super smoothly, at 500 people, if each took just one minute, that’s 8 hours. And if it averages 10 minutes with chatting, that’s like 80 hours!]","[Well, they’re all celebrating my birthday, so I’m actually happy to receive them directly. It’s not like I’m just doing the same thing over and over, and compared to something like walking through an unchanging space for a hundred years, this is nothing......]","[No, like, I don’t know how to respond when you compare it to literal mind-breaking torture...... Kaito, you’re one tough kid. Onee-chan’s seriously impressed.]","Well, I mean, I don’t know if it’s actually 500 people, but even if it is, it’s not a big deal. Sure, if I were spending an hour talking with each one...... I might get tired, but I’m just casually chatting while accepting presents, so there’s zero reason to feel exhausted.","[Oops, looks like we got a bit off track. Here you go, my long-awaited present!]","[Thank you very much. That’s quite a large box.]","[Fufufu, it’s a bookshelf for your desk! The center part slides out, you know. Pretty cool, right~~?]","I thought it might be something related to magical tools, but it turned out to be completely unrelated. Still, I had to admit, it was an impressively spot-on choice.","Now that I think about it, I had been wishing for a small bookshelf for my desk. I could store books in the magic box, but when it came to something like a book I was in the middle of reading, having to take out the magic box every time, dig through it, and pull it out...... it was just a hassle. Having it right on the desk was way better.","[I’m honestly surprised. You gave me something unexpectedly and perfectly useful.]","[Hmm? That line makes it sound like you were halfway expecting me to bring some kind of gag gift~~]","[......Well, I did consider the possibility, a little.]","[I was torn between this and a super realistic rainbow frog pen holder, you know.]","[I’m glad you went with this one. In any case, thank you again.]","[Don’t mention it~~ Oh, and hey, doesn’t your Otherworld culture say you’re supposed to return gifts triple in value? I’m loo...... wait, no, I really don’t need three desk bookshelves......]","[Ahaha, well, it’s not like you literally triple what you received...... but if you want something in return, I’ll need to know your birthday, Tre-san......]","[......When was it again?]","[Ehhh......]","[I mean, I’ve lived so long, you know? And we don’t really have the tradition of celebrating birthdays in the Demon Realm...... But since I do want a return gift, I guess I’ll figure one out!]","As Tre-san gave me a big thumbs-up, I couldn’t help but chuckle wryly, holding back the urge to question whether birthdays were really something you were supposed to come up with.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [It’s easy to forget, but come to think of it, Kaito...... he does have a ridiculously strong mental fortitude....... like, canonically strongest-level......]","? ? ? : [Well, I mean, if someone can walk through an unchanging landscape for a hundred years and then say something like \"that went by faster than I expected\", then yeah...... receiving presents from 500 people probably isn’t much of a mental burden for him.]"]},{"number":2285,"title":"Chapter 2285: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 29","paragraphs":["Receiving birthday presents has progressed quite a bit, I've already gotten gifts from over a hundred people. Even so, I still haven't reached even half of the people here. Well, there's no time limit or anything, so taking it slow shouldn't be a problem.","<CANALIS>","Oh, next is Canalis-san...... On behalf of the people giving the five EX gifts, Canalis-san had been the one giving them, so it feels like this is her sixth appearance, but I haven’t actually received a gift directly from her yet.","Knowing Canalis-san, I doubt it’ll be anything weird, but she’s the type who could probably prepare literally anything if she wanted to, so it’s hard to imagine what it'll be.","[Oh, it’s my turn now. Tahaa~~ Since I already got to give you so many presents with the EX ones, I really feel like I’ve lucked out! Now then, once again, happy birthday, Kaito-sama.]","[Thank you. Canalis-san, you were involved pretty deeply with organizing everything, not just with the EX gifts, and I’m really grateful for that.]","[Oh, no need to mention it. Despite how I look, I’m one of the hardcore loyalists to Kaito-sama, so it’s not a burden at all. Tahaa~~ I’ve been having a great time doing this. Though to be fair, the actual ringleader behind all this Shallow Vernal, I just helped out here and there.]","Her expression remained completely still, as always, but her cheerful tone conveyed how much fun she was having.","Canalis-san is an Omnipotent and Omniscient God, so Sympathy Magic doesn’t work on her, but she tends to express her emotions quite clearly in her voice, so it’s surprisingly easy to read her mood.","[Now then, for my present...... Since it’s a special occasion, I decided to unleash my God Power a little and whipped up something quite amazing. Tahaa~~ Sorry for being an unrestrained God! Oh, but rest assured, I explained everything in advance to Shallow Vernal, Makina-san, Kuromueina-san, and Alice-san, and got full approval.]","[You even got permission from Makina-san...... So does that mean this has something to do with the world I came from?]","Shiro-san is Trinia's God, and asking for approval from Kuro and Alice was probably to make sure the gift wasn’t overboard. But the fact that she also checked with Makina, who has ties to the Otherworld...... to Earth, made me think the item must somehow be related to my original world.","[Sharp as ever. Yes, the item I prepared for you is this.]","[......Eh? This is...... a tablet device?]","What Canalis-san pulled out was a flat board-shaped object...... no need to gloss it over, it was clearly a fairly large tablet.","[Yes. Well, no point beating around the bush, so I’ll go ahead and reveal the gimmick: this tablet...... lets you watch movies.]","[Eh? Movies, as in, movies from my world?]","[Exactly. The interface looks just like a normal subscription video site, so you can easily search for movies by title or genre. Tahaa~~ Sorry for shamelessly copying a major streaming service! Also, I figured if everything was completely free, Kaito-sama might feel a bit uncomfortable. So I used Shallow Vernal’s gift from your last birthday, the game console, as a reference, and set it up so you buy the movies using currency preloaded into the tablet. Thanks to mysterious God Power, the money gets properly paid to the right places. It’s a one-time purchase model, so you can rewatch anything you’ve bought as many times as you want, and even make custom playlists of your favorites.]","[Whoa, that’s amazing! That really gets me excited, there were quite a few movies I’ve been wanting to rewatch, so this makes me really happy.]","Honestly, this really does make me happy. In Trinia, visual magic tools have only just been developed recently, so there’s almost nothing in the way of film-like entertainment. When it comes to that kind of content, the world I came from is overwhelmingly superior.","I’ve often found myself wanting to watch movies again, and since it’s been such a long time, I’m genuinely excited to get back into it.","[Canalis-san, thank you so much.]","[Ah, that radiant smile directed at a hardcore loyalist like me is making my heart flutter———– this is dangerous! Is it okay if I just die from how cute that was? That said, I’m really glad you’re pleased. Tahaa~~ Let me know if you come across any good movies.]","[Definitely. Since I’ve got it now, let’s watch some together sometime.]","[Oh my, what a temptingly delightful invitation. When the time comes, I’ll be there fully prepared, with popcorn and drinks in hand, of course!]","Now that I think about it, watching movies with someone else sounds like fun too. It’s even possible to do something like a movie date, just like in a theater with a partner...... Hmmm, this really opens up a lot of possibilities. I can’t wait to start using it.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Umm...... I’d really appreciate it if you could, uh...... not expand his dating options any further......]"]},{"number":2286,"title":"Chapter 2286: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 30","paragraphs":["It’s only natural, but each present really shows the giver’s personality, which makes it kind of entertaining. Also, the efficiency of using parallel worlds to receive them is impressive, after about 30 hours, I think I’ve already received more than half.","Well, part of the reason it’s taking some time is that I’ve been chatting leisurely with the people who gave me the presents, but even so, the pace isn’t bad.","More importantly, the fact that physical fatigue resets with each transfer to a parallel world is a godsend. Even if each individual interaction barely tires me out, that adds up. It wouldn’t be surprising if my arms or shoulders started hurting, but I haven’t felt anything like that, which is a huge relief.","<MIKUMO AKANE>","And next is Akane-san. Kaori-san seemed super tense in the party atmosphere, but Akane-san looked pretty relaxed, even during the talent show, she seemed at ease.","[Yo, Kaito, congrats.]","[Thank you, Akane-san. Your performance at the talent show was amazing too.]","[Well, I was just standing there, really. But with so many VIPs gathered like that, it doesn’t hurt to get some face time in, right? Our trading firm isn’t really targeting the wealthy class or anything, so it’s not like currying favor with high-status people gives us some direct advantage, but you never know when a good opportunity might pop up. If I can promote myself for free, might as well.]","Akane-san really is shrewd. Whether by coincidence or intent, if there’s a chance to take advantage of a situation, she will. She definitely has the personality of a businesswoman, it’s no wonder she’s suited to being a guild president.","[By the way, Kaito, you’re hopping across parallel worlds to receive presents, right? That’s crazy sci-fi stuff...... You’re still living outside the bounds of common sense as always. So, how many have you gotten so far?]","[Hmm, I haven’t been counting precisely, but I think I’ve received them from over half the participants.]","[Oh? Then you’re past the halfway mark huh...... But still, that must be a lot. Isn’t it taking quite a bit of time?]","[Time resets with each world jump, so I don’t have an exact count, but I’d guess around 30 hours so far?]","[......Huh? Wait, are you serious? You’ve been receiving presents for 30 hours straight......? No, you must’ve taken breaks, right?]","[No, not really. I haven’t gotten tired or anything, so I haven’t taken any breaks......]","[.....................]","Akane-san, hearing my answer, rubbed her temple with her index finger like she was trying to stave off a headache and gave me an expression I couldn’t quite read.","[You’ve really been going nonstop for about 30 hours?]","[Yes. But physical fatigue gets reset when I transfer worlds, and I don’t get sleepy or hungry. I’m just chatting with acquaintances and receiving gifts, so there’s nothing mentally exhausting either. It hasn’t been a problem.]","[......You know, when I first met you, I thought this: \"Kaito is someone who’s constantly favored by fate or connections or something, and that’s how he built up such a crazy social network. But Kaito himself is just an ordinary guy who’s really lucky\"......]","[Well, that’s pretty much the truth......]","[No, it ain’t. After spending enough time with you, I’ve come to realize something...... you’re kind of a d*mn monster......]","[Eeeeh......]","Somehow, I just got labeled a monster out of nowhere with a look of exasperation, but that’s gotta be a huge misunderstanding.","[You know, I thought the same thing back at that boat party! You made the rounds to greet every single guest, but you didn’t look tired at all!]","[Well, I was just saying hi to people I knew, and I did take some breaks, so I barely felt any physical fatigue.]","[I’m talking about mentally, d*mn it! Why do you look like mental exhaustion just doesn’t apply to you!? That’s not normal!!! Most people would be totally drained from all that socializing! I’ve had to attend my fair share of parties as a guild leader, and just going around greeting people leaves me exhausted...... You really are...... Well, I guess without that kind of insane mental stamina, there’s no way you could’ve built up that kind of social network...... You’re just a walking bundle of things I wanna retort to, as always.]","She wasn’t mocking or insulting me, but it definitely didn’t feel like praise either. I gave her an awkward smile in response.","Now that I think about it, I vaguely remember Lilia-san saying parties tire her out too...... I guess I’d get tired too if I had to greet a bunch of strangers, but at the boat party, and even now, I’m mostly surrounded by people I know, so it just feels like I’m casually chatting with friends. I think that’s very different from a formal noble’s party or something.","[Well, whatever. If I start pointing out everything weird about you, there’s no end to it...... Anyway, about your present, I figured something consumable would be safest, so I brought a few kinds of sauces. You can never have too much sauce, after all.]","[Thank you...... That’s quite a few bottles. Are they all different kinds?]","[Of course they are. Different dishes call for different sauces...... Oh, and to make it easy for amateurs, I labeled each one with suggestions for what kind of food it goes well with.]","I swallowed the urge to say that I’d never used this many sauces in my life. It’s probably just that, for Akane-san, sauce is something she takes seriously, switching between several kinds is probably second nature to her.","I’ve already learned the hard way, thanks to Kuro’s baby castella obsession and Ein-san’s maid fixation, that butting into someone’s passion can end badly, so I just gave her another grateful smile and thanked her again.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Kaito's a bit of an airhead sometimes, so having people like Akane or Elise around to call him out on it is actually pretty valuable.]"]},{"number":2287,"title":"Chapter 2287: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 31","paragraphs":["The present-giving continued. Though Tre-san and Akane-san expressed concern, I could honestly say that I didn’t feel mentally tired at all.","Since I was simply enjoying some pleasant conversations while receiving presents, it felt like I could keep going without needing a break.","<TIAMAT>","......Hmm, maybe I should take a break after all. I let my guard down because I’d already dealt with the mentally exhausting folks, Shiro-san, Makina-san, and Pandora-san, but...... yeah, there's Medea-san and Phenex-san still left......","[Hello, Miyama Kaito-san. A fine day, isn’t it? Though this world is filled with sorrow, it is also a day that reminds us this world isn't filled with sorrow alone...... Happy birthday.]","[Thank you. You're in your human form today, Medea-san?]","Apparently, Medea-san isn't on any infiltration missions at the moment, so she herself said it was fine to call her by her real name even in a crowd like this. That’s why I just refer to her normally as Medea-san.","She and Phenex-san had performed together at a live concert before, where she appeared in her usual lamia form, but today, she had taken on a human shape.","[My original body is rather large, you see. There's a chance I might obstruct someone's view and inadvertently cause sadness. And more importantly, they say meeting someone's gaze is the first step to forming a closer connection. Moments like these give rise to wonderful encounters, and I wouldn’t want to miss the chance to make new friends......]","[I- I see...... errr, just, you know, keep it reasonable......]","On the surface, it sounded like a normal statement about wanting to meet new people at a party where there were many strangers. But in Medea-san’s case, with her peculiar preferences and the ecstatic look on her face, it came off like she was scheming something indecent.","Well, despite how she talks, I get the feeling that Medea-san probably won’t actually try to make new “friends” or anything. She may seem to act on madness, but she knows how to hit the brakes right at the edge. Still...... the look she had, like she was about to drool, was honestly a little concerning.","[Fufufu, don’t worry. I do understand that publicly displaying one’s fetishes in a place like this is essentially suicide. The feelings just overflow from within me, nothing more, I have no intention of acting on them.]","[Well, yeah, I figured...... I actually think you're someone who knows when and how to restrain yourself.]","[Indeed, you may rest assured...... That said, while it's a joyful thing, the world has been peaceful lately, so I haven’t had many chances to meet and part with new friends, which saddens me. Phenex does allow me to kill her from time to time, so that keeps my heart content though.]","[......You two sure are close.]","Yeah, as I thought, Medea-san is someone who can look at herself objectively. She understands her preferences are seen as deviant by society, which is why she laments the lack of opportunities to indulge in them while also expressing happiness over the world being at peace. If you ignore her unusual fetishes, she’s actually a fairly reasonable person.","Well, that fetish is the one and only major issue about her but...... as long as she’s goofing off with someone like Phenex-san, who shares her tastes, it’s probably fine.","[Now then, for your birthday gift...... Back when Miyama Kaito-san visited the forest, you didn’t seem very satisfied with the chair, so I’ve been making chairs myself since then. I’ve brought one of my best creations today.]","[A chair? Thank you...... It's beautifully wrapped, but what kind of chair is it?]","Back when I visited the Dark Forest where Tiamat-san lives, she brought out a chair made of bones...... the creator was apparently Rasal-san, but Pandora-san even commented on it at the time.","It seems that inspired her to start making chairs, and now she’d brought one as a birthday present.","[It's a snakeskin chair.]","[........................]","[Ahh, please don’t worry...... It’s not made from my skin or anything like that. I used the skin of a species called the Grey Python, which is commonly used for leather goods.]","[A- Ahhhh, I see. Sorry, I just...... made a weird assumption there......]","When she said \"snakeskin\", for a moment I thought Medea-san had made a chair out of her own skin and given it to me as a gift, but apparently, that wasn't the case.","[Think nothing of it...... In fact, I did initially consider gifting you a chair made from my own skin, but then Shalltear-sama suddenly appeared and said \"He’s going to be utterly horrified, so stop it\", so I prepared something else instead.]","[I- I see......]","Alice really is always reliable. I mean, Medea-san’s lower body is technically that of a snake, so it wouldn’t be impossible...... but still, if an acquaintance handed me a chair and said “I made this using my own skin”, I honestly wouldn’t know how to react. I’m incredibly glad that got nipped in the bud ahead of time.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [By the way, with their conversation like that, didn't Kaito take some mental damage from this......?]","? ? ? : [Not really, no. When he's listening to stuff like my group, Ein-san's maid theories, or Kuro-san's baby castella rants, he just ends up looking fed up because he’s completely uninterested. He feels mentally tired, but his SAN value doesn’t drop at all. I doubt he'll even need a break.]","Serious-senpai : [Feeling tired but taking no actual damage...... I'm impressed.]","? ? ? : [Well, I mean, it is Kaito-san we're talking about here. He deals with Makina, who shows up at his place like 5 times a week or summons him into a synchronized dream, and still acts totally unfazed. Of course his mental fortitude is monstrous.]","Serious-senpai : [Now that you mention it, I remember the narration briefly touched on it, but I just glossed over it...... He's so used to Makina’s rampages that he can even tell what stage of a meltdown she's in...... This guy’s really got the mental strength of a monster......]"]},{"number":2288,"title":"Chapter 2288: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 32","paragraphs":["The gift reception proceeded without any particular trouble, and with probably less than 50 people left now, even if I assumed it took 10 minutes per person, that’s 500 minutes...... It would be done in around 8 hours. But realistically, each conversation would probably only take around 5 minutes, so it'd be finished in about 5 hours.","Still, looking back, I feel like most of my lovers were clumped toward the beginning. Maybe my desire to receive gifts from them early influenced the order.","<ELISE>","And now it was Elise-san's turn. Before long, she appeared, led by Ein-san, wearing a gentle smile...... or rather, a customer service smile.","Ah, I see. Since there are all kinds of people around, and with Ein-san right beside her, she’s in “fake nice” mode......","[Hello, Kaito-san! Happy birthday!]","[T- Thank you very much.]","I felt a shiver down my spine. I mean, I know it’s rude to say, but she sounded completely different from how she normally talks to me that it was jarring.","Still, I thought it couldn’t be helped...... but just as that crossed my mind, the scenery around me suddenly changed. Or rather than changed, it was more like...... we were still in the same spot at the party venue, but everyone else had vanished.","Judging by the surprised look on Elise-san’s face, this wasn’t something she had done either. So...... what was going on?","Just then, I suddenly heard Canalis-san’s voice echoing throughout the space.","[Yes hello, this is a support feature courtesy of your helpful God! Since I’m an Omnipotent and Omniscient God, I totally understand the situation there. So, I created a space for just the two of you. Feel free to hand over your gift here. Tahaa~~ sorry for the after-the-fact explanation! Once the gift exchange is done, you’ll automatically return and then move on to the next parallel world.]","That’s Canalis-san for you, such precise support. Seeing that Elise-san couldn’t act like herself with others around, she moved just the two of us to another world.","Elise-san let out a deep sigh after briefly showing a very complicated expression.","[......Haahh. Well, there’s no hiding things from an Omnipotent God. It’s just handing over a gift anyway, so it wouldn’t have made much difference to stay in character, but I suppose this way is more relaxing.]","[Honestly, I’m glad like this. If we’re going to talk, I’d rather talk with the real Elise-san.]","[You really don’t hold back with your womanizing lines. The fact that you say them so naturally makes it worse. But if that’s what you prefer, I won’t complain. Anyway, here, I brought your present, so accept it gratefully.]","[Thank you very much...... By the way, is it okay if I ask what’s inside?]","What Elise-san handed me, now back to her usual self, was a small box just big enough to fit in the palm of my hand. The wrapping was stylish and tasteful, very fitting for someone with her taste.","[It's nothing special. It's an artichoke ornament.]","[Artichoke?]","[It's a vegetable. A vegetable, yes, but it's also considered a plant of good fortune. It’s often used as a motif for ornaments. It's said to ward off evil and bring good luck...... Basically, it’s a kind of interior decor that’s auspicious in fortune-telling terms. I don’t really think someone like you needs any help improving your luck, but I chose it since it’s unlikely to overlap with anyone else’s gifts and ties into my area of expertise. Just put it somewhere, on a table or a shelf or something.]","[I see. Thank you very much.]","As expected of Elise-san, a fortune teller, it was an ornament meant to boost luck. It was small and could be placed just about anywhere, so I decided I’d decorate my room with it once I got home.","[So, is your gift receiving going smoothly, Human-san?]","[Yes, I’m in the final stretch. I think I can finish within a few more hours.]","[You really are as absurd as ever. Well, I guess someone as thick-skinned and over-the-top as you can manage it without a problem......]","After listening to me, Elise-san gave me a slightly exasperated look, then pulled out a magic box and took out a few bite-sized cookies, handing them to me.","[Not like you need them, but have a little sugar or something.]","[......Thank you. I’ll have some then...... Ah, they’re gently sweet and really delicious.]","[Sheesh...... Well, do your best there. Within reason, that is.]","As she said that and gave me a small smile, I once again thought, despite the things she says, Elise-san really is a kind person.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [God's support is way too generous...... But since it's already the final stretch, what I'm really curious about is, who’s going to be the one to give the last present? I feel like all the major characters have already shown up......]"]},{"number":2289,"title":"Chapter 2289: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 33","paragraphs":["I steadily kept receiving presents, and by now, I figured there probably weren’t many left. Actually, I couldn't even immediately recall who I hadn’t received one from yet. I could think of one person, but beyond that, I honestly had no idea how many remained.","Still, I spun the garapon, thinking the end must be near......","<SHALLOW VERNAL>","......Eh? No, no, this can’t be right. Shiro-san showing up here doesn’t make sense. A second time?","I was thrown into confusion at seeing Shiro-san’s name again, someone who should’ve already given me her present, only for her to appear right in front of me.","[No, that’s not it. My name showing up is a kind of signal.]","[......A signal?]","[Yes. With the next present exchange being the final one, this marks the moment when Kaito-san will return to the original timeline. After that, the parallel worlds will be merged. You’ll receive the final present from the last person, and that will mark the end of the gift exchanges. My reappearance in the garapon is the signal for that.]","[Ah, I see......]","Now that I thought about it, it did make sense. While I retained the memory of all the presents I had received so far, if during the upcoming integration of the parallel worlds everyone were to inherit memories from all those worlds, it would be far too overwhelming.","So most likely, each person would only inherit the memories of the parallel world where they personally gave their present. That way, their act of giving would remain intact in memory, and the exchanges would be considered complete. It’d naturally flow into the next event from there, but having a clear breakpoint like this made a lot more sense.","Which is probably why the parallel world integration would happen now, followed by receiving the final gift as a way to wrap things up, and then moving straight into the final bonus event.","[Well then, you’re already back in the original timeline, so I’ll leave the rest to Alice.]","As Shiro-san said that and disappeared, Alice gave a slight nod and began speaking, as if on cue.","\"Alright. As previously announced, we will now proceed with the integration of the parallel worlds. Each of you will retain the memories of the world where you gave your gift to Kaito-san, and the presents you prepared will be updated to a state where they’ve already been given. You may suddenly feel like your memories have increased, but don’t worry, the Gods will use their Omnipotent powers to ensure the transition is smooth...... Once the memory transfer is complete, Kaito-san will receive the final present, and that will mark the end of the birthday gift giving that began with Shallow Vernal-sama.\"","\"Honestly though, isn’t it kind of amazing how Shall-tan and Kurorin are just sitting there all chill? Getting bombarded with all these parallel world memories at once feels kinda uncomfortable.\"","\"Well, we handle that by cleverly partitioning our thoughts. Ahh, there’s no need to worry, everyone. Fate-san only ended up like that because she chose to inherit all the memories of the different parallel worlds on her own. For the rest of you, you’ll only be inheriting the memories of the world in which you gave your present, so the information load won’t be overwhelming or make you feel sick.\"","It seemed that those who were Quasi-Omnipotent level, like Fate-san, Alice, and Kuro, were capable of inheriting memories from parallel worlds on their own. Something similar had happened during Hydra Kingdom's Founding Festival, but perhaps because she still wasn’t fully used to it, Fate-san looked like she was trying to endure a mild headache.","\"Alright. We’ll begin the integration in 5 seconds. 5...... 4...... 3...... 2...... 1...... There. Everyone’s memory transfer should now be complete. I think everyone’s fine, but if anyone feels unwell, please speak up. Now then...... there’s one person whose memory of giving their present wasn’t transferred. Yes, you are the final one.\"","Truthfully, I already knew who that last person was. In fact, while the garapon was spinning earlier, I had been thinking how it’s getting close to the end, but that person still hasn’t shown up.","When I shifted my gaze toward the person in question, I saw her face had gone completely pale, an expression of utter despair on it.","\"Well, this is mostly a formality, but let’s still spin the garapon for the final round. Kaito-san, if you would, go ahead~~\"","Starting with Shiro-san and ending here, the one Alice referred to as the grand finale would have to hand over her gift while under the full attention of everyone present...... which, honestly, felt a bit pitiful.","With those thoughts in mind, I spun the garapon again...... and the name of the final person appeared.","<LUNAMARIA>","......Looking at her direction, I saw Lilia-san, wearing a deeply sympathetic expression, gently pat Luna-san on the shoulder as Luna-san forced a stiff smile with eyes that looked like those of a dead fish.","<Afterword>","~ ~ This Chapter’s Summary ~ ~","Lunamaria : [I- It can’t be......! The memory...... of me giving my present...... I- It’s not here......]","Stomachache Demon : [Compose a haiku. I’ll grant you a merciful end.]","This Chapter’s Victim : [AIEEEEE!? A stomach blow!? Why a stomach blow!? WHYYYYYY!?]","Stomach Slayer : [For it's finally time...... to send you off to your best friend...... there in the land of stomachaches......]"]},{"number":2290,"title":"Chapter 2290: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 34","paragraphs":["The last person to give a present was Luna-san, who approached me with an expression that mixed despair and sadness. Normally in situations like this, it's Lilia-san who ends up drawing the short straw, but this time, Lilia-san had already gone early on.","Well, Lilia-san's turn had also been in a rather brutal position...... but it feels rare for Luna-san to end up in this kind of situation.","[......Between last time and this time, is it your intention to humiliate me every time during your birthday gatherings, Miyama-sama......?]","[Uh, I don't think I was even involved with what happened at karaoke last time...... and this time was just a coincidence......]","Come to think of it, last time. during the karaoke contest, she sang \"Lovingly☆Lovely~ ☆Vampire\" or something like that? I vaguely remember her singing some super cutesy idol song while drowning in embarrassment.","Thinking about it that way, I guess it’s not wrong to say she gets the short end of the stick at my birthday parties every time...... though technically, it's only been twice so far......","As for the karaoke incident, it's true that we made Luna-san advance even though she clearly didn't want to, but that was because the other group was practically a strategic weapon, causing mass nausea with their singing, so it was a necessary sacrifice for the sake of the others. And this time really was just coincidence.","[......Can you really say, with confidence, that this was a coincidence?]","[Huh? I mean, it was a lottery draw......]","[Yes, I don’t believe you intended to make me go last from the beginning, Miyama-sama. But surely, at some point, you noticed that among the people you often interact with, I hadn't gone yet?]","[Yeah...... I did notice. Even after the people from my house and Lilia-san’s mansion had pretty much all gone, I realized Luna-san still hadn't appeared......]","That's right. I did have opportunities to notice that among the people I’m close with, only Luna-san hadn’t been picked in the draw yet, and I did notice it.","But that’s just normal, and it shouldn’t have affected anything......","[......Did you not think to yourself at that moment? Something like \"Wouldn’t it be funny if Luna-san was the last one?\" or \"Maybe Luna-san will end up being the final one after all?\"...... Did such thoughts not cross your mind?]","[....................................]","I did think that...... It's true, near the end, when Luna-san still hadn’t shown up, I distinctly remember wondering something like “Could it be that Luna-san will be the very last one?”","And if what I thought somehow fed into the cascade of fortunate coincidences that led to Luna-san being the finale...... then, yeah, I kind of can’t deny that possibility.","[W- Well, it was probably just a coincidence.]","[You totally thought it! You definitely thought it, didn’t you!?]","[......Luna-san, there's no end to this kind of blame game. And honestly, we can't say for sure either way, so let’s leave it at that.]","[Gununu... true, there's no solid proof......]","After hearing Luna-san speak, I couldn't help but think that maybe, just maybe, it was my fault...... but in truth, there’s no way to know for sure. Luna-san also seemed to understand that this was just speculation, and after making a frustrated face, she sighed quietly.","[......Haa, still, I really didn’t prepare anything worthy of being the finale. I just bought it from a shop I usually go to......]","[It’s not like the last gift has to be something amazing.]","After that exchange, Luna-san reached into her magic box and pulled out a slender package, holding it out to me.","[......Um...... Happy birthday.]","[Thank you very much...... Is this...... marshmallows?]","The box Luna-san handed me had a transparent window, letting me see inside, and inside were marshmallows shaped like cute animals, like cats and bears.","[They’re marshmallows meant to be added to tea or coffee. They’re lightly sweetened, so they also go well with cocoa.]","[Hehh...... so they gradually melt and sweeten the drink as they go?]","[Yes, they float on the surface, so they’re also visually enjoyable, I guess......]","She explained it a bit shyly, but this was an adorably charming gift, a very girly one, in a good way.","Actually, the idea of floating marshmallows in coffee or cocoa feels very cute and stylish. And I had just received some cocoa from Aria-san, so maybe I could try them together.","[They're really cute, and I’m looking forward to trying them out. Thank you.]","[Well, as long as you’re pleased...... But presenting something like this while everyone's watching, I feel like I might faint from embarrassment. I now understand how Milady must have felt. Honestly, Miyama-sama, your tendency to torment the stomachs of ladies is quite troubling.]","Despite her words, Luna-san’s smile was soft, and though she sounded like she was complaining, her tone carried a certain gentleness.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Wasn't there supposed to be a break after this? But, you know, Kaito doesn’t look tired or anything, so maybe they could just keep going...... I- I mean, there’s no need for a couple to take a break together or anything......]"]},{"number":2291,"title":"Chapter 2291: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 35","paragraphs":["With Luna-san’s reasonably intact sense of shame, the gift-receiving process through the use of parallel worlds was successfully completed. Honestly though, this format was really great.","Since we were using parallel worlds, there was no need to worry about time or rush through things like an assembly line. There was even enough leeway to have relaxed chats with each person, so personally, I was extremely satisfied. If there’s ever a next time, I really hope we use this format again for the gift exchange.","Even though the gift-giving was over, the party itself hadn’t come to an end. There was still one more event to go...... something thought up by the representatives of the Human Realm, apparently. I guess we’ll be transitioning to that next?","\"Alright then, now that Kaito-san has finished receiving his gifts without any issues...... shall we take a break? Well, for most people, it’ll feel like we’re taking another break immediately after the last one, but Kaito-san has been receiving gifts non-stop.\"","\"Actually, how many different parallel worlds did Kai-chan travel to for all the gift handoffs?\"","\"Kaito-san received gifts from 423 people through the parallel world format. Including casual conversations, it took an average of about 7 minutes per person, which adds up to roughly 50 hours.\"","\"Ehhhh...... That’s over two full days! Ugh, no way I could handle that. I’d give up somewhere halfway through the first person.\"","\"......Why would you quit halfway through the first one......? Well, setting Fate-san's extreme slacking aside, it really did take quite a bit of time. But since the gift receiving was done through parallel worlds, physical fatigue would recover with each transfer, and if he wanted to, he could take breaks at any point.\"","When you hear the actual numbers laid out like that, it really does sound like a lot of time. That said, from my perspective, it just felt like time passed while I was happily chatting with people, so I don’t feel like I spent all that long. Not feeling any physical fatigue makes a huge difference.","\"Yeah, I mean it sounds mentally exhausting as hell, so Kai-chan really should rest...... rest...... hmm. Shall-tan, I think I might not have inherited all the memories properly? I can’t find any memory of Kai-chan taking a break.\"","\"......He didn’t take any. In the end, he went all 50 hours straight without a single break.\"","\"Wait, is Kai-chan even okay? Oh, so that’s why you want to take a break......\"","\"Exactly. If Kaito-san had been pushing himself or acting fine while actually exhausted, I, Kuro-san, or someone else would’ve stepped in and forced a break. Look, see how Kuro-san is unusually being exasperated over there?\"","Turning to look at Kuro in response to Alice’s words, I saw she was indeed giving a faintly exasperated smile. It was the kind of look that practically said, “Good grief, you really are just helpless, Kaito-kun.”","\"Kaito-san’s mental endurance is straight-up monstrous, so he’s not even remotely tired, looking totally unbothered. If anything, knowing how Kaito-san thinks, he’s probably genuinely happy he got to talk with everyone thanks to the parallel world format and is wishing the next time goes the same way too.\"","\"......Yup. Kai-chan really is something else.\"","\"Well, even though I don’t think Kaito-san is tired...... There are still a lot of people who are concerned or just worried, so we’ll take a break anyway. A change of pace is always good.\"","Even though Alice understood I wasn’t mentally fatigued, she still firmly declared that we’d take a break. To be fair, people like Tre-san, Akane-san, and quite a few others had asked whether I was tired during the gift exchanges, so this was probably the safest call.","\"Makes sense. Oh hey, Shall-tan, while we’re at it, give me another <Kai-chan’s Insane Episode>, will ya?\"","\"......Unn?\"","Whoa there. Fate-san’s starting to say weird stuff again......","\"Well, you know, when I hear stories about how amazing Kai-chan is, I feel really proud and happy as his girlfriend. Basically, it lets me experience this wonderful, heartwarming feeling without doing anything myself, so it’s really easy and fun for me. So gimme more! Like just now, stuff I wouldn’t notice on my own but is totally there, right?\"","\"......Hmmm. Alright then, here’s one from during this birthday party. Around the middle of the event, Electrone-san made an appearance, right? Fate-san, what did you think when you first saw her?\"","\"Eh? Well, I mean, she’s a God on the same level as Shallow Vernal-sama, so I thought the pressure, her aura, was absolutely overwhelming.\"","Unn? Was there really that kind of pressure when Electrone-san appeared? I only remember it being like a flashy live performance entrance, with a strong visual impact. That’s all I recall......","\"Yes, exactly. Whether you call it magic power, divine power, aura, or presence pressure, I’m not really sure what the right term is, but being an Omnipotent God, just her manifesting gave off an extraordinary pressure. It wasn’t the kind of thing that crushed your spirit or anything like that, but there was definitely a heavy presence from her very existence. I’m sure everyone in the venue felt it...... well, it seemed like Electrone-san noticed everyone’s reaction and quickly adjusted herself, so the pressure only lasted a brief moment.\"","\"Unn. So what about it?\"","\"Well, the thing is...... Kaito-san, for some reason, maybe because he’s interacted with Gods too much and his senses are out of whack, clearly didn’t feel any of that pressure. Not like he adapted using Sympathy Magic or anything, he just acted totally normal...... I think his only reaction when Electrone-san appeared was something along the lines of “Wow, what an entrance”.\"","\"......Yeah, Kai-chan really is amazing.\"","That one really came out of nowhere for me. I honestly didn’t feel any pressure at all...... Judging by Fate-san and Alice’s reactions, though, it looks like I just completely missed something that everyone else experienced.","Maybe it’s because I’ve talked so much with Shiro-san and Makina-san that I’ve gotten used to that kind of divine aura......","<Afterword>","~ ~The Truth ~ ~","Divine Aura (Omniscient & Omnipotent) : [Well, I mean, even if someone has amazing adaptability, I still have my pride as the divine aura of an Omniscient and Omnipotent God, right? So it's only natural they'd feel a bit of pressure from a higher being, just until they adapt, of course. Alright then, let’s throw out a little intimidation!]","Little Epilogue (Outlier) : [......Huh?]","Divine Aura (Omniscient & Omnipotent) : [———But only to everyone except for Kaito-sama!!! Ahhh, no no no. Just because I’m a divine aura doesn’t mean I can do whatever I want, there are lines you don’t cross! Intimidating Kaito-sama, even for a moment, is absolutely unforgivable! In fact, even waiting for him to adapt is a huge problem!!! I should be the one humbly adapting myself to his Sympathy Magic from the start!!!]"]},{"number":2292,"title":"Chapter 2292: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 36","paragraphs":["For the time being, the second break was officially confirmed, and just like the first time, it would last 30 minutes. Everyone would be automatically transferred to the break room from where they were, and rest there.","Well, this time it probably wouldn’t be with Shiro-san like before, so I might as well take it easy and refresh myself.","Just as I was thinking that, the scenery changed and I was moved to the break room...... where I met eyes with the person in front of me.","[......Arehh? Lilia-san?]","[A- Ahaha......]","Upon arriving in the break room, I saw Lilia-san standing there with a somewhat indescribable expression. I tilted my head in confusion. Was this what I thought it was? That I’d be taking this break together with Lilia-san?","Now that I think about it, I vaguely remember Shiro-san saying something like that. It had already been around 2 days since then, so I’d completely forgotten.","[Come to think of it, Shiro-san did mention something like that. So, that means I’ll be spending this break with you, Lilia-san?]","[Yes, Shallow Vernal-sama was considerate...... but still, even if we’re spending a break together like this, what exactly should we do? Since I was assigned to this because we haven’t done anything particularly couple-like, I assume we’re supposed to do something a couple would do...... but what, exactly? By the way, what did you do when you were with Shallow Vernal-sama?]","[We went to the beach together.]","[......U- Unn?]","Upon hearing my words, Lilia-san made a face like she’d just been hit with a story about outer space. I suppose that was inevitable.","It was true we went to the beach, but it was more like being inside a dream or a mental world, maybe...... Hmmm, this is really hard to explain......","[Errr, how should I put it...... the break itself felt like taking a nap, but in the dream, in the mental world, I went to the beach with Shiro-san, and time was kind of extended, so we ended up spending a fair amount of time playing around.]","[......I- I see. I don’t fully understand, but if it’s Shallow Vernal-sama, then I suppose that’s not so strange. However, that doesn’t help me decide what I should do.]","[Well, yeah, that’s true. But it’s not like we have to do something special or dramatic. Why not just have some tea and relax? I've got tea in the magic box, plus a table and sofa in here.]","[You’re right. Then I’ll be your conversation partner for this break.]","Apparently, the whole idea originated from Shiro-san’s comment that it wasn’t fair they didn’t do anything \"couple-like\" when giving their present. Because of that, Lilia-san seemed to feel like she had to do something, but I don’t think there’s any need to force ourselves.","Besides, unlike with Shiro-san, this time there’s no time distortion or anything like that, we just have 30 minutes. Casual small talk should be more than enough.","Hearing that, Lilia-san seemed relieved and smiled softly. Then she sat down across from me at the table in the break room.","I figured I’d just get some tea and snacks from the magic box and have a chat, when something strange happened.","[......A- Arehh? All of a sudden, I’m feeling really sleepy......]","[You too, Kaito-san? I suddenly feel...... very...... sleepy......]","The moment we sat down in our chairs, a wave of overwhelming drowsiness hit us. It was so intense there wasn’t even time to question what was happening. With no way to resist it, my eyelids fell, and my consciousness slipped into a hazy slumber.","And when I came to...... for some reason, I was standing in front of an open-air bath, completely naked except for a towel wrapped around my waist.","[......Eh?]","[T- This place is——— kyaah!? Eh? W- Why am I dressed like this......?]","[Lilia-san?]","[K- Kaito-san, please don’t look this way right now!]","I turned toward Lilia-san’s voice and saw that, just like me, she had her clothes taken off and had a towel wrapped around her body...... essentially the appearance of someone about to take a bath. Suddenly finding herself in such a state, her face went bright red and she started panicking.","Right then, glowing text appeared above the open-air bath in front of us.","\"Just like with me, time outside has been distorted, so Lilia, please enjoy this moment with Kaito-san as lovers to your heart’s content too. Since my setting was the beach, I’ve chosen a hot spring this time.\"","Shiro-san, what are you doing......? No, I’m sure she meant this with 100% good intentions, figuring since she’d spent time with me that way, she should give Lilia-san a similar chance too.","[......A- Arehh? That means this is a dream, right? T- That's strange...... even though it’s a dream, my stomach really hurts......]","By the way, Lilia-san, the person on the receiving end of this very thoughtful \"support\", was holding her stomach with a complicated expression on her face.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [She actually did it!!! That God! Are you kidding me!? She really went and did it!!! Just brute-forced her way into starting a hot spring mixed bathing episode!?]"]},{"number":2293,"title":"Chapter 2293: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 37","paragraphs":["Now then, although we were suddenly thrown into a hot spring, this place is, just like with Shiro-san, inside a dream. The sensations and such are no different from reality, but there are also significant differences.","First of all, while we are in a hot spring, it’s not like we arrived here through the changing room or anything. So neither I nor Lilia-san have a change of clothes, and even our magic boxes are unusable in a dream. On top of that, there doesn’t even seem to be a way to exit the bath area where the hot spring is located...... not even past what you’d call a changing room......","[......Errr, Lilia-san, are you okay?]","[J- Just give me a second. I’m trying really hard to remind myself...... This is just a dream...... This is just a dream......]","Lilia-san, though not as extreme as Alice, is quite shy and not good with romance-related things. As expected, being suddenly thrown into a situation where she’s in a hot spring with only a towel, without any preparation or mental readiness, is too much for her. Her face was already flushed bright red, to the point I wondered if she was already getting dizzy from the heat, as she desperately kept whispering to herself like a mantra that this was just a dream.","Fortunately, in a way, Lilia-san and I had previously experienced a mixed bath together. It was under circumstances where she’d been tricked by Luna-san, but still, having had that kind of experience once already probably helps her mentally a lot now.","If not for that previous experience, and we were suddenly dropped into this situation, I imagine Lilia-san might’ve actually fainted right here in the dream......","[......Lilia-san, a thought just came to me.]","[Yes? What is it?]","[Sorry if this sounds like I’m bringing up old things, but in the past, haven’t you fainted from embarrassment from this before?]","[Y- Yes, it’s terribly embarrassing, but yes...... When I get overwhelmed with embarrassment, my thoughts kind of shut down, I suppose. Something like that.]","[......And I assume you’re feeling pretty embarrassed right now too, but since this is a dream, can you even faint in it?]","[............So I don’t even have the option to escape by losing consciousness huh.]","Whether that's actually true or not, I’m not sure. It might be possible to faint inside a dream, but fainting isn’t really something you can do on purpose, so there’s no way to test it. I don’t really know...... but I feel like it’s safer to assume you probably can’t.","[More importantly, are we really inside a dream right now? It feels no different from reality, and all my senses seem to be working normally......]","[To be more precise, it’s like our minds were pulled into some kind of special space. Well, there’s still a lot that I don’t fully understand either...... But just standing around like this forever isn’t going to help. Shall we go ahead and get in the hot spring?]","[Y- Yes, let’s.]","[Ah, and it’s not like this is some public bath or inn or anything, so I think it’s totally fine to keep our towels on.]","Technically, it’s considered bad manners to soak a towel in the water at a hot spring, but this isn’t a public facility or a regular hot spring inn. It’s a dream after all. In this case, prioritizing Lilia-san’s peace of mind is more important, so I think it’s perfectly fine.","And so, both Lilia-san and I decided to enter the hot spring while keeping our towels wrapped around us.","Once I soaked in the hot spring...... just like when we were at the ocean, it was hard to believe this was really a dream, the sensations felt so real, it truly felt like I was bathing in an actual hot spring.","[Ahh~~ but it’s actually nice. It feels like a good way to refresh myself after what felt like quite a long time.]","[For us, it was only a short time, but for Kaito-san more than two whole days have passed, hasn’t it? Wasn’t it exhausting?]","[Not at all, really. I didn’t feel tired in the slightest. Honestly, I was just enjoying some pleasant conversations while receiving gifts. I didn’t even have to worry about the time, so it was all pretty relaxing.]","[Fufu, that’s just like Kaito-san. I’m a noble as well, so I’ve had to exchange many greetings at parties, but the mental fatigue can be quite overwhelming. I suppose it’s a bit different from what you experienced, but I still admire your mental resilience.]","From what I imagine, greetings between nobles likely involve a lot of reading between the lines, like a battle of subtle probing, which sounds mentally exhausting, so I can understand how tiring that could be.","As a side note, Lilia-san still looked extremely embarrassed. Her face was bright red, and her eyes kept darting around while she tried to keep up the conversation, clearly doing her best to focus on talking in order to distract herself from her embarrassment...... Honestly, while I’m sure it’s tough for her, from where I’m sitting, it just makes her look kind of adorable.","[Lilia-san, how should I say this...... it seems like you've got it rough again this time. Though, yeah, most of that is my fault......]","[Why do things always turn out that way......? No, well, regardless, what’s important is that we got through the difficult parts, and there shouldn’t be anything else to worry about now.]","[......When you say that, Lilia-san, it kinda makes me feel like something else is going to happen......]","[......Yes, I had the same feeling, so I’ll stay alert until the very end, just in case.]","After hearing my words, Lilia-san seemed to sense something might be coming, based on her past experiences, and answered that she wouldn’t let her guard down.","Well, in most cases, when you’re prepared and on alert, unexpected things don’t tend to happen. And so, I feel like we’ll probably be okay...... but somehow, I can’t shake this sense of unease. Like something might happen the moment we let our guard down, maybe after the birthday party ends.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Oh? Avoided the follow-up attack by not being too optimistic huh...... But since the Stomach Annihilator has already declared a death sentence, I feel like your gut’s gonna get punched for something else after the party anyway.]"]},{"number":2294,"title":"Chapter 2294: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 38","paragraphs":["At first, I was understandably quite flustered, but the hot spring felt so good that I gradually started to relax. And once I relaxed, I naturally began to pay attention to the situation itself.","Right now, Lilia-san and I are sitting side by side in the hot spring. Even though we're wrapped in towels, it's still quite an intense situation. Naturally, my heart's racing too.","However, I can't afford to show my nervousness here. That's because Lilia-san, sitting next to me, seems even more overwhelmed, she has absolutely no room to breathe.","Alice is also quite shy, but even then, she tends to joke around and tease herself a bit, so she still manages to talk. In Lilia-san’s case though, if I don’t take the lead, I get the feeling she won’t say a single word and will just sit there with a bright red face, staring down at the water.","So, it's up to me to take the lead. And as the one leading, I need to act composed. Otherwise, my tension will just make things even more awkward for both of us.","Well, I should be fine. One way or another, I’ve already survived quite a few mixed baths up to this point, so I’ve got enough experience under my belt...... hmm, thinking about it again, haven’t I ended up in mixed baths a little too often? W- Well, I’ll set that aside for now.","[Lilia-san, you don’t have to be so nervous. I mean, I totally understand feeling embarrassed, of course, but if you’re too stiff, you won’t be able to enjoy the hot spring.]","[Y- Yes, that’s certainly true...... but still, the embarrassment is...... Kaito-san, you seem so calm.]","[Well, I’m definitely nervous too, sitting here in a mixed bath and all, and my heart’s pounding but...... seeing how tense you are, it kinda made me calm down a bit, actually.]","[I- I see...]","[I’ll try not to look your way as much as possible, so please try to relax a little too. You’re probably tired from the party, right? This is a rare chance, you should take the opportunity to refresh yourself.]","Yes, it’s easy to focus on my own burden here, but Lilia-san must be exhausted too. She handed out her present in that crazy order earlier, got caught up in between that death-stare battle between Shiro-san and Makina-san, and even served as a judge in the hidden talent show...... yeah, she must be pretty worn out.","[Not looking...... um, Kaito-san...... t- this might be a really weird question but...... I- I guess you would want to...... um, look...... at such things.......?]","......What do I do? That’s a way more intense question than I expected...... She’s probably a little high from the tension and embarrassment right now, but still, that question is incredibly hard to answer.","No, answering it isn’t the problem, it’s answering it in a way that doesn’t make things awkward between us that’s the challenge. But staying silent would just make it awkward in a different way......","[......Well, of course, I won't deny that I have those kinds of feelings and desires. Lilia-san, you're an incredibly attractive woman...... and you're my girlfriend......]","For now, I decided to just answer honestly. Of course, it’s a bit embarrassing, but I don’t think there’s any point in dodging the question or trying to cover it up.","After hearing my answer, Lilia-san, her face still red, fell silent for a moment, then timidly opened her mouth.","[......Errr...... then...... w- would you like to see?]","She just said something unbelievable, or rather, I’m pretty sure her mind is kind of short-circuiting right now. It feels like she’s put the pedal to the metal and can’t stop herself anymore.","How should I say this...... the embarrassment and tension pushed her past a breaking point, and now she’s just charging forward without thinking things through.","And responding to that question is even harder than the last one...... way harder.","I mean, of course if you asked me whether I wanted to or not, I’d say I do, and I even almost nodded in my dazed state...... but I can’t just go along with it like that.","If this were a situation where we were alone on a hot spring trip, I probably would’ve nodded...... But right now, we’re just on a break in the middle of a birthday party. Based on how Shiro-san’s break went earlier, we’ll definitely have to head back after a certain amount of time.","If I just get swept up in the moment and act on impulse here, it’ll be unbelievably awkward when we go back to the break room, and more than that, I’d be stuck with all kinds of frustrations afterward.","[Um, that’s...... that’s an extremely tempting offer, but since we are on a break right now and all...... maybe we could save it for another time? Like...... the next time we go out, just the two of us......]","[......Time? You mean, we don’t have...... Oh......]","Lilia-san blinked in confusion for a moment at my words, but then seemed to realize something, and her face turned even redder than before.","Yeah...... I might’ve messed that up. I mean, I don’t think I said anything wrong, but the result is this awkward, ticklish atmosphere that’s hard to shake.","[..................Umm...... Kaito-san...... let’s go on a trip together again sometime......]","[......Yeah. Let’s go somewhere again, just the two of us.]","Her voice was so soft it was almost a whisper, but even so, hearing her say that, considering everything that had just happened, made me really happy. My face grew hot, but I smiled in return.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [So if she doesn’t faint, she panics and slams the gas pedal to the floor...... Sealing off the option to faint...... actually increases her sweetness power......?]"]},{"number":2295,"title":"Chapter 2295: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 39","paragraphs":["After some time, it seemed that Lilia-san had gotten a bit more used to things, and she began to enjoy the conversation in a more relaxed manner. Being an open-air bath, the view was spectacular, and for some reason, a tray of sake had suddenly appeared, so they were drinking it together.","[But this alcohol is really easy to drink. Nihonshu, was it?]","[Yes, though there are some similar drinks in Trinia, and I’ve heard people like Neun-san even make it themselves, it’s definitely not common. That said, while nihonshu is indeed smooth, the alcohol content is pretty strong. If you drink a lot just because it’s easy to down...... hmm...... I wonder, if you drink alcohol in a dream, do you actually get drunk?]","[Good question. Even though we can taste it like this, the alcohol itself isn’t entering our real bodies back in the real world, so I’d think we wouldn’t get drunk......]","[You’re not particularly strong with alcohol, right, Lilia-san? Are you okay?]","I remembered that when we first went to the Archlesia Empire and brought Bell back, Lilia-san drank some wine and heard how she wasn’t that strong with alcohol.","In fact, I rarely ever saw her drink, and when she did, it was usually just a little bit of wine. So if the effects of drunkenness carried over somehow, I thought it might cause problems at the party afterward, which is why I asked.","[For now, I don’t feel like the alcohol is affecting me, so I’m fine. Also, I can neutralize or dispel status effects, so even if I did get drunk, I could instantly fix it. Well, back when Kaito-san brought Bellfried back, I was deliberately trying to get drunk as a form of escapism......]","[A- Ahaha, sorry about that...... But setting that aside, I often hear about this neutralizing or dispelling of status effects, once you’re on the level of a Count rank, is that something everyone can do?]","[There are some differences depending on personal skill and magic power, but it’s not a particularly difficult technique. To put it very simply, resistance to status effects is a matter of imbuing the magic power you normally wrap your body in with resistance. Once you’re used to it, you can maintain it constantly without thinking about it. It’s actually one of the first things taught in knight training.]","[I see, so the level of resistance depends on how practiced or strong your magic power is huh.]","Come to think of it, Fors-san once said that Laguna-san had such incredibly high resistance that most poisons didn’t work on her. Laguna-san doesn’t seem like the most dexterous type, so it might really come down to the sheer strength and volume of her magic power.","[Dispelling drunkenness isn’t a difficult spell either. If you focus, you can sense how much alcohol is in your body, and then you just use magic power to purge it. That’s the basic idea.]","[......I see.]","You can sense how much alcohol is in your body if you focus? No, I can’t...... She says it like it’s completely normal, but I’m not sure if this is supposed to be common knowledge...... It’s hard to tell with Lilia-san.","According to Luna-san and Sieg-san, Lilia-san isn’t exactly bad at explaining things, but she tends to be catastrophically off the mark in some areas.","It’s not that she explains things poorly. She really does try to teach and explain based on the other person’s level of understanding, but because she herself is such an extraordinary genius, things that feel obvious or normal to her are often completely out of reach for others. That seems to be the common issue.","[I remember Luna-san once said \"Don’t take it at face value when Lilia-san says something isn’t difficult\".]","[Eh? H- Hmmm, now that you mention it, Sieg and Luna used to get exasperated with me back in the knight order too......]","[They said your intuition was too genius-like. Have there been a lot of situations like that?]","[It’s a bit embarrassing to talk about my failures, but yes...... For example, there was a time someone asked me to teach them how to counter restraints or seals formed by magic power. Since I can sense and read the structure of spells and barriers the moment they touch my skin, I thought the lesson was about how to use that to break them. But apparently, you’re supposed to start by analyzing what kind of magic formation is being used, and being able to quickly identify or predict it is the key. They were rather exasperated when they realized I skipped all that.]","[Ah, I see. So for Lilia-san, it was just something you’ve always intuitively understood, so you thought it was natural. But from everyone else’s perspective, it seemed like you had incredible skill and knowledge, breaking things down instantly, so they asked you to teach it, but in reality, you were just handling it with innate talent, and your approach wasn’t really something others could learn from.]","[Yes, that sort of thing happened often. Things that are normally honed through training and experience, I could often do instinctively. Because of that, there was often a disconnect in perception. Even with mimicking other people’s movements, I genuinely thought anyone could do the same thing after seeing it once......]","Lilia-san really is a standout genius. During the Shirakami Festival, she scored a perfect on the free throw contest after watching just a few people try it. She probably does understand that what feels natural to her isn’t the same for others, but determining exactly what others can or can’t do must be incredibly difficult. Being a genius comes with its own set of hardships.","[Speaking of which, you know Isis-san’s place? Alice says Eul... Eulpecula is just as much of a genius as you, Lilia-san. Apparently, Eul can do almost anything after seeing it once, and she’s incredibly dexterous...... You two might really get along when it comes to that kind of intuitive sense.]","[Really? I’d love to talk with her sometime.]","[I’ll introduce you next time there’s a chance.]","Honestly, I said it on a whim, but thinking about it now, Lilia-san and Eul probably would get along really well.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [Umm...... Kaito-san, could you not do that? When those two meet, there’s...... chemistry. Specifically, Eulpecula-san’s growth rate accelerates to a Mach-speed level, and she’s already on track to break all sorts of youngest-records as it is. Please don’t go handing her any more awakening flags. For the tranquility of Alice-chan’s stomach...... please......]"]},{"number":2296,"title":"Chapter 2296: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 40","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I'm on a business trip tomorrow, so the next update will be the day after tomorrow.","When it was with Shiro-san, I could’ve just asked her directly, but with Lilia-san, I found myself unsure when exactly this hot spring dream was supposed to end.","[......I wonder when we’re supposed to wake up from this?]","[I don’t know. It’s not like we’re getting tipsy or overheated, either.]","Yes, we’d been in the hot spring for a fair amount of time already, but neither of us felt faint or dizzy. That probably meant, as expected, that this really was just a dream.","Still, even so, I couldn’t help but wonder how long we were going to stay like this.","And right at that moment, as if answering both mine and Lilia-san’s shared thought, glowing text appeared in the air before us.","\"In order for Lilia to enjoy some flirting too, you will wake up once you and Lilia kiss.\"","[ [ ! ? ! ? ] ]","I see...... so we’re using that kind of setup, returning to the real world upon meeting specific conditions...... Like one of those rooms where you can’t leave unless you do XXX...... I wouldn’t be surprised if this was also one of Shiro-san’s experiments, the fruit of her broad research into romance.","Of course, it’s the ones experiencing the result of that research who have it rough, Lilia-san had just managed to calm down, and now her face was going bright red again, like it might burst at any second.","[......This is definitely Shiro-san thinking she was being considerate.]","[I- I- I- I suppose so. If this is Shallow Vernal-sama’s thoughtfulness...... t- then to reject it would be......]","[Lilia-san, it’s not like...... ah, no, never mind.]","[Hmm?]","[It’s just...... your face is really red, so I was wondering if you’re okay......]","[My face is practically boiling already.]","For a moment, I almost said she didn’t have to force herself, that if she wasn’t comfortable I could talk to Shiro-san about it, but judging from Lilia-san’s expression and the emotions I could sense through Sympathy Magic, that didn’t seem to be what she wanted to hear.","I mean, yes...... of course, she was embarrassed. I could feel her nervousness and fluster too, but strangely, I could also feel a sense of happiness.","How should I say this...... Although she was surprised by how sudden this was, she was using the excuse of \"not wasting Shiro-san’s goodwill\" as a way to summon the courage to take a step forward, even if she was embarrassed. That’s how it felt, like she was, even if just a little, thankful for it.","[Errr, well then...... Lilia-san, if you’ll excuse me.]","[Y- Yes. P- Please, just...... do it in one go, with confidence!]","Thinking that I should take the lead here, I turned my body and gently placed my hands on Lilia-san’s shoulders. She flinched for a moment, then quickly showed a resolved expression and closed her eyes.","Her hair, tied up to keep it from getting wet, gave her a slightly different look from usual. And being this close, touching her, reminded me all over again...... Lilia-san might be a genius with power rivaling that of a Count-rank despite being Human, but she’s also a lovely woman. That realization made my heart pound in a strange way.","I leaned in, gently pressing my lips against hers. Maybe because we’d been in the hot spring, her lips felt a little moist, and oddly enough, there was something sweet and comforting about it.","Then, at that moment, Lilia-san brought her hands around to my back and pressed her lips to mine just a little more firmly. I had a feeling her mind was probably in full-on panic mode, but still, the way she was doing her best to meet me halfway was just so endearing that, without thinking, I slid my hands from her shoulders around her back and held her tightly.","And like that, we stayed locked in the moment, embracing each other with our lips still pressed together...... until, before long, we gently pulled our faces apart, neither of us sure who moved first.","[......T- The truly fortunate part is that, since we’re here, I haven’t passed out from embarrassment, so I’m grateful for that. My head feels like it’s about to boil over, and if this had been reality, I’m certain I would’ve lost consciousness......]","[Isn’t there a chance you’ll faint after you wake up?]","[......If possible, I’d appreciate it if you could wake me up before the break ends.]","[So you’ve already accepted that you will faint!?]","[Well, um...... for someone as inexperienced as I am, this is all a bit too stimulating...... I- I do understand, though. I know I need to get used to this kind of thing more from now on...... I know that, but this time I didn’t faint, and we’re alone together in a dream, so I...... acted a bit more boldly than usual...... I’m well aware I’ve already gone far beyond my tolerance.]","[I- I see......]","As I thought, or maybe it was inevitable, when Lilia-san is too overwhelmed to faint, she tends to slam the gas pedal to cope with the fluster.","This time too, she must’ve figured well that at least, she won’t pass out, and so she charged forward with actions that she normally wouldn’t dare take due to embarrassment.","[Kaito-san.]","[Eh? ——–!?]","Just as I let out a small, helpless smile, Lilia-san gave me a soft smile...... then suddenly leaned in and kissed me again, catching me completely off guard.","[......I’ve already accepted that I’ll probably faint once I wake up, so I thought I’d do something I normally couldn’t, out of embarrassment......]","[Ahaha, how should I say this...... you’re strangely decisive at the weirdest times.]","[If I keep stacking up experiences like this, I feel like I’ll be able to get used to it a little more......]","Lilia-san said this with a beet-red face and a small, embarrassed smile, and in that moment, I found her unbelievably adorable. The arms I still had wrapped around her tightened just a little.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Guh...... I- I get it now...... making Lilia unable to faint is a terrible idea...... Please, from now on, don’t put her in a faint-proof state again......]"]},{"number":2297,"title":"Chapter 2297: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 41","paragraphs":["Shortly after our kiss ended, Lilia-san and I woke up...... and just as she declared, she managed to move herself to the sofa before promptly passing out.","I couldn’t help but chuckle at the thought that she basically fell asleep again the moment she woke up. Anyhow, I spent some time relaxing as well, and once the break was over, I gently woke Lilia-san and before we were teleported back to the venue.","\"Alright. With the break now over, we’ll move on to our final event.\"","\"Hmm, wasn’t the final event something planned by the representatives of the Human Realm?\"","Since I had already received the presents, I could sit back and enjoy the last event at a leisurely pace. Still, I couldn’t help but wonder what it would be.","A game tournament, a live concert, a hidden talent show...... Judging by the past events, it seemed to lean towards fun, lively entertainment.","\"That’s right. And for the final performance, we’ll be having a quiz competition.\"","\"Hehh, a quiz huh? They did something similar during the White God Festival too. It’s definitely the kind of event a large crowd can enjoy together.\"","So it's a quiz huh...... Just as Fate-san said, depending on the format, it can involve a lot of participants.","\"Before explaining the rules, we’ll be distributing answer devices to everyone. Thanks to convenient God Power, these will be handed out directly. So please hold out one hand, palm facing up.\"","Following the instructions, I opened my hand with the palm facing up, and moments later, a slender stick-like object appeared in my hand. It looked to be about 30 cm long, with buttons labeled 1 to 4, presumably for selecting your answer.","\"Well, you’ll probably figure out how to use it just by looking. Each question is multiple-choice with four options. You’ll select the number you think is correct. The answers will be automatically tallied, and the person with the most correct answers wins. There are prizes for the top scorers as well.\"","\"So that means there’ll be quite a few questions, right?\"","\"Yes. The quiz will have 5 questions each from four categories, Human Realm, Demon Realm, God Realm, and Otherworld, plus five bonus high-difficulty questions worth double points, for a total of 25 questions and a maximum of 30 points. The questions will be selected in random order.\"","\"Fumu fumu, so for someone like me, I’d probably get most of the God Realm questions right, but I’m not too confident about the Demon Realm or Otherworld ones. Sounds like a good balance.\"","I see, it seems like a pretty fair setup, and even if you don’t know the answer, it’s multiple-choice, so there’s still a chance of getting it right.","In my case, if I just pick answers at random, closing my eyes and choosing, I might get lucky and score a few points. But when I actually think about it, I tend to get things wrong, so winning purely by luck is unlikely. That makes this more fun.","\"By the way, just to confirm...... Fate-san, are you participating?\"","\"Eh? No way. Sounds like a hassle.\"","\"I thought so. In that case, Fate-san will be in charge of drawing the quiz questions at random...... Here, we’ll give you the job of spinning this garapon.\"","\"Ehhh...... That sounds even more annoying than answering questions...... I feel like I’ve been tricked. I’ve really been working hard today...... Well, I guess I can manage for Kai-chan’s sake...... Kai-chan! It’s me! Just wanted to call out to you~~\"","Fate-san smiled brightly and waved at me...... What's with this cute creature!? Seeing her wave so cheerfully, I couldn’t help but think how incredibly adorable she looked...... For the time being, I gave her a small wave in return.","\"Well, anyhow, the setup is simple. Let’s get started then...... Fate-san, please draw the first question.\"","\"Okay~~ ......Errr, it’s question 3 from the Otherworld category.\"","\"Question 3 from the Otherworld category. Alright, here is the question. The question and answer choices will be displayed on the front stage, so if you miss hearing the options, you can check there. Here we go. What is the name of the country that past Hero Actors, the Otherworlders including Kaito-san, came from? 1: Japan, 2: Wa, 3: Edo Japan, 4: America...... You have three minutes to answer.\"","I see. For us Otherworlders, including myself, this is an easy question, but for the locals of Trinia, it would likely be quite a tricky one.","Many of them might know that the Otherworld Cuisine here would sometimes be called as “washoku”, and they might assume it means they're cuisine coming from a country called “Wa”, leading them to choose option 2. Others who’ve heard the term “Japan” might not know whether that’s the full formal name or just a shortened version, and might be torn between 1 and 3.","And fundamentally, people who’ve never heard the word “Japan” before might even choose option 4.","\"......Alright, answer submission is now closed. The correct answer is option 1: Japan. For the record, options 2 and 3 don’t actually exist, but option 4 is the name of a real country in the Otherworld. However, it is not where Kaito-san and the others come from. Incidentally, the reason past Hero Actors are always from Japan is because the First Hero, Hikari-san, was from Japan. After the Treaty of Friendship was signed, adjustments were made to the summoning magic circle so that it would target individuals from the same country as Hikari-san, and who are roughly the same age as she was at the time.\"","Ah, so that’s how it works...... No wonder all the past Hero Actors, myself included, are Japanese.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ahh, I see. Depending on the questions, it could also subtly serve as a way to promote tourist spots or local specialties from various countries in the Human Realm...... and with Alice providing commentary, it also becomes a chance to learn about the different realms and the Otherworld.]"]},{"number":2298,"title":"Chapter 2298: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 42","paragraphs":["Thanks to the first question being related to the Otherworld, I was able to start off smoothly with the correct answer. It’s not like I absolutely have to win, but since I’m doing this anyway, I’d like to get a decent accuracy rate.","\"Now then, please draw the next question.\"","\"Yep, yep...... Let’s see, it’s Question 4 from the God Realm category.\"","\"Our second question will be related to the God Realm. Among the following, who is a direct subordinate of the Supreme God here with us, Fate-san? 1. God of Flash, Shine, 2. God of Fortune, Luck, 3. God of Earth, Gaia, 4. God of Love, Heart...... You have three minutes to answer.\"","Oh, I know this one too. I remember hearing that Fate-san’s direct subordinates were Shea-san and the God of Fortune, so the correct answer is number 2. If I'm not mistaken, the God of Flash should be Chronois-san's direct subordinate, and the Gaia-san is Life-san's direct subordinate.","That said, while I know the answer because I heard it directly from Fate-san, it might be a pretty tough question for others.","\"Time’s up. Let’s reveal the answer...... Since she’s here, let’s have Fate-san announce it. Fate-san, if you would?\"","\"The correct answer is number 2, God of Fortune. God of Flash is God of Time and Space's direct subordinate, and God of Earth is God of Life's direct subordinate. I bet a lot of people got tripped up by number 4. Many people know I’m the Supreme God in charge of Hydra Kingdom, and since God of Love has a temple there, some might think she’s my direct subordinate...... and while she is technically my subordinate, when we say “Supreme God's direct subordinate” among us Gods, we refer to High-ranking Gods who directly receive orders from a Supreme God. God of Love is a Lower-ranking God, so she can't be considered one.\"","\"If I recall correctly, God of Love is actually the direct subordinate of God of Calamity, Shea-san, who is Fate-san’s direct subordinate.\"","\"That’s right. Direct subordinates are basically those who work in the Supreme God’s temple. There’s no fixed number or anything, but for me, God of Time and Space, and God of Life, we each have five direct subordinates.\"","I see, yeah, I can imagine a lot of people might’ve picked Heart-san. Thanks to events like the White God Festival, it seems the Gods are getting more involved with the Human and the Demon Realm, but info on the God Realm is still pretty limited.","\"Alright, let’s keep this moving.\"","\"Next up~~ Oh, it’s a high-difficulty Question 5!\"","\"Here it is, the high-difficulty bonus point question. Now then, the question is...... What is the name of the representative of the Kruels’s city from four generations ago? 1. Berdogi Nememishi Arukemi Temejia Mero, 2. Ameshia Temelso Raziel Nikardo Aru, 3. Rimegithe Lenoria Githurd Armetes Anne, 4. Temelso Nememishi Raziel Berdogi Artia...... Now, which one is it?\"","\"Whoa, that's way too difficult though!?\"","Just as Fate-san said, this is an insanely difficult question. The options reappeared on the screen, and the sheer wall of letters was overwhelming.","Errr, first off, number 3 is Anne-san’s real name, so that’s out. And as for number 4, there’s a rule among the Kruels that their names must consist of 16 characters taken from their parents’ and grandparents’ names, and then two additional letters added to make 18 total, so that one’s invalid too.","(T/N: the 16 character part is hard to translate to english, but it's referring to their names when written in Japanese.)","That leaves 1 or 2 as possible answers...... but I don’t know which. There’s really nothing more to go on here, so I’ll just take the 50/50 gamble...... Hmm, based on how it sounds, I’ll go with number 2.","\"......Now then, let’s reveal the correct answer. It’s number 2: Ameshia Temelso Raziel Nikardo Aru.\"","\"That’s ridiculously hard...... I mean, is that even something anyone outside the Kruels would know?\"","\"If you’re well-versed in magic crystals or mining, or if you’re familiar with the politics of Archlesia Empire, you might know. This person developed a new magic crystal mining technique. “Aru’s New Mining Method” was a big topic for a while, and thanks to that achievement, he became the city’s representative.\"","\"Hehh, I had no idea.\"","Yeah, I didn’t know either, but I guess some people do.","\"At first, I was thinking of making it so that all answer choices ended with “Aru”, and you'd have to guess the correct 16-character prefix. But I figured that would be way too hard, so I scrapped that idea.\"","\"Yeah, even people who know about Aru’s new mining method wouldn’t be able to answer that, so good call.\"","Yeah, if they’d done that, it would’ve left me with nothing but blind guesses. I appreciated that there was at least some room to think it through.","\"Alright, let’s keep things going.\"","\"Next question~~ Ohh, looks like we’ve got Question 3 from the Demon Realm. We’re drawing pretty evenly so far.\"","\"Indeed. Now, here’s a question about the Demon Realm. The total number of Dragon King, Magnawell-san, subordinates, most often known as the Dragon King’s Subordinates, is approximately 88 million. Out of those, how many of them are classified as Dragons? 1. About 44 million, 2. About 30 million, 3. About 65 million, 4. About 80 million...... You have three minutes to answer.\"","This one’s pretty tough too, but there’s enough to go on to make a call. First, thinking back to what Flare-san and Lilia-san mentioned during the Dragon Carnival, it’s clear that the Dragon outnumber those that aren't, that much is certain.","So that rules out 1 and 2. Also, during the Carnival, Flare-san mentioned that aside from the event itself, there’s a separate occasion where Magnawell’s non-Dragon subordinates get to show off their strength. The fact that such an event exists means the number of non-dragon subordinates has to be fairly significant too.","In that case, having 65 million dragons and 23 million others, option 3, feels the most plausible. I’ll go with that.","\"Now for the answer...... the correct answer is number 3: 65 million. While it’s true that the Dragon subordinates are the most well-known, Magnawell-san also has many non-Dragon subordinates, which includes Beastkins and Magical Beasts. The proportion of Dragons in their camp is about 70–80%.\"","\"The Dragon King’s forces are really large-scale. Among the Six Kings, I think only Shall-tan’s forces are bigger, right? By the way, how many subordinates does Shall-tan have?\"","\"Ours total about 1.9 billion.\"","\"The Phantasmal King’s army is on a whole other level......\"","Hearing the numbers like this really drives home just how insane the Phantasmal King’s forces are. 1.9 billion, that’s unbelievable. Well, according to Alice, a portion of those are more like part-timers who only provide designated info, kind of like contracted workers. She said if you only count those in a more typical subordinate role like the other Kings have, it’s closer to around a billion...... But even then, that’s still crazy.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Well, if you consider that Japan's current population is about 120 million, even Magnawell’s 88 million subordinates is already insane......]","? ? ? : [Well, there are over 10 billion Demons alone, so yeah...... the Demon Realm is just that vast.]"]},{"number":2299,"title":"Chapter 2299: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 43","paragraphs":["It’s actually a pretty well-thought-out quiz in its own way———– it requires a broad range of knowledge, and the fact that different people have strengths in different questions is a nice touch.","Even that difficult question about the Kruels earlier would probably have been a lucky one for Anne-san......","\"Alright then, next is...... Question 5 from the Human Realm.\"","\"Continuing with another Human Realm question, it looks like we’ve now covered one from every major category. For the Human Realm, there are five types of questions: those about the three main Human Realm countries, about Friendship City, and about Kaito-san’s house.\"","Apparently, there are even questions about my house. Well, I should be able to answer those without any issues...... I should be able to, right? But if they ask something like how many secret rooms there are in my house, I honestly wouldn’t know.","\"Now then, here is the question: among the following choices, select the one that currently does not exist within Kaito-san’s property. Please note that Lilia-san’s mansion grounds are not considered part of Kaito-san’s property. We are strictly referring to what exists within the bounds of Kaito-san’s property. Also, anything stored in subspace, such as inside a Magic Box, is excluded. It’s about whether the item exists right now, at this very moment, within Kaito-san’s property. Now for the options, 1. World Tree, 2. Tea Tree, 3. Stone Sauna, 4. Bar...... You have three minutes to answer.\"","Ugh, this is a trick question...... First off, almost everyone knows there’s a World Tree on my property. And since I’ve launched a tea brand, people would naturally assume I’ve got tea trees as well...... which makes it feel obvious, but that’s actually the trap.","Because the correct answer is 2. Tea trees used to be in my backyard...... but if we’re talking about [currently], that’s no longer the case. After Canalis-san arrived, the tea trees and cacao trees were moved into a separate space she created. So technically, what’s left on my property is just the entrance to that space. And since the question explicitly says to exclude subspace and Magic Boxes, the tea trees do not currently exist on my property.","As for the other options, which many people might choose, like the stone sauna and the bar, they do exist. The sauna is in the relaxation room, and the bar is located in the basement.","\"......Alright. Time’s up. The correct answer was 2: Tea Tree. Tea trees are currently located in a separate space created by Canalis-san, so based on the condition that excludes subspace and similar areas, they are not considered to exist within Kaito-san’s property.\"","\"Totally a trick question...... But, well, since Shall-tan specifically mentioned excluding Magic Boxes and subspace, thinking about what could be stored in those, maybe I should’ve been suspicious of the tea tree.\"","As Fate-san said, the mention of the Magic Box was probably meant to be a hint. Of all the options, the tea tree is the only one that could realistically be stored in a Magic Box... Of course, storing it in there would stop time, meaning the tea wouldn’t grow, so I wouldn’t actually do that...... Though now that I think about it, I do have the one Shiro-san gave me stored away, but that’s not technically a tea tree, it’s a black tea tree, so......","\"Alright, that’s the fifth question done...... and there are still quite a few perfect scores.\"","\"Whoa~~ Impressive. I guess people who really know their stuff do know this kind of thing. Okay, next up is...... a high-difficulty question, number 2.\"","\"Ooh, we’re hitting the hard questions now. Alright, here’s the next question. The World Quoits Elite Rankings, updated every half-year, were officially published on the 30th Day of Earth Month. Among the following players, who is not in the top 100 as of that latest update? 1. Player Purple Strong, 2. Player Faraway Maria, 3. Player Lia Maidwing, 4. Player Grand Blue...... You have three minutes to answer.\"","\"Ugh, that's tough! I haven’t heard of any of these names......\"","\"Well, though they were players who made it within the rankings, they're all on the lower end, so even RINGTOSS fans might not be familiar with them all. It’s a pretty tricky question. Just to clarify, all of the players listed have made it into the Top 100 at least once, but the question is asking who among them is currently not in the Top 100 as of this year’s Earth Month rankings.\"","These high-difficulty questions are seriously hard...... but that doesn’t mean there’s no way to reason through them. For instance, among the names listed, I do remember seeing a player named Purple Strong and one called Faraway Maria at a RINGTOSS night match I watched with Dr. Vier before.","Well, maybe the other two also participated in that match, but I don’t remember...... and even for the two familiar names, I don’t recall exactly what ranks they were. Still, I think I remember Dr. Vier mentioning that Faraway Maria had a relatively high ranking that day, aside from Baby Castella Mask, of course.","I don’t really know for sure...... but for now, eliminating the two names I recognize among the choices...... I'll just go with my gut and pick 4.","\"......Alright, the correct answer is number 4: Player Grand Blue. Incidentally, Player Purple Strong is currently ranked 85th, Player Faraway Maria is 75th, and Player Lia Maidwing is 97th. Player Grand Blue, on the other hand, was ranked 98th in the preceding Heaven Month rankings last year, while Player Lia Maidwing was outside the top 100 back then.\"","\"Whew~~ that’s a tough one. But maybe fans of RINGTOSS would know? I'm clueless about that, but it is a pretty popular sport, so I guess there are probably plenty of people who do.\"","Well, I got lucky again this time, but these high-difficulty questions are no joke. That said, if I just guess randomly, I’ll probably end up relying too much on luck stat or something, so I should at least try to reason things out with whatever knowledge I do have...... I mean, in the end I left it to a 50-50 guess...... but I did put thought into narrowing it down, so I’ll call that a win.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [These high-difficulty questions look merciless, but they actually leave just enough room for Kaito to make an educated guess based on what he already knows, that’s very like Alice. I get the feeling there hasn’t been a single question where Kaito had absolutely no clue at all.]","? ? ? : [Totally. You’ve got to hand it to Alice-chan, it’s a brilliant way to keep Kaito-san from just blindly guessing the right answers.]","Serious-senpai : [Honestly, I feel like you're intentionally crafting the questions to give Kaito a slight advantage...... just subtle enough not to be obvious.]","? ? ? : [As expected! Countermeasures against luck are flawless!!!]","Serious-senpai : [........................]"]},{"number":2300,"title":"Chapter 2300: Miyama Kaito’s Birthday Celebration Party Continues 44","paragraphs":["The quiz competition progressed, and over half the questions had already been covered by the time question 15 ended. The questions had clearly been well thought out, diverse in genre, and often prompted reactions like “Ah, I see!” after hearing the answer. It was genuinely entertaining.","In the Human Realm category, when Hydra Kingdom came up, the question was about tourist spots, and it felt like a bit of a promotional effort for the country. The correct answer turned out to be that private beach I had once visited with my lovers, but all the other options were also tourist destinations within the Hydra Kingdom that I hadn’t heard of before. It made me want to visit them sometime.","So far, I’ve gotten every question right, a very strong performance. Other than the high-difficulty ones, I’ve been answering correctly with careful thought, and even with the tougher questions, I’ve narrowed things down enough that I’m minimizing how much I rely on luck. I’d say I’m doing really well.","Ideally, I’d like to get a perfect score all the way through...... but the high-difficulty questions are seriously tough. Who knows how things will turn out......","\"Next is...... Question 4 of the Otherworld category.\"","\"Alright, here’s the question. In Trinia, there is a fruit called \"ripple\". What is this fruit called in the Otherworld? 1. Apple, 2. Dragon Fruit, 3. Lycopene, 4. Durian.\"","Questions related to the Otherworld tend to be pretty easy for us Otherworlders. But looking around the venue, it seemed like more people were struggling with these than with other questions.","Even for this one, there are probably quite a few people who know that ripple hasn’t had its name changed in the Otherworld, but when asked what it is called over there, not many seem to know the correct answer.","Still, if you know it’s a similar-sounding name, or guess that it might start with “ri” as well, you can narrow the choices down. That part felt well-designed, too.","(T/N: Japanese confuse their r and l. Lycopene is written as リコピン/rikopin, both starting with リ/ri.)","\"......And now, the correct answer. It’s number 1: Apple. Generally, most ingredients have their names changed in the Otherworld to avoid confusing the Hero Actors, but ripple is an exception. In some regions, it’s used in rituals, and there are races in the Demon Realm who revere the Ripple Tree as their Sacred Tree. Because of that, the name hasn’t been changed.\"","\"Ahh, I think I remember hearing something like that. Wasn’t it a race that lives in a desert, where ripple grows in a miraculous oasis they call their sacred grounds?\"","\"Yes, they're a race known as the “Illusory People”, the Fernarts. Incidentally, there’s even one here in this venue, Frau-san. The assistant of Akane-san, who performed in the talent show earlier, is a Fernart. I imagine she also eats ripple on certain fixed days of the year, following her tribe’s customs.\"","Now that I think about it, during the Maid Olympia, didn’t Lilia-san say that Frau-san might be from a tribe living in the deserts of the Demon Realm? At the time, Lilia-san didn’t seem to know much about them, but that tribe is the Fernarts huh...... It’s really informative and interesting that Alice adds these little supplementary explanations.","\"Alright, let’s move on.\"","\"Yep yep...... Next is High Difficulty, Question 1.\"","\"Ah, here we go. This high-difficulty question, from my perspective as the question creator...... is the hardest. It’s ridiculously tough. Honestly, if I hadn’t made it myself, I’d probably get it wrong too.\"","\"Ehhh, even Shall-tan might get it wrong......? Well, I guess with four choices, there’s still a one-in-four chance, at least......\"","Whoa there, if Alice says even she might get it wrong, this must be no joke. The other high-difficulty questions were already really hard, and now it feels like we’ve finally hit a question where the answer might come down to pure luck.","\"Now then, this question’s format is a little different. Please look at the large monitor on the stage. A series of pictures labeled 1 through 4 will be displayed using the Recorder Magic Tool, and you’ll select your answer from those.\"","\"Ahh, so there’s a format like that too. You really put a lot of thought into this.\"","So it's that so-called panel-choice style question...... Sounds like it’s going to be seriously hard. Maybe it’s one where you have to guess the place just from part of a photo?","Thinking that, I looked up at the monitor on stage...... and saw close-up photos of Shiro-san’s face, labeled with numbers.","\"Alright then, which one of these is depicting Shallow Vernal-sama smiling? You have three minutes to answer.\"","\"T- Thank goodnessssss...... I'm seriously, seriously glad I’m not participating in the quiz. I mean, as Shall-tan said, this one is insanely hard. The difficulty’s off the charts...... and if I answered it and got it wrong, the psychological damage, or more like, the self-loathing I'd feel would be devastating......\"","\"If you’d like, you can participate in just this one question, you know?\"","\"No way! Absolutely not!!! If I got it wrong, I wouldn’t recover for the rest of the quiz...... Look, just look at the faces of the other Gods and Olirin...... They’re desperate. Bloodshot eyes and everything...... Well, I get it. Not only is this beyond just difficult, they also have to get it right, so they’re racking their brains with everything they’ve got.\"","Prompted by Fate-san’s words, I glanced over at Chronois-san and Life-san, and yeah...... their intensity was something else. It was like they were determined not to miss even a single clue from the photos, no matter how small.","......Well, it's just that...... while the atmosphere in the venue was, for better or worse, pretty hyped up over this unprecedentedly difficult question...... But since it was \"too easy of a question\", for me, who had answered it immediately after hearing the question, the mood they're feeling isn't quite something I can match with.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [As always, the protagonist gives off strong MC energy at the most inexplicable moments.]","? ? ? : [Well, in all fairness, Kaito-san really is probably the best in the world at reading Shallow Vernal-sama’s expressions. Even when his monologue says something like \"Shiro-san looks like she’s having fun\", from an outside perspective, her expression hasn’t changed at all.]"]}]);
